"There is no need to use this to access Git repositories, ordinary :ref:`vcs-"
"git` works the same, the only difference is how pushing to a repository is "
"handled. With :ref:`vcs-git` changes are pushed directly to the repository, "
"while the :guilabel:`Pagure` backend creates a merge request."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ Git, :ref:`vcs-git` ທຳມະດາກໍເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຄືກັນ, "
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງພຽງຢ່າງດຽວແມ່ນວິທີການ Push ໄປຍັງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ. ດ້ວຍ :ref:`vcs-git` "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະຖືກ Push ໂດຍກົງໄປຍັງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ back-end :guilabel:`Pagure` "
"ຈະສ້າງ Merge request."

msgid ""
"To create merge requests, select :guilabel:`Pagure` as :ref:`component-vcs` "
"and configure :setting:`PAGURE_CREDENTIALS`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງ Merge request, ເລືອກ :guilabel:`Pagure` ເປັນ :ref:`component-vcs` "
"ແລະຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`PAGURE_CREDENTIALS`."

msgid "Other workflows"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກອື່ນໆ"

msgid "Gitee repository access"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ Gitee"

msgid "Gitee notifications"
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Gitee"

msgid ""
"Weblate has support for Gitee webhooks. Add a :guilabel:`WebHook` "
"for :guilabel:`Push` event with destination to ``/hooks/gitee/`` URL on your "
"Weblate installation, for example ``https://hosted.weblate.org/hooks/gitee/"
"``. This can be done in :guilabel:`WebHooks` under "
"repository :guilabel:`Management`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບ Gitee webhooks. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ :guilabel:`WebHook` "
"ສຳລັບເຫດການ :guilabel:`Push` ທີ່ມີປາຍທາງໄປຍັງ URL ``/hooks/gitee/`` ບົນການຕິດຕັ້ງ "
"Weblate ຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``https://hosted.weblate.org/hooks/gitee/``. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ :guilabel:`WebHooks` ພາຍໃຕ້ :guilabel:`Management` ຂອງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ."

msgid "`Webhooks in Gitee manual <https://help.gitee.com/webhook>`_"
msgstr "`Webhooks ໃນຄູ່ມື Gitee <https://help.gitee.com/webhook>`_"

msgid ":http:post:`/hooks/gitee/`"
msgstr ":http:post:`/hooks/gitee/`"

msgid "Gerrit review requests"
msgstr "ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການກວດສອບ Gerrit"

msgid ""
"Gerrit support adds a thin layer atop :ref:`vcs-git` using the :pypi:`git-"
"review` tool to allow pushing translation changes as Gerrit review requests, "
"instead of pushing them directly to the repository."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບ Gerrit ເພີ່ມຊັ້ນບາງໆຢູ່ເທິງ :ref:`vcs-git` ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື :pypi:`git-review` "
"ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ Push ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປເປັນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການກວດສອບ Gerrit, ແທນທີ່ຈະ Push "
"ພວກມັນໂດຍກົງໄປຍັງຣີໂພຊິທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"The optional :ref:`component-push_branch` setting selects the target branch "
"for the Gerrit review. Leave it empty to use :ref:`component-branch`. Use "
"the short branch name, such as ``main``; Weblate and ``git-review`` push the "
"review to ``refs/for/<branch>`` automatically. Gerrit push options can be "
"appended after ``%`` in either setting, for example ``main%topic=l10n``. "
"Gerrit interprets these options as the configured Weblate Gerrit account and "
"applies its own permissions."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`component-push_branch` (ທາງເລືອກ) ຈະເລືອກ Branch "
"ປາຍທາງສຳລັບການກວດສອບ Gerrit. ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ :ref:`component-branch`. ໃຊ້ຊື່ "
"Branch ແບບສັ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ ``main``; Weblate ແລະ ``git-review`` ຈະ Push ການກວດສອບໄປຍັງ "
"``refs/for/<branch>`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວເລືອກ Gerrit push ສາມາດຕື່ມຕໍ່ຫຼັງ ``%`` "
"ໃນທັງສອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``main%topic=l10n``. Gerrit ຈະຕີຄວາມຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນບັນຊີ "
"Weblate Gerrit ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແລະນຳໃຊ້ສິດທິຂອງມັນເອງ."

msgid ""
"The Gerrit documentation has the details on the configuration necessary to "
"set up such repositories. There is no separate code-hosting credential "
"setting for this backend."
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານຂອງ Gerrit ມີລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບໂຄ້ດດັ່ງກ່າວ. "
"ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບການຝາກໂຄ້ດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານ (backend) ນີ້."

msgid "Docker credentials"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ Docker"

msgid ""
"For Docker installations, code-hosting API credentials can also be provided "
"through environment variables, see :ref:`docker-vcs-config`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ Docker, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງ API "
"ສຳລັບການຝາກໂຄ້ດຜ່ານຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environment variables) ໄດ້, "
"ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`docker-vcs-config`."

msgid "Component Lists"
msgstr "ລາຍການອົງປະກອບ"

msgid ""
"Specify multiple lists of components to appear as options on the user "
"dashboard, from which users can pick one as their default view. "
"See :ref:`dashboard` to learn more."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸລາຍການອົງປະກອບຫຼາຍລາຍການເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງເປັນຕົວເລືອກເທິງໜ້າຄວບຄຸມ (dashboard) ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້, "
"ເຊິ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງເປັນມຸມມອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໄດ້. ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`dashboard` "
"ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"A status will be presented for each component list presented on the "
"dashboard."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຈະຖືກສະແດງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການອົງປະກອບທີ່ປາກົດເທິງໜ້າຄວບຄຸມ."

msgid ""
"Each component list has a name displayed to the user and a slug used in the "
"URL. Component lists can be managed using the :ref:`api`. Instance "
"administrators can also use the low-level :ref:`admin-interface` when direct "
"database-object management is necessary."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະລາຍການອົງປະກອບມີຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ ແລະ ສະລັກ (slug) ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ URL. "
"ລາຍການອົງປະກອບສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`api`. ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ (administrators) "
"ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`admin-interface` ລະດັບຕ່ຳເມື່ອຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈັດການວັດຖຸຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Change dashboard settings for anonymous users from the admin interface, "
"altering what dashboard is presented to unauthenticated users."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຈາກອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ, "
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງໜ້າຄວບຄຸມທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

msgid "Automatic component lists"
msgstr "ລາຍການອົງປະກອບອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid ""
"Add components to the list automatically based on their slug by "
"creating :guilabel:`Automatic component list assignment` rules."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມສະລັກ (slug) "
"ຂອງພວກມັນໂດຍການສ້າງກົດ :guilabel:`Automatic component list assignment`."

msgid ""
"Useful for maintaining component lists for large installations, or in case "
"you want to have one component list with all components on your Weblate "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການຮັກສາລາຍການອົງປະກອບສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຫຼື "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການມີລາຍການອົງປະກອບໜຶ່ງລາຍການທີ່ມີອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Make a component list containing all the components of your Weblate "
"installation."
msgstr "ສ້າງລາຍການອົງປະກອບທີ່ມີອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Define :guilabel:`Automatic component list assignment` with ``^.*$`` as "
"regular expression in both the project and the component fields."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ :guilabel:`Automatic component list assignment` ດ້ວຍ ``^.*$`` "
"ເປັນນິພົດປົກກະຕິ (regular expression) ທັງໃນຊ່ອງໂຄງການ ແລະ ຊ່ອງອົງປະກອບ."

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

msgid ""
"All settings are stored in :file:`settings.py` (as is usual for Django)."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ :file:`settings.py` (ຕາມປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ Django)."

msgid ""
"After changing any of these settings, you need to restart Weblate — both "
"WSGI and Celery processes."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີສະຕາດ Weblate — ທັງຂະບວນການ WSGI ແລະ "
"Celery."

msgid ""
"In case it is run as ``mod_wsgi``, you need to restart Apache to reload the "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມັນເຮັດວຽກເປັນ ``mod_wsgi``, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຣີສະຕາດ Apache ເພື່ອໂຫຼດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Please also check :doc:`Django's documentation <django:ref/settings>` for "
"parameters configuring Django itself."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :doc:`ເອກະສານຂອງ Django <django:ref/settings>` ສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວ "
"Django ເອງ."

msgid ""
"Configures where contact form sends e-mails. If not configured, e-mail "
"addresses from :setting:`ADMINS` are used."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ຈະສົ່ງອີເມວໄປໃສ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຈາກ :setting:`ADMINS` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Configure this as a list of e-mail addresses:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ເປັນລາຍການທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ:"

msgid "Configures which domains are allowed for fetching assets in Weblate."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າໂດເມນໃດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຊັບສິນ (assets) ໃນ Weblate."

msgid ""
"This enhances security by preventing loading assets from untrusted sources. "
"Assets are downloaded once by the Weblate server and stored locally, rather "
"than being served directly from external domains to users."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພໂດຍການປ້ອງກັນການໂຫຼດຊັບສິນຈາກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖື. "
"ຊັບສິນຈະຖືກດາວໂຫຼດຄັ້ງດຽວໂດຍເຊີບເວີ Weblate ແລະ ເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງໂດຍກົງຈາກໂດເມນພາຍນອກໄປຫາຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The allowlist is applied to the initial URL and to every HTTP redirect "
"target before Weblate follows it. Redirects to hosts outside of this "
"allowlist are rejected."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການອະນຸຍາດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບ URL ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ກັບທຸກເປົ້າໝາຍການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ (redirect) HTTP "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ Weblate ຈະຕິດຕາມມັນ. ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຮສທີ່ຢູ່ນອກລາຍການອະນຸຍາດນີ້ຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ."

msgid ""
"It expects a list of host/domain names. You can use fully qualified names "
"(e.g ``www.example.com``) or prepend with a period as a wildcard to match "
"all subdomains (e.g ``.example.com`` will match ``cdn.example.com`` or "
"``static.example.com``)."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຕ້ອງການລາຍການຊື່ໂຮສ/ໂດເມນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຊື່ເຕັມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``www.example.com``) ຫຼື "
"ໃສ່ຈຸດນຳໜ້າເປັນ Wildcard ເພື່ອຈັບຄູ່ກັບທຸກໂດເມນຍ່ອຍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``.example.com`` ຈະຈັບຄູ່ກັບ "
"``cdn.example.com`` ຫຼື ``static.example.com``)."

msgid "Defaults to ``[\"*\"]``, which allows all domains."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``[\"*\"]``, ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດທຸກໂດເມນ."

msgid "**Example**"
msgstr "**ຕົວຢ່າງ**"

msgid "This is currently used in the following places:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນບ່ອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Screenshot uploads, see :ref:`screenshots`"
msgstr "ການອັບໂຫຼດຮູບໜ້າຈໍ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`screenshots`"

msgid "Remote HTML downloads for the :ref:`addon-weblate.cdn.cdnjs` add-on"
msgstr "ການດາວໂຫຼດ HTML ທາງໄກສຳລັບ Add-on :ref:`addon-weblate.cdn.cdnjs`"

msgid ""
"Configures which custom machinery domains are explicitly allowed in project-"
"level machine translation configuration."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າໂດເມນເຄື່ອງມື (machinery) "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງໃດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງ (machine translation) "
"ລະດັບໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"This setting applies only to machinery services and does not "
"affect :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_DOMAINS`."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ກັບບໍລິການເຄື່ອງມືເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_DOMAINS`."

msgid ""
"It expects a list of host/domain names. You can use fully qualified names or "
"prepend with a period as a wildcard to match all subdomains."
msgstr ""
"ມັນຕ້ອງການລາຍການຊື່ໂຮສ/ໂດເມນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຊື່ເຕັມ ຫຼື ໃສ່ຈຸດນຳໜ້າເປັນ Wildcard "
"ເພື່ອຈັບຄູ່ກັບທຸກໂດເມນຍ່ອຍ."

msgid "Defaults to ``[]``."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``[]``."

msgid ""
"The allowlist affects project-managed machinery in two ways: it permits the "
"configured endpoint during outbound validation, and it marks matching hosts "
"as trusted when deciding whether remote provider error details or response "
"bodies can be shown to the user. Matching hosts are also exempt from private-"
"target restrictions. For direct connections, Weblate does not resolve, pin, "
"or verify the peer address of matching hosts. Only add hosts or domains "
"whose network destinations are trusted. When a configured :ref:`http-proxy` "
"is used, the proxy is trusted to resolve the destination hostname."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ອະນຸຍາດ (allowlist) ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ລະບົບການຈັດການໂຄງການໃນສອງທາງຄື: ມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເອັນພອຍ "
"(endpoint) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຂາອອກ, ແລະ ມັນກຳນົດໃຫ້ໂຮສ (host) "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ເມື່ອຕ້ອງຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື "
"ເນື້ອໃນການຕອບກັບຈາກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທາງໄກໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນຫຼືບໍ່. ໂຮສທີ່ກົງກັນຍັງໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຈຳກັດ "
"ເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ (private-target). ສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ, Weblate ຈະບໍ່ມີການແປງຊື່, ປັກໝຸດ, "
"ຫຼື ກວດສອບທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງໂຮສທີ່ກົງກັນ. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມສະເພາະໂຮສ ຫຼື ໂດເມນ ທີ່ປາຍທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍນັ້ນໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ :ref:`http-proxy` ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້, ພຣັອກຊີຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືໃນການແປງຊື່ໂຮສປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"Configures size limit in bytes for fetching or uploading assets into "
"Weblate. Defaults to 10 MB."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດເປັນໄບຕ໌ສຳລັບການດຶງ ຫຼື ອັບໂຫຼດຊັບສິນເຂົ້າໃນ Weblate. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10 MB."

msgid ""
"Defines hostnames or domains exempt from :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"for remote asset downloads that enforce private-target checks. Entries "
"follow Django host matching semantics, so values such as "
"``assets.internal.example`` or ``.internal.example`` can be used."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ໂດເມນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກ :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"ສຳລັບການດາວໂຫຼດຊັບສິນທາງໄກທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການກວດສອບເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ. "
"ລາຍການຕ່າງໆປະຕິບັດຕາມຫຼັກການຈັບຄູ່ໂຮສຂອງ Django, ສະນັ້ນຄ່າເຊັ່ນ "
"``assets.internal.example`` ຫຼື ``.internal.example`` ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"This does not replace :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_DOMAINS`; remote assets must "
"still match the asset domain allowlist."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແທນ :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_DOMAINS`; "
"ຊັບສິນທາງໄກຍັງຕ້ອງຈັບຄູ່ກັບລາຍການອະນຸຍາດໂດເມນຊັບສິນ."

msgid "Default configuration:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:"

msgid ""
"Reject remote asset URLs pointing to internal or non-public addresses unless "
"the target host is included in :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. On by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິເສດ URL ຊັບສິນທາງໄກທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສາທາລະນະ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"When enabled, hostnames that cannot be resolved during validation are "
"rejected unless they are explicitly included "
"in :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. This currently applies to screenshot "
"URL uploads and remote HTML downloads for the :ref:`addon-weblate.cdn.cdnjs` "
"add-on."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. "
"ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບການອັບໂຫຼດ URL ຮູບໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ການດາວໂຫຼດ HTML ທາງໄກສຳລັບ Add-on :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.cdn.cdnjs`."

msgid ""
"Argon2id time cost for the ALTCHA proof-of-work challenge. Defaults to ``3``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົ້ນທຶນເວລາ Argon2id ສຳລັບການທ້າທາຍ Proof-of-work ຂອງ ALTCHA. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``3``."

msgid ""
"Replaces ``ALTCHA_MAX_NUMBER``, which applied to the removed ALTCHA widget "
"v2."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແທນ ``ALTCHA_MAX_NUMBER``, ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ກັບວິດເຈັດ ALTCHA v2 ທີ່ຖືກເອົາອອກໄປ."

msgid "Argon2id memory cost in KiB. Defaults to ``65536``."
msgstr "ຕົ້ນທຶນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ Argon2id ເປັນ KiB. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``65536``."

msgid "Argon2id parallelism factor. Defaults to ``1``."
msgstr "ປັດໄຈຄວາມຂະໜານ (parallelism) Argon2id. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``1``."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`ALTCHA Proof of Work Mechanism <https://altcha.org/docs/proof-of-work/>`_"
msgid ""
"`ALTCHA Proof of Work Mechanism <https://altcha.org/docs/integration/proof-"
"of-work-captcha/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ກົນໄກ Proof of Work ຂອງ ALTCHA <https://altcha.org/docs/proof-of-work/>`_"

msgid "Username of users that are not signed in."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"The maximum number of days Weblate will keep audit logs containing "
"information about the account activity."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນມື້ສູງສຸດທີ່ Weblate ຈະເກັບບັນທຶກການກວດສອບ (audit logs) ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບກິດຈະກຳຂອງບັນຊີ."

msgid "Defaults to 180 days."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 180 ມື້."

msgid ""
"Maximum number of failed authentication attempts before rate limiting is "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງສູງສຸດຂອງການພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ລົ້ມເຫລວກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາ (rate "
"limiting)."

msgid "This is currently applied in the following locations:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານທີ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Sign in. Deletes the account password, preventing the user from signing in "
"without requesting a new password."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ. ລົບລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງບັນຊີ, ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຂໍລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"Second-factor sign in. Deletes the account password after this many rejected "
"second-factor submissions since the last successful second-factor sign in. "
"This also invalidates pending password sign-ins. Other authentication "
"methods and API tokens remain usable."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Password reset. Prevents new e-mails from being sent, avoiding spamming "
"users with too many password-reset attempts."
msgstr ""
"ການຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການສົ່ງອີເມວໃໝ່, "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການສະແປມຜູ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍການພະຍາຍາມຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Defaults to 10."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10."

msgid "Updates all repositories on a daily basis."
msgstr "ອັບເດດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ທັງໝົດໃນທຸກໆມື້."

msgid ""
"Useful if you are not using :ref:`hooks` to update Weblate repositories "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນປະໂຫຍດຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`hooks` ເພື່ອອັບເດດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"On/off options exist in addition to string selection for backward "
"compatibility."
msgstr "ມີຕົວເລືອກເປີດ/ປິດ ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກການເລືອກສະຕຣິງເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບຮຸ່ນກ່ອນ."

msgid "The options are:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "No daily updates."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດປະຈຳວັນ."

msgid "``\"remote\"`` also ``False``"
msgstr "``\"remote\"`` ແລະ ``False``"

msgid "Only update remotes."
msgstr "ອັບເດດພຽງແຕ່ຣີໂມດເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "``\"full\"`` also ``True``"
msgstr "``\"full\"`` ແລະ ``True``"

msgid "Update remotes and merge working copy."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຣີໂມດ ແລະ ລວມ (merge) ສຳເນົາທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"This requires that :ref:`celery` is working, and will take effect after it "
"is restarted."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ :ref:`celery` ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ແລະ ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມັນຖືກຣີສະຕາດ."

msgid ""
"Prefix for constructing avatar URLs as: ``${AVATAR_URL_PREFIX}/avatar/$"
"{MAIL_HASH}?${PARAMS}``. The following services are known to work:"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນຳໜ້າສຳລັບການສ້າງ URL ຮູບແທນຕົວ (avatar) ດັ່ງນີ້: ``${AVATAR_URL_PREFIX}/avatar/$"
"{MAIL_HASH}?${PARAMS}``. ບໍລິການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກວ່າເຮັດວຽກໄດ້:"

msgid "Gravatar (default), as per https://gravatar.com/"
msgstr "Gravatar (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ຕາມ https://gravatar.com/"

msgid "Libravatar, as per https://www.libravatar.org/"
msgstr "Libravatar, ຕາມ https://www.libravatar.org/"

msgid ""
"How long the authentication token and temporary password from password reset "
"e-mails is valid for. Set in number of seconds, defaulting to 172800 (2 "
"days)."
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ໂທເຄັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານຊົ່ວຄາວຈາກອີເມວຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານມີຜົນບັງຄັບໃຊ້. "
"ຕັ້ງເປັນຈຳນວນວິນາທີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 172800 (2 ມື້)."

msgid ""
"How many days Weblate rejects reusing a previously used password for a user."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນມື້ທີ່ Weblate ປະຕິເສດການໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ແລ້ວສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The checking is based on the audit log, :setting:`AUDITLOG_EXPIRY` needs to "
"be at least same as this."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບແມ່ນອີງຕາມບັນທຶກການກວດສອບ, :setting:`AUDITLOG_EXPIRY` "
"ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເທົ່າກັບຄ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Password changes made prior to Weblate 2.15 will not be accounted for in "
"this policy."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ເຮັດກ່ອນ Weblate 2.15 ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນນະໂຍບາຍນີ້."

msgid "List of automatic fixes to apply when saving a string."
msgstr "ລາຍການການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອບັນທຶກສະຕຣິງ."

msgid ""
"Provide a fully-qualified path to the Python class that implements the "
"autofixer interface."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມ (fully-qualified path) ໄປຫາຄລາສ Python "
"ທີ່ຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດອິນເຕີເຟດການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Available fixes are described at :ref:`autofix`."
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີຢູ່ໄດ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ທີ່ :ref:`autofix`."

msgid "You can select which ones to use:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກອັນໃດທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້:"

msgid ""
"Defines how often lengthy maintenance tasks should be triggered for a "
"component."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມຖີ່ທີ່ວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ຍາວນານຄວນຖືກກະຕຸ້ນສຳລັບອົງປະກອບ."

msgid "Right now this controls:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ຄວບຄຸມ:"

msgid ":ref:`addon-weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate` add-on"
msgstr "Add-on :ref:`addon-weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate`"

msgid ":doc:`checks` recalculation"
msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ :doc:`checks` ຄືນໃໝ່"

msgid "Possible choices:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້:"

msgid "``monthly`` (this is the default)"
msgstr "``monthly`` (ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)"

msgid ""
"Increasing the frequency is not recommended when Weblate contains thousands "
"of components."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄວາມຖີ່ເມື່ອ Weblate ມີອົງປະກອບຫຼາຍພັນຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"List of languages to offer users for starting a new translation. When not "
"specified, a built-in list is used (which includes all commonly used "
"languages, but without country specific variants)."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການພາສາທີ່ຈະສະເໜີໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເລີ່ມການແປໃໝ່. ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ, "
"ລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນລະບົບຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ (ເຊິ່ງລວມມີພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປທັງໝົດ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີພາສາສະເພາະປະເທດ)."

msgid ""
"This only limits non privileged users to add unwanted languages. Project "
"admins are still presented with the full selection of languages defined in "
"Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ພຽງແຕ່ຈຳກັດຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດພິເສດໃນການເພີ່ມພາສາທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. "
"ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງໂຄງການຍັງຄົງເຫັນຕົວເລືອກພາສາທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ Weblate."

msgid ""
"This does not define new languages for Weblate — it only filters existing "
"ones in the database."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດພາສາໃໝ່ສຳລັບ Weblate — ມັນພຽງແຕ່ກັ່ນຕອງພາສາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"You can pass additional arguments to :command:`borg create` when built-in "
"backups are triggered."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສົ່ງອາກິວເມນຕ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມໄປໃຫ້ :command:`borg create` "
"ເມື່ອການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຖືກກະຕຸ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Directory where Weblate stores cache files. Defaults to :file:`cache` "
"subfolder in :setting:`DATA_DIR`."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເລກະທໍຣີທີ່ Weblate ເກັບໄຟລ໌ແຄຊ (cache). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ :file:`cache` "
"ໃນ :setting:`DATA_DIR`."

msgid ""
"Change this to local or temporary filesystem if :setting:`DATA_DIR` is on a "
"network filesystem."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນອັນນີ້ເປັນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ຫຼື ຊົ່ວຄາວ ຖ້າ :setting:`DATA_DIR` ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

msgid ""
"Weblate stores generated helper files here and executes some of them, "
"so :setting:`CACHE_DIR` has to be writable and mounted on a filesystem that "
"allows execution. Avoid using ``noexec`` mount options for this directory."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ເກັບໄຟລ໌ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ ແລະ ປະຕິບັດບາງຢ່າງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ :setting:`CACHE_DIR` "
"ຕ້ອງສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ ແລະ ຖືກເມົາ (mount) ຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດງານໄດ້. "
"ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກເມົາ ``noexec`` ສຳລັບໄດເລກະທໍຣີນີ້."

msgid ""
"The Docker container uses a separate volume for this, see :ref:`docker-"
"volume`."
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີ Docker ໃຊ້ໂວລຸມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບອັນນີ້, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-volume`."

msgid "The following subdirectories usually exist:"
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິຈະມີໄດເລກະທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Generated helper files used for VCS access."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ VCS."

msgid ":program:`font-config` cache for :ref:`fonts`."
msgstr "ແຄຊ :program:`font-config` ສຳລັບ :ref:`fonts`."

msgid "Cached user avatars, see :ref:`avatars`."
msgstr "ຮູບແທນຕົວຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ແຄຊໄວ້, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`avatars`."

msgid ""
"Default location for static Django files, specified "
"by :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT`. See :ref:`static-files`."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Django ຄົງທີ່ (static), "
"ລະບຸໂດຍ :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT`. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`static-files`."

msgid "OCR trained data for :ref:`screenshots`."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຜ່ານການຝຶກອົບຮົມ OCR ສຳລັບ :ref:`screenshots`."

msgid ""
"CSP_SCRIPT_SRC, CSP_IMG_SRC, CSP_CONNECT_SRC, CSP_STYLE_SRC, CSP_FONT_SRC, "
"CSP_FORM_SRC"
msgstr ""
"CSP_SCRIPT_SRC, CSP_IMG_SRC, CSP_CONNECT_SRC, CSP_STYLE_SRC, CSP_FONT_SRC, "
"CSP_FORM_SRC"

msgid ""
"Customize the :http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` header for Weblate. The "
"header is automatically generated based on enabled integrations with third-"
"party services (Matomo, Google Analytics, Sentry, …)."
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງສ່ວນຫົວ :http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` ສຳລັບ Weblate. "
"ສ່ວນຫົວຈະຖືກສ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມການເຊື່ອມໂຍງທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ກັບບໍລິການພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ (Matomo, "
"Google Analytics, Sentry, ...)."

msgid "All these default to an empty list."
msgstr "ທັງໝົດນີ້ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນລາຍການຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"`Content Security Policy (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"HTTP/Guides/CSP>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງເນື້ອຫາ (CSP) <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/"
"Web/HTTP/Guides/CSP>`_"

msgid "List of quality checks to perform on a translation."
msgstr "ລາຍການການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການກັບການແປ."

msgid ""
"Provide a fully-qualified path to the Python class implementing the check "
"interface."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມໄປຫາຄລາສ Python ທີ່ຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດອິນເຕີເຟດການກວດສອບ."

msgid "Adjust the list of checks to include ones relevant to you."
msgstr "ປັບປ່ຽນລາຍການການກວດສອບເພື່ອລວມເອົາອັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"All built-in :ref:`checks` are turned on by default, from where you can "
"change these settings. By default they are commented out in :ref:`sample-"
"configuration` so that default values are used. New checks are then carried "
"out for each new Weblate version."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບ :ref:`checks` ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກຄອມເມນ (comment out) "
"ໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`sample-configuration` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ການກວດສອບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການສຳລັບ "
"Weblate ແຕ່ລະຮຸ່ນ."

msgid "You can turn off all checks:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການກວດສອບທັງໝົດ:"

msgid "You can turn on only a few:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດພຽງບາງອັນ:"

msgid ""
"Changing this setting only affects newly changed translations. Existing "
"checks will still be stored in the database. To also apply changes to the "
"stored translations, run :wladmin:`updatechecks`."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບການແປທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໃໝ່. "
"ການກວດສອບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບການແປທີ່ເກັບໄວ້, "
"ໃຫ້ຮັນ :wladmin:`updatechecks`."

msgid ""
"Number of hours between committing pending changes by way of the background "
"task."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຊົ່ວໂມງລະຫວ່າງການຄອມມິດ (commit) ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ໂດຍຜ່ານວຽກງານພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid ""
"Configures the maximum size, in bytes, for uploaded component ZIP files. "
"Defaults to 50 MB."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ຂອງອົງປະກອບທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 50 MB."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_COMPONENT_ZIP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_COMPONENT_ZIP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE``."

msgid ""
"Configures how e-mail from the contact form is being sent. Choose a "
"configuration that matches the configuration of your mail server."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວິທີການສົ່ງອີເມວຈາກແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່. ເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຊີບເວີອີເມວຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"The sender is used as :mailheader:`Reply-To`, this is the default behaviour."
msgstr "ຜູ້ສົ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ :mailheader:`Reply-To`, ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The sender is used as :mailheader:`From`. Your mail server needs to allow "
"sending such e-mails."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ສົ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ :mailheader:`From`. ເຊີບເວີອີເມວຂອງເຈົ້າຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສົ່ງອີເມວດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid "Disables the contact form entirely."
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The folder Weblate stores all data in. It contains links to VCS "
"repositories, a fulltext index and various configuration files for external "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີທີ່ Weblate ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍລິ້ງໄປຫາບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ VCS, ດັດຊະນີຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕັມ "
"(fulltext index) ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆສຳລັບເຄື່ອງມືພາຍນອກ."

msgid "Home directory used for invoking scripts."
msgstr "ໄດເລກະທໍຣີຫຼັກທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຮຽກໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ."

msgid "SSH keys and configuration."
msgstr "ກະແຈ SSH ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Default location for Django media files, specified "
"by :setting:`django:MEDIA_ROOT`. Contains uploaded screenshots, "
"see :ref:`screenshots`."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ມີເດຍຂອງ Django, ລະບຸໂດຍ :setting:`django:MEDIA_ROOT`. "
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`screenshots`."

msgid "Version-control repositories for translations."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນສຳລັບການແປ."

msgid "Daily backup data. Please check :ref:`backup-dumps` for details."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງປະຈຳວັນ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`backup-dumps` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ":file:`fonts`:"
msgstr ":file:`fonts`:"

msgid "User-uploaded fonts, see :ref:`fonts`."
msgstr "ຟອນ (fonts) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ອັບໂຫຼດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`fonts`."

msgid "Various caches. Can be placed elsewhere using :setting:`CACHE_DIR`."
msgstr "ແຄຊຕ່າງໆ. ສາມາດວາງໄວ້ບ່ອນອື່ນໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`CACHE_DIR`."

msgid ""
"This directory has to be writable by Weblate. Running it as WSGI means the "
"``www-data`` user should have write access to it."
msgstr ""
"ໄດເລກະທໍຣີນີ້ຕ້ອງສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ໂດຍ Weblate. ການຮັນມັນເປັນ WSGI ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``www-data`` "
"ຄວນມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງການຂຽນ."

msgid ""
"The easiest way to achieve this is to make the user the owner of the "
"directory:"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການບັນລຸສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໄດເລກະທໍຣີ:"

msgid ""
"Defaults to ``/home/weblate/data``, but it is expected to be configured."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``/home/weblate/data``, ແຕ່ຄາດວ່າຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Whether the database backups should be stored as plain text, compressed or "
"skipped. The authorized values are:"
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄວນຖືກເກັບເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ, ບີບອັດ ຫຼື ຂ້າມໄປ. ຄ່າທີ່ອະນຸຍາດມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "The default access-control setting for new projects:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໂຄງການໃໝ່:"

msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Custom` if you are managing ACL manually, which means not "
"relying on the internal Weblate management."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Custom` ຖ້າເຈົ້າຈັດການ ACL ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ເພິ່ງພາການຈັດການພາຍໃນຂອງ Weblate."

msgid ""
"Configures whether :guilabel:`Automatically watch projects on contribution` "
"should be turned on for new users. Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ :guilabel:`Automatically watch projects on contribution` "
"ຄວນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``True``."

msgid "The default value for component restriction."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຈຳກັດອົງປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"DEFAULT_ADD_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_ADDON_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_COMMIT_MESSAGE, "
"DEFAULT_DELETE_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_MERGE_MESSAGE"
msgstr ""
"DEFAULT_ADD_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_ADDON_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_COMMIT_MESSAGE, "
"DEFAULT_DELETE_MESSAGE, DEFAULT_MERGE_MESSAGE"

msgid ""
"Default commit messages for different operations, please "
"check :ref:`component` for details."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄອມມິດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການດຳເນີນງານຕ່າງໆ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`component` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
"The built-in defaults follow Conventional Commits and include Weblate links "
"where available. Changing these settings affects newly created defaults; "
"existing message templates can be reset in the settings forms "
"with :guilabel:`Restore site default`. For inherited values, restoring the "
"site default also disables inheritance for that message."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດຕາມ Conventional Commits ແລະ ລວມມີລິ້ງ Weblate ບ່ອນທີ່ມີ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່; "
"ເທມເພລດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສາມາດຣີເຊັດໃນແບບຟອມການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ :guilabel:`Restore site "
"default`. ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ສືບທອດມາ, "
"ການຣີເຊັດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເວັບໄຊຍັງເປັນການປິດການສືບທອດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນ."

msgid "Default add-ons to install for every created component."
msgstr "Add-ons ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບທຸກອົງປະກອບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "This setting affects only newly created components."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນພຽງແຕ່ອົງປະກອບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid "Committer e-mail address, defaulting to ``noreply@weblate.org``."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ຄອມມິດ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``noreply@weblate.org``."

msgid "Committer name, defaulting to ``Weblate``."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ຄອມມິດ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``Weblate``."

msgid ":ref:`component-source_language` for any new components."
msgstr ":ref:`component-source_language` ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບໃໝ່ໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"Defaults to `en`. The matching language object needs to exist in the "
"database."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `en`. ວັດຖຸພາສາທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ກັນຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid ":ref:`component-merge_style` for any new components."
msgstr ":ref:`component-merge_style` ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບໃໝ່ໃດໆ."

msgid "`rebase` - default"
msgstr "`rebase` - ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

msgid "`merge`"
msgstr "`merge`"

msgid ""
"Configures the default value of :ref:`project-use_shared_tm` "
"and :ref:`project-contribute_shared_tm`."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ :ref:`project-use_shared_tm` ແລະ :ref:`project-"
"contribute_shared_tm`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default value for :ref:`project-translation_review`, turned "
"off by default."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ :ref:`project-translation_review`, ປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Configures the default value for :ref:`project-source_review`, turned off by "
"default."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ :ref:`project-source_review`, ປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Configures the default value of :ref:`project-autoclean_tm`."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ :ref:`project-autoclean_tm`."

msgid "Default setting for translation propagation, defaults to ``True``."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການເຜີຍແຜ່ການແປ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``True``."

msgid "Configures the default title and message for pull requests."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Pull requests."

msgid ""
"The built-in default follows Conventional Commits and includes Weblate links "
"and translation status."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບປະຕິບັດຕາມ Conventional Commits ແລະ ລວມມີລິ້ງ Weblate ແລະ "
"ສະຖານະການແປ."

msgid "Whether to turn on Gravatar-based avatars for users. On by default."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຮູບແທນຕົວໂດຍອີງຕາມ Gravatar ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Avatars are fetched and cached on the server, lowering the risk of leaking "
"private info, speeding up the user experience."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແທນຕົວຈະຖືກດຶງ ແລະ ແຄຊໄວ້ເທິງເຊີບເວີ, ເຊິ່ງຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການຮົ່ວໄຫຼຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສົບການຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Whether to turn on anonymous remote hooks."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປີດໃຊ້ Hooks ທາງໄກແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ."

msgid "Weblate now requires https for WebAuthn support."
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນ Weblate ຕ້ອງການ https ສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບ WebAuthn."

msgid ""
"Whether to send links to Weblate as HTTPS or HTTP. This setting affects sent "
"e-mails and generated absolute URLs."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະສົ່ງລິ້ງໄປຫາ Weblate ເປັນ HTTPS ຫຼື HTTP. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ອີເມວທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປ ແລະ URL "
"ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"In the default configuration this is also used for several Django settings "
"related to HTTPS — it enables secure cookies, toggles HSTS or enables "
"redirection to a HTTPS URL."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Django ຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ HTTPS — ມັນເປີດໃຊ້ "
"Secure cookies, ສະຫຼັບ HSTS ຫຼື ເປີດໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາ URL HTTPS."

msgid ""
"The HTTPS redirection might be problematic in some cases and you might hit "
"an issue with infinite redirection in case you are using a reverse proxy "
"doing an SSL termination which does not correctly pass protocol headers to "
"Django. Please tweak your reverse proxy configuration to "
"emit :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Proto` or :http:header:`Forwarded` headers or "
"configure :setting:`django:SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` to let Django correctly "
"detect the SSL status."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ HTTPS ອາດຈະເປັນບັນຫາໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ແລະ "
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບບັນຫາກັບການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງແບບບໍ່ມີສິ້ນສຸດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ Reverse proxy ທີ່ເຮັດ SSL "
"termination ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງ Protocol headers ໄປຫາ Django ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"Reverse proxy ຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສົ່ງສ່ວນຫົວ :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Proto` "
"ຫຼື :http:header:`Forwarded` ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`django:SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Django ກວດຫາສະຖານະ SSL ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"In case this is disabled, Weblate will fail to start with an "
"``otp_webauthn.E031`` error. You can silence this error by adding it "
"to :setting:`django:SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS`, but still WebAuthn will not "
"work for sites without HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກປິດ, Weblate ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``otp_webauthn.E031``. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມມັນໃສ່ :setting:`django:SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS`, ແຕ່ "
"WebAuthn ຈະຍັງຄົງບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທີ່ບໍ່ມີ HTTPS."

msgid ""
"Turn on/off the :guilabel:`Community` menu so users can share translation "
"progress on social networks."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ/ປິດ ເມນູ :guilabel:`Community` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການແປເທິງເຄືອຂ່າຍສັງຄົມ."

msgid ""
"Insert additional markup into the HTML header. Can be used for verification "
"of site ownership, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ແຊກ Markup ເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າໃນສ່ວນຫົວ HTML. ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກວດສອບຄວາມເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງເວັບໄຊ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"No sanitization is performed on the string. It is inserted as-is into the "
"HTML header."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການເຮັດ Sanitization ກັບສະຕຣິງ. ມັນຈະຖືກແຊກເຂົ້າໄປໃນສ່ວນຫົວ HTML ຕາມສະພາບເດີມ."

msgid "URL where support for your Weblate instance can be found."
msgstr "URL ທີ່ສາມາດພົບການສະໜັບສະໜູນສຳລັບອິນສະແຕນສ໌ (instance) Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "List for credentials for Gitea servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ Gitea."

msgid "`Creating a Gitea personal access token`_"
msgstr "`ການສ້າງໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນຂອງ Gitea`_"

msgid "List for credentials for GitLab servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ GitLab."

msgid ""
"The personal access token needs the :guilabel:`api` scope to be able to use "
"the API."
msgstr "ໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນຕ້ອງການຂອບເຂດ :guilabel:`api` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ API ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"`GitLab: Personal access token <https://docs.gitlab.com/user/profile/"
"personal_access_tokens/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`GitLab: ໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນ <https://docs.gitlab.com/user/profile/"
"personal_access_tokens/>`_"

msgid "List for credentials for GitHub servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ GitHub."

msgid ""
"It is possible to use both fine-grained personal access tokens and classic "
"personal access tokens. The fine-grained tokens are limited to a single "
"organization, so it won't work if you want Weblate to fork a repository "
"outside the organization (typically to the user namespace)."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ທັງໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນແບບລະອຽດ (fine-grained) ແລະ "
"ໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນແບບຄລາດສິກ. ໂທເຄັນແບບລະອຽດຖືກຈຳກັດໄວ້ພຽງອົງການດຽວ, "
"ສະນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ Weblate ແຍກ (fork) ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່ນອກອົງການ "
"(ປົກກະຕິຈະເປັນເນມສະເປສຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້)."

msgid ""
"To clone, push and create pull requests, the read and write access "
"to :guilabel:`Contents` and :guilabel:`Pull requests` is required."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອ Clone, Push ແລະ ສ້າງ Pull requests, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງການອ່ານ ແລະ "
"ການຂຽນສຳລັບ :guilabel:`Contents` ແລະ :guilabel:`Pull requests`."

msgid ""
":guilabel:`Administration` might also be necessary for forking a repository "
"if you intend to use forking and the original repository is not public."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Administration` ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການແຍກ (forking) ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕັ້ງໃຈຈະໃຊ້ການແຍກ ແລະ ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຕົ້ນສະບັບບໍ່ແມ່ນສາທາລະນະ."

msgid "Use ``api.github.com`` as an API host for https://github.com/."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ ``api.github.com`` ເປັນໂຮສ API ສຳລັບ https://github.com/."

msgid "`Creating a GitHub personal access token`_"
msgstr "`ການສ້າງໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນຂອງ GitHub`_"

msgid ""
"Webhook secret for a legacy GitHub App which delivers events to the generic "
"GitHub webhook URL, ``/hooks/github/``."
msgstr ""
"Webhook secret ສຳລັບ GitHub App ແບບເກົ່າ ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງເຫດການໄປຫາ URL ຂອງ GitHub webhook "
"ທົ່ວໄປ, ``/hooks/github/``."

msgid ""
"App webhook deliveries to the generic URL are rejected when this setting is "
"empty or their ``X-Hub-Signature-256`` does not match. Ordinary repository "
"webhooks are unaffected. GitHub Apps registered through Weblate use their "
"per-App webhook URLs and do not use this setting."
msgstr ""
"ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ App webhook ໄປຫາ URL ທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດຫາກການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ວ່າງເປົ່າ ຫຼື ``X-Hub-"
"Signature-256`` ຂອງພວກເຂົາບໍ່ກົງກັນ. Webhook ຂອງຄັງເກັບປົກກະຕິຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. GitHub "
"Apps ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ Weblate ຈະໃຊ້ URL ຂອງ webhook ແຍກຕາມ App ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້."

msgid "List for credentials for Bitbucket Data Center."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ Bitbucket Data Center."

msgid ""
"`Bitbucket: HTTP access token <https://confluence.atlassian.com/"
"bitbucketserver/http-access-tokens-939515499.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Bitbucket: ໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ HTTP <https://confluence.atlassian.com/"
"bitbucketserver/http-access-tokens-939515499.html>`_"

msgid "List for credentials for Bitbucket Cloud servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ Bitbucket Cloud."

msgid ""
"The configuration dictionary consists of credentials defined for each API "
"host. The API host might be different from what you use in the web browser, "
"for example GitHub API is accessed as ``api.github.com``."
msgstr ""
"ພົດຈະນານຸກົມການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຮສ API. ໂຮສ API "
"ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກອັນທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ໃນເວັບບຣາວເຊີ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: GitHub API ຖືກເຂົ້າເຖິງເປັນ "
"``api.github.com``."

msgid "The following configuration is available for each host:"
msgstr "ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຮສ:"

msgid "API user."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ API."

msgid "The user workspace slug."
msgstr "ສະລັກ (slug) ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "The API token with `pullrequest:write` permission."
msgstr "ໂທເຄັນ API ທີ່ມີສິດອະນຸຍາດ `pullrequest:write`."

msgid ""
"Additional settings not described here can be found at :ref:`settings-"
"credentials`."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`settings-credentials`."

msgid ""
"`Create an API token <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/"
"create-an-api-token/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ສ້າງໂທເຄັນ API <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/create-an-"
"api-token/>`_"

msgid ""
"`API token permissions <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/"
"api-token-permissions/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ສິດອະນຸຍາດໂທເຄັນ API <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/api-"
"token-permissions/>`_"

msgid "List for credentials for Azure DevOps servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ Azure DevOps."

msgid "The name of the Azure DevOps project. This is not the repository name."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງໂຄງການ Azure DevOps. ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "The name of the organization of the project."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງອົງການຂອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"An optional list of work items IDs from your organization. When provided new "
"pull requests will have these attached."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການທາງເລືອກຂອງ ID ລາຍການວຽກງານຈາກອົງການຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເມື່ອໃຫ້ໄວ້, Pull requests "
"ໃໝ່ຈະມີສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕິດໄປນຳ."

msgid "API token for the API user, required."
msgstr "ໂທເຄັນ API ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ API, ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"`Azure DevOps: Personal access token <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"azure/devops/organizations/accounts/use-personal-access-tokens-to-"
"authenticate?view=azure-devops&tabs=Windows>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Azure DevOps: ໂທເຄັນການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນບຸກຄົນ <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/"
"azure/devops/organizations/accounts/use-personal-access-tokens-to-"
"authenticate?view=azure-devops&tabs=Windows>`_"

msgid ""
"Google Analytics ID to turn on monitoring of Weblate using Google Universal "
"Analytics."
msgstr ""
"Google Analytics ID ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມ Weblate ໂດຍໃຊ້ Google Universal "
"Analytics."

msgid ""
"Google Analytics 4 integration is currently not available for Weblate, "
"please see https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/issues/14015."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Google Analytics 4 ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Weblate, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://"
"github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/issues/14015."

msgid ""
"Hide repository credentials from the web interface. In case you have "
"repository URL with user and password, Weblate will hide it when related "
"info is shown to users."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຈາກອິນເຕີເຟດເວັບ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີ URL ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, Weblate ຈະເຊື່ອງມັນໄວ້ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"For example instead of ``https://user:password@git.example.com/repo.git`` it "
"will show just ``https://git.example.com/repo.git``. It tries to clean up "
"VCS error messages too in a similar manner."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ ``https://user:password@git.example.com/repo.git`` "
"ມັນຈະສະແດງພຽງ ``https://git.example.com/repo.git``. "
"ມັນພະຍາຍາມລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ VCS ໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

msgid "On by default."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Controls how prominently Weblate exposes its own version."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ Weblate ເປີດເຜີຍເວີຊັນຂອງຕົວມັນເອງ."

msgid "Supported values are:"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ:"

msgid ""
"Show the version in shared UI such as the footer and expose it "
"in :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເວີຊັນໃນ UI ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ ເຊັ່ນ: ສ່ວນທ້າຍ ແລະ ເປີດເຜີຍມັນໃນ :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."

msgid ""
"Hide the version from prominent shared UI, while keeping it discoverable on "
"the :guilabel:`About` page and in :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງເວີຊັນຈາກ UI ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງສາມາດຄົ້ນພົບໄດ້ໃນໜ້າ :guilabel:`About` ແລະ "
"ໃນ :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."

msgid ""
"Hide the version from shared UI and :http:get:`/api/metrics/`. This also "
"makes anonymous documentation links point to the latest documentation "
"instead of the version matching the installed release."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງເວີຊັນຈາກ UI ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ ແລະ :http:get:`/api/metrics/`. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ລິ້ງເອກະສານແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນຊີ້ໄປຫາເອກະສານຫຼ້າສຸດ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນເວີຊັນທີ່ກົງກັບຮຸ່ນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Hiding the version is a recommended security practice in some corporations, "
"but it does not prevent an attacker from inferring the version by probing "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອງເວີຊັນແມ່ນການປະຕິບັດດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ແນະນຳໃນບາງບໍລິສັດ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອງກັນຜູ້ໂຈມຕີຈາກການຄາດເດົາເວີຊັນໂດຍການກວດສອບພຶດຕິກຳ."

msgid "The default is ``show``."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``show``."

msgid ""
"Compatibility alias for :setting:`VERSION_DISPLAY`. Set this to ``True`` to "
"get the same behavior as ``VERSION_DISPLAY = \"hide\"``."
msgstr ""
"ນາມແຝງທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບ :setting:`VERSION_DISPLAY`. ຕັ້ງອັນນີ້ເປັນ ``True`` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພຶດຕິກຳດຽວກັນກັບ ``VERSION_DISPLAY = \"hide\"``."

msgid ""
"Template used to generate e-mail addresses for internal Weblate bot "
"accounts. Defaults to ``\"noreply-{scope}-{name}@weblate.org\"``."
msgstr ""
"ເທມເພລດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວສຳລັບບັນຊີບັອດ Weblate ພາຍໃນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``\"noreply-"
"{scope}-{name}@weblate.org\"``."

msgid ""
"It can contain ``{scope}``, ``{name}``, ``{username}``, ``{site_title}``, "
"and ``{site_domain}``."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດມີ ``{scope}``, ``{name}``, ``{username}``, ``{site_title}`` ແລະ "
"``{site_domain}``."

msgid ""
"Use ``{scope}`` and ``{name}`` when generating the e-mail local part. The "
"``{username}`` value contains the internal ``scope:name`` username."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ ``{scope}`` ແລະ ``{name}`` ເມື່ອສ້າງສ່ວນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງອີເມວ. ຄ່າ ``{username}`` "
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ``scope:name`` ພາຍໃນ."

msgid ""
"Existing internal bot accounts are updated when :wladmin:`migrate` is run. "
"Project API token accounts are not affected."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີບັອດພາຍໃນທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອ :wladmin:`migrate` ຖືກຮັນ. ບັນຊີໂທເຄັນ API "
"ຂອງໂຄງການຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ."

msgid "Indicates whether Weblate is running behind a reverse proxy."
msgstr "ຊີ້ບອກວ່າ Weblate ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼັງ Reverse proxy ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"If set to ``True``, Weblate gets IP address from a header defined "
"by :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ ``True``, Weblate ຈະໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP "
"ຈາກສ່ວນຫົວທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER`."

msgid ""
"The reverse proxy which connects to Weblate must overwrite the configured "
"header or append a verified peer address at the position selected "
"by :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET`. Weblate does not verify which peer supplied "
"the header, so trusting a client-controlled value allows IP address spoofing."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Ensure that untrusted clients cannot reach Weblate without passing through "
"the trusted proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is not on by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Indicates which header Weblate should obtain the IP address from "
"when :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` is turned on."
msgstr ""
"ຊີ້ບອກວ່າ Weblate ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກສ່ວນຫົວໃດເມື່ອ :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` "
"ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid "Defaults to ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``."

msgid "The default changed from 1 to -1."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປ່ຽນຈາກ 1 ເປັນ -1."

msgid ""
"Indicates which part of :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER` is used as client IP "
"address."
msgstr "ຊີ້ບອກວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງ :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER` ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

msgid ""
"Depending on your setup, this header might consist of several IP addresses, "
"(for example ``X-Forwarded-For: client-ip, proxy-a, proxy-b``) and you can "
"configure which address from the header is used as client IP address here."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, ສ່ວນຫົວນີ້ອາດປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍທີ່ຢູ່ IP, (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ``X-Forwarded-For: "
"client-ip, proxy-a, proxy-b``) ແລະ ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ໃດຈາກສ່ວນຫົວຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP "
"ຂອງລູກຄ້າທີ່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Setting this affects the security of your installation. Select only an "
"address added or verified by a proxy under your control. Addresses supplied "
"by the client are untrusted. Ensure that the selected offset matches how "
"your proxies construct the header."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Setting this affects the security of your installation. You should only "
#| "configure it to use trusted proxies for determining the IP address. "
#| "Please check <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/"
#| "Headers/X-Forwarded-For#security_and_privacy_concerns> for more details."
msgid ""
"See <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/X-"
"Forwarded-For#security_and_privacy_concerns> for more details."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ. ເຈົ້າຄວນກຳນົດຄ່າມັນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Proxy "
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນການກຳນົດທີ່ຢູ່ IP. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/X-Forwarded-"
"For#security_and_privacy_concerns> ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Defaults to -1."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ -1."

msgid "CSS class added to the wrappers around legal document templates."
msgstr "ຄລາສ CSS ທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ Wrapper ອ້ອມເທມເພລດເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"Defaults to ``\"tos\"``. Weblate does not attach styling to this class; "
"custom legal styles can use it to target document wrappers. Set this to an "
"empty string to render legal documents without a wrapper class."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``\"tos\"``. Weblate ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຮູບແບບ (styling) ໃຫ້ກັບ class ນີ້; "
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທາງກົດໝາຍທີ່ກຳນົດເອງເພື່ອຈັດການກັບ document wrappers ໄດ້. "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫວ່າງເປົ່າເພື່ອສະແດງເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍໂດຍບໍ່ມີ wrapper class."

msgid "List of legal document page identifiers to hide from the legal module."
msgstr "ລາຍການຕົວລະບຸໜ້າເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍທີ່ຈະເຊື່ອງຈາກໂມດູນທາງກົດໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"The ``index`` page is always visible. Supported document identifiers are "
"``terms``, ``cookies``, ``privacy``, and ``contracts``."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າ ``index`` ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ສະເໝີ. ຕົວລະບຸເອກະສານທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ ``terms``, ``cookies``, "
"``privacy`` ແລະ ``contracts``."

msgid ""
"Hidden pages are removed from the legal menu and return a 404 response when "
"requested directly. Hiding ``terms`` or ``privacy`` is not recommended when "
"legal document confirmation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກເມນູທາງກົດໝາຍ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າຕອບກັບ 404 ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍໂດຍກົງ. "
"ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຊື່ອງ ``terms`` (ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ) ຫຼື ``privacy`` (ຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ) "
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍ."

msgid ""
"When ``terms`` or ``privacy`` is hidden, links exposed through the "
"``terms_url`` and ``privacy_url`` template variables "
"use :setting:`LEGAL_URL` and :setting:`PRIVACY_URL` as fallbacks when "
"configured. If no fallback URL is configured, the related link is omitted."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ ``terms`` ຫຼື ``privacy`` ຖືກເຊື່ອງ, ລິ້ງທີ່ເປີດເຜີຍຜ່ານຕົວປ່ຽນເທມເພລດ ``terms_url`` "
"ແລະ ``privacy_url`` ຈະໃຊ້ :setting:`LEGAL_URL` ແລະ :setting:`PRIVACY_URL` "
"ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ URL ສຳຮອງທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ລິ້ງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

msgid ""
"With legal document confirmation enabled, hiding ``terms`` and "
"setting :setting:`LEGAL_URL` makes the confirmation page link to the "
"external terms document instead of embedding :file:`legal/documents/"
"tos.html`. When a privacy policy link is available, the confirmation covers "
"both documents."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍ, ການເຊື່ອງ ``terms`` ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LEGAL_URL` ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າຢືນຢັນລິ້ງໄປຫາເອກະສານຂໍ້ກຳນົດຈາກພາຍນອກ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ :file:`legal/documents/tos.html` ທີ່ຝັງໄວ້. "
"ເມື່ອມີລິ້ງນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ, ການຢືນຢັນຈະກວມເອົາທັງສອງເອກະສານ."

msgid ""
"In non-Docker deployments, define :setting:`LEGAL_HIDDEN_DOCUMENTS` "
"and :setting:`LEGAL_URL` before ``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS`` is created so the "
"API schema terms link uses the same fallback."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ Docker, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ :setting:`LEGAL_HIDDEN_DOCUMENTS` "
"ແລະ :setting:`LEGAL_URL` ກ່ອນທີ່ ``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS`` ຈະຖືກສ້າງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລິ້ງເງື່ອນໄຂໂຄງຮ່າງ API ໃຊ້ຕົວສຳຮອງດຽວກັນ."

msgid "You need :ref:`legal` installed to make this work."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ :ref:`legal` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກ."

msgid ""
"Date of the legal documents users last agreed to. Whenever the date changes, "
"users are required to agree with the current terms of service and, when a "
"privacy policy link is available, the privacy policy."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີຂອງເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຍອມຮັບຫຼ້າສຸດ. ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ວັນທີປ່ຽນແປງ, "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດການບໍລິການປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ (ຖ້າມີລິ້ງໃຫ້)."

msgid "URL where your Weblate instance shows its legal documents."
msgstr "URL ທີ່ອິນສະແຕນສ໌ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າສະແດງເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Useful if you host your legal documents outside Weblate instead of using "
"the :ref:`legal` module. When the legal module is enabled, Weblate links to "
"the internal legal pages by default."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນປະໂຫຍດຖ້າເຈົ້າໂຮສເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍໄວ້ນອກ Weblate ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນ :ref:`legal`. "
"ເມື່ອໂມດູນທາງກົດໝາຍຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, Weblate ຈະລິ້ງໄປຫາໜ້າທາງກົດໝາຍພາຍໃນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Additional licenses to include in the license choices."
msgstr "ໃບອະນຸຍາດເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າໃນຕົວເລືອກໃບອະນຸຍາດ."

msgid ""
"Each license definition should be a tuple of its short name, a long name, a "
"URL and a boolean, indicating whether it is a libre license."
msgstr ""
"ການກຳນົດໃບອະນຸຍາດແຕ່ລະອັນຄວນເປັນ Tuple ຂອງຊື່ຫຍໍ້, ຊື່ເຕັມ, URL ແລະ Boolean, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊີ້ບອກວ່າເປັນໃບອະນຸຍາດແບບ libre ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "For example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid "Setting this to blank value now disables license alert."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງເປົ່າດຽວນີ້ຈະປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃບອະນຸຍາດ."

msgid ""
"Filter list of licenses to show. This also disables the license alert when "
"set to empty."
msgstr "ກັ່ນຕອງລາຍການໃບອະນຸຍາດທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃບອະນຸຍາດເມື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ."

msgid "This filter uses the short license names."
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງນີ້ໃຊ້ຊື່ໃບອະນຸຍາດແບບຫຍໍ້."

msgid "Following disables the license alert:"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃບອະນຸຍາດ:"

msgid "Defines whether the license attribute in :ref:`component` is required."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າແອດທຣິບິວ (attribute) ໃບອະນຸຍາດໃນ :ref:`component` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid "This is off by default."
msgstr "ປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Whether the length of a given translation should be limited. The restriction "
"is the length of the source string × 10 characters."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າຄວາມຍາວຂອງການແປທີ່ກຳນົດຄວນຖືກຈຳກັດຫຼືບໍ່. ການຈຳກັດແມ່ນຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣິງຕົ້ນສະບັບ × 10 "
"ຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid ""
"Set this to ``False`` to allow longer translations (up to 10,000 characters) "
"irrespective of source string length."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ເປັນ ``False`` ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ການແປຍາວຂຶ້ນ (ສູງສຸດ 10,000 ຕົວອັກສອນ) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຄວາມຍາວຂອງສະຕຣິງຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid "Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``True``."

msgid "LOCALIZE_CDN_URL and LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH"
msgstr "LOCALIZE_CDN_URL ແລະ LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH"

msgid ""
"These settings configure the CDN add-ons, including :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.cdn.cdnjs` and :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.cdn.files`. :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL` defines root URL where the "
"localization CDN is available and :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH` defines path "
"where Weblate should store generated files which will be served at "
"the :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL`. The files are served by your web server or "
"CDN, not by Weblate; see :ref:`cdn-server-security` for secure serving "
"guidance."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະກຳນົດ CDN Add-ons, ລວມທັງ :ref:`addon-weblate.cdn.cdnjs` "
"ແລະ :ref:`addon-weblate.cdn.files`. :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL` ກຳນົດ URL "
"ຮາກບ່ອນທີ່ CDN ການແປພາສາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ ແລະ :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH` "
"ກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ Weblate ຄວນເກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກສົ່ງທີ່ :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL`. "
"ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍເຊີບເວີເວັບ ຫຼື CDN ຂອງທ່ານ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂດຍ Weblate; ເບິ່ງ :ref:`cdn-server-"
"security` ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການສົ່ງທີ່ປອດໄພ."

msgid "On Hosted Weblate, this uses ``https://weblate-cdn.com/``."
msgstr "ເທິງ Hosted Weblate, ອັນນີ້ໃຊ້ ``https://weblate-cdn.com/``."

msgid ""
"ID of the site in Matomo (formerly Piwik) you want to use for tracking "
"Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ID ຂອງເວັບໄຊໃນ Matomo (ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນ Piwik) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມ Weblate."

msgid "This integration does not support the Matomo Tag Manager."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ Matomo Tag Manager."

msgid ""
"Full URL (including trailing slash) of a Matomo (formerly Piwik) "
"installation you want to use to track Weblate use. Please check <https://"
"matomo.org/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"URL ເຕັມ (ລວມທັງ Trailing slash) ຂອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ Matomo (ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ແມ່ນ Piwik) "
"ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການໃຊ້ Weblate. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ <https://matomo.org/> "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Number of nearby strings to show in each direction in the full editor."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແຕ່ລະທິດທາງໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂແບບເຕັມ."

msgid ""
"This is just a default value, users can adjust this in :ref:`user-profile`."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດປັບອັນນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`user-profile`."

msgid "Default number of elements to display when pagination is active."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນອົງປະກອບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ Pagination ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "List for credentials for Pagure servers."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເຊີບເວີ Pagure."

msgid "`Pagure API <https://pagure.io/api/0/>`_"
msgstr "`Pagure API <https://pagure.io/api/0/>`_"

msgid ""
"Minimal password score as evaluated by the `zxcvbn <https://github.com/"
"dwolfhub/zxcvbn-python>`_ password strength estimator."
msgstr ""
"ຄະແນນລະຫັດຜ່ານຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຕາມການປະເມີນໂດຍ `zxcvbn <https://github.com/dwolfhub/zxcvbn-"
"python>`_ ຕົວປະເມີນຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຂງຂອງລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

msgid "Defaults to 0, which means strength checking is disabled."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການກວດສອບຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຂງຖືກປິດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"URL for password reset when authentication is handled by an external "
"identity provider, such as LDAP, SAML, or OAuth."
msgstr ""
"URL ສຳລັບການຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານເມື່ອການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕົວຕົນພາຍນອກ, ເຊັ່ນ: LDAP, "
"SAML, ຫຼື OAuth."

msgid ""
"When set, :guilabel:`Forgot your password?` on the sign-in page links to "
"this URL instead of Weblate's built-in password reset page."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ, :guilabel:`Forgot your password?` ເທິງໜ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຈະລິ້ງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໜ້າຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ Weblate."

msgid "URL where your Weblate instance shows its privacy policy."
msgstr "URL ທີ່ອິນສະແຕນສ໌ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າສະແດງນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Useful if you host your privacy policy outside Weblate instead of using "
"the :ref:`legal` module. When the legal module is enabled, Weblate links to "
"the internal legal pages by default."
msgstr ""
"ເປັນປະໂຫຍດຖ້າເຈົ້າໂຮສນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວໄວ້ນອກ Weblate ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນ :ref:`legal`. "
"ເມື່ອໂມດູນທາງກົດໝາຍຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, Weblate ຈະລິ້ງໄປຫາໜ້າທາງກົດໝາຍພາຍໃນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Configures whether the private commit e-mail is opt-in or opt-out (by "
"default it is opt-in)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າອີເມວຄອມມິດສ່ວນຕົວເປັນແບບ Opt-in ຫຼື Opt-out (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Opt-in)."

msgid ""
"This setting only applies to users which have not explicitly chosen a commit "
"e-mail."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກອີເມວຄອມມິດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"Template to generate a private commit e-mail for a user. Defaults to "
"``\"{username}@users.noreply.{site_domain}\"``."
msgstr ""
"ເທມເພລດສຳລັບສ້າງອີເມວຄອມມິດສ່ວນຕົວສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``\"{username}@users.noreply."
"{site_domain}\"``."

msgid ""
"It can contain ``{user_id}``, ``{username}``, ``{site_title}``, and "
"``{site_domain}``."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດມີ ``{user_id}``, ``{username}``, ``{site_title}`` ແລະ ``{site_domain}"
"``."

msgid "Set to blank string to disable."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນສະຕຣິງຫວ່າງເປົ່າເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Using a different commit e-mail is opt-in for users unless configured "
"by :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_EMAIL_OPT_IN`. Users can configure their commit "
"e-mail in the :ref:`profile`."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ອີເມວຄອມມິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເປັນແບບ Opt-in ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_EMAIL_OPT_IN`. "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວຄອມມິດຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໃນ :ref:`profile`."

msgid ""
"Configures whether the private commit name is opt-in or opt-out (by default "
"it is opt-in)."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຊື່ຄອມມິດສ່ວນຕົວເປັນແບບ Opt-in ຫຼື Opt-out (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Opt-in)."

msgid ""
"This setting only applies to users which have not explicitly chosen a commit "
"name."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຊື່ຄອມມິດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"Template to generate a private commit name for a user. Defaults to "
"``\"{site_title} user {user_id}\"``."
msgstr ""
"ເທມເພລດສຳລັບສ້າງຊື່ຄອມມິດສ່ວນຕົວສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``\"{site_title} user {user_id}"
"\"``."

msgid ""
"Using a different commit name is opt-in for users unless configured "
"by :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_NAME_OPT_IN`. Users can configure their commit "
"name in the :ref:`profile`."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຊື່ຄອມມິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເປັນແບບ Opt-in ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ :setting:`PRIVATE_COMMIT_NAME_OPT_IN`. "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ຄອມມິດຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າໃນ :ref:`profile`."

msgid ""
"Defines how many backups per project are kept on the server. Defaults to 3."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຳນວນການສຳຮອງຕໍ່ໂຄງການທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີບເວີ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 3."

msgid ""
"Defines how long the project backups will be kept on the server. Defaults to "
"30 days."
msgstr "ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ການສຳຮອງໂຄງການຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນເຊີບເວີ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 30 ມື້."

msgid ""
"Configures the maximum size, in bytes, for uploaded project backup ZIP "
"files. Defaults to 536870912 bytes (512 MiB)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ZIP ສຳຮອງໂຄງການທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 536870912 "
"ໄບຕ໌ (512 MiB)."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`` environment variable. Docker "
"setups can also be constrained by :envvar:`CLIENT_MAX_BODY_SIZE`; other "
"deployments can be constrained by their reverse proxy request body-size "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE``. ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Docker "
"ຍັງສາມາດຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍ :envvar:`CLIENT_MAX_BODY_SIZE`; "
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງອື່ນໆສາມາດຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຂີດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດເນື້ອຫາຂອງການຮ້ອງຂໍ Reverse proxy."

msgid ""
"Defines the maximum number of ZIP entries allowed when importing a project "
"backup."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງລາຍການ ZIP ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າການສຳຮອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"This is a safeguard against malformed or intentionally fragmented archives. "
"Defaults to 100000 entries."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການປ້ອງກັນຈາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແຍກສ່ວນໂດຍເຈດຕະນາ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 100000 ລາຍການ."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_MEMBERS`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_MEMBERS``."

msgid ""
"Defines the maximum total uncompressed size, in bytes, for ZIP entries in an "
"imported project backup. Defaults to 536870912 bytes (512 MiB)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດບໍ່ບີບອັດລວມສູງສຸດ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ສຳລັບລາຍການ ZIP ໃນການສຳຮອງໂຄງການທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 536870912 ໄບຕ໌ (512 MiB)."

msgid ""
"This limits archives that are small when uploaded but expand to much more "
"data during validation or restore."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳກັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນ້ອຍເມື່ອອັບໂຫຼດ ແຕ່ຂະຫຍາຍເປັນຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບ ຫຼື ການກູ້ຄືນ."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED_SIZE`` environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_TOTAL_UNCOMPRESSED_SIZE``."

msgid ""
"Defines the maximum uncompressed size, in bytes, for a single highly "
"compressed ZIP entry in an imported project backup."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດບໍ່ບີບອັດສູງສຸດ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ສຳລັບລາຍການ ZIP ທີ່ບີບອັດສູງໃນການສຳຮອງໂຄງການທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ."

msgid ""
"This limit is only applied to entries that are large enough and compress "
"enough to look suspicious. Large low-compression files are intentionally "
"allowed here and are expected to be constrained by the HTTP upload limit. "
"Defaults to 262144000 bytes (250 MiB)."
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບລາຍການທີ່ໃຫຍ່ພໍ ແລະ ບີບອັດໄດ້ຫຼາຍຈົນເບິ່ງໜ້າສົງໄສ. "
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການບີບອັດຕ່ຳຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ໂດຍເຈດຕະນາ ແລະ "
"ຄາດວ່າຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຂີດຈຳກັດການອັບໂຫຼດ HTTP. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 262144000 ໄບຕ໌ (250 MiB)."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_SIZE`` environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_SIZE``."

msgid ""
"Defines the minimum uncompressed size, in bytes, at which Weblate starts "
"considering the ZIP compression ratio during project backup import."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດບໍ່ບີບອັດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ທີ່ Weblate ເລີ່ມພິຈາລະນາອັດຕາສ່ວນການບີບອັດ ZIP "
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າສຳຮອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"Smaller files are ignored for the compression-ratio-based validation to "
"avoid rejecting reasonably sized files that compress well. Defaults to "
"1048576 bytes (1 MiB)."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຈະຖືກລະເລີຍສຳລັບການກວດສອບໂດຍອີງຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນການບີບອັດ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການປະຕິເສດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດສົມເຫດສົມຜົນທີ່ບີບອັດໄດ້ດີ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1048576 ໄບຕ໌ (1 MiB)."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MIN_RATIO_SIZE`` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MIN_RATIO_SIZE``."

msgid ""
"Defines the maximum allowed ratio between the uncompressed and compressed "
"size for a large ZIP entry during project backup import."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດອັດຕາສ່ວນສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດລະຫວ່າງຂະໜາດບໍ່ບີບອັດ ແລະ ຂະໜາດບີບອັດສຳລັບລາຍການ ZIP "
"ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າສຳຮອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"This is used together "
"with :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_SIZE` "
"and :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MIN_RATIO_SIZE` to detect suspiciously "
"compressed entries while still allowing large repository pack files and "
"other low-compression content. Defaults to 250."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_SIZE` "
"ແລະ :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MIN_RATIO_SIZE` "
"ເພື່ອກວດຈັບລາຍການທີ່ບີບອັດຢ່າງໜ້າສົງໄສ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ Pack ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ແລະ "
"ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີການບີບອັດຕ່ຳອື່ນໆ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 250."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_RATIO`` environment "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_RATIO``."

msgid ""
"Defines a regular expression to restrict project naming. Any matching names "
"will be rejected."
msgstr "ກຳນົດນິພົດປົກກະຕິເພື່ອຈຳກັດການຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຄງການ. ຊື່ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ."

msgid ""
"Reject using certain hosts in project website. Any subdomain is matched, so "
"including ``example.com`` will block ``test.example.com`` as well. The list "
"should contain lower case strings only, the parsed domain is lower cased "
"before matching."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິເສດການໃຊ້ບາງໂຮສໃນເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ. ໂດເມນຍ່ອຍໃດກໍຕາມຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່, ສະນັ້ນການລວມ "
"``example.com`` ຈະບລັອກ ``test.example.com`` ດ້ວຍ. "
"ລາຍການຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍສະຕຣິງຕົວພິມນ້ອຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ໂດເມນທີ່ຖືກແຍກວິເຄາະຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຕົວພິມນ້ອຍກ່ອນການຈັບຄູ່."

msgid ""
"Defines a set of project slugs exempt "
"from :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_HOST`, :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_NUMERIC`, :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`, "
"and :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_RE` when validating the project website. "
"Project slugs are matched case-insensitively."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊຸດສະລັກໂຄງການທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກ :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_HOST`, :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_NUMERIC`, :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"ແລະ :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_RE` ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ. "
"ສະລັກໂຄງການຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"This exemption weakens outbound URL protections for matching projects, "
"including the private-target restriction enforced "
"by :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`. Use it only for trusted, "
"administrator-managed projects where bypassing these checks is intentional."
msgstr ""
"ການຍົກເວັ້ນນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ້ອງກັນ URL ຂາອອກອ່ອນແອລົງສຳລັບໂຄງການທີ່ກົງກັນ, "
"ລວມເຖິງການຈຳກັດເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໂດຍ :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`. "
"ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂຄງການທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ແລະ ຈັດການໂດຍຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເຊິ່ງການຂ້າມການກວດສອບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນໂດຍເຈດຕະນາ."

msgid "Reject using numeric IP address in project website. On by default."
msgstr "ປະຕິເສດການໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຕົວເລກໃນເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Reject using project website and repository browser URLs pointing to "
"internal or non-public addresses. On by default."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິເສດການໃຊ້ເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ ແລະ URL ບຣາວເຊີບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສາທາລະນະ. "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Defines a regular expression to limit what can be entered as :ref:`project-"
"web`. Any matching URLs will be rejected."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດນິພົດປົກກະຕິເພື່ອຈຳກັດສິ່ງທີ່ສາມາດປ້ອນເຂົ້າເປັນ :ref:`project-web`. URL "
"ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ."

msgid ""
"Defines hostnames or domains exempt from :setting:`WEBHOOK_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"for outbound webhook delivery. Entries follow Django host matching "
"semantics, so values such as ``hooks.internal.example`` or "
"``.internal.example`` can be used."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ໂດເມນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກ :setting:`WEBHOOK_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"ສຳລັບການສົ່ງ Webhook ຂາອອກ. ລາຍການປະຕິບັດຕາມຫຼັກການຈັບຄູ່ໂຮສຂອງ Django, ສະນັ້ນຄ່າເຊັ່ນ "
"``hooks.internal.example`` ຫຼື ``.internal.example`` ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Reject webhook URLs pointing to internal or non-public addresses unless the "
"target host is included in :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. On by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິເສດ URL Webhook ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສາທາລະນະ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. "
"ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"When enabled, hostnames that cannot be resolved during validation are "
"rejected unless they are explicitly included "
"in :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid "Allows public engage page even with :setting:`REQUIRE_LOGIN`."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໜ້າ Engage ສາທາລະນະເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີ :setting:`REQUIRE_LOGIN`."

msgid ""
"Defines how many days generated translation reports are retained. Defaults "
"to 90 days. Changing the value also changes when existing reports become "
"eligible for removal by the daily cleanup task."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າຈະເກັບຮັກສາລາຍງານການແປທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນເວລາຈັກມື້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 90 ມື້. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່ານີ້ຍັງຈະປ່ຽນແປງເວລາທີ່ລາຍງານທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍວຽກງານທຳຄວາມສະອາດປະຈຳມື້."

msgid "Limits how many notifications for a single user will be sent out."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ດຽວ."

msgid "The default setting is:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ:"

msgid ""
"Maximum number of authentication attempts before rate limiting is applied."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງສູງສຸດຂອງການພະຍາຍາມຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການນຳໃຊ້ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາ."

msgid "Defaults to 5."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 5."

msgid "How long authentication is accepted after rate limiting applies."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບຫຼັງຈາກມີການນຳໃຊ້ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາ."

msgid "An amount of seconds, defaulting to 300 (5 minutes)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວິນາທີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 300 (5 ນາທີ)."

msgid "How long authentication is locked after rate limiting applies."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຖືກລັອກຫຼັງຈາກມີການນຳໃຊ້ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາ."

msgid "An amount of seconds defaulting to 600 (10 minutes)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວິນາທີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 600 (10 ນາທີ)."

msgid ""
"List of authentication backends to allow registration from. This only limits "
"new registrations, users can still authenticate and add authentication using "
"all configured authentication backends."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການແບັກເອັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳກັດສະເພາະການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່, "
"ຜູ້ຍັງສາມາດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໂດຍໃຊ້ແບັກເອັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"It is recommended to keep :setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN` on while limiting "
"registration backends, otherwise users will be able to register, but Weblate "
"will not show links to register in the user interface."
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປີດ :setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN` ໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຈຳກັດແບັກເອັນການລົງທະບຽນ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະສາມາດລົງທະບຽນໄດ້, ແຕ່ Weblate ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງລິ້ງເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "The backend names match names used in the URL for authentication."
msgstr "ຊື່ແບັກເອັນຈະກົງກັບຊື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ URL ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

msgid ""
"Whether registration of new accounts is protected by a CAPTCHA. Defaults to "
"enabled."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າການລົງທະບຽນບັນຊີໃໝ່ຈະຖືກປົກປ້ອງໂດຍ CAPTCHA ຫຼືບໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"If turned on, a CAPTCHA is added to all pages where a user enters their e-"
"mail address:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເປີດ, CAPTCHA ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ທຸກໜ້າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ:"

msgid "New account registration."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນບັນຊີໃໝ່."

msgid "Password recovery."
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

msgid "Adding e-mail to an account."
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມອີເມວໃສ່ບັນຊີ."

msgid "Contact form for users that are not signed in."
msgstr "ແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ."

msgid "The protection currently consists of following steps:"
msgstr "ການປົກປ້ອງປັດຈຸບັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Mathematical captcha to be solved by the user."
msgstr "Captcha ຄະນິດສາດ ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Proof of work challenge calculated by the browser. The difficulty can be "
"adjusted using :setting:`ALTCHA_COST`, :setting:`ALTCHA_MEMORY_COST`, "
"and :setting:`ALTCHA_PARALLELISM`."
msgstr ""
"ການທ້າທາຍ Proof of work ທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍບຣາວເຊີ. "
"ຄວາມຍາກສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`ALTCHA_COST`, :setting:`ALTCHA_MEMORY_COST` "
"ແລະ :setting:`ALTCHA_PARALLELISM`."

msgid "Allows you to filter which e-mail addresses can register."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວໃດທີ່ສາມາດລົງທະບຽນໄດ້."

msgid "Defaults to ``.*``, which allows any e-mail address to be registered."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``.*``, ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທຸກທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວລົງທະບຽນໄດ້."

msgid "You can use it to restrict registration to a single e-mail domain:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຈຳກັດການລົງທະບຽນໃຫ້ເຫຼືອພຽງໂດເມນອີເມວດຽວ:"

msgid ""
"Allow registration with disposable e-mail domains. When enabled, the "
"disposable domain blocklist is bypassed. Default is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນດ້ວຍໂດເມນອີເມວຊົ່ວຄາວ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ບັນຊີລາຍການບລັອກໂດເມນຊົ່ວຄາວຈະຖືກຂ້າມ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``False``."

msgid ""
"Whether registration of new accounts is currently permitted. Defaults to "
"enabled."
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າການລົງທະບຽນບັນຊີໃໝ່ຈະຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃນປັດຈຸບັນຫຼືບໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເປີດໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"This setting affects built-in authentication by e-mail address or through "
"the Python Social Auth (you can allow certain back-ends "
"using :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_BACKENDS`)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໂດຍທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ ຫຼື ຜ່ານ Python Social Auth "
"(ເຈົ້າສາມາດອະນຸຍາດບາງແບັກເອັນໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_BACKENDS`)."

msgid ""
"If using third-party authentication methods such as :ref:`ldap-auth`, it "
"just hides the registration form, but new users might still be able to sign "
"in and create accounts."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໃຊ້ວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມເຊັ່ນ :ref:`ldap-auth`, "
"ມັນພຽງແຕ່ເຊື່ອງແບບຟອມລົງທະບຽນ, ແຕ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ອາດຈະຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ ແລະ ສ້າງບັນຊີໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Allow rebinding authentication backends for existing users. Turn this on "
"when migrating between authentication providers."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ Rebinding ແບັກເອັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. "
"ເປີດອັນນີ້ເມື່ອມີການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

msgid ""
"Off by default to not allow adding other authentication backends to an "
"existing account. Rebinding can lead to account compromise when using more "
"third-party authentication backends."
msgstr ""
"ປິດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແບັກເອັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອື່ນໃສ່ບັນຊີທີ່ມີຢູ່. Rebinding "
"ສາມາດນຳໄປສູ່ການປະນິປະນອມບັນຊີເມື່ອໃຊ້ແບັກເອັນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Threshold for triggering an alert for outdated repositories, or ones that "
"contain too many changes. Defaults to 25."
msgstr ""
"ເກນສຳລັບການກະຕຸ້ນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ, ຫຼື ອັນທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 25."

msgid ""
"This "
"enables :class:`django:django.contrib.auth.middleware.LoginRequiredMiddleware` "
"and configures REST framework to require authentication for all API "
"endpoints."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເປີດໃຊ້ :class:`django:django.contrib.auth.middleware.LoginRequiredMiddleware` "
"ແລະ ກຳນົດ REST framework ໃຫ້ຕ້ອງການການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບທຸກຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ API."

msgid "Weblate now relies on Django built-in middleware."
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນ Weblate ເພິ່ງພາ Middleware ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ Django."

msgid ""
"This is implemented in the :ref:`sample-configuration`. For Docker, "
"use :envvar:`WEBLATE_REQUIRE_LOGIN`."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດໃນ :ref:`sample-configuration`. ສຳລັບ Docker, "
"ໃຊ້ :envvar:`WEBLATE_REQUIRE_LOGIN`."

msgid ""
"Configuration for :ref:`collecting-errors` using Google Cloud Error "
"Reporting. Set to ``None`` to disable the integration, or set to a "
"dictionary of keyword arguments for the Google Cloud Error Reporting client."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ :ref:`collecting-errors` ໂດຍໃຊ້ Google Cloud Error Reporting. "
"ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``None`` ເພື່ອປິດການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນພົດຈະນານຸກົມຂອງ Keyword arguments "
"ສຳລັບໄຄລ໌ເອັນ Google Cloud Error Reporting."

msgid ""
"Weblate automatically supplies ``service`` as ``weblate`` and ``version`` as "
"the current Weblate version or Git revision. Explicit values in the "
"dictionary override these defaults."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຈະໃຫ້ ``service`` ເປັນ ``weblate`` ແລະ ``version`` ເປັນເວີຊັນ Weblate "
"ປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື Git revision ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຄ່າທີ່ລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນພົດຈະນານຸກົມຈະທັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid "Enable backend tracing using OpenTelemetry. Disabled by default."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕິດຕາມແບັກເອັນໂດຍໃຊ້ OpenTelemetry. ປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Traces are exported only when this is enabled "
"and :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` is configured."
msgstr ""
"Traces ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເມື່ອສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ "
"ແລະ :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT` ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"OTLP HTTP traces endpoint for OpenTelemetry, for example ``https://"
"collector.example.com/v1/traces``."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ OTLP HTTP traces ສຳລັບ OpenTelemetry, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``https://"
"collector.example.com/v1/traces``."

msgid ""
"Additional HTTP headers for the OpenTelemetry OTLP exporter. Defaults to an "
"empty dictionary."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວ HTTP ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ OpenTelemetry OTLP exporter. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນພົດຈະນານຸກົມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Additional OpenTelemetry resource attributes. Defaults to an empty "
"dictionary."
msgstr "ແອດທຣິບິວຊັບພະຍາກອນ OpenTelemetry ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນພົດຈະນານຸກົມຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

msgid "OpenTelemetry service name. Defaults to ``weblate``."
msgstr "ຊື່ບໍລິການ OpenTelemetry. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``weblate``."

msgid ""
"Configure sampling rate for OpenTelemetry traces. Set to 1 to trace all "
"events, 0 (the default) disables tracing."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ OpenTelemetry traces. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມທຸກເຫດການ, 0 "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ປິດການຕິດຕາມ."

msgid "Sentry DSN to use for :ref:`collecting-errors`."
msgstr "Sentry DSN ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບ :ref:`collecting-errors`."

msgid ""
"`Django integration for Sentry <https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/python/"
"integrations/django/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງ Django ສຳລັບ Sentry <https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/python/"
"integrations/django/>`_"

msgid "Configures environment for Sentry. Defaults to ``devel``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບ Sentry. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``devel``."

msgid ""
"Configure whether to monitor Celery Beat tasks with Sentry. Defaults to "
"``True``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະຕິດຕາມວຽກງານ Celery Beat ດ້ວຍ Sentry ຫຼືບໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``True``."

msgid ""
"Configure sampling rate for performance monitoring. Set to 1 to profile all "
"traced events (the default), 0 disables profiling."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບ. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ເພື່ອໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທຸກເຫດການທີ່ຕິດຕາມ "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), 0 ປິດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"`Sentry Performance Monitoring <https://docs.sentry.io/product/sentry-basics/"
"performance-monitoring/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ການຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບ Sentry <https://docs.sentry.io/product/sentry-basics/"
"performance-monitoring/>`_"

msgid ""
"Allow Sentry to collect certain personally identifiable information. Turned "
"off by default."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ Sentry ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສາມາດລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ບາງຢ່າງ. ປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "This is turned off by default now, used to be turned on by default."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ເຊິ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Configure sampling rate for profiling monitoring. Set to 1 to trace all "
"events, 0 (the default) disables tracing."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດອັດຕາການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມທຸກເຫດການ, 0 (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) "
"ປິດການຕິດຕາມ."

msgid "`Sentry Profiling <https://docs.sentry.io/product/profiling/>`_"
msgstr "`Sentry Profiling <https://docs.sentry.io/product/profiling/>`_"

msgid "SESSION_COOKIE_AGE_2FA"
msgstr "SESSION_COOKIE_AGE_2FA"

msgid ""
"Set session expiry while in :ref:`2fa`. This "
"complements :setting:`django:SESSION_COOKIE_AGE` which is used for "
"unauthenticated users."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງເຊສຊັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ :ref:`2fa`. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເສີມກັບ :setting:`django:SESSION_COOKIE_AGE` ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

msgid ""
"Set session expiry for authenticated users. This "
"complements :setting:`django:SESSION_COOKIE_AGE` which is used for "
"unauthenticated users."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງເຊສຊັນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແລ້ວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເສີມກັບ :setting:`django:SESSION_COOKIE_AGE` ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ."

msgid ""
"Use simple language codes for default language/country combinations. For "
"example an ``fr_FR`` translation will use the ``fr`` language code. This is "
"usually the desired behavior, as it simplifies listing languages for these "
"default combinations."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາແບບງ່າຍສຳລັບການລວມພາສາ/ປະເທດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການແປ ``fr_FR`` "
"ຈະໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາ ``fr``. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, "
"ເພາະມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ການລາຍຊື່ພາສາສຳລັບການລວມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Turn this off if you want to different translations for each variant."
msgstr "ປິດອັນນີ້ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການການແປທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕົວແປ."

msgid ""
"Glossary components are typically shared into other projects to make them "
"available for translation work. When these are visible in the component list "
"of projects that are using them, it can cause confusion or distract "
"translators from the actual components that are meant to be translated."
msgstr ""
"ອົງປະກອບອະທິບາຍສັບ (Glossary components) "
"ປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກແບ່ງປັນໄປຍັງໂຄງການອື່ນໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບວຽກງານການແປ. "
"ເມື່ອສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປາກົດໃນລາຍການອົງປະກອບຂອງໂຄງການທີ່ກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ, ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມສັບສົນ ຫຼື "
"ຫັນເຫຄວາມສົນໃຈຂອງນັກແປຈາກອົງປະກອບຕົວຈິງທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະແປ."

msgid ""
"This is turned off by default, making shared glossary components visible."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ອົງປະກອບອະທິບາຍສັບທີ່ແບ່ງປັນສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Configures site domain. Necessary to produce correct absolute links in many "
"scopes (for example activation e-mails, notifications or RSS feeds)."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດໂດເມນເວັບໄຊ. ຈຳເປັນໃນການສ້າງລິ້ງທີ່ສົມບູນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຫຼາຍຂອບເຂດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ອີເມວການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ຫຼື RSS feeds)."

msgid "If Weblate is running on a non-standard port, include it here as well."
msgstr "ຖ້າ Weblate ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພອດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ, ໃຫ້ລວມມັນໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້ດ້ວຍ."

msgid "**Examples:**"
msgstr "**ຕົວຢ່າງ:**"

msgid ""
"This setting should only contain the domain name. For configuring protocol, "
"(turning on and enforcing HTTPS) use :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` and for "
"changing the URL, use :setting:`URL_PREFIX`."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄວນມີພຽງຊື່ໂດເມນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການກຳນົດ Protocol, (ເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ HTTPS) "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` ແລະ ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນ URL, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :setting:`URL_PREFIX`."

msgid ""
"On a Docker container, the site domain is configured "
"through :envvar:`WEBLATE_ALLOWED_HOSTS`."
msgstr ""
"ເທິງຄອນເທນເນີ Docker, ໂດເມນເວັບໄຊຖືກກຳນົດຜ່ານ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ALLOWED_HOSTS`."

msgid "Site title to be used for the website and sent e-mails."
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ເວັບໄຊທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ອີເມວທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປ."

msgid ""
"Additional characters to include in the visual keyboard, :ref:`visual-"
"keyboard`."
msgstr "ຕົວອັກສອນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າໃນແປ້ນພິມສະເໝືອນ, :ref:`visual-keyboard`."

msgid "The default value is:"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ:"

msgid ""
"Redirects users directly to a project or component instead of showing the "
"dashboard. You can either set it to ``True`` so it only works if there is "
"actually only single project in Weblate. Alternatively, set the project "
"slug, and it will redirect unconditionally to this project."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄປຫາໂຄງການ ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບໂດຍກົງ ແທນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຄວບຄຸມ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ "
"``True`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກຖ້າມີພຽງໂຄງການດຽວໃນ Weblate. ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ຕັ້ງສະລັກໂຄງການ, "
"ແລະ ມັນຈະປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຄງການນີ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ມີເງື່ອນໄຂ."

msgid ""
"Allows adding custom parameters when Weblate is invoking SSH. Useful when "
"connecting to servers using legacy encryption or other non-standard features."
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີແບບກຳນົດເອງເມື່ອ Weblate ກຳລັງຮຽກໃຊ້ SSH. "
"ເປັນປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເກົ່າ ຫຼື ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານອື່ນໆ."

msgid ""
"For example when SSH connection in Weblate fails with `Unable to negotiate "
"with legacyhost: no matching key exchange method found. Their offer: diffie-"
"hellman-group1-sha1`, you can turn that on using:"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໃນ Weblate ລົ້ມເຫລວດ້ວຍ `Unable to negotiate with "
"legacyhost: no matching key exchange method found. Their offer: diffie-"
"hellman-group1-sha1`, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້:"

msgid ""
"The string is evaluated by the shell, so ensure any whitespace and special "
"characters is quoted."
msgstr ""
"ສະຕຣິງຈະຖືກປະເມີນໂດຍ Shell, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ Space ແລະ "
"ຕົວອັກສອນພິເສດໃດໆຖືກໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມ."

msgid ""
"This is trusted administrator-controlled configuration. Arbitrary SSH "
"options can alter connection routing and override the address pinning "
"provided by :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`. Administrators are responsible "
"for the security and compatibility impact of all configured arguments."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື. ຕົວເລືອກ SSH ຕ່າງໆສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງເສັ້ນທາງ "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ຂ້າມການປັກໝຸດທີ່ຢູ່ ທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`. "
"ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຕ້ອງຮັບຜິດຊອບຕໍ່ຜົນກະທົບດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຂອງອາຄິວເມນ (arguments) "
"ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid "`OpenSSH Legacy Options <https://www.openssh.org/legacy.html>`_"
msgstr "`ຕົວເລືອກ OpenSSH ແບບເກົ່າ <https://www.openssh.org/legacy.html>`_"

msgid "The URL where your Weblate instance reports its status."
msgstr "URL ທີ່ອິນສະແຕນສ໌ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າລາຍງານສະຖານະຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Disables semiannual support status check and redirecting superusers upon "
"login to the donation page in case there is no active support subscription."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການກວດສອບສະຖານະການສະໜັບສະໜູນແບບເຄິ່ງປີ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ Superuser "
"ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄປຫາໜ້າການບໍລິຈາກ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີການສະໝັກສະໜັບສະໜູນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

msgid ""
"Improve your Weblate experience by purchasing a support subscription and "
"boosting Weblate progress instead of turning this off."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງປະສົບການ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍການຊື້ການສະໝັກສະໜັບສະໜູນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງ Weblate "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະປິດສິ່ງນີ້."

msgid ""
"Configures the maximum size, in bytes, for uploaded translation files. "
"Defaults to 50 MB."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ, ເປັນໄບຕ໌, ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 50 MB."

msgid ""
"In Docker, configure this using the ``WEBLATE_TRANSLATION_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`` "
"environment variable."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າອັນນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ "
"``WEBLATE_TRANSLATION_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE``."

msgid ""
"Configures when the :guilabel:`Component seems unused` alert is triggered."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ :guilabel:`Component seems unused` ຈະຖືກກະຕຸ້ນເມື່ອໃດ."

msgid "Defaults to 365 days, set to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 365 ມື້, ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid ""
"Controls whether languages database should be updated when running database "
"migration and is on by default. This setting has no effect on invocation "
"of :wladmin:`setuplang`."
msgstr ""
"ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນພາສາຄວນຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອຮັນການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການຮຽກໃຊ້ :wladmin:`setuplang`."

msgid ""
"The languages display might become inconsistent with this. Weblate language "
"definitions expand over time and it will not display language code for the "
"defined languages."
msgstr ""
"ການສະແດງພາສາອາດຈະບໍ່ສອດຄ້ອງກັບສິ່ງນີ້. ຄຳນິຍາມພາສາຂອງ Weblate ຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄປຕາມເວລາ ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງລະຫັດພາສາສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

msgid ""
"This setting allows you to run Weblate under some path (otherwise it relies "
"on being run from the webserver root)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຮັນ Weblate ພາຍໃຕ້ເສັ້ນທາງໃດໜຶ່ງ (ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ມັນຈະເພິ່ງພາການຮັນຈາກຮາກຂອງເວັບເຊີບເວີ)."

msgid ""
"To use this setting, you also need to configure your server to strip this "
"prefix. For example with WSGI, this can be achieved by setting "
"``WSGIScriptAlias``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຍັງຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫ້ຕັດຄຳນຳໜ້ານີ້ອອກ. ຕົວຢ່າງກັບ WSGI, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``WSGIScriptAlias``."

msgid "The prefix should start with a ``/``."
msgstr "ຄຳນຳໜ້າຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ``/``."

msgid ""
"This setting does not work with Django's built-in server, you would have to "
"adjust :file:`urls.py` to contain this prefix."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບເຊີບເວີໃນຕົວຂອງ Django, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງ :file:`urls.py` "
"ໃຫ້ມີຄຳນຳໜ້ານີ້."

msgid ""
"A set of hosts to allow when configuring VCS URL. Defaults to an empty set, "
"which does no filtering at all."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດຂອງໂຮສທີ່ອະນຸຍາດເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ຂອງ VCS. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຊຸດຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ມີການກັ່ນຕອງໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"When :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` is enabled, matching hosts are also "
"exempt from the private-target restriction. This exemption is also needed "
"for VCS backends which cannot bind the client connection to the address "
"validated by Weblate, such as Mercurial and Subversion."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`, "
"ໂຮສທີ່ກົງກັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຈຳກັດເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ. "
"ການຍົກເວັ້ນນີ້ຍັງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານຂອງ VCS ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຜູກມັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງໄຄເອັນ (client) "
"ກັບທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ Weblate ກວດສອບແລ້ວໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ Mercurial ແລະ Subversion."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` is enabled, matching hosts are also "
#| "exempt from the private-target restriction."
msgid ""
"Use :setting:`VCS_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST` instead when hosts should be exempt "
"from the private-target restriction without filtering access to other public "
"hosts."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`, "
"ໂຮສທີ່ກົງກັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Defines hostnames or domains exempt "
#| "from :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` for remote asset downloads that "
#| "enforce private-target checks. Entries follow Django host matching "
#| "semantics, so values such as ``assets.internal.example`` or "
#| "``.internal.example`` can be used."
msgid ""
"Defines hostnames or domains exempt from :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`. "
"Unlike :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`, this setting does not filter access to "
"other hosts. Entries follow Django host matching semantics, so values such "
"as ``vcs.internal.example`` or ``.internal.example`` can be used."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື ໂດເມນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກ :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` "
"ສຳລັບການດາວໂຫຼດຊັບສິນທາງໄກທີ່ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການກວດສອບເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ. "
"ລາຍການຕ່າງໆປະຕິບັດຕາມຫຼັກການຈັບຄູ່ໂຮສຂອງ Django, ສະນັ້ນຄ່າເຊັ່ນ "
"``assets.internal.example`` ຫຼື ``.internal.example`` ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` is enabled, matching hosts are also "
#| "exempt from the private-target restriction. This exemption is also needed "
#| "for VCS backends which cannot bind the client connection to the address "
#| "validated by Weblate, such as Mercurial and Subversion."
msgid ""
"The exemption is needed for VCS backends which cannot bind the client "
"connection to the address validated by Weblate, such as Mercurial and "
"Subversion. It can also be used to allow private Git repository hosts."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`, "
"ໂຮສທີ່ກົງກັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບການຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການຈຳກັດເປົ້າໝາຍສ່ວນຕົວ. "
"ການຍົກເວັ້ນນີ້ຍັງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານຂອງ VCS ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຜູກມັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງໄຄເອັນ (client) "
"ກັບທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ Weblate ກວດສອບແລ້ວໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ Mercurial ແລະ Subversion."

msgid ""
"When :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS` is non-empty, its host filter still applies "
"and takes precedence over this allowlist."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A set of URL schemes to allow when configuring VCS URL. Only ``https`` and "
"``ssh`` are allowed by default."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດຂອງຮູບແບບ URL ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ຂອງ VCS. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອະນຸຍາດພຽງ ``https`` ແລະ "
"``ssh`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Reject VCS repository URLs pointing to internal or non-public addresses "
#| "unless the target host is included in :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`. On by "
#| "default."
msgid ""
"Reject VCS repository URLs pointing to internal or non-public addresses "
"unless the target host is included in :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS` or "
"matches :setting:`VCS_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`. On by default."
msgstr ""
"ປະຕິເສດ URL ຂອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ VCS ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນສາທາລະນະ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ໂຮສປາຍທາງຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When enabled, hostnames that cannot be resolved during validation are "
#| "rejected unless they are explicitly included "
#| "in :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgid ""
"When enabled, hostnames that cannot be resolved during validation are "
"rejected unless they are trusted by :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS` "
"or :setting:`VCS_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ຈະຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "For Git repositories accessed over HTTPS or SSH, Weblate binds each VCS "
#| "command to the addresses approved during runtime validation for direct "
#| "connections. Configured HTTP proxies are trusted infrastructure and "
#| "resolve repository hostnames instead. Automatic redirect following "
#| "remains disabled. Permanent same-host HTTP redirects are probed "
#| "separately through the same outbound route, validated, and stored as the "
#| "canonical component repository URL. Cross-host redirects have to be "
#| "configured manually. Mercurial, Subversion, custom VCS backends, and "
#| "additional URL schemes are rejected unless the target host is explicitly "
#| "included in :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`."
msgid ""
"For Git repositories accessed over HTTPS or SSH, Weblate binds each VCS "
"command to the addresses approved during runtime validation for direct "
"connections. Configured HTTP proxies are trusted infrastructure and resolve "
"repository hostnames instead. Automatic redirect following remains disabled. "
"Permanent same-host HTTP redirects are probed separately through the same "
"outbound route, validated, and stored as the canonical component repository "
"URL. Cross-host redirects have to be configured manually. Mercurial, "
"Subversion, custom VCS backends, and additional URL schemes are rejected "
"unless the target host is trusted by :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS` "
"or :setting:`VCS_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບ Git ທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານ HTTPS ຫຼື SSH, Weblate ຈະຜູກມັດແຕ່ລະຄຳສັ່ງ VCS ເຂົ້າກັບທີ່ຢູ່ "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການອະນຸຍາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດສອບເວລາໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ. HTTP ພຣັອກຊີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ "
"ຖືວ່າເປັນໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື ແລະ ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ແປງຊື່ໂຮສຂອງຄັງເກັບແທນ. "
"ການຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ ອັດຕະໂນມັດຍັງຄົງຖືກປິດໄວ້. ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ HTTP "
"ແບບຖາວອນພາຍໃນໂຮສດຽວກັນ ຈະຖືກກວດສອບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຜ່ານເສັ້ນທາງຂາອອກດຽວກັນ, ຖືກກວດສອບ, ແລະ "
"ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ເປັນທາງການ. "
"ການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຂ້າມໂຮສຕ້ອງໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. Mercurial, Subversion, ລະບົບຫຼັງບ້ານ VCS "
"ແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ແລະ ຮູບແບບ URL ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ "
"ນອກຈາກວ່າໂຮສເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ."

msgid ""
"Network-level egress filtering which blocks internal, loopback, link-local, "
"reserved, and cloud metadata address ranges is recommended as defense in "
"depth, especially for custom integrations and administrator-installed "
"extensions."
msgstr ""
"ການກັ່ນຕອງການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອອກ (egress filtering) ໃນລະດັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ ເຊິ່ງບລັອກຊ່ວງທີ່ຢູ່ internal, "
"loopback, link-local, reserved, ແລະ cloud metadata ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳ "
"ເພື່ອເປັນການປ້ອງກັນທີ່ໜາແໜ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລະບົບແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ "
"ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Configures minimal delay in seconds between third-party API calls "
"in :ref:`code-hosting-github-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gitlab-merge-"
"requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gitea-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-"
"pagure-merge-requests`, and :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຊ້າຕໍ່າສຸດເປັນວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການໂທ API ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມໃນ :ref:`code-hosting-"
"github-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gitlab-merge-requests`, :ref:`code-"
"hosting-gitea-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-pagure-merge-requests`, "
"ແລະ :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests`."

msgid ""
"This rate-limits API calls from Weblate to these services to avoid "
"overloading them."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດອັດຕາການໂທ API ຈາກ Weblate ໄປຍັງການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເຮັດວຽກໜັກເກີນໄປ."

msgid ""
"If you are being limited by secondary rate-limiter at GitHub, increasing "
"this might help."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຕົວຈຳກັດອັດຕາສຳຮອງທີ່ GitHub, ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໄດ້."

msgid "The default value is 10."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10."

msgid ""
"Configures timeout in seconds for third-party API calls such as forking or "
"creating merge requests in :ref:`code-hosting-github-pull-"
"requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gitlab-merge-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-"
"gitea-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-pagure-merge-requests`, "
"and :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດລົງເປັນວິນາທີສຳລັບການໂທ API ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ ເຊັ່ນ: ການແຍກ (forking) ຫຼື "
"ການສ້າງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍລວມ (merge requests) ໃນ :ref:`code-hosting-github-pull-"
"requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gitlab-merge-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-"
"gitea-pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-pagure-merge-requests`, "
"ແລະ :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests`."

msgid "Configuration of available VCS backends."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VCS backends ທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Weblate offers configured backends when their required commands are "
"available. Exact command versions are validated by the deployment and "
"periodic configuration health checks."
msgstr ""

msgid "You can limit choices or add custom VCS back-ends by using this."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈຳກັດທາງເລືອກ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມ VCS back-ends ແບບກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້."

msgid "Configures how deep cloning of repositories Weblate should do."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເລິກໃນການໂຄລນຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທີ່ Weblate ຄວນເຮັດ."

msgid ""
"Currently this is only supported in :ref:`vcs-git`. By default Weblate does "
"shallow clones of the repositories to make cloning faster and save disk "
"space. Depending on your usage (for example when using "
"custom :ref:`addons`), you might want to increase the depth or turn off "
"shallow clones completely by setting this to 0."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນນີ້ຮອງຮັບພຽງແຕ່ໃນ :ref:`vcs-git` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Weblate "
"ຈະເຮັດການໂຄລນແບບຕື້ນ (shallow clones) ຂອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການໂຄລນໄວຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌. "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງເຈົ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງເມື່ອໃຊ້ :ref:`addons` ແບບກຳນົດເອງ), "
"ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄວາມເລິກ ຫຼື ປິດການໂຄລນແບບຕື້ນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ 0."

msgid ""
"In case you get ``fatal: protocol error: expected old/new/ref, got 'shallow "
"<commit hash>'`` error when pushing from Weblate, turn off shallow clones "
"completely by setting:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ``fatal: protocol error: expected old/new/ref, got "
"'shallow <commit hash>'`` ເມື່ອກົດດັນ (push) ຈາກ Weblate, "
"ໃຫ້ປິດການໂຄລນແບບຕື້ນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

msgid ""
"List of add-ons available for use. To use them, they have to be enabled for "
"a given translation component. By default this includes all built-in add-"
"ons, when extending the list you will probably want to keep existing ones "
"enabled, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຂອງ add-ons ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານພວກມັນ, "
"ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບອົງປະກອບການແປທີ່ກຳນົດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສິ່ງນີ້ລວມມີ add-ons ໃນຕົວທັງໝົດ, "
"ເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍລາຍການເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຮັກສາອັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"Removing the add-on from the list does not uninstall it from the components. "
"Weblate will crash in that case. Please uninstall the add-on from all "
"components prior to removing it from this list."
msgstr ""
"ການລຶບ add-on ອອກຈາກລາຍການບໍ່ແມ່ນການຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງມັນອອກຈາກອົງປະກອບ. Weblate "
"ຈະຂັດຂ້ອງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ add-on "
"ອອກຈາກທຸກອົງປະກອບກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລຶບມັນອອກຈາກລາຍການນີ້."

msgid ""
"Configures how long activity logs for add-ons are kept. Defaults to 180 days."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາໃນການເກັບຮັກສາບັນທຶກກິດຈະກຳສຳລັບ add-ons. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 180 ວັນ."

msgid ""
"List of available exporters offering translation downloads or glossaries in "
"various file formats."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງຕົວສົ່ງອອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ເຊິ່ງສະເໜີການດາວໂຫຼດການແປ ຫຼື ອະພິທານສັບໃນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ."

msgid "List of file formats available for use."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "The default list already has the common formats."
msgstr "ລາຍການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມີຮູບແບບທົ່ວໄປຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "List of machinery services available for use."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂອງການບໍລິການເຄື່ອງມື (machinery services) ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "Identity used by Weblate to sign Git commits, for example:"
msgstr "ຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Weblate ເພື່ອລົງນາມ Git commits, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"The Weblate GPG keyring is searched for a matching key (:file:`home/.gnupg` "
"under :setting:`DATA_DIR`). If not found, a key is generated, please "
"check :ref:`gpg-sign` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Weblate GPG keyring ຈະຖືກຄົ້ນຫາຫາຄີທີ່ກົງກັນ (:file:`home/.gnupg` "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ :setting:`DATA_DIR`). ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບ, ຄີຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບ :ref:`gpg-sign` "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Defines whether :ref:`project-web` has to be specified when creating a "
"project. On by default, as that suits public server setups."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ :ref:`project-web` ຕ້ອງຖືກລະບຸເມື່ອສ້າງໂຄງການຫຼືບໍ່. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເພາະມັນເໝາະສົມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີສາທາລະນະ."

msgid "Default: ``True``"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: ``True``"

msgid ""
"Defines whether Weblate should check project website availability and show "
"alerts for unreachable project websites."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດວ່າ Weblate ຄວນກວດສອບຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບເວັບໄຊໂຄງການທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"When set to ``False``, Weblate will skip website availability checks and "
"will not generate project website alerts. This is useful when:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ ``False``, Weblate ຈະຂ້າມການກວດສອບຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງເວັບໄຊ ແລະ "
"ຈະບໍ່ສ້າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເວັບໄຊໂຄງການ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອ:"

msgid "Your websites are behind firewalls that block Weblate's requests"
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ຫຼັງໄຟວໍທີ່ບລັອກການຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງ Weblate"

msgid "You want to avoid 403/503-type errors from bot protection"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດປະເພດ 403/503 ຈາກການປ້ອງກັນບອທ໌"

msgid "Project website availability is not a concern for your installation"
msgstr "ຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງເວັບໄຊໂຄງການບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ກັງວົນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງເຈົ້າ"

msgid "Configuring version control credentials"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ"

msgid ""
"This section describes VCS credential variables "
"as :setting:`GITHUB_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`GITLAB_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`GITEA_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`PAGURE_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`BITBUCKETSERVER_CREDENTIALS`."
msgstr ""
"ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍຕົວປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ VCS "
"ເຊັ່ນ :setting:`GITHUB_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`GITLAB_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`GITEA_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`PAGURE_CREDENTIALS`, :setting:`BITBUCKETSERVER_CREDENTIALS`."

msgid ""
"The credentials can also be overridden in :ref:`component-push` "
"or :ref:`component-repo` (if push URL is not configured), these take "
"precedence over the ones specified in the configuration file."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວສາມາດຖືກແທນທີ່ໃນ :ref:`component-push` ຫຼື :ref:`component-repo` "
"(ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ push URL), ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າສິ່ງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid "API user, required."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ API, ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid ""
"Scheme override. Weblate attempts to parse scheme from the repository URL "
"and falls backs to ``https``. If you are running the API server internally, "
"you might want to use ``http`` instead, but consider security."
msgstr ""
"ການແທນທີ່ຮູບແບບ (Scheme override). Weblate ພະຍາຍາມແຍກວິເຄາະຮູບແບບຈາກ URL "
"ຂອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ ແລະ ກັບໄປໃຊ້ ``https``. ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງແລ່ນ API ເຊີບເວີພາຍໃນ, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ "
"``http`` ແທນ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ."

msgid ""
"In the Docker container, the credentials can be configured using environment "
"variables, see :ref:`docker-vcs-config`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ Docker, ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-vcs-config`."

msgid "Continuous localization"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພາສາແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ"

msgid ""
"There is infrastructure in place so that your translation closely follows "
"development. This way translators can work on translations the entire time, "
"instead of working through huge amount of new text just prior to release."
msgstr ""
"ມີພື້ນຖານໂຄງລ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແປຂອງເຈົ້າຕິດຕາມການພັດທະນາຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, "
"ນັກແປສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບການແປໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານກ່ອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ."

msgid ""
":doc:`/devel/integration` describes basic ways to integrate your development "
"with Weblate. :doc:`/admin/code-hosting` lists provider-specific setup steps "
"for common code-hosting sites."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/devel/integration` ອະທິບາຍວິທີການພື້ນຖານໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການພັດທະນາຂອງທ່ານກັບ "
"Weblate. :doc:`/admin/code-hosting` "
"ລວມລາຍຊື່ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສຳລັບເວັບໄຊຝາກໂຄ້ດທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "This is the process:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືຂະບວນການ:"

msgid "Developers make changes and push them to the VCS repository."
msgstr "ນັກພັດທະນາເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ ພຣັຊ (push) ພວກມັນໄປຍັງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ VCS."

msgid ""
"Optionally the translation files are updated, see :ref:`translations-update`."
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ການແປຈະຖືກອັບເດດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`translations-update`."

msgid ""
"Weblate pulls changes from the VCS repository, parses translation files and "
"updates its database, see :ref:`update-vcs`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ VCS, ແຍກວິເຄາະໄຟລ໌ການແປ ແລະ ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`update-vcs`."

msgid ""
"Translators submit translations using the Weblate web interface, or upload "
"offline changes."
msgstr "ນັກແປສົ່ງການແປໂດຍໃຊ້ເວັບອິນເຕີເຟສຂອງ Weblate, ຫຼື ອັບໂຫຼດການປ່ຽນແປງແບບອອບໄລນ໌."

msgid ""
"Once the translators are finished, Weblate commits the changes to the local "
"repository (see :ref:`lazy-commit`)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອນັກແປເຮັດສຳເລັດ, Weblate ຈະຄອມມິດ (commit) ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`lazy-commit`)."

msgid ""
"Changes are pushed back to the upstream repository (see :ref:`code-hosting-"
"push-options`)."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະຖືກພຣັຊກັບຄືນໄປຍັງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີຕົ້ນທາງ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`code-hosting-push-options`)."

msgid ""
"Upstream code-hosting site is not necessary, you can use Weblate "
"with :ref:`vcs-local` where there is only the repository inside Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ເວັບໄຊຝາກໂຄ້ດຕົ້ນທາງແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສະເໝີໄປ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Weblate ຮ່ວມກັບ :ref:`vcs-local` "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຄັງເກັບໂຄ້ດພາຍໃນ Weblate ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Updating repositories"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ"

msgid ""
"You should set up some way of updating backend repositories from their "
"source."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງວິທີໃນການອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີເບື້ອງຫຼັງຈາກແຫຼ່ງຂອງພວກມັນ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use :ref:`hooks` to integrate with the majority of common code-hosting "
#| "services, see :doc:`/admin/code-hosting`. You must also :ref:`project-"
#| "enable_hooks` for this to work."
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`hooks` to integrate with the majority of common code-hosting "
"services, see :doc:`/admin/code-hosting`. You must also :ref:`project-"
