"repository URL matches the payload; see :ref:`hooks-target-matching`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ :ref:`hooks` ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບບໍລິການຝາກໂຄ້ດທົ່ວໄປສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :doc:`/admin/code-"
"hosting`. ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`project-enable_hooks` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Manually trigger update either in the repository management or "
"using :ref:`api` or :ref:`wlc`"
msgstr "ກະຕຸ້ນການອັບເດດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃນການຈັດການຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ :ref:`api` ຫຼື :ref:`wlc`"

msgid ""
"Enable :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE` to automatically update all components on your "
"Weblate instance"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE` ເພື່ອອັບເດດທຸກອົງປະກອບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນອິນສະແຕນສ໌ Weblate "
"ຂອງເຈົ້າ"

msgid ""
"Execute :wladmin:`updategit` (with selection of project or ``--all`` to "
"update all)"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດ :wladmin:`updategit` (ດ້ວຍການເລືອກໂຄງການ ຫຼື ``--all`` ເພື່ອອັບເດດທັງໝົດ)"

msgid ""
"Whenever Weblate updates the repository, the post-update addons will be "
"triggered, see :ref:`addons`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ Weblate ອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ, add-ons ຫຼັງການອັບເດດຈະຖືກກະຕຸ້ນ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`addons`."

msgid "Matching webhook targets"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Forge webhooks update components whose :ref:`component-repo` exactly matches "
"a repository URL from the payload (HTTPS or SSH as reported by the forge, "
"plus common variants such as a trailing slash)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Generic forge webhook endpoints are compatibility interfaces, and ordinary "
"repository deliveries are not cryptographically authenticated. Legacy GitHub "
"App deliveries containing installation data are an exception: the generic "
"GitHub endpoint verifies their signature "
"using :setting:`GITHUB_LEGACY_APP_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. Repository matching does "
"not apply project or component access control because webhooks also need to "
"update private projects and :ref:`restricted components <component-"
"restricted>`. Their JSON responses include diagnostic counts for repository, "
"branch, and enabled-hook matches. Successful responses also include the full "
"project/component slugs and absolute API URLs of updated components. "
"Supplying a matching repository URL can therefore confirm that a repository "
"is registered and reveal these identifiers."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Components managed through an authenticated integration are excluded from "
"generic webhook matching and its diagnostic counts. Currently this applies "
"to the :guilabel:`GitHub (via Weblate GitHub app)` VCS backend. These "
"components receive notifications only through their dedicated tokenized and "
"signed :ref:`GitHub App webhook URL <code-hosting-github-app-webhook>`. "
"Future authenticated integrations are expected to use the same separation."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The returned API URLs do not grant access to the components. The web "
"interface and API continue to enforce normal access control, and webhook "
"responses do not include repository content, translations, or credentials. "
"Where available, prefer an authenticated integration such as :ref:`code-"
"hosting-github-app-webhook`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Host and path suffix fallback matching was removed. If updates stop, "
"align :ref:`component-repo` with a URL from the forge webhook payload."
msgstr ""

msgid "Avoiding merge conflicts"
msgstr "ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມ (merge conflicts)"

msgid ""
"The merge conflicts from Weblate arise when same file was changed both in "
"Weblate and outside it. Depending on the situation, there are several "
"approaches that might help here:"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມຈາກ Weblate ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ Weblate ແລະ ພາຍນອກມັນ. "
"ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສະຖານະການ, ມີຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ອາດຊ່ວຍໄດ້:"

msgid "Avoiding merge conflicts by changing translation files in Weblate only"
msgstr "ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມໂດຍການປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ການແປໃນ Weblate ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

msgid ""
"Avoiding edits outside Weblate is easy with monolingual files — you can add "
"new strings within Weblate and leave whole editing of the files there. For "
"bilingual files, there is usually some kind of message extraction process to "
"generate translatable files from the source code. In some cases, this can be "
"split into two parts:"
msgstr ""
"ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແກ້ໄຂນອກ Weblate ແມ່ນງ່າຍດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ພາສາດຽວ — ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ພາຍໃນ "
"Weblate ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ສອງພາສາ, "
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີຂະບວນການສະກັດຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແປໄດ້ຈາກໂຄດຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງສ່ວນ:"

msgid ""
"The extraction generates template (for example gettext POT is generated "
"using :program:`xgettext`)."
msgstr ""
"ການສະກັດຈະສ້າງເທມເພລດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ gettext POT ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`xgettext`)."

msgid ""
"Further process merges it into actual translations (the gettext PO files are "
"updated using :program:`msgmerge`)."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ມາຈະລວມມັນເຂົ້າກັບການແປຕົວຈິງ (ໄຟລ໌ gettext PO "
"ຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`msgmerge`)."

msgid ""
"You can perform the second step within Weblate and it will ensure that all "
"pending changes are included before this operation."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະຕິບັດຂັ້ນຕອນທີສອງພາຍໃນ Weblate ແລະ "
"ມັນຈະຮັບປະກັນວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກ່ອນການດຳເນີນການນີ້."

msgid "Avoiding merge conflicts by locking Weblate while doing outside changes"
msgstr "ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມໂດຍການລັອກ Weblate ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງພາຍນອກ"

msgid ""
"Integrating Weblate into your updating process so that it flushes changes "
"before updating the files outside Weblate can be achieved by "
"using :ref:`api` to force Weblate to push all pending changes and lock the "
"translation while you are doing changes on your side."
msgstr ""
"ການລວມ Weblate "
"ເຂົ້າໃນຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນລຶບລ້າງການປ່ຽນແປງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ນອກ Weblate "
"ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ :ref:`api` ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ Weblate ພຣັຊການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດ ແລະ "
"ລັອກການແປໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງຢູ່ທາງຝັ່ງຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "The script for doing updates can look like this:"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບສຳລັບການອັບເດດສາມາດເບິ່ງຄືກັບນີ້:"

msgid ""
"If you have multiple components sharing the same repository, you need to "
"lock them all separately:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບທີ່ໃຊ້ຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີດຽວກັນ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງລັອກພວກມັນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ:"

msgid ""
"The example uses :ref:`wlc`, which needs configuration (API keys) to be able "
"to control Weblate remotely. You can also achieve this using any HTTP client "
"instead of :ref:`wlc`, for example curl, see :ref:`api`."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງໃຊ້ :ref:`wlc`, ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (API keys) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ Weblate "
"ຈາກໄລຍະໄກ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດບັນລຸສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ HTTP client ໃດກໍໄດ້ແທນ :ref:`wlc`, ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"curl, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`api`."

msgid "Repository maintenance"
msgstr "ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຄັງເກັບ"

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` view shows repository status for a "
"project, component, or translation and lets privileged users run maintenance "
"operations from the user interface."
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງ :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` ສະແດງສະຖານະຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີສຳລັບໂຄງການ, "
"ອົງປະກອບ ຫຼື ການແປ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີສິດທິພິເສດດຳເນີນການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຈາກອິນເຕີເຟສຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"The same actions can also be triggered using :ref:`api` or, for the "
"supported subset, :ref:`wlc`."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳດຽວກັນຍັງສາມາດຖືກກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`api` ຫຼື, ສຳລັບຊຸດຍ່ອຍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, :ref:`wlc`."

msgid ""
"Availability of individual actions depends on permissions, the configured "
"version control system, whether pushing is configured, and whether the "
"selected object can be locked."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງການກະທຳແຕ່ລະອັນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສິດທິ, ລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພຣັຊ "
"(pushing) ຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ບໍ່ວ່າວັດຖຸທີ່ເລືອກຈະສາມາດຖືກລັອກໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"Repository actions started from this view are queued for background "
"processing. For a project, Weblate processes the affected repositories "
"sequentially in one task and shows its progress. Repeating the same action "
"opens the existing task; a different action cannot be started for the same "
"repository until that task finishes."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The :guilabel:`File management` actions are available only "
#| "from :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` for an individual translation. "
#| "These actions rewrite that translation file and commit the result; they "
#| "are not project-wide or component-wide operations."
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Synchronize` and :guilabel:`Rescan` repository operations are "
"queued for background processing as described above. The "
"separate :guilabel:`File management` actions are available only for an "
"individual translation. They rewrite that translation file and commit the "
"result during the web request; they are not project-wide or component-wide "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳ :guilabel:`File management` ມີໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ຈາກ :guilabel:`Repository "
"maintenance` ສຳລັບການແປສ່ວນບຸກຄົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການກະທຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຂຽນໄຟລ໌ການແປນັ້ນໃໝ່ ແລະ "
"ຄອມມິດຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ; ພວກມັນບໍ່ແມ່ນການດຳເນີນການທົ່ວໂຄງການ ຫຼື ທົ່ວອົງປະກອບ."

msgid ""
"Operations that read repository content, such as updating, resetting, or "
"rescanning, also reconcile translation files in Weblate. Added or removed "
"translation files are reflected after this processing finishes. Glossary "
"language synchronization and cleanup are described in :ref:`glossary-"
"language-sync`."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ອ່ານເນື້ອຫາຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ, ເຊັ່ນ: ການອັບເດດ, ການຣີເຊັດ, ຫຼື ການສະແກນໃໝ່, "
"ຍັງເຮັດການປອງດອງໄຟລ໌ການແປໃນ Weblate. ໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມ ຫຼື "
"ລຶບອອກຈະສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນຫຼັງຈາກການປະມວນຜົນນີ້ສິ້ນສຸດລົງ. ການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນພາສາອະພິທານສັບ ແລະ "
"ການລຶບລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`glossary-language-sync`."

msgid "Action"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການ"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "ມັນເຮັດຫຍັງ"

msgid "Typical use"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ"

msgid ":guilabel:`Commit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ຄອມມິດ`"

msgid "Commits pending changes stored in Weblate to the local repository."
msgstr "ຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ເຊິ່ງເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Weblate ໄປຍັງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid "Flush pending Weblate changes before doing repository work elsewhere."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງການປ່ຽນແປງ Weblate ທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີບ່ອນອື່ນ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Push`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ພຸຊ`"

msgid "Pushes committed local repository changes to the configured upstream."
msgstr "ພຣັຊການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ຄອມມິດແລ້ວໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid ""
"Send committed translations upstream when automatic push is disabled or "
"delayed."
msgstr "ສົ່ງການແປທີ່ຄອມມິດແລ້ວໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງເມື່ອການພຣັຊອັດຕະໂນມັດຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ຖືກຊັກຊ້າ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Update`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ອັບເດດ`"

msgid ""
"Fetches upstream changes, integrates them using the component's "
"configured :ref:`component-merge_style`, and reconciles translation files."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຕົ້ນທາງ, ລວມເຂົ້າກັບມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`component-merge_style` "
"ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຂອງອົງປະກອບ, ແລະ ປອງດອງໄຟລ໌ການແປ."

msgid ""
"Bring Weblate in sync with upstream using the default integration strategy."
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນກັບຕົ້ນທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ຍຸດທະສາດການລວມແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Update with merge`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ອັບເດດດ້ວຍການລວມ`"

msgid "Fetches upstream changes and integrates them with an explicit merge."
msgstr "ດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ລວມເຂົ້າກັບມັນດ້ວຍການລວມທີ່ລະບຸຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ."

msgid "Override the default merge style for a single update."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຮູບແບບການລວມແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການອັບເດດດຽວ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Update with rebase`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ອັບເດດດ້ວຍການປ່ຽນຖານ (rebase)`"

msgid ""
"Fetches upstream changes and rebases local Weblate commits on top of "
"upstream."
msgstr "ດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ລີເບສ (rebases) ຄອມມິດ Weblate ທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃສ່ເທິງຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid "Keep history linear when that matches your workflow."
msgstr "ຮັກສາປະຫວັດໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ເມື່ອສິ່ງນັ້ນກົງກັບຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Update with merge without fast-forward`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ອັບເດດດ້ວຍການລວມແບບບໍ່ມີ fast-forward`"

msgid ""
"Fetches upstream changes and creates an explicit merge commit even when a "
"fast-forward would be possible."
msgstr ""
"ດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ສ້າງຄອມມິດການລວມທີ່ລະບຸຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການຟັສ-ຟໍຣ໌ເວີດ (fast-"
"forward) ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Preserve merge commits for auditing or branch-management reasons."
msgstr "ຮັກສາຄອມມິດການລວມໄວ້ເພື່ອເຫດຜົນດ້ານການກວດສອບ ຫຼື ການຈັດການສາຂາ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Lock` / :guilabel:`Unlock`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ລັອກ` / :guilabel:`ປົດລັອກ`"

msgid "Prevents or allows translators to make further changes in Weblate."
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນ ຫຼື ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ນັກແປເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ Weblate."

msgid ""
"Freeze translation changes while doing repository maintenance outside "
"Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ແຊ່ແຂງ (Freeze) ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີພາຍນອກ Weblate."

msgid ":guilabel:`Reset and discard`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ຣີເຊັດ ແລະ ຖິ້ມການປ່ຽນແປງ`"

msgid ""
"Resets Weblate's local repository to upstream, discards pending Weblate "
"changes, and reconciles translation files."
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ Weblate ໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງ, ຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງ Weblate ທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່, ແລະ "
"ປອງດອງໄຟລ໌ການແປ."

msgid "Use when upstream should overwrite the local Weblate repository state."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຕົ້ນທາງຄວນຂຽນທັບສະຖານະຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ Weblate ທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Reset and reapply`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ຣີເຊັດ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່`"

msgid ""
"Resets Weblate's local repository to upstream, reconciles translation files, "
"and reapplies pending translations. See :ref:`manage-vcs-reset-reapply`."
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ Weblate ໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງ, ປອງດອງໄຟລ໌ການແປ, ແລະ "
"ນຳໃຊ້ການແປທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ຄືນໃໝ່. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`manage-vcs-reset-reapply`."

msgid ""
"Recover from diverged history while keeping pending Weblate translations."
msgstr "ຟື້ນຟູຈາກປະຫວັດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາການແປ Weblate ທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid ":guilabel:`Cleanup`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ`"

msgid ""
"Removes untracked files and stale branches from the local repository "
"checkout."
msgstr "ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ເກົ່າແກ່ອອກຈາກການເຊັກເອົາ (checkout) ຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid ""
"Clean up leftover files or stale repository state in Weblate's checkout."
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຫຼືອຢູ່ ຫຼື ສະຖານະຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທີ່ເກົ່າແກ່ໃນການເຊັກເອົາຂອງ Weblate."

msgid ":guilabel:`Synchronize`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ`"

msgid ""
"Forces Weblate to write all known translations back to the repository files."
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ Weblate ຂຽນການແປທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກທັງໝົດກັບຄືນໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ."

msgid ""
"Repair cases where repository files became out of sync with the database "
"state."
msgstr "ສ້ອມແປງກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີບໍ່ຊິ້ງກັບສະຖານະຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Rescan`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ສະແກນໃໝ່`"

msgid ""
"Re-reads translation files from the local repository into Weblate and "
"removes translations whose files no longer match the component configuration."
msgstr ""
"ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ການແປຄືນໃໝ່ຈາກຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນເຂົ້າໄປໃນ Weblate ແລະ "
"ລຶບການແປທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງພວກມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງປະກອບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "Import file changes after manual repository work or file creation."
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າການປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັງຈາກການເຮັດວຽກຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌."

msgid ":guilabel:`Remove duplicates`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ລຶບລາຍການທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ`"

msgid ""
"Removes repeated strings with the same identifier from one translation file."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ້ຳໆທີ່ມີຕົວລະບຸອັນດຽວກັນອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ການແປອັນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Repair duplicate strings reported by Weblate when the file contains repeated "
"units."
msgstr "ສ້ອມແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ້ຳທີ່ Weblate ລາຍງານເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ມີໜ່ວຍຊ້ຳກັນ."

msgid ":guilabel:`Cleanup unused`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ລ້າງລາຍການທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້`"

msgid ""
"Removes strings no longer present in the base file from one translation "
"file. The :ref:`addon-weblate.cleanup.generic` add-on can perform this "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານອີກຕໍ່ໄປອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ການແປອັນດຽວ. add-on :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.cleanup.generic` ສາມາດປະຕິບັດສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Run a one-time cleanup without installing the add-on."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການລຶບລ້າງຄັ້ງດຽວໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ add-on."

msgid ":guilabel:`Remove obsolete`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ລຶບລາຍການທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ`"

msgid "Removes obsolete strings from one PO translation file."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ການແປ PO ອັນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Run a one-time PO cleanup without enabling automatic obsolete string removal."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການລຶບລ້າງ PO ຄັ້ງດຽວໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ການລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Reset and reapply recovery behavior"
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳການຟື້ນຟູການຣີເຊັດ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່"

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Reset and reapply` operation keeps pending translations from "
"Weblate while resetting the local repository state to match upstream."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການ :guilabel:`Reset and reapply` ຈະຮັກສາການແປທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ຈາກ Weblate "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຣີເຊັດສະຖານະຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕົ້ນທາງ."

msgid ""
"The operation can restore pending translations only when the target language "
"files still exist after the reset or when Weblate can create them for the "
"component, for example using a valid :ref:`component-new_base`."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການສາມາດກູ້ຄືນການແປທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ພາສາເປົ້າໝາຍຍັງມີຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກການຣີເຊັດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອ "
"Weblate ສາມາດສ້າງພວກມັນສຳລັບອົງປະກອບນັ້ນ, ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`component-new_base` "
"ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"If neither of these conditions is met, Weblate keeps the pending changes in "
"its database and reports a recovery error instead of failing later with a "
"generic parse error."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ມີເງື່ອນໄຂໃດໃນນີ້ຖືກຕອບສະໜອງ, Weblate ຈະຮັກສາການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນ ແລະ "
"ລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການຟື້ນຟູແທນທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວພາຍຫຼັງດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການແຍກວິເຄາະທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid "Avoiding merge conflicts by focusing on Git operations"
msgstr "ການຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມໂດຍການເນັ້ນໃສ່ການກະທຳຂອງ Git"

msgid ""
"Even when Weblate is the single source of the changes in the translation "
"files, conflicts can appear when using :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` add-"
"on, :ref:`component-merge_style` is configured to :guilabel:`Rebase`, or you "
"are squashing commits outside of Weblate (for example, when merging a pull "
"request)."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ Weblate ຈະເປັນແຫຼ່ງດຽວຂອງການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ການແປ, ຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ "
"add-on :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash`, :ref:`component-merge_style` "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ :guilabel:`Rebase`, ຫຼື ເຈົ້າກຳລັງສະຄວັຊ (squashing) ຄອມມິດນອກ Weblate "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມື່ອລວມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ - pull request)."

msgid ""
"The reason for merge conflicts is different in this case. Weblate can have "
"new local commits after you merge earlier Weblate commits upstream. This "
"typically happens if merging is not automated and changes wait for days or "
"weeks for a human review. Git is then sometimes no longer able to identify "
"upstream changes as matching the Weblate ones and refuses to perform a "
"rebase."
msgstr ""
"ເຫດຜົນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການລວມແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນກໍລະນີນີ້. Weblate "
"ສາມາດມີຄອມມິດທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກເຈົ້າລວມຄອມມິດ Weblate ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ເຂົ້າກັບຕົ້ນທາງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຖ້າການລວມບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງລໍຖ້າເປັນເວລາຫຼາຍມື້ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼາຍອາທິດເພື່ອໃຫ້ມະນຸດກວດສອບ. ບາງຄັ້ງ Git ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸການປ່ຽນແປງຕົ້ນທາງວ່າກົງກັບຂອງ Weblate "
"ແລະ ປະຕິເສດທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດການລີເບສ."

msgid ""
"Squash merging Weblate changes makes this harder to recover from. A squash "
"merge creates a new commit instead of preserving the individual Weblate "
"commits in the upstream history. Weblate still has the original commits in "
"its local repository, and Git can no longer prove that upstream already "
"contains them. If the conflict was also resolved manually, the file contents "
"can differ from both repositories, so Weblate can keep failing to update "
"even after the pull request was merged upstream."
msgstr ""
"ການລວມແບບສະຄວັຊ (Squash merging) ການປ່ຽນແປງ Weblate ເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຟື້ນຟູໄດ້ຍາກຂຶ້ນ. "
"ການລວມແບບສະຄວັຊຈະສ້າງຄອມມິດໃໝ່ແທນທີ່ຈະຮັກສາຄອມມິດ Weblate ແຕ່ລະອັນໃນປະຫວັດຕົ້ນທາງ. "
"Weblate ຍັງມີຄອມມິດເດີມຢູ່ໃນຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ແລະ Git "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດພິສູດໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປວ່າຕົ້ນທາງມີພວກມັນຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງຖືກແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, "
"ເນື້ອຫາໄຟລ໌ອາດແຕກຕ່າງຈາກທັງສອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ, ສະນັ້ນ Weblate "
"ສາມາດສືບຕໍ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການອັບເດດເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຫຼັງຈາກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (pull request) "
"ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຕົ້ນທາງແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"If upstream no longer contains Weblate commits because they were squash "
"merged, updating the repository might not be enough. Use :guilabel:`Reset "
"and reapply` from :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` to reset Weblate to "
"upstream while keeping pending translations; see :ref:`manage-vcs-reset-"
"reapply`. Use :guilabel:`Reset and discard` only when upstream should fully "
"replace Weblate's local changes."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕົ້ນທາງບໍ່ມີຄອມມິດ Weblate ອີກຕໍ່ໄປເພາະວ່າພວກມັນຖືກລວມແບບສະຄວັຊ, "
"ການອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີອາດບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Reset and reapply` "
"ຈາກ :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` ເພື່ອຣີເຊັດ Weblate "
"ໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາການແປທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່; ເບິ່ງ :ref:`manage-vcs-reset-reapply`. "
"ໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Reset and discard` ເມື່ອຕົ້ນທາງຄວນທົດແທນການປ່ຽນແປງທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ Weblate "
"ຢ່າງສົມບູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"To approach this, you either need to minimize the amount of pending changes "
"in Weblate when you merge a pull request, or avoid the conflicts completely "
"by not squashing changes."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮັບມືກັບສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຈຳນວນການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນ Weblate "
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລວມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ, ຫຼື ຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໂດຍການບໍ່ສະຄວັຊການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Here are few options how to avoid that:"
msgstr "ນີ້ຄືບາງທາງເລືອກໃນການຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນັ້ນ:"

msgid ""
"Do not use :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` or squash merging for Weblate "
"changes. Squashing is why Git might no longer recognize the changes after "
"merging."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` ຫຼື ການລວມແບບສະຄວັຊສຳລັບການປ່ຽນແປງ Weblate. "
"ການສະຄວັຊແມ່ນເຫດຜົນທີ່ Git ອາດບໍ່ຮັບຮູ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼັງຈາກການລວມ."

msgid ""
"When resolving conflicts outside Weblate, merge the Weblate commits with a "
"regular merge commit and push that result upstream. Do not squash merge the "
"conflict-resolution pull request."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງນອກ Weblate, ໃຫ້ລວມຄອມມິດ Weblate ດ້ວຍຄອມມິດການລວມແບບປົກກະຕິ ແລະ "
"ພຣັຊຜົນນັ້ນໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງ. ຢ່າສະຄວັຊລວມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງ."

msgid ""
"Let Weblate commit pending changes before merging. This will update the pull "
"request with all its changes, and both repositories will be in sync."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ Weblate ຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ກ່ອນການລວມ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະອັບເດດຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ, ແລະ ທັງສອງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີຈະຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນກັນ."

msgid ""
"Use the review features in Weblate (see :doc:`/workflows`) so that you can "
"automatically merge GitHub pull requests after CI passes."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການກວດສອບໃນ Weblate (ເບິ່ງ :doc:`/workflows`) "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດລວມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ GitHub ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກ CI ຜ່ານ."

msgid ""
"Use locking in Weblate to avoid changes while GitHub pull request is in "
"review."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການລັອກໃນ Weblate ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ GitHub "
"ກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນການກວດສອບ."

msgid "Code-hosting notifications"
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈາກບໍລິການຝາກໂຄ້ດ"

msgid ""
"Provider-specific app and webhook instructions for GitHub, GitLab, "
"Bitbucket, Pagure, Azure Repos, Gitea, Forgejo, and Gitee are covered "
"in :doc:`/admin/code-hosting`."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳແນະນຳແອັບ ແລະ ເວັບຮຸກ (webhook) ສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສຳລັບ GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket, "
"Pagure, Azure Repos, Gitea, Forgejo, ແລະ Gitee ຖືກກວມເອົາໃນ :doc:`/admin/code-"
"hosting`."

msgid "Provider-specific notifications"
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ"

msgid ""
"These legacy anchors are kept for compatibility. Current provider-specific "
"app and webhook setup is documented in :doc:`/admin/code-hosting`."
msgstr ""
"ແອນເຄີ (anchors) ເດີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແອັບ ແລະ "
"ເວັບຮຸກສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໃນປັດຈຸບັນຖືກເອກະສານໄວ້ໃນ :doc:`/admin/code-hosting`."

msgid ":ref:`GitHub notifications <code-hosting-github-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ GitHub <code-hosting-github-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`GitLab notifications <code-hosting-gitlab-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ GitLab <code-hosting-gitlab-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`Bitbucket notifications <code-hosting-bitbucket-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Bitbucket <code-hosting-bitbucket-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`Pagure notifications <code-hosting-pagure-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Pagure <code-hosting-pagure-notifications>`"

msgid ""
":ref:`Azure Repos notifications <code-hosting-azure-repos-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Azure Repos <code-hosting-azure-repos-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`Gitea notifications <code-hosting-gitea-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Gitea <code-hosting-gitea-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`Forgejo notifications <code-hosting-forgejo-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Forgejo <code-hosting-forgejo-notifications>`"

msgid ":ref:`Gitee notifications <code-hosting-gitee-notifications>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Gitee <code-hosting-gitee-notifications>`"

msgid "Automatically updating repositories nightly"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຕອນກາງຄືນ"

msgid ""
"Weblate automatically fetches remote repositories nightly to improve "
"performance when merging changes later. You can optionally turn this into "
"doing nightly merges as well, by enabling :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate "
"ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທາງໄກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຕອນກາງຄືນເພື່ອປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບເມື່ອລວມການປ່ຽນແປງໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນການລວມໃນຕອນກາງຄືນໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, "
"ໂດຍການເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE`."

msgid ""
"Each translation component can have a push URL set up (see :ref:`component-"
"push`), and in that case Weblate will be able to push changes to the remote "
"repository. Weblate can also be configured to automatically push changes on "
"every commit, see :ref:`component-push_on_commit`."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະອົງປະກອບການແປສາມາດມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ push URL (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`component-push`), ແລະ "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ Weblate ຈະສາມາດພຣັຊການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີທາງໄກ. Weblate "
"ຍັງສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ພຣັຊການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນທຸກຄອມມິດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`component-"
"push_on_commit`."

msgid ""
"For the push options table and provider-specific pull, merge, and review "
"request workflows, see :ref:`code-hosting-push-options`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງທາງເລືອກການພຣັຊ ແລະ ຂະບວນການຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ, ລວມ, ແລະ "
"ກວດສອບສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`code-hosting-push-options`."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`vcs-repos` for setting up SSH keys, and :ref:`lazy-commit` for "
"info about when Weblate decides to commit changes."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`vcs-repos` ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH keys, ແລະ :ref:`lazy-commit` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເວລາທີ່ Weblate ຕັດສິນໃຈຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Protected branches"
msgstr "ສາຂາທີ່ຖືກປົກປ້ອງ"

msgid ""
"If you are using Weblate on protected branch, you can configure it to use "
"pull requests and perform actual review on the translations (what might be "
"problematic for languages you do not know). An alternative approach is to "
"waive this limitation for the Weblate push user."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ Weblate ໃນສາຂາທີ່ຖືກປົກປ້ອງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າມັນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ "
"ດຳເນີນການກວດສອບການແປຕົວຈິງ (ສິ່ງທີ່ອາດເປັນບັນຫາສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້). "
"ວິທີທາງເລືອກແມ່ນການຍົກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ Weblate push."

msgid "For example on GitHub this can be done in the repository configuration:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໃນ GitHub ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ:"

msgid "Interacting with others"
msgstr "ການພົວພັນກັບຄົນອື່ນ"

msgid "Weblate makes it easy to interact with others using its API."
msgstr "Weblate ເຮັດໃຫ້ການພົວພັນກັບຄົນອື່ນເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ API ຂອງມັນ."

msgid "Lazy commits"
msgstr "Lazy commits"

msgid ""
"The behaviour of Weblate is to group commits from the same author into one "
"commit if possible. This greatly reduces the number of commits, however you "
"might need to explicitly tell it to do the commits in case you want to get "
"the VCS repository in sync, e.g. for merge (this is by default allowed for "
"the :guilabel:`Managers` group, see :ref:`privileges`)."
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ Weblate ແມ່ນການຈັດກຸ່ມຄອມມິດຈາກຜູ້ຂຽນດຽວກັນເຂົ້າເປັນຄອມມິດດຽວຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຄອມມິດໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, "
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງບອກມັນຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງໃຫ້ເຮັດຄອມມິດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຊິ້ງຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ VCS, "
"ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບການລວມ (ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກອະນຸຍາດໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບກຸ່ມ :guilabel:`Managers`, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`privileges`)."

msgid ""
"The changes in this mode are committed once any of the following conditions "
"are fulfilled:"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂໝດນີ້ຈະຖືກຄອມມິດເມື່ອເງື່ອນໄຂໃດໜຶ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກຕອບສະໜອງ:"

msgid "Somebody else changes an already changed string."
msgstr "ຜູ້ອື່ນປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງແລ້ວ."

msgid "A merge from upstream occurs."
msgstr "ການລວມຈາກຕົ້ນທາງເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "An explicit commit is requested."
msgstr "ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍຄອມມິດຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ."

msgid "A file download is requested."
msgstr "ມີການຮ້ອງຂໍດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Change is older than period defined as :ref:`component-commit_pending_age` "
"on :ref:`component`."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນແປງເກົ່າກວ່າໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນ :ref:`component-commit_pending_age` "
"ໃນ :ref:`component`."

msgid ""
"Commits are created for every component. So in case you have many components "
"you will still see lot of commits. You might utilize :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.git.squash` add-on in that case."
msgstr ""
"ຄອມມິດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບທຸກອົງປະກອບ. ສະນັ້ນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບ "
"ເຈົ້າຍັງຈະເຫັນຄອມມິດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ເຈົ້າອາດໃຊ້ add-on :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If you want to commit changes more frequently and without checking of age, "
"you can schedule a regular task to perform a commit. This can be done "
"using :guilabel:`Periodic Tasks` in :ref:`admin-interface`. First create "
"desired :guilabel:`Interval` (for example 120 seconds). Then add new "
"periodic task and choose ``weblate.trans.tasks.commit_pending`` "
"as :guilabel:`Task` with ``{\"hours\": 0}`` as :guilabel:`Keyword Arguments` "
"and desired interval."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງເລື້ອຍໆຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບອາຍຸ, "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຕາຕະລາງວຽກງານປົກກະຕິເພື່ອປະຕິບັດຄອມມິດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Periodic Tasks` ໃນ :ref:`admin-interface`. "
"ກ່ອນອື່ນໃຫ້ສ້າງ :guilabel:`Interval` ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (ຕົວຢ່າງ 120 ວິນາທີ). "
"ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມວຽກງານປົກກະຕິໃໝ່ ແລະ ເລືອກ ``weblate.trans.tasks.commit_pending`` "
"ເປັນ :guilabel:`Task` ດ້ວຍ ``{\"hours\": 0}`` ເປັນ :guilabel:`Keyword "
"Arguments` ແລະ ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

msgid "Processing repository with scripts"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບ"

msgid ""
"The way to customize how Weblate interacts with the repository "
"is :ref:`addons`. Consult :ref:`addon-script` for info on how to execute "
"external scripts through add-ons."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການປັບແຕ່ງວິທີທີ່ Weblate ພົວພັນກັບຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີແມ່ນ :ref:`addons`. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`addon-script` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປະຕິບັດສະຄຣິບພາຍນອກຜ່ານ add-ons."

msgid "Keeping translations same across components"
msgstr "ການຮັກສາການແປໃຫ້ຄືກັນໃນທຸກອົງປະກອບ"

msgid ""
"Once you have multiple translation components, you might want to ensure that "
"the same strings have same translation. This can be achieved at several "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າມີຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບການແປ, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການຮັບປະກັນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນມີການແປດຽວກັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດບັນລຸໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍລະດັບ."

msgid "Translation propagation"
msgstr "ການແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍການແປ"

msgid ""
"With :ref:`component-allow_translation_propagation` enabled (what is the "
"default, see :ref:`component`), all new translations are automatically done "
"in all components with matching strings. Such translations are properly "
"credited to currently translating user in all components."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍການເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`component-allow_translation_propagation` (ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`component`), ການແປໃໝ່ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນທຸກອົງປະກອບທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນ. "
"ການແປດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຖືກໃຫ້ເຄຣດິດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ກຳລັງແປໃນທຸກອົງປະກອບ."

msgid "Propagation preconditions:"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຂອງການແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍ:"

msgid ""
"All components have to reside in a single project (linking component is not "
"enough)."
msgstr "ທຸກອົງປະກອບຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໂຄງການດຽວ (ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງອົງປະກອບບໍ່ພຽງພໍ)."

msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`component-allow_translation_propagation` to automatically reuse "
"translations for matching strings."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`component-allow_translation_propagation` "
"ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການແປຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
"The translation propagation requires the key to be match for monolingual "
"translation formats, so keep that in mind when creating translation keys."
msgstr ""
"ການແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍການແປຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄີກົງກັນສຳລັບຮູບແບບການແປພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນຈົ່ງຈື່ໄວ້ເມື່ອສ້າງຄີການແປ."

msgid ""
"The strings are propagated while translating, strings loaded from the "
"repository are not propagated."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍໃນຂະນະທີ່ແປ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໂຫຼດຈາກຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຜ່ຂະຫຍາຍ."

msgid ""
"This feature currently has limitations, and we want to make it more "
"universal. Please share your feedback at https://github.com/WeblateOrg/"
"weblate/issues/3166."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ, ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນສາກົນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ກະລຸນາແບ່ງປັນຄຳຕິຊົມຂອງເຈົ້າທີ່ https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/issues/3166."

msgid "Consistency check"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງ"

msgid ""
"The :ref:`check-inconsistent` check fires whenever the strings are "
"different. You can utilize this to review such differences manually and "
"choose the right translation."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-inconsistent` ຈະເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອທົບທວນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງດັ່ງກ່າວດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ເລືອກການແປທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Automatic translation"
msgstr "ການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid ""
"Automatic translation based on different components can be way to "
"synchronize the translations across components. You can either trigger it "
"manually (see :ref:`auto-translation`) or make it run automatically on "
"repository update using add-on (see :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate`)."
msgstr ""
"ການແປອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆສາມາດເປັນວິທີໃນການຊິ້ງການແປຂ້າມອົງປະກອບ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກະຕຸ້ນມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`auto-translation`) ຫຼື "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການອັບເດດຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີໂດຍໃຊ້ add-on (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate`)."

msgid "Customizing Weblate"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Extend and customize using Django and Python. Contribute your changes "
"upstream so that everybody can benefit. This reduces your maintenance costs; "
"code in Weblate is taken care of when changing internal interfaces or "
"refactoring the code."
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Django ແລະ Python. "
"ປະກອບສ່ວນການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເຈົ້າໄປຍັງຕົ້ນທາງເພື່ອໃຫ້ທຸກຄົນໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຕົ້ນທຶນການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຂອງເຈົ້າ; ໂຄດໃນ Weblate "
"ຈະຖືກດູແລເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງອິນເຕີເຟສພາຍໃນ ຫຼື ການຣີແຟັກເຕີ (refactoring) ໂຄດ."

msgid "You can also customize Weblate look in :ref:`manage-appearance`."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຮູບລັກສະນະຂອງ Weblate ໃນ :ref:`manage-appearance`."

msgid ""
"Neither internal interfaces nor templates are considered a stable API. "
"Please review your customizations for every upgrade, the interfaces or their "
"semantics might change without notice."
msgstr ""
"ທັງອິນເຕີເຟສພາຍໃນ ແລະ ເທມເພລດບໍ່ຖືວ່າເປັນ API ທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ. "
"ກະລຸນາທົບທວນການປັບແຕ່ງຂອງເຈົ້າສຳລັບທຸກການອັບເກຣດ, ອິນເຕີເຟສ ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງພວກມັນອາດປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແຈ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າ."

msgid "Creating a Python module"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໂມດູນ Python"

msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with Python, you might want to look into `Python For "
"Beginners <https://www.python.org/about/gettingstarted/>`_, explaining the "
"basics and pointing to further tutorials."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບ Python, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການເບິ່ງ `Python For Beginners <https://"
"www.python.org/about/gettingstarted/>`_, ເຊິ່ງອະທິບາຍພື້ນຖານ ແລະ ຊີ້ໄປຫາບົດຮຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"To write a file with custom Python code (called a module), a place to store "
"it is needed, either in the system path (usually something like :file:`/usr/"
"lib/python3.12/site-packages/`) or in the Weblate directory, which is also "
"added to the interpreter search path."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຂຽນໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍໂຄດ Python ແບບກຳນົດເອງ (ເອີ້ນວ່າໂມດູນ), ຕ້ອງການບ່ອນເກັບມັນ, "
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງລະບົບ (ປົກກະຕິຄື :file:`/usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/`) ຫຼື "
"ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ Weblate, ເຊິ່ງຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນເສັ້ນທາງການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງອິນເຕີພຣີເຕີ (interpreter)."

msgid ""
"When :ref:`using Docker <docker-deploy>`, you can place Python modules "
"in :file:`/app/data/python/` (see :ref:`docker-volume`), so they can be "
"loaded by Weblate, for example from a :ref:`settings override file <docker-"
"settings-override>`."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ :ref:`using Docker <docker-deploy>`, ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງໂມດູນ Python ໃນ :file:`/"
"app/data/python/` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-volume`), ເພື່ອໃຫ້ Weblate ສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຈາກ :ref:`settings override file <docker-settings-override>`."

msgid "Better yet, turn your customization into a proper Python package:"
msgstr "ດີກວ່ານັ້ນ, ປ່ຽນການປັບແຕ່ງຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫ້ເປັນແພັກເກັດ Python ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ:"

msgid "Create a folder for your package (we will use `weblate_customization`)."
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຟນເດີສຳລັບແພັກເກັດຂອງເຈົ້າ (ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ `weblate_customization`)."

msgid ""
"Within it, create a :file:`pyproject.toml` file to describe the package:"
msgstr "ພາຍໃນນັ້ນ, ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ :file:`pyproject.toml` ເພື່ອອະທິບາຍແພັກເກັດ:"

msgid ""
"Create a folder for the Python module: :file:`src/weblate_customization`"
msgstr "ສ້າງໂຟນເດີສຳລັບໂມດູນ Python: :file:`src/weblate_customization`"

msgid ""
"Within it, create a :file:`__init__.py` file to ensure Python can import the "
"module."
msgstr ""
"ພາຍໃນນັ້ນ, ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ :file:`__init__.py` ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າ Python ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໂມດູນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"This package can now be installed using :command:`uv pip install -e`. More "
"info to be found in `Editable packages documentation`_."
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດນີ້ສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ :command:`uv pip install -e`. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມສາມາດພົບໄດ້ໃນ "
"`Editable packages documentation`_."

msgid ""
"Once installed, the module can be used in the Weblate configuration (for "
"example ``weblate_customization.checks.FooCheck``)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ໂມດູນສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Weblate (ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"``weblate_customization.checks.FooCheck``)."

msgid "Your package structure should look like this:"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງແພັກເກັດຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນມີລັກສະນະນີ້:"

msgid ""
"You can find an example of customizing Weblate at <https://github.com/"
"WeblateOrg/customize-example>, it covers all the topics described below."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດພົບຕົວຢ່າງການປັບແຕ່ງ Weblate ທີ່ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/customize-"
"example>, ມັນກວມເອົາທຸກຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

msgid "Changing the logo"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນໂລໂກ້"

msgid ""
"Create a simple Django app containing the static files you want to overwrite "
"(see :ref:`custom-module`)."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງແອັບ Django ງ່າຍໆທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ສະຕິກ (static files) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຂຽນທັບ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-"
"module`)."

msgid "Branding appears in the following files:"
msgstr "ການສ້າງແບຣນປາກົດໃນໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Logo shown in the navigation bar."
msgstr "ໂລໂກ້ສະແດງໃນແຖບນຳທາງ."

msgid "Web icons depending on screen resolution and web-browser."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເວັບຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມລະອຽດໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ເວັບບຣາວເຊີ."

msgid "Web icon used by legacy browsers."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເວັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍບຣາວເຊີລຸ້ນເກົ່າ."

msgid ""
"Avatars for bots or anonymous users. Some web-browsers use these as shortcut "
"icons."
msgstr "ອະວະຕາສຳລັບບອທ໌ ຫຼື ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸຊື່. ບາງເວັບບຣາວເຊີໃຊ້ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນໄອຄອນທາງລັດ."

msgid "Used in notifications e-mails."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໃນອີເມວການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

msgid "Add it to :setting:`django:INSTALLED_APPS`:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມມັນໃສ່ :setting:`django:INSTALLED_APPS`:"

msgid ""
"Run :samp:`weblate collectstatic --noinput`, to collect static files served "
"to clients."
msgstr ""
"ແລ່ນ :samp:`weblate collectstatic --noinput`, ເພື່ອເກັບໄຟລ໌ສະຕິກທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແກ່ລູກຄ້າ."

msgid "Custom quality checks, add-ons, automatic suggestions and auto-fixes"
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບແບບກຳນົດເອງ, add-ons, ຄຳແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid ""
"To install your code for :ref:`custom-autofix`, :ref:`own-"
"checks`, :ref:`custom-machinery` or :ref:`own-addon` in Weblate:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໂຄດຂອງເຈົ້າສຳລັບ :ref:`custom-autofix`, :ref:`own-checks`, :ref:`custom-"
"machinery` ຫຼື :ref:`own-addon` ໃນ Weblate:"

msgid ""
"Place the files into your Python module containing the Weblate customization "
"(see :ref:`custom-module` or :ref:`docker-python-override`)."
msgstr ""
"ວາງໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນ Python ຂອງເຈົ້າທີ່ມີການປັບແຕ່ງ Weblate (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-"
"module` ຫຼື :ref:`docker-python-override`)."

msgid ""
"Add its fully-qualified path to the Python class in the dedicated settings:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ຂອງມັນໃສ່ຄລາສ Python ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະ:"

msgid "Weblate deployments"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Weblate can be easily installed in your cloud. Please find detailed guide "
"for your platform:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍໃນຄລາວຂອງເຈົ້າ. "
"ກະລຸນາຊອກຫາຄຳແນະນຳລະອຽດສຳລັບແພລັດຟອມຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

msgid "Third-party deployments for Weblate"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ Weblate ໂດຍພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ"

msgid ""
"Following deployments are not developed or supported by Weblate team. Parts "
"of the setup might vary from what is described in this documentation."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳໃຊ້ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກພັດທະນາ ຫຼື ສະໜັບສະໜູນໂດຍທີມງານ Weblate. "
"ບາງສ່ວນຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າອາດແຕກຕ່າງຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານນີ້."

msgid "Weblate Cloudron Package"
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດ Weblate Cloudron"

msgid ""
"`Cloudron <https://www.cloudron.io/>`_ is a platform for self-hosting web "
"applications. Weblate installed with Cloudron will be automatically kept up-"
"to-date. The package is maintained by the Cloudron team; see the `Weblate "
"package documentation <https://docs.cloudron.io/packages/weblate/>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Cloudron <https://www.cloudron.io/>`_ "
"ແມ່ນແພລດຟອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງເວັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. Weblate ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ Cloudron "
"ຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ແພັກເກດນີ້ຖືກດູແລໂດຍທີມງານ Cloudron; ເບິ່ງ `ເອກະສານແພັກເກດ "
"Weblate <https://docs.cloudron.io/packages/weblate/>`_."

msgid "Install Weblate with Cloudron"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ດ້ວຍ Cloudron"

msgid "Weblate in YunoHost"
msgstr "Weblate ໃນ YunoHost"

msgid ""
"The self-hosting project `YunoHost <https://yunohost.org/>`_ provides a "
"package for Weblate. Once you have your YunoHost installation, you may "
"install Weblate as any other application. It will provide you with a fully "
"working stack with backup and restoration, but you may still have to edit "
"your settings file for specific usages."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງການໂຮສຕິງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ `YunoHost <https://yunohost.org/>`_ ໃຫ້ແພັກເກັດສຳລັບ "
"Weblate. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ YunoHost ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate "
"ເໝືອນກັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໆ. ມັນຈະໃຫ້ສະແຕັກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ກັບການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຍັງອາດຈະຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະ."

msgid ""
"You may use your administration interface, or this button (it will bring you "
"to your server):"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າອາດໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟສການບໍລິຫານຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຫຼື ປຸ່ມນີ້ (ມັນຈະນຳເຈົ້າໄປຫາເຊີບເວີຂອງເຈົ້າ):"

msgid "Install Weblate with YunoHost"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ດ້ວຍ YunoHost"

msgid "It also is possible to use the command-line interface:"
msgstr "ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງອິນເຕີເຟສ (command-line interface) ໄດ້:"

msgid "Quick setup guide"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນ"

msgid "Configuration instructions"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

msgid "Installing Weblate"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Depending on your setup and experience, choose an appropriate installation "
"method for you:"
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ປະສົບການຂອງເຈົ້າ, ຈົ່ງເລືອກວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບເຈົ້າ:"

msgid ":doc:`install/docker`, recommended for production setups."
msgstr ":doc:`install/docker`, ແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນການຜະລິດ (production)."

msgid "Virtualenv installation, recommended for production setups:"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Virtualenv, ແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນການຜະລິດ:"

msgid ":doc:`install/source`, recommended for development."
msgstr ":doc:`install/source`, ແນະນຳສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ."

msgid "Architecture overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ"

msgid "Web server"
msgstr "ເວັບເຊີເວີ"

msgid "Handling incoming HTTP requests, :ref:`static-files`."
msgstr "ຈັດການການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ຂາເຂົ້າ, :ref:`static-files`."

msgid "Celery workers"
msgstr "Celery workers"

msgid ":ref:`celery` are executed here."
msgstr ":ref:`celery` ຖືກປະຕິບັດທີ່ນີ້."

msgid ""
"Depending on your workload, you might want to customize the number of "
"workers."
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະລິມານວຽກງານຂອງເຈົ້າ, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງຈຳນວນ workers."

msgid "Use dedicated node when scaling Weblate horizontally."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂນດ (node) ສະເພາະເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ Weblate ທາງນອນ."

msgid "Application server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

msgid "A WSGI or ASGI server serving web pages to users."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ WSGI ຫຼື ASGI ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການເວັບໄຊແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL database server for storing all the content, see :ref:`database-"
"setup`."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL ສຳລັບເກັບເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`database-setup`."

msgid ""
"Use dedicated database node for sites with hundreds of millions of hosted "
"words."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂນດຖານຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທີ່ມີຄຳສັບທີ່ຖືກໂຮສຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍລ້ານຄຳ."

msgid "Datastore"
msgstr "Datastore"

msgid ""
"Key/value datastore such as Valkey or Redis server for cache and tasks "
"queue, see :ref:`celery`."
msgstr ""
"Key/value datastore ເຊັ່ນ Valkey ຫຼື Redis server ສຳລັບແຄຊ (cache) ແລະ ຄິວວຽກງານ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`celery`."

msgid "File system"
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌"

msgid ""
"File system storage for storing VCS repositories and uploaded user data. "
"This is shared by all the processes."
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບເກັບຮີໂປຊິທໍຣີ VCS ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກແບ່ງປັນໂດຍທຸກຂະບວນການ."

msgid "Use networked storage when scaling Weblate horizontally."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບເນັດເວີກເມື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ Weblate ທາງນອນ."

msgid "E-mail server"
msgstr "ອີເມວເຊີບເວີ"

msgid ""
"SMTP server for outgoing e-mail, see :ref:`out-mail`. It can be provided "
"externally."
msgstr "ເຊີບເວີ SMTP ສຳລັບອີເມວຂາອອກ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`out-mail`. ມັນສາມາດຖືກຈັດຫາໂດຍພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
":doc:`/admin/install/docker` includes PostgreSQL and Valkey, making the "
"installation easier."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/admin/install/docker` ລວມມີ PostgreSQL ແລະ Valkey, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Software requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຊອບແວ"

msgid "Operating system"
msgstr "ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

msgid ""
"Weblate is known to work on Linux, FreeBSD and macOS. Other Unix like "
"systems will most likely work too."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກວ່າເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໃນ Linux, FreeBSD ແລະ macOS. ລະບົບອື່ນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄື Unix "
"ສ່ວນຫຼາຍກໍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid ""
"Weblate is not supported on Windows. But it may still work and patches are "
"happily accepted."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນ Windows. ແຕ່ມັນອາດຈະຍັງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ແລະ ແພັດຊ໌ (patches) "
"ຕ່າງໆກໍຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບ."

msgid ""
":ref:`architecture` describes overall Weblate architecture and required "
"services."
msgstr ""
":ref:`architecture` ອະທິບາຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ Weblate ໂດຍລວມ ແລະ ການບໍລິການທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

msgid "Python dependencies"
msgstr "Python dependencies"

msgid ""
"Weblate is written in `Python <https://www.python.org/>`_ and supports "
"Python 3.12 or newer. You can install dependencies using pip or from your "
"distribution packages, full list is available in :file:`requirements.txt`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຖືກຂຽນດ້ວຍ `Python <https://www.python.org/>`_ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບ Python 3.12 ຫຼື "
"ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ໂດຍໃຊ້ pip ຫຼື ຈາກແພັກເກັດການແຈກຢາຍຂອງເຈົ້າ, "
"ລາຍການເຕັມມີຢູ່ໃນ :file:`requirements.txt`."

msgid "Most notable dependencies:"
msgstr "Dependencies ທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດ:"

