msgstr ":ref:`mt-google-translate-api-v3` ພ້ອມຮອງຮັບອະພິທານສັບ"

msgid "PostgreSQL, see :ref:`database-setup`"
msgstr "PostgreSQL, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`database-setup`"

msgid "Integrating SAML 2 IDP into Weblate"
msgstr "ການລວມ SAML 2 IDP ເຂົ້າໃນ Weblate"

msgid ":pypi:`Sphinx`"
msgstr ":pypi:`Sphinx`"

msgid "Needed for :ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.sphinx`"
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ :ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.sphinx`"

msgid "Hosted Weblate integration"
msgstr "ການລວມ Hosted Weblate"

msgid "WSGI server for Weblate"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ WSGI ສຳລັບ Weblate"

msgid ""
"When installing using pip, you can directly specify desired features when "
"installing:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ pip, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້ໂດຍກົງເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

msgid "Or you can install Weblate with all optional features:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມທັງໝົດ:"

msgid "Or you can install Weblate without any optional features:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມໃດໆ:"

msgid "Troubleshooting pip install"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ pip install"

msgid ""
"This is caused by incompatibility of binary packages distributed via PyPI "
"with the distribution. To address this, you need to rebuild the package on "
"your system:"
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ເກີດຈາກຄວາມບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນຂອງແພັກເກັດໄບນາຣີທີ່ແຈກຢາຍຜ່ານ PyPI ກັບການແຈກຢາຍ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງແພັກເກັດຄືນໃໝ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

msgid ""
"This is a known issue of the xmlsec package, please see https://github.com/"
"xmlsec/python-xmlsec/issues/314."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນບັນຫາທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນດີຂອງແພັກເກັດ xmlsec, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ https://github.com/xmlsec/python-"
"xmlsec/issues/314."

msgid ""
"The ``lxml`` and ``xmlsec`` packages have to be built against one "
"``libxml2``. You should build them locally to avoid this issue:"
msgstr ""
"ແພັກເກັດ ``lxml`` ແລະ ``xmlsec`` ຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ ``libxml2`` ອັນດຽວ. "
"ເຈົ້າຄວນສ້າງພວກມັນໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫານີ້:"

msgid "Other system requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການລະບົບອື່ນໆ"

msgid "The following dependencies have to be installed on the system:"
msgstr "Dependencies ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບ:"

msgid "https://git-scm.com/"
msgstr "https://git-scm.com/"

msgid "``git-review`` (optional for Gerrit support)"
msgstr "``git-review`` (ເສີມສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບ Gerrit)"

msgid "``git-svn`` (optional for Subversion support)"
msgstr "``git-svn`` (ເສີມສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບ Subversion)"

msgid "https://git-scm.com/docs/git-svn"
msgstr "https://git-scm.com/docs/git-svn"

msgid ""
"``tesseract`` (needed only if :program:`tesserocr` binary wheels are not "
"available for your system)"
msgstr ""
"``tesseract`` (ຕ້ອງການກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ :program:`tesserocr` binary wheels "
"ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບລະບົບຂອງເຈົ້າ)"

msgid "https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract"
msgstr "https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract"

msgid "Build-time dependencies"
msgstr "Dependencies ໃນເວລາສ້າງ (Build-time)"

msgid ""
"To build some of the :ref:`python-deps` you might need to install their "
"dependencies. This depends on how you install them, so please consult "
"individual packages for documentation. You won't need those if using "
"prebuilt ``Wheels`` while installing using ``pip`` or when you use "
"distribution packages."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສ້າງບາງ :ref:`python-deps` ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ dependencies ຂອງພວກມັນ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວິທີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ, ສະນັ້ນກະລຸນາປຶກສາເອກະສານຂອງແພັກເກັດແຕ່ລະອັນ. "
"ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງການພວກມັນຖ້າໃຊ້ ``Wheels`` ທີ່ສ້າງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ ``pip`` ຫຼື "
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ແພັກເກັດການແຈກຢາຍ."

msgid "Verifying release artifacts"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບອະຕິເຟກ (artifacts) ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ"

msgid ""
"Release archives can be verified using the signatures, attestations, and "
"SBOMs published with GitHub release assets. See :ref:`verify`."
msgstr ""
"ອະໄຄບ໌ (archives) ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນສາມາດຖືກກວດສອບໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍເຊັນ, ການຮັບຮອງ, ແລະ SBOMs "
"ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ພ້ອມກັບຊັບສິນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ GitHub. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`verify`."

msgid "Filesystem permissions"
msgstr "ສິດທິລະບົບໄຟລ໌"

msgid ""
"The Weblate process needs to be able to read and write to the directory "
"where it keeps data - :setting:`DATA_DIR`. All files within this directory "
"should be owned and writable by the user running all Weblate processes "
"(typically WSGI and Celery, see :ref:`server` and :ref:`celery`)."
msgstr ""
"ຂະບວນການ Weblate ຕ້ອງສາມາດອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີບ່ອນທີ່ມັນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ "
"- :setting:`DATA_DIR`. ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດພາຍໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຄວນເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ແລ່ນຂະບວນການ Weblate ທັງໝົດ (ປົກກະຕິຄື WSGI ແລະ Celery, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`server` ແລະ :ref:`celery`)."

msgid ""
"The default configuration places them in the same tree as the Weblate "
"sources, however you might prefer to move these to a better location such "
"as: :file:`/var/lib/weblate`."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນວາງພວກມັນໄວ້ໃນທຣີດຽວກັນກັບແຫຼ່ງ Weblate, "
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍພວກມັນໄປບ່ອນທີ່ດີກວ່າ ເຊັ່ນ: :file:`/var/lib/weblate`."

msgid ""
"Weblate tries to create these directories automatically, but it will fail "
"when it does not have permissions to do so."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ພະຍາຍາມສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວເມື່ອບໍ່ມີສິດທິໃນການເຮັດດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid ""
"The configured :setting:`CACHE_DIR` also has to be writable by the Weblate "
"process and has to allow executing generated helper files. Do not "
"mount :setting:`CACHE_DIR` with the ``noexec`` option."
msgstr ""
":setting:`CACHE_DIR` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ຍັງຕ້ອງສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້ໂດຍຂະບວນການ Weblate ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດໄຟລ໌ຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຢ່າເມົາທ໌ (mount) :setting:`CACHE_DIR` "
"ດ້ວຍທາງເລືອກ ``noexec``."

msgid ""
"You should also take care when running :ref:`manage`, as they should be ran "
"under the same user as Weblate itself is running, otherwise permissions on "
"some files might be wrong."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງຄວນລະມັດລະວັງເມື່ອແລ່ນ :ref:`manage`, ເພາະພວກມັນຄວນຖືກແລ່ນພາຍໃຕ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ດຽວກັນກັບ "
"Weblate, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນສິດທິໃນບາງໄຟລ໌ອາດຈະຜິດພາດ."

msgid ""
"In the Docker container, all files in the :file:`/app/data` volume have to "
"be owned by the ``weblate`` user inside the container (UID 1000)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ Docker, ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດໃນໂວລຸມ :file:`/app/data` ຕ້ອງເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"``weblate`` ພາຍໃນຄອນເທນເນີ (UID 1000)."

msgid "Database setup for Weblate"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ Weblate"

msgid "It is recommended to run Weblate with a PostgreSQL database server."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ແລ່ນ Weblate ກັບເຊີບເວີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ PostgreSQL."

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL 13 and higher is supported. PostgreSQL 15 or newer is recommended."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ PostgreSQL 13 ແລະ ສູງກວ່າ. ແນະນຳ PostgreSQL 15 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid "Database connections"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid ""
"In the default configuration, each Weblate process keeps a persistent "
"connection to the database. Persistent connections improve Weblate "
"responsiveness, but might require more resources for the database server. "
"Please consult :setting:`django:CONN_MAX_AGE` and :ref:`django:persistent-"
"database-connections` for more info."
msgstr ""
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ລະຂະບວນການ Weblate ຈະຮັກສາການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຖາວອນກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບຖາວອນຈະຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງການຕອບສະໜອງຂອງ Weblate, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບເຊີບເວີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. "
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :setting:`django:CONN_MAX_AGE` ແລະ :ref:`django:persistent-database-"
"connections` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Weblate needs at least the following number of connections:"
msgstr "Weblate ຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍຕາມຈຳນວນນີ້:"

msgid ":math:`(4 \\times \\mathit{nCPUs}) + 2` for Celery processes"
msgstr ":math:`(4 \\times \\mathit{nCPUs}) + 2` ສຳລັບຂະບວນການ Celery"

msgid ":math:`\\mathit{nCPUs} + 1` for WSGI workers"
msgstr ":math:`\\mathit{nCPUs} + 1` ສຳລັບ WSGI workers"

msgid ""
"This applies to Docker container defaults and example configurations "
"provided in this documentation, but the numbers will change once you "
"customize the amount of WSGI workers or adjust parallelism of Celery."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຄອນເທນເນີ Docker ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານນີ້, "
"ແຕ່ຕົວເລກຈະປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອເຈົ້າປັບແຕ່ງຈຳນວນ WSGI workers ຫຼື ປັບຄວາມຂະໜານຂອງ Celery."

msgid ""
"The actual limit for the number of database connections needs to be higher "
"to account for the following situations:"
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຕົວຈິງສຳລັບຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕ້ອງສູງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຮອງຮັບສະຖານະການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ":ref:`manage` need their connection as well."
msgstr ":ref:`manage` ຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງພວກມັນເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid ""
"If a process is killed (for example by OOM killer), it might block the "
"existing connection until timeout."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂະບວນການຖືກຂ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍ OOM killer), ມັນອາດຈະບລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈົນກວ່າຈະໝົດເວລາ."

msgid ":ref:`celery`, :ref:`uwsgi`, :envvar:`WEBLATE_WORKERS`"
msgstr ":ref:`celery`, :ref:`uwsgi`, :envvar:`WEBLATE_WORKERS`"

msgid "PostgreSQL"
msgstr "PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL is usually the best choice for Django-based sites. It's the "
"reference database used for implementing Django database layer."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບເວັບໄຊທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Django. "
"ມັນແມ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນອ້າງອີງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະຕິບັດຊັ້ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Django."

msgid ""
"Weblate uses trigram extension which has to be installed separately in some "
"cases. Look for ``postgresql-contrib`` or a similarly named package."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ trigram extension ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃນບາງກໍລະນີ. ຊອກຫາ "
"``postgresql-contrib`` ຫຼື ແພັກເກັດທີ່ມີຊື່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

msgid "Creating a database in PostgreSQL"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນໃນ PostgreSQL"

msgid ""
"It is usually a good idea to run Weblate in a separate database, and "
"separate user account:"
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວມັນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະແລ່ນ Weblate ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ແລະ ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ:"

msgid ""
"If you don't want to make the Weblate user a superuser in PostgreSQL, you "
"can omit that. In that case you will have to perform some of the migration "
"steps manually as a PostgreSQL superuser in schema Weblate will use:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ Weblate ເປັນ superuser ໃນ PostgreSQL, "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະເວັ້ນສິ່ງນັ້ນໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດບາງຂັ້ນຕອນການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (migration) "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຖານະ superuser PostgreSQL ໃນສະຄີມາທີ່ Weblate ຈະໃຊ້:"

msgid "Configuring Weblate to use PostgreSQL"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Weblate ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ PostgreSQL"

msgid "The :file:`settings.py` snippet for PostgreSQL:"
msgstr "ສະນິບເປັດ (snippet) :file:`settings.py` ສຳລັບ PostgreSQL:"

msgid ""
"The database migration performs `ALTER ROLE <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/"
"16/sql-alterrole.html>`_ on the database role used by Weblate. In most "
"cases, the name of the role matches the username. In more complex setups the "
"role name is different from the username, and you will get an error about "
"non-existing role during the database migration "
"(``psycopg2.errors.UndefinedObject: role \"weblate@hostname\" does not "
"exist``). This is known to happen with Azure Database for PostgreSQL, but "
"it's not limited to this environment. Please set ``ALTER_ROLE`` to change "
"the name of the role Weblate should alter during the database migration."
msgstr ""
"ການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະປະຕິບັດ `ALTER ROLE <https://www.postgresql.org/docs/16/sql-"
"alterrole.html>`_ ບົດບາດຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Weblate. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ຊື່ຂອງບົດບາດຈະກົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້. ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສັບສົນກວ່າ, ຊື່ບົດບາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ "
"ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກ່ຽວກັບບົດບາດທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ "
"(``psycopg2.errors.UndefinedObject: role \"weblate@hostname\" does not "
"exist``). ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກວ່າເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ Azure Database ສຳລັບ PostgreSQL, "
"ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດພຽງແຕ່ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມນີ້. ກະລຸນາຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``ALTER_ROLE`` ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຊື່ຂອງບົດບາດທີ່ "
"Weblate ຄວນປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະຫວ່າງການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "Other configurations"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ"

msgid "Configuring outgoing e-mail"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວຂາອອກ"

msgid ""
"Weblate sends out e-mails on various occasions - for account activation and "
"on various notifications configured by users. For this it needs access to an "
"SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສົ່ງອີເມວໃນໂອກາດຕ່າງໆ - ສຳລັບການເປີດໃຊ້ບັນຊີ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຕ່າງໆທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ ມັນຕ້ອງການການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີບເວີ SMTP."

msgid ""
"The mail server setup is configured using these "
"settings: :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_TLS`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_SSL`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_USER` "
"and :setting:`django:EMAIL_PORT`. Their names are quite self-explanatory, "
"but you can find more info in the Django documentation."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີອີເມວຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້: :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_TLS`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_SSL`, :setting:`django:EMAIL_HOST_USER` "
"ແລະ :setting:`django:EMAIL_PORT`. ຊື່ຂອງພວກມັນອະທິບາຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ດີພໍສົມຄວນ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດພົບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນເອກະສານ Django."

msgid ""
"In case you get error about not supported authentication (for "
"example :samp:`SMTP AUTH extension not supported by server`), it is most "
"likely caused by using insecure connection and server refuses to "
"authenticate this way. Try enabling :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_TLS` in such "
"case."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດກ່ຽວກັບການພິສູດຢືນຢັນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ (ຕົວຢ່າງ :samp:`SMTP AUTH extension "
"not supported by server`), ມັນເກີດຈາກການໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພ ແລະ "
"ເຊີບເວີປະຕິເສດທີ່ຈະພິສູດຢືນຢັນດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້. ລອງເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`django:EMAIL_USE_TLS` "
"ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ."

msgid ":ref:`Configuring outgoing e-mail in Docker container <docker-mail>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີເມວຂາອອກໃນຄອນເທນເນີ Docker <docker-mail>`"

msgid "Running behind reverse proxy"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນຫຼັງຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີ (reverse proxy)"

msgid ""
"Several features in Weblate rely on correct HTTP headers being passed to "
"Weblate. When using reverse proxy, please make sure that the needed "
"information is correctly passed."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ Weblate ອີງໃສ່ຫົວຂໍ້ (headers) HTTP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງ Weblate. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີ, ກະລຸນາຮັບປະກັນວ່າຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"To debug this configuration, you can look at :guilabel:`HTTP environment` "
"in :ref:`manage-performance`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອດີບັຄ (debug) ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງ :guilabel:`HTTP environment` "
"ໃນ :ref:`manage-performance`."

msgid "Client IP address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໄຄລເອັນທ໌"

msgid "This is needed for :ref:`rate-limit` or :ref:`audit-log`."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ :ref:`rate-limit` ຫຼື :ref:`audit-log`."

msgid ""
"Weblate parses IP address from the ``REMOTE_ADDR``, which is set by the WSGI "
"handler. This might be empty (when using socket for WSGI) or contain a "
"reverse proxy address, so Weblate needs an additional HTTP header with a "
"client IP address."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ແຍກວິເຄາະທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກ ``REMOTE_ADDR``, ເຊິ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍ WSGI handler. "
"ນີ້ອາດຈະຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຊັອກເກັດສຳລັບ WSGI) ຫຼື ມີທີ່ຢູ່ຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີ, ສະນັ້ນ Weblate ຕ້ອງການຫົວຂໍ້ "
"HTTP ເພີ່ມເຕີມພ້ອມກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

msgid ""
"Enabling :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` should be sufficient for the "
"most usual setups, but you might need to adjust :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER` "
"and :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET` as well "
"(use :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_HEADER` and :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_OFFSET` "
"in the Docker container)."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` ຄວນພຽງພໍສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປທີ່ສຸດ, "
"ແຕ່ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບ :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER` ແລະ :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET` "
"ເຊັ່ນກັນ (ໃຊ້ :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_HEADER` "
"ແລະ :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_OFFSET` ໃນຄອນເທນເນີ Docker)."

msgid ""
"The reverse proxy which connects to Weblate must overwrite the configured "
"header or append a verified peer address at the position selected "
"by :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET`. Do not select a client-supplied address, and "
"do not expose the application server through a path which bypasses the "
"trusted proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When using ``X-Forwarded-For`` with the Docker container, "
"configure :envvar:`WEBLATE_TRUSTED_PROXY_ADDRESSES` with the reverse proxies "
"allowed to supply client addresses."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This configuration cannot be turned on by default, because it would allow IP "
"address spoofing on installations that don't have a properly configured "
"reverse proxy."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເພາະມັນຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການປອມແປງທີ່ຢູ່ IP "
"ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ມີຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Server host name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີບເວີ"

msgid ""
"The :http:header:`Host` header should match to whatever is configured "
"as :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN`. Additional configuration might be needed in your "
"reverse proxy (for example use ``ProxyPreserveHost On`` for Apache or "
"``proxy_set_header Host $host;`` with nginx)."
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ :http:header:`Host` ຄວນກົງກັບສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN`. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມອາດຈຳເປັນໃນຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີຂອງເຈົ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງໃຊ້ ``ProxyPreserveHost On`` "
"ສຳລັບ Apache ຫຼື ``proxy_set_header Host $host;`` ກັບ nginx)."

msgid ""
"CSRF verification failed errors are often caused by a mismatch between "
"the :http:header:`Host` header and configured :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການພິສູດຢືນຢັນ CSRF ລົ້ມເຫຼວມັກຈະເກີດຈາກຄວາມບໍ່ກົງກັນລະຫວ່າງຫົວຂໍ້ :http:header:`Host` "
"ແລະ :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN` ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid "Client protocol"
msgstr "ໂປຣໂຕຄອນຂອງລູກຄ້າ"

msgid ""
"Not passing correct protocol may cause Weblate to end up in redirection loop "
"trying to upgrade client to HTTPS. Make sure it is correctly exposed by the "
"reverse proxy as :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Proto`."
msgstr ""
"ການບໍ່ສົ່ງໂປຣໂຕຄອນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ຕົກຢູ່ໃນວົງຈອນການປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ (redirection "
"loop) ໂດຍພະຍາຍາມອັບເກຣດລູກຄ້າໄປຍັງ HTTPS. "
"ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າວ່າມັນຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍຣີເວີສພຣອກຊີເປັນ :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Proto`."

msgid ""
"This header then needs to be configured "
"in :setting:`django:SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` (:file:`settings.py`) "
"or :envvar:`WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` (Docker environment)."
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ :setting:`django:SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` "
"(:file:`settings.py`) ຫຼື :envvar:`WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER` "
"(ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Docker)."

msgid ""
"The header value is case-sensitive in the configuration, so "
"``WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER=HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PROTO,https`` and "
"``WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER=HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PROTO,HTTPS`` are not "
"interchangeable."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຫົວຂໍ້ມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"``WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER=HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PROTO,https`` ແລະ "
"``WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER=HTTP_X_FORWARDED_PROTO,HTTPS`` "
"ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທນກັນໄດ້."

msgid ""
"If you are getting a \"Too many redirects\" error from the browser, this is "
"most likely caused by mismatch between the actual protocol (HTTPS) and what "
"is observed by Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ \"Too many redirects\" ຈາກບຣາວເຊີ, "
"ມັນມັກຈະເກີດຈາກຄວາມບໍ່ກົງກັນລະຫວ່າງໂປຣໂຕຄອນຕົວຈິງ (HTTPS) ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ Weblate ສັງເກດເຫັນ."

msgid ""
"The protocol proxy headers are automatically handled by :program:`gunicorn` "
"in the default configuration, but other WSGI servers have more secure "
"configuration and require explicit setting of this."
msgstr ""
"ຫົວຂໍ້ພຣອກຊີໂປຣໂຕຄອນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ :program:`gunicorn` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ "
"WSGI servers ອື່ນໆມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ປອດໄພກວ່າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ."

msgid ""
"Since Weblate 5.13 the Docker container is using :program:`granian` and it "
"now requires the explicit configuration "
"of :envvar:`WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ Weblate 5.13 ຄອນເທນເນີ Docker ໄດ້ໃຊ້ :program:`granian` ແລະ "
"ປັດຈຸບັນມັນຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງຂອງ :envvar:`WEBLATE_SECURE_PROXY_SSL_HEADER`."

msgid "HTTP proxy"
msgstr "HTTP proxy"

msgid ""
"Weblate supports per-protocol HTTP proxy configuration for outbound HTTP "
"requests and Git repositories. Define the proxy environment variables "
"in :file:`settings.py`:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP ພຣັອກຊີ ແຍກຕາມໂປຣໂຕຄໍ ສຳລັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP ຂາອອກ ແລະ ຄັງເກັບ "
"Git. ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມພຣັອກຊີໃນ :file:`settings.py`:"

msgid ""
"Only ``http_proxy`` and ``https_proxy`` are supported. Generic and bypass "
"variables such as ``all_proxy`` and ``no_proxy``, operating-system proxy "
"configuration, and VCS-specific proxy configuration are not supported."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ ``http_proxy`` ແລະ ``https_proxy`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວປ່ຽນແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ "
"ແບບຂ້າມ ເຊັ່ນ ``all_proxy`` ແລະ ``no_proxy``, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແລະ "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີສະເພາະຂອງ VCS ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"`Proxy environment variables <https://everything.curl.dev/usingcurl/proxies/"
"env.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Proxy <https://everything.curl.dev/usingcurl/proxies/"
"env.html>`_"

msgid "Adjusting configuration"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

msgid ""
"Copy :file:`weblate/settings_example.py` to :file:`weblate/settings.py` and "
"adjust it to match your setup. You will probably want to adjust the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາ :file:`weblate/settings_example.py` ໄປຍັງ :file:`weblate/settings.py` "
"ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງມັນໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ. ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການປັບຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"List of site administrators to receive notifications when something goes "
"wrong, for example notifications on failed merges, or Django errors."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການຂອງຜູ້ບໍລິຫານເວັບໄຊທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອມີບາງຢ່າງຜິດພາດ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການລວມທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ Django."

msgid ""
"Contact form sends e-mail on these as well unless :setting:`ADMINS_CONTACT` "
"is configured."
msgstr ""
"ແບບຟອມຕິດຕໍ່ສົ່ງອີເມວຫາພວກເຂົາເຊັ່ນກັນ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ :setting:`ADMINS_CONTACT` ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"You need to set this to list the hosts your site is supposed to serve. For "
"example:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອລາຍຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າຄວນໃຫ້ບໍລິການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid "Alternatively you can include wildcard:"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກອື່ນ ເຈົ້າສາມາດລວມ wildcard:"

msgid ""
"Configure how your sessions will be stored. In case you keep the default "
"database backend engine, you should schedule: :command:`weblate "
"clearsessions` to remove stale session data from the database."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການເກັບຮັກສາເຊສຊັນ (sessions) ຂອງເຈົ້າ. "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຮັກສາເຄື່ອງຈັກເບື້ອງຫຼັງຖານຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຈົ້າຄວນວາງຕາຕະລາງ: :command:`weblate "
"clearsessions` ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນເຊສຊັນທີ່ເກົ່າແກ້ອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid ""
"If you are using Valkey or Redis as cache (see :ref:`production-cache`) it "
"is recommended to use it for sessions as well:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ Valkey ຫຼື Redis ເປັນແຄຊ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`production-cache`) "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊສຊັນເຊັ່ນກັນ:"

msgid ""
"Connectivity to database server, please check Django's documentation for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບເອກະສານຂອງ Django ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Disable this for any production server. With debug mode enabled, Django will "
"show backtraces in case of error to users, when you disable it, errors will "
"be sent per e-mail to ``ADMINS`` (see above)."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານນີ້ສຳລັບເຊີບເວີການຜະລິດໃດກໍໄດ້. ດ້ວຍโໝດດີບັຄທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້, Django ຈະສະແດງ backtraces "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແກ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເມື່ອເຈົ້າປິດມັນ, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈະຖືກສົ່ງທາງອີເມວຫາ ``ADMINS`` "
"(ເບິ່ງຂ້າງເທິງ)."

msgid ""
"Debug mode also slows down Weblate, as Django stores much more info "
"internally in this case."
msgstr "โໝດດີບັຄຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ຊ້າລົງ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ Django ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໃນກໍລະນີນີ້."

msgid ""
"E-mail sender address for outgoing e-mail, for example registration e-mails."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຜູ້ສົ່ງອີເມວສຳລັບອີເມວຂາອອກ, ຕົວຢ່າງອີເມວການລົງທະບຽນ."

msgid ""
"Key used by Django to sign some info in cookies, see :ref:`production-"
"secret` for more info."
msgstr ""
"ຄີທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Django ເພື່ອລົງນາມຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງໃນຄຸກກີ້, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`production-secret` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"E-mail used as sender address for sending e-mails to the administrator, for "
"example notifications on failed merges."
msgstr ""
"ອີເມວທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ຜູ້ສົ່ງສຳລັບການສົ່ງອີເມວຫາຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ, ຕົວຢ່າງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນກ່ຽວກັບການລວມທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວ."

msgid "Filling up the database"
msgstr "ການຕື່ມຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid ""
"After your configuration is ready, you can run :wladmin:`migrate` to create "
"the database structure. Now you should be able to create translation "
"projects using the admin interface."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າພ້ອມແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແລ່ນ :wladmin:`migrate` ເພື່ອສ້າງໂຄງສ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. "
"ປັດຈຸບັນເຈົ້າຄວນຈະສາມາດສ້າງໂຄງການການແປໂດຍໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟສຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ."

msgid ""
"Once you are done, you should also check the :guilabel:`Performance report` "
"in the admin interface, which will give you hints of potential non optimal "
"configuration on your site."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳເລັດ, ເຈົ້າຍັງຄວນກວດສອບ :guilabel:`Performance report` "
"ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສຜູ້ບໍລິຫານ, ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ອາດບໍ່ເໝາະສົມໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "Production setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນການຜະລິດ (Production)"

msgid ""
"For a production setup you should carry out adjustments described in the "
"following sections. The most critical settings will trigger a warning, which "
"is indicated by an exclamation mark in the top bar if signed in as a "
"superuser:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນການຜະລິດ ເຈົ້າຄວນດຳເນີນການປັບປ່ຽນທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນພາກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຈະກະຕຸ້ນການເຕືອນ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກຊີ້ບອກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍອັດສະເຈີຍ (exclamation mark) "
"ໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງຖ້າລັອກອິນເປັນ superuser:"

msgid ""
"It is also recommended to inspect checks triggered by Django (though you "
"might not need to fix all of them):"
msgstr ""
"ຍັງແນະນຳໃຫ້ກວດສອບການກວດສອບທີ່ກະຕຸ້ນໂດຍ Django "
"(ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າອາດຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດກໍຕາມ):"

msgid ""
"You can also review the very same checklist at :ref:`manage-performance` in "
"the :ref:`management-interface`."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດທົບທວນລາຍການກວດສອບດຽວກັນທີ່ :ref:`manage-performance` "
"ໃນ :ref:`management-interface`."

msgid "Disable debug mode"
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດດີບັຄ"

msgid "Disable Django's debug mode (:setting:`DEBUG`) by:"
msgstr "ປິດໂໝດດີບັຄຂອງ Django (:setting:`DEBUG`) ໂດຍ:"

msgid ""
"With debug mode on, Django stores all executed queries and shows users "
"backtraces of errors, which is not desired in a production setup."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໂໝດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ (debug mode), Django ຈະເກັບບັນທຶກທຸກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ດຳເນີນການ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງປະຫວັດຄວາມຜິດພາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນມີໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

msgid "Properly configure admins"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid ""
"Set the correct admin addresses to the :setting:`ADMINS` setting to define "
"who will receive e-mails in case something goes wrong on the server, for "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ADMINS` "
"ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າໃຜຈະເປັນຜູ້ຮັບອີເມວໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດບັນຫາຂຶ້ນກັບເຊີບເວີ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid "Set correct site domain"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດເມນຂອງເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid ""
"Adjust site name and domain in the admin interface, otherwise links in RSS "
"or registration e-mails will not work. This is configured "
"using :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN` which should contain site domain name."
msgstr ""
"ປັບຊື່ເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ໂດເມນໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນລິ້ງໃນ RSS ຫຼື "
"ອີເມວຢືນຢັນການລົງທະບຽນຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້. ສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`SITE_DOMAIN` "
"ເຊິ່ງຄວນລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງເວັບໄຊ."

msgid ""
"Prior to the 4.2 release the Django sites framework was used instead, please "
"see :doc:`django:ref/contrib/sites`."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນ 4.2, ຈະໃຊ້ Django sites framework ແທນ, "
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :doc:`django:ref/contrib/sites`."

msgid "Correctly configure HTTPS"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTPS ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to run Weblate using the encrypted HTTPS "
"protocol. After enabling it, you should set :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` in the "
"settings:"
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Weblate ໂດຍຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ HTTPS ທີ່ມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ. ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, "
"ເຈົ້າຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` ໃນສ່ວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ:"

msgid ""
"You might want to set up HSTS as well, see :ref:`django:security-"
"recommendation-ssl` for more details."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HSTS ນຳ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`django:security-recommendation-ssl` "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Set properly SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid ""
"If your site is served over SSL, you have to consider setting a value "
"for :setting:`django:SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS` in the :file:`settings.py` to "
"enable HTTP Strict Transport Security. By default it's set to 0 as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານ SSL, "
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງພິຈາລະນາຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`django:SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS` "
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ :file:`settings.py` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ HTTP Strict Transport Security. "
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້."

msgid ""
"If set to a non-zero integer value, "
"the :class:`django:django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware` sets "
"the :ref:`django:http-strict-transport-security` header on all responses "
"that do not already have it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, :class:`django:django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware` "
"ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ header :ref:`django:http-strict-transport-security` "
"ໃສ່ໃນທຸກຄຳຕອບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີ."

msgid ""
"Setting this incorrectly can irreversibly (for some time) break your site. "
"Read the :ref:`django:http-strict-transport-security` documentation first."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນນີ້ຜິດພາດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ (ໃນໄລຍະເວລາໜຶ່ງ) ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຍາກ. "
"ກະລຸນາອ່ານເອກະສານ :ref:`django:http-strict-transport-security` ກ່ອນ."

msgid "Use a powerful database engine"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ລະບົບຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ"

msgid ""
"Please use PostgreSQL for a production environment, see :ref:`database-"
"setup` for more info."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ PostgreSQL ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`database-setup` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Use adjacent location for running the database server, otherwise the "
"networking performance or reliability might ruin your Weblate experience."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສະຖານທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງສຳລັບການແລ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນເຊີບເວີ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນປະສິດທິພາບຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ ຫຼື "
"ຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສົບການການໃຊ້ງານ Weblate ບໍ່ດີ."

msgid ""
"Check the database server performance or tweak its configuration, for "
"example using `PGTune <https://pgtune.leopard.in.ua/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບປະສິດທິພາບຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍການໃຊ້ `PGTune <https://"
"pgtune.leopard.in.ua/>`_."

msgid ""
"Weblate deployment checks report non-finite PostgreSQL relation statistics. "
"Run ``ANALYZE`` on the reported relations to rebuild corrupted statistics."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ລາຍງານສະຖິຕິຄວາມສຳພັນຂອງ PostgreSQL ທີ່ບໍ່ສິ້ນສຸດ. ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງ "
"``ANALYZE`` ໃນຄວາມສຳພັນທີ່ຖືກລາຍງານ ເພື່ອສ້າງສະຖິຕິທີ່ເສຍຫາຍຄືນໃໝ່."

msgid "Configure cache"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າແຄສ (cache)"

msgid ""
"If possible, use Valkey or Redis from Django by adjusting the ``CACHES`` "
"configuration variable, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Valkey ຫຼື Redis ຈາກ Django ໂດຍການປັບຕົວປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``CACHES``, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"In case you change settings for the cache, you might need to adjust them for "
"Celery as well, see :ref:`celery`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຄສ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Celery ນຳ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`celery`."

msgid "Avatar caching"
msgstr "ການແຄສຮູບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ (Avatar)"

msgid ""
"In addition to caching of Django, Weblate performs caching of avatars. It is "
"recommended to use a separate, file-backed cache for this purpose:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການແຄສຂອງ Django ແລ້ວ, Weblate ຍັງມີການແຄສຮູບໂປຣໄຟລ໌. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຄສແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້:"

msgid "Configure e-mail sending"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າການສົ່ງອີເມວ"

msgid ""
"Weblate needs to send out e-mails on several occasions, and these e-mails "
"should have a correct sender address, please "
"configure :setting:`SERVER_EMAIL` and :setting:`DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL` to match "
"your environment, for example:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສົ່ງອີເມວໃນຫຼາຍໆໂອກາດ, ແລະ ອີເມວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນມີທີ່ຢູ່ຜູ້ສົ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ກະລຸນາຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`SERVER_EMAIL` ແລະ :setting:`DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL` "
"ໃຫ້ກົງກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"To disable sending e-mails by Weblate set :setting:`django:EMAIL_BACKEND` to "
"``django.core.mail.backends.dummy.EmailBackend``."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດການສົ່ງອີເມວໂດຍ Weblate, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`django:EMAIL_BACKEND` ເປັນ "
"``django.core.mail.backends.dummy.EmailBackend``."

msgid ""
"This will disable *all* e-mail delivery including registration or password "
"reset e-mails."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະປິດການສົ່ງອີເມວ *ທັງໝົດ* ລວມທັງອີເມວການລົງທະບຽນ ຫຼື ການຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

msgid ":std:setting:`django:EMAIL_BACKEND`"
msgstr ":std:setting:`django:EMAIL_BACKEND`"

msgid ":std:setting:`django:DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL`"
msgstr ":std:setting:`django:DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL`"

msgid ":std:setting:`django:SERVER_EMAIL`"
msgstr ":std:setting:`django:SERVER_EMAIL`"

msgid "Allowed hosts setup"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຮສທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ (Allowed hosts)"

msgid ""
"Django requires :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS` to hold a list of domain names your "
"site is allowed to serve, leaving it empty will block any requests."
msgstr ""
"Django ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS` "
"ມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ເວັບໄຊຂອງເຈົ້າອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບໍລິການ, ການປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທຸກຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຖືກບລັອກ."

msgid ""
"In case this is not configured to match your HTTP server, you will get "
"errors like :samp:`Invalid HTTP_HOST header: '1.1.1.1'. You may need to add "
"'1.1.1.1' to ALLOWED_HOSTS.`"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ກົງກັບ HTTP ເຊີບເວີຂອງທ່ານ, ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຊັ່ນ :samp:`Invalid "
"HTTP_HOST header: '1.1.1.1'. You may need to add '1.1.1.1' to ALLOWED_HOSTS.`"

msgid ""
"On Docker container, this is available as :envvar:`WEBLATE_ALLOWED_HOSTS`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker container, ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ALLOWED_HOSTS`."

msgid "Django secret key"
msgstr "ກຸນແຈລັບ (Secret key) ຂອງ Django"

msgid ""
"The :setting:`SECRET_KEY` setting is used by Django to sign cookies, and you "
"should really generate your own value rather than using the one from the "
"example setup."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`SECRET_KEY` ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ Django ເພື່ອເຊັນຄຸກກີ້, "
"ເຈົ້າຄວນສ້າງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານເອງແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid ""
"You can generate a new key using :program:`weblate-generate-secret-key` "
"shipped with Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງກຸນແຈໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`weblate-generate-secret-key` ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ "
"Weblate."

msgid "Running maintenance tasks"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາ"

msgid ""
"For optimal performance, it is good idea to run some maintenance tasks in "
"the background. This is automatically done by :ref:`celery` and covers "
"following tasks:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ, ມັນເປັນການດີທີ່ຈະແລ່ນວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາບາງຢ່າງໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ :ref:`celery` ແລະ ກວມເອົາວຽກງານຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Configuration health check (hourly)."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມພ້ອມຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ທຸກຊົ່ວໂມງ)."

msgid ""
"Committing pending changes (hourly), see :ref:`lazy-commit` "
"and :wladmin:`commit_pending`."
msgstr ""
"ການຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ (ທຸກຊົ່ວໂມງ), ເບິ່ງ :ref:`lazy-commit` "
"ແລະ :wladmin:`commit_pending`."

msgid "Updating component alerts (daily)."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຂອງອົງປະກອບ (ທຸກວັນ)."

msgid "Update remote branches (nightly), see :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE`."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດສາຂາຣີໂມດ (ທຸກຄືນ), ເບິ່ງ :setting:`AUTO_UPDATE`."

msgid "Translation memory backup to JSON (daily), see :wladmin:`dump_memory`."
msgstr ""
"ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ Translation memory ເປັນໄຟລ໌ JSON (ທຸກວັນ), "
"ເບິ່ງ :wladmin:`dump_memory`."

msgid ""
"Fulltext and database maintenance tasks (daily and weekly tasks), "
"see :wladmin:`cleanuptrans`."
msgstr ""
"ວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ Fulltext (ວຽກງານປະຈຳວັນ ແລະ ປະຈຳອາທິດ), "
"ເບິ່ງ :wladmin:`cleanuptrans`."

msgid "System locales and encoding"
msgstr "ລະບົບ Locale ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

msgid ""
"The system locales should be configured to UTF-8 capable ones. On most Linux "
"distributions this is the default setting. In case it is not the case on "
"your system, please change locales to UTF-8 variant."
msgstr ""
"Locale ຂອງລະບົບຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ UTF-8. ໃນ Linux ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ແມ່ນ, ກະລຸນາປ່ຽນ Locale ເປັນແບບ UTF-8."

msgid ""
"For example by editing :file:`/etc/default/locale` and setting there "
"``LANG=\"C.UTF-8\"``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ :file:`/etc/default/locale` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``LANG=\"C.UTF-8\"``."

msgid ""
"In some cases the individual services have separate configuration for "
"locales. This varies between distribution and web servers, so check "
"documentation of your web server packages for that."
msgstr ""
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ບໍລິການແຕ່ລະຢ່າງຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Locale ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມແຕ່ລະ "
"Distribution ແລະ ເວັບເຊີບເວີ, ສະນັ້ນໃຫ້ກວດສອບເອກະສານຂອງແພັກເກດເວັບເຊີບເວີຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "Apache on Ubuntu uses :file:`/etc/apache2/envvars`:"
msgstr "Apache ເທິງ Ubuntu ໃຊ້ :file:`/etc/apache2/envvars`:"

msgid ""
"Apache on CentOS uses :file:`/etc/sysconfig/httpd` (or :file:`/opt/rh/"
"httpd24/root/etc/sysconfig/httpd`):"
msgstr ""
"Apache ເທິງ CentOS ໃຊ້ :file:`/etc/sysconfig/httpd` (ຫຼື :file:`/opt/rh/httpd24/"
"root/etc/sysconfig/httpd`):"

msgid "Using custom certificate authority"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ Custom certificate authority"

msgid ""
"Weblate verifies SSL certificates during HTTP requests. Requests made using "
"HTTPX2 use the system certificate store, so install custom certificate "
"authorities there."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຈະກວດສອບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຮ້ອງຂໍ HTTP. ການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ໃຊ້ HTTPX2 "
"ຈະໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງລະບົບ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄວ້ທີ່ນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Check your distribution documentation for more details. For example, on "
"Debian this can be done by placing the CA certificate into :file:`/usr/local/"
"share/ca-certificates/` and running :command:`update-ca-certificates`."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບເອກະສານຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນ Debian "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການວາງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ໄວ້ໃນ :file:`/usr/local/share/ca-certificates/"
"` ແລະ ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ :command:`update-ca-certificates`."

msgid ""
"The Weblate container does not include it in the search path, you need to "
"specify full path to execute it. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate container ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາມັນໄວ້ໃນເສັ້ນທາງການຊອກຫາ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມເພື່ອແລ່ນມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"Once this is done, Weblate HTTPX2 requests and system tools, including Git, "
"will trust the certificate."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ການຮ້ອງຂໍຜ່ານ Weblate HTTPX2 ແລະ ເຄື່ອງມືຂອງລະບົບ ລວມທັງ Git "
"ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຕໍ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Some integrations, including OAuth and OpenID Connect authentication, use "
"Requests, which does not use the system certificate store by default. When "
"these integrations communicate with services using the custom certificate "
"authority, configure Requests to use the system CA bundle by adding the "
"following to :file:`settings.py` (the path is Debian-specific):"
msgstr ""
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບາງຢ່າງ, ລວມທັງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ OAuth ແລະ OpenID Connect, ໃຊ້ Requests "
"ເຊິ່ງໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ບ່ອນເກັບໃບຮັບຮອງຂອງລະບົບ. ເມື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການ "
"ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຮັບຮອງແບບກຳນົດເອງ (custom CA), ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Requests ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊຸດ CA ຂອງລະບົບ "
"ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່ :file:`settings.py` (ເສັ້ນທາງນີ້ແມ່ນສະເພາະສຳລັບ Debian):"

msgid "Running server"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນເຊີບເວີ"

msgid ""
"In case you are not experienced with services described below, you might "
"want to try :doc:`install/docker`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ມີປະສົບການກັບບໍລິການທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຢາກລອງໃຊ້ :doc:`install/"
"docker`."

msgid ""
"You will need several services to run Weblate, the recommended setup "
"consists of:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງມີຫຼາຍບໍລິການເພື່ອແລ່ນ Weblate, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳປະກອບດ້ວຍ:"

msgid "Database server (see :ref:`database-setup`)"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເຊີບເວີ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`database-setup`)"

msgid "Cache server (see :ref:`production-cache`)"
msgstr "ແຄສເຊີບເວີ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`production-cache`)"

msgid ""
"Frontend web server for static files and SSL termination (see :ref:`static-"
"files`)"
msgstr ""
"Frontend web server ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Static ແລະ SSL termination (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`static-"
"files`)"

msgid "WSGI server for dynamic content (see :ref:`uwsgi`)"
msgstr "WSGI server ສຳລັບເນື້ອຫາ Dynamic (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`uwsgi`)"

msgid "Celery for executing background tasks (see :ref:`celery`)"
msgstr "Celery ສຳລັບດຳເນີນການວຽກງານເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`celery`)"

msgid ""
"There are some dependencies between the services, for example cache and "
"database should be running when starting up Celery or uwsgi processes."
msgstr ""
"ມີການເພິ່ງພາອາໄສກັນລະຫວ່າງບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງ Cache ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄວນຈະແລ່ນຢູ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"Celery ຫຼື uwsgi processes."

msgid ""
"In most cases, you will run all services on single (virtual) server, but in "
"case your installation is heavy loaded, you can split up the services. The "
"only limitation on this is that Celery and Wsgi servers need access "
"to :setting:`DATA_DIR`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຈົ້າຈະແລ່ນທຸກບໍລິການເທິງເຊີບເວີ (virtual) ດຽວ, "
"ແຕ່ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານມີການໃຊ້ງານໜັກ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແຍກບໍລິການອອກໄດ້. ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດຽວຄື Celery "
"ແລະ Wsgi servers ຕ້ອງການການເຂົ້າເຖິງ :setting:`DATA_DIR`."

msgid ""
"The WSGI process has to be executed under the same user the Celery process, "
"otherwise files in the :setting:`DATA_DIR` will be stored with mixed "
"ownership, leading to runtime issues."
msgstr ""
"WSGI process ຕ້ອງຖືກແລ່ນພາຍໃຕ້ User ດຽວກັນກັບ Celery process, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ໃນ :setting:`DATA_DIR` ຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບດ້ວຍ Ownership ທີ່ປົນເປກັນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນລະຫວ່າງການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "See also :ref:`file-permissions` and :ref:`celery`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ :ref:`file-permissions` ແລະ :ref:`celery`."

msgid "Running web server"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນເວັບເຊີບເວີ"

msgid ""
"Running Weblate is not different from running any other Django based "
"program. Django is usually executed as WSGI or fcgi (see examples for "
"different webservers below)."
msgstr ""
"ການແລ່ນ Weblate ບໍ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການແລ່ນໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນທີ່ໃຊ້ Django. ປົກກະຕິ Django ຈະຖືກແລ່ນເປັນ "
"WSGI ຫຼື fcgi (ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບເວັບເຊີບເວີຕ່າງໆຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້)."

msgid ""
"The sample configuration files shown below are maintained in the Weblate "
"source tree under :file:`weblate/examples/`. They are included in source "
"distributions and in this documentation, but Python wheels only install "
"runtime files. When installing Weblate from PyPI, get the matching source "
"distribution or source checkout before copying these examples."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງຢູ່ໃນ Weblate source tree "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ :file:`weblate/examples/`. ພວກມັນຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ Source distributions ແລະ "
"ໃນເອກະສານນີ້, ແຕ່ Python wheels ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ Runtime ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate "
"ຈາກ PyPI, ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ Source distribution ຫຼື Source checkout "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນກ່ອນຈະກັອບປີ້ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid "For testing purposes, you can use the built-in web server in Django:"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງໃນການທົດສອບ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Built-in web server ໃນ Django ໄດ້:"

msgid ""
"DO NOT USE THIS SERVER IN A PRODUCTION SETTING. It has not gone through "
"security audits or performance tests. See also Django documentation "
"on :djadmin:`django:runserver`."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີນີ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ (Production). ມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຜ່ານການກວດສອບຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫຼື "
"ການທົດສອບປະສິດທິພາບ. ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນເອກະສານ Django "
"ກ່ຽວກັບ :djadmin:`django:runserver`."

msgid ""
"The Django built-in server serves static files only with :setting:`DEBUG` "
"enabled as it is intended for development only. For production use, please "
"see WSGI setups:"
msgstr ""
"Django built-in server ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ Static ເມື່ອເປີດ :setting:`DEBUG` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ WSGI:"

msgid "Serving static files"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ Static"

msgid ":file:`/media/` is no longer used for serving screenshots."
msgstr ":file:`/media/` ບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Screenshot ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"Django needs to collect its static files in a single directory. To do so, "
"execute :samp:`weblate collectstatic --noinput`. This will copy the static "
"files into a directory specified by the :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT` "
"setting (this defaults to a ``static`` directory "
"inside :setting:`CACHE_DIR`). Production installations use content hashes in "
"collected filenames so that updated assets do not reuse stale browser or "
"proxy caches."
msgstr ""
"Django ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລວບລວມໄຟລ໌ static ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີດຽວ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, "
"ໃຫ້ຣັນຄຳສັ່ງ :samp:`weblate collectstatic --noinput`. ນີ້ຈະສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ static "
"ໄປໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT` (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນໂຟນເດີ "
"``static`` ພາຍໃນ :setting:`CACHE_DIR`). ການຕິດຕັ້ງເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຈິງຈະໃຊ້ content hashes "
"ໃນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ລວບລວມ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ assets ທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່ໄປໃຊ້ cache ເກົ່າໃນບຣາວເຊີ ຫຼື proxy."

msgid ""
"It is recommended to serve static files directly from your web server, you "
"should use that for the following paths:"
msgstr ""
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ Static ໂດຍກົງຈາກເວັບເຊີບເວີຂອງທ່ານ, ເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບ Path ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Serves static files for Weblate and the admin interface (from defined "
"by :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT`)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ Static ສຳລັບ Weblate ແລະ ອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ "
"(ຈາກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ :setting:`django:STATIC_ROOT`)."

msgid "Should be rewritten to serve :file:`/static/favicon.ico`."
msgstr "ຄວນຖືກ Rewrite ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ :file:`/static/favicon.ico`."

msgid "Content security policy"
msgstr "ນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງເນື້ອຫາ (Content security policy)"

msgid ""
"The default Weblate configuration enables "
"``weblate.middleware.SecurityMiddleware`` middleware which sets security "
"related HTTP headers like :http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` "
"or :http:header:`X-XSS-Protection`. These are by default set up to work with "
"Weblate and its configuration, but this might need customization for your "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Weblate ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ ``weblate.middleware.SecurityMiddleware`` "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP headers ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄວາມປອດໄພ ເຊັ່ນ :http:header:`Content-Security-"
"Policy` ຫຼື :http:header:`X-XSS-Protection`. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກກັບ Weblate ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງຕາມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "Sample configuration for NGINX and Granian"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ NGINX ແລະ Granian"

