"tree):"

msgid "Sample configuration for Apache"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບ Apache"

msgid "It is recommended to use prefork MPM when using WSGI with Weblate."
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Prefork MPM ເມື່ອໃຊ້ WSGI ກັບ Weblate."

