"apache.gunicorn.conf` ໃນ Source tree):"

msgid "Sample configuration to start Granian"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Granian"

msgid ""
"Weblate has `wsgi` optional dependency (see :ref:`python-deps`) that will "
"install everything you need to run Granian. When installing Weblate you can "
"specify it as:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ມີ Optional dependency ຊື່ `wsgi` (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`python-deps`) "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພື່ອແລ່ນ Granian. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Once you have Granian installed, you can run it. This is usually done at the "
"system level. The following examples show starting via systemd:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Granian ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແລ່ນມັນໄດ້. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເຮັດໃນລະດັບລະບົບ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຜ່ານ systemd:"

msgid ""
"Granian uses worker processes for parallel Python execution, blocking "
"threads for concurrent WSGI requests, and runtime threads for network I/O. "
"The sample uses two workers with eight blocking threads each, limits each "
"worker to 16 concurrent connections, and leaves the runtime threads at "
"Granian's default. Adjust the workers and blocking threads to the available "
"memory, CPU cores, and database connection limit. Keep the backpressure "
"equal to or higher than the number of blocking threads."
msgstr ""
"Granian ໃຊ້ຂະບວນການ worker ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນ Python ແບບຂະໜານ, ໃຊ້ blocking "
"threads ສຳລັບການຮ້ອງຂໍ WSGI ພ້ອມກັນ, ແລະ runtime threads ສຳລັບ network I/O. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ສອງ workers ໂດຍມີແປດ blocking threads ແຕ່ລະອັນ, ຈຳກັດແຕ່ລະ worker ຢູ່ທີ່ 16 "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນ, ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ runtime threads ເປັນໄປຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Granian. ປັບປ່ຽນ "
"workers ແລະ blocking threads ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, CPU cores, ແລະ "
"ຂີດຈຳກັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່. ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຄ່າ backpressure ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າຈຳນວນຂອງ "
"blocking threads."

msgid "Sample configuration to start Granian with ASGI"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Granian ດ້ວຍ ASGI"

msgid ""
"ASGI deployment is available as an opt-in alternative to WSGI. Install the "
"``asgi`` optional dependency:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ ASGI ມີໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ແທນ WSGI. ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependency) ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບ "
"``asgi``:"

msgid "The following systemd unit runs the Django ASGI application:"
msgstr "ຊຸດ systemd ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ລັນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Django ASGI:"

msgid ""
"The sample uses Granian's ASGI interface without lifespan or WebSocket "
"support, because Weblate currently exposes HTTP only. Weblate's middleware "
"supports both deployment modes and uses thread-sensitive adapters where it "
"still relies on synchronous Django APIs. The health check is asynchronous, "
"but most Weblate views remain synchronous, and CPU-intensive or long-running "
"work should still be handled by :ref:`celery`."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ ASGI ຂອງ Granian ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບ lifespan ຫຼື WebSocket, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກປະຈຸບັນ Weblate ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຜ່ານ HTTP ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມິດເດິລແວ (middleware) ຂອງ Weblate "
"ຮອງຮັບການຕິດຕັ້ງທັງສອງແບບ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຕົວປັບຕໍ່ທີ່ທົນທານຕໍ່ເທຣດ (thread-sensitive) "
"ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ຍັງຕ້ອງອາໄສ Django APIs ແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັສ (synchronous). ການກວດສອບສະຖານະ "
"(health check) ແມ່ນເປັນແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັສ, ແຕ່ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ Weblate "
"ຍັງຄົງເປັນແບບຊິງໂຄຣນັສ, ແລະ ວຽກທີ່ໃຊ້ CPU ສູງ ຫຼື ວຽກທີ່ເຮັດວຽກດົນ "
"ຄວນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ :ref:`celery`."

msgid ""
"WSGI remains the default deployment mode. Docker images can opt in to ASGI "
"by setting :envvar:`WEBLATE_ASGI` to ``1``. Adjust the worker count and "
"backpressure to the available memory, CPU cores, and database connection "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"WSGI ຍັງຄົງເປັນຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. Docker images ສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ ASGI "
"ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ASGI` ເປັນ ``1``. ໃຫ້ປັບຈຳນວນ worker ແລະ "
"backpressure ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ຄໍຂອງ CPU, ແລະ ຂີດຈຳກັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Sample configuration to start Gunicorn"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Gunicorn"

msgid "Gunicorn has to be installed separately:"
msgstr "Gunicorn ຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ:"

msgid ""
"Once you have Gunicorn installed, you can run it. This is usually done at "
"the system level. The following examples show starting via systemd:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ Gunicorn ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແລ່ນມັນໄດ້. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເຮັດໃນລະດັບລະບົບ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຜ່ານ systemd:"

msgid "Running Weblate under path"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນ Weblate ພາຍໃຕ້ Path"

msgid ""
"A sample Apache configuration to serve Weblate under ``/weblate``. Again "
"using ``mod_wsgi`` (:file:`weblate/examples/apache-path.conf` in the source "
"tree):"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Apache ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ Weblate ພາຍໃຕ້ ``/weblate``. ໃຊ້ ``mod_wsgi`` "
"ເຊັ່ນເຄີຍ (:file:`weblate/examples/apache-path.conf` ໃນ Source tree):"

msgid "Additionally, you will have to adjust :file:`weblate/settings.py`:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງ :file:`weblate/settings.py`:"

msgid "Background tasks using Celery"
msgstr "ວຽກງານເບື້ອງຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ Celery"

msgid ""
"Weblate uses Celery to execute regular and background tasks. You are "
"supposed to run a Celery service that will execute these. For example, it is "
"responsible for handling following operations (this list is not complete):"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ Celery ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການວຽກງານປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ວຽກງານເບື້ອງຫຼັງ. "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແລ່ນບໍລິການ Celery ເພື່ອເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ນີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ, "
"ມັນຮັບຜິດຊອບໃນການຈັດການການດຳເນີນງານດັ່ງນີ້ (ລາຍການນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ):"

msgid "Receiving webhooks from external services (see :ref:`hooks`)."
msgstr "ການຮັບ Webhooks ຈາກບໍລິການພາຍນອກ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`hooks`)."

msgid ""
"Running regular maintenance tasks such as backups, cleanups, daily add-ons, "
"or updates (see :ref:`backup`, :setting:`BACKGROUND_TASKS`, :ref:`addons`)."
msgstr ""
"ການແລ່ນວຽກງານບຳລຸງຮັກສາເປັນປົກກະຕິ ເຊັ່ນ: ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ, ການທຳຄວາມສະອາດ, Add-ons "
"ປະຈຳວັນ, ຫຼື ການອັບເດດ "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`backup`, :setting:`BACKGROUND_TASKS`, :ref:`addons`)."

msgid "Running :ref:`auto-translation`."
msgstr "ການແລ່ນ :ref:`auto-translation`."

msgid "Sending digest notifications."
msgstr "ການສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບ Digest."

msgid "Offloading expensive operations from the WSGI process."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍການດຳເນີນງານທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງອອກຈາກ WSGI process."

msgid "Committing pending changes (see :ref:`lazy-commit`)."
msgstr "ການຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`lazy-commit`)."

msgid "A typical setup using Valkey or Redis as a backend looks like this:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ Valkey ຫຼື Redis ເປັນ Backend ມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid ""
":ref:`Redis broker configuration in Celery <celery:broker-redis-"
"configuration>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Redis broker ໃນ Celery <celery:broker-redis-configuration>`"

msgid ""
"You should also start the Celery worker to process the tasks and start "
"scheduled tasks. For debugging or development, this can be done directly on "
"the command-line:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Celery worker ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນວຽກງານຕ່າງໆ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນວຽກງານທີ່ຕັ້ງເວລາໄວ້. "
"ສຳລັບການ Debug ຫຼື ພັດທະນາ, ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານ Command-line:"

msgid ""
"To reduce startup memory usage, Celery workers do not repeat the Django "
"system checks. The Weblate container runs the more "
"comprehensive :command:`weblate check --deploy` automatically during "
"container startup. For other installation methods, run the command after "
"installation, upgrades, or configuration changes. The checks are also "
"available in the :ref:`management interface <manage-performance>`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Celery process has to be executed under the same user as the WSGI "
"process, otherwise files in the :setting:`DATA_DIR` will be stored with "
"mixed ownership, leading to runtime issues."
msgstr ""
"Celery process ຕ້ອງຖືກແລ່ນພາຍໃຕ້ User ດຽວກັນກັບ WSGI process, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ໃນ :setting:`DATA_DIR` ຈະຖືກຈັດເກັບດ້ວຍ Ownership ທີ່ປົນເປກັນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາໃນລະຫວ່າງການໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "See also :ref:`file-permissions` and :ref:`server`."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ :ref:`file-permissions` ແລະ :ref:`server`."

msgid "Executing Celery tasks in the WSGI using eager mode"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການ Celery tasks ໃນ WSGI ໂດຍໃຊ້ Eager mode"

msgid ""
"This will have severe performance impact on the web interface, and will "
"break features depending on regular trigger (for example committing pending "
"changes, digest notifications, or backups)."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງເວັບອິນເຕີເຟດ, ແລະ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຟີເຈີທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບການກະຕຸ້ນ "
"(Trigger) ເປັນປົກກະຕິໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການຄອມມິດການປ່ຽນແປງ, ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບ Digest, "
"ຫຼື ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ)."

msgid ""
"For development, you might want to use eager configuration, which does "
"process all tasks in place:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຢາກໃຊ້ Eager configuration, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະປະມວນຜົນວຽກງານທັງໝົດໃນທີ່ດຽວ:"

msgid "Running Celery as system service"
msgstr "ການແລ່ນ Celery ເປັນ System service"

msgid ""
"Most likely you will want to run Celery as a daemon and that is covered "
"by :doc:`celery:userguide/daemonizing`. For the most common Linux setup "
"using systemd, adapt the example files listed below. These examples are "
"maintained in the Weblate source tree under :file:`weblate/examples/`; "
"Python wheels do not install these deployment samples."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວເຈົ້າຈະຢາກແລ່ນ Celery ເປັນ Daemon ເຊິ່ງມີອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :doc:`celery:userguide/"
"daemonizing`. ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Linux ທົ່ວໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ systemd, ໃຫ້ປັບໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້. "
"ໄຟລ໌ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງຢູ່ໃນ Weblate source tree ພາຍໃຕ້ :file:`weblate/examples/`; "
"Python wheels ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ Deployment samples ເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

msgid ""
"Systemd unit to be placed as :file:`/etc/systemd/system/celery-"
"weblate.service`:"
msgstr ""
"Systemd unit ທີ່ຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ທີ່ :file:`/etc/systemd/system/celery-weblate.service`:"

msgid ""
"Environment configuration to be placed as :file:`/etc/default/celery-"
"weblate`:"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Environment ທີ່ຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ທີ່ :file:`/etc/default/celery-weblate`:"

msgid ""
"Additional configuration to rotate Celery logs using :command:`logrotate` to "
"be placed as :file:`/etc/logrotate.d/celery`:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອ Rotate Celery logs ໂດຍໃຊ້ :command:`logrotate` "
"ທີ່ຕ້ອງວາງໄວ້ທີ່ :file:`/etc/logrotate.d/celery`:"

msgid "Periodic tasks using Celery beat"
msgstr "ວຽກງານເປັນໄລຍະໂດຍໃຊ້ Celery beat"

msgid ""
"Weblate comes with built-in setup for scheduled tasks. The task schedule is "
"stored in the database and tasks are executed by the Celery beat daemon."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ມາພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Built-in ສຳລັບ Scheduled tasks. "
"ຕາຕະລາງວຽກງານຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ວຽກງານຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໂດຍ Celery beat daemon."

msgid ""
"You can define additional tasks in :file:`settings.py`, for example "
"see :ref:`lazy-commit`."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດວຽກງານເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນ :file:`settings.py`, ຕົວຢ່າງເບິ່ງ :ref:`lazy-"
"commit`."

msgid "Monitoring Celery status"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມສະຖານະ Celery"

msgid ""
"You can find current length of the Celery task queues in "
"the :ref:`management-interface` or you can use :wladmin:`celery_queues` on "
"the command-line. In case the queue will get too long, you will also get "
"configuration error in the admin interface."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຄວາມຍາວປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ Celery task queues ໃນ :ref:`management-interface` "
"ຫຼື ໃຊ້ :wladmin:`celery_queues` ເທິງ Command-line. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຄິວ (Queue) ຍາວເກີນໄປ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"The Celery errors are by default only logged into Celery log and are not "
"visible to user. In case you want to have overview on such failures, it is "
"recommended to configure :ref:`collecting-errors`."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ Celery ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ Celery log ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້. "
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການພາບລວມຂອງຄວາມຜິດພາດດັ່ງກ່າວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`collecting-"
"errors`."

msgid "Single-process Celery setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Celery ແບບ Single-process"

msgid ""
"In case you have very limited memory, you might want to reduce number of "
"Weblate processes. All Celery tasks can be executed in a single process "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຈຳກັດຫຼາຍ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຢາກຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ Weblate processes. Celery "
"tasks ທັງໝົດສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ໃນ Process ດຽວໂດຍໃຊ້:"

msgid ""
"An installation using Docker can be configured to use a single-process "
"Celery setup by setting :envvar:`CELERY_SINGLE_PROCESS`."
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ Docker ສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Celery ແບບ Single-process "
"ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :envvar:`CELERY_SINGLE_PROCESS`."

msgid "This will have a noticeable performance impact on Weblate."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ Weblate ຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ."

msgid "Monitoring Weblate"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Weblate provides the ``/healthz/`` URL to be used in simple health checks, "
"for example using Kubernetes. The Docker container has built-in health check "
"using this URL."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ມີ URL ``/healthz/`` ໄວ້ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກວດສອບ Health check ແບບງ່າຍໆ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ Kubernetes. Docker container ມີ Built-in health check ທີ່ໃຊ້ URL ນີ້."

msgid ""
"For monitoring metrics of Weblate you can use the :http:get:`/api/metrics/` "
"API endpoint. Monitoring tools running locally can retrieve the same metrics "
"using the :wladmin:`metrics` command."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມຕົວຊີ້ວັດ (metrics) ຂອງ Weblate ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ API endpoint :http:get:`/"
"api/metrics/`. ເຄື່ອງມືຕິດຕາມທີ່ລັນຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ (locally) "
"ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຊີ້ວັດດຽວກັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ :wladmin:`metrics`."

msgid "`Weblate plugin for Munin <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/munin>`_"
msgstr "`Weblate plugin ສຳລັບ Munin <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/munin>`_"

msgid "Collecting error reports and monitoring performance"
msgstr "ການເກັບລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ແລະ ການຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບ"

msgid ""
"Weblate, as any other software, can fail. In order to collect useful failure "
"states we recommend to use third party services to collect such information. "
"This is especially useful in case of failing Celery tasks, which would "
"otherwise only report error to the logs and you won't get notified on them. "
"Weblate has support for the following services:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate, ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບຊອບແວອື່ນໆ, ສາມາດເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້. ເພື່ອເກັບສະຖານະຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເປັນປະໂຫຍດ, "
"ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ບໍລິການຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງກ່າວ. "
"ນີ້ຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດໂດຍສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ Celery tasks ລົ້ມເຫຼວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວມັນຈະລາຍງານພຽງແຕ່ໃນ Log ແລະ ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. Weblate "
"ຮອງຮັບບໍລິການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"The default Weblate configuration instruments Django to send e-mails upon "
"server errors via :py:class:`django:django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler`. "
"This is the least effort setup, but you should consider other options for "
"privacy reasons, as the error e-mails might include sensitive data. You can "
"read more on that in :ref:`django:logging-security-implications`."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ Weblate ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Django "
"ສົ່ງອີເມວເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນເຊີບເວີຜ່ານ :py:class:`django:django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler`. "
"ນີ້ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າຄວນພິຈາລະນາທາງເລືອກອື່ນຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກອີເມວຂໍ້ຜິດພາດອາດມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ :ref:`django:logging-"
"security-implications`."

msgid ""
"To disable this behavior, remove ``mail_admins`` from "
"the :setting:`django:LOGGING` in Weblate settings, or "
"disable :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_NOTIFY_ERROR` in the Docker environment."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປິດພຶດຕິກຳນີ້, ໃຫ້ເອົາ ``mail_admins`` ອອກຈາກ :setting:`django:LOGGING` "
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Weblate, ຫຼື ປິດ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_NOTIFY_ERROR` ໃນ Docker "
"environment."

msgid "Sentry"
msgstr "Sentry"

msgid ""
"Weblate has built-in support for `Sentry <https://sentry.io/>`_. To use it, "
"it's enough to set :setting:`SENTRY_DSN` in the :file:`settings.py`:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ມີການຮອງຮັບ `Sentry <https://sentry.io/>`_ ໃນຕົວ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`SENTRY_DSN` ໃນໄຟລ໌ :file:`settings.py`:"

msgid ""
"Sentry can be also used to monitor performance of Weblate by collecting "
"traces and profiles for defined percentage of operations. This can be "
"configured using :setting:`SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE` "
"and :setting:`SENTRY_PROFILES_SAMPLE_RATE`."
msgstr ""
"Sentry ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍການເກັບ Traces ແລະ Profiles "
"ສຳລັບເປີເຊັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຂອງການດຳເນີນງານ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE` "
"ແລະ :setting:`SENTRY_PROFILES_SAMPLE_RATE`."

msgid "Google Cloud Error Reporting"
msgstr "Google Cloud Error Reporting"

msgid ""
"Weblate can report handled server errors to `Google Cloud Error Reporting`_. "
"Install Weblate with the ``google-errors`` extra and "
"configure :setting:`GOOGLE_CLOUD_ERROR_REPORTING` in :file:`settings.py`:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງເຊີບເວີທີ່ຈັດການໄດ້ໄປຍັງ `Google Cloud Error "
"Reporting`_. ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Weblate ດ້ວຍ ``google-errors`` extra ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`GOOGLE_CLOUD_ERROR_REPORTING` ໃນ :file:`settings.py`:"

msgid ""
"Weblate automatically reports errors under the ``weblate`` service and uses "
"the current Weblate version or Git revision as the reported version. These "
"values can be overridden by setting ``service`` or ``version`` "
"in :setting:`GOOGLE_CLOUD_ERROR_REPORTING`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຈະລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພາຍໃຕ້ບໍລິການ ``weblate`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເວີຊັ່ນ Weblate "
"ຫຼື Git revision ປັດຈຸບັນເປັນເວີຊັ່ນທີ່ລາຍງານ. ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຖືກ Override ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"``service`` ຫຼື ``version`` ໃນ :setting:`GOOGLE_CLOUD_ERROR_REPORTING`."

msgid "OpenTelemetry"
msgstr "OpenTelemetry"

msgid ""
"Weblate can export backend traces using `OpenTelemetry <https://"
"opentelemetry.io/>`_. It uses OTLP over HTTP and can send traces to an "
"OpenTelemetry Collector or a compatible vendor endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດ Export backend traces ໂດຍໃຊ້ `OpenTelemetry <https://"
"opentelemetry.io/>`_. ມັນໃຊ້ OTLP over HTTP ແລະ ສາມາດສົ່ງ Traces ໄປຍັງ "
"OpenTelemetry Collector ຫຼື Vendor endpoint ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"The integration traces Django requests, Celery tasks, Redis, outgoing HTTP "
"requests, database calls, and Weblate-specific spans. Configure it "
"using :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_ENABLED`, :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`, "
"and :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE`."
msgstr ""
"Integration ດັ່ງກ່າວຈະຕິດຕາມ Django requests, Celery tasks, Redis, outgoing HTTP "
"requests, database calls, ແລະ Weblate-specific spans. "
"ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_ENABLED`, :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`, "
"ແລະ :setting:`OPENTELEMETRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE`."

msgid "Rollbar"
msgstr "Rollbar"

msgid ""
"Weblate has built-in support for `Rollbar <https://rollbar.com/>`_. To use "
"it, it's enough to follow instructions for `Rollbar notifier for Python "
"<https://docs.rollbar.com/docs/python/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ມີການຮອງຮັບ `Rollbar <https://rollbar.com/>`_ ໃນຕົວ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ, "
"ພຽງແຕ່ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບ `Rollbar notifier ສຳລັບ Python <https://"
"docs.rollbar.com/docs/python/>`_."

msgid "In short, you need to adjust :file:`settings.py`:"
msgstr "ໂດຍຫຍໍ້, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງ :file:`settings.py`:"

msgid ""
"Everything else is integrated automatically, you will now collect both "
"server and client side errors."
msgstr "ທຸກຢ່າງຖືກລວມເຂົ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ດຽວນີ້ເຈົ້າຈະເກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທັງຝັ່ງເຊີບເວີ ແລະ Client."

msgid ""
"Error logging also includes exceptions that were gracefully handled, but "
"might indicate a problem - such as failed parsing of an uploaded file."
msgstr ""
"Error logging ຍັງລວມເຖິງ Exception ທີ່ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແຕ່ອາດຊີ້ໃຫ້ເຫັນເຖິງບັນຫາ - ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການ Parse ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດຜິດພາດ."

msgid "Graylog log management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ Log ແບບ Graylog"

msgid ""
"Weblate can be configured to log using the GELF TCP protocol. This was "
"developed for Graylog integration, but can be used with any compliant "
"logging platform."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ Log ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ GELF TCP. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກພັດທະນາເພື່ອການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ "
"Graylog, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ Platform ການ Log ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid ""
"The configuration boilerplate is included in :ref:`sample-configuration`, "
"for Docker this can be configured using :envvar:`WEBLATE_LOG_GELF_HOST`."
msgstr ""
"Boilerplate ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ລວມຢູ່ໃນ :ref:`sample-configuration`, ສຳລັບ Docker "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :envvar:`WEBLATE_LOG_GELF_HOST`."

msgid "Migrating Weblate to another server"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍ Weblate ໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີອື່ນ"

msgid ""
"Migrating Weblate to another server should be pretty easy, however it stores "
"data in few locations which you should migrate carefully. The best approach "
"is to stop Weblate for the migration."
msgstr ""
"ການຍ້າຍ Weblate ໄປຍັງເຊີບເວີອື່ນຄວນຈະງ່າຍຫຼາຍ, "
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມມັນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນບາງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຄວນຍ້າຍຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ. ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການຢຸດ "
"Weblate ກ່ອນການຍ້າຍ."

msgid "Migrating database"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid ""
"The most straightforward approach is to use database native tools, as they "
"are usually the most effective (e.g. :command:`pg_dump`). Alternatively you "
"can use replication if your database supports it."
msgstr ""
"ວິທີທີ່ກົງໄປກົງມາທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືພື້ນຖານຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກປົກກະຕິພວກມັນມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: :command:`pg_dump`). ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Replication ຖ້າຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Migrating between databases described in :ref:`database-migration`."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍລະຫວ່າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນມີອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`database-migration`."

msgid "Migrating VCS repositories"
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍ VCS repositories"

msgid ""
"The VCS repositories stored under :setting:`DATA_DIR` need to be migrated as "
"well. You can simply copy them or use :command:`rsync` to do the migration "
"more effectively."
msgstr ""
"VCS repositories ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ :setting:`DATA_DIR` ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກຍ້າຍນຳ. "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກັອບປີ້ພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ :command:`rsync` ເພື່ອຍ້າຍໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Other notes"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດອື່ນໆ"

msgid ""
"Don't forget to move other services Weblate might have been using like "
"Valkey, Redis, Cron jobs or custom authentication backends."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມຍ້າຍບໍລິການອື່ນໆທີ່ Weblate ອາດຈະໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ ເຊັ່ນ: Valkey, Redis, Cron jobs ຫຼື Custom "
"authentication backends."

msgid "Installing using Docker"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ Docker"

msgid ""
"With dockerized Weblate deployment you can get your personal Weblate "
"instance up and running in seconds. All of Weblate's dependencies are "
"already included. PostgreSQL is set up as the default database and Valkey as "
"a caching backend."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍການ Deployment Weblate ແບບ Docker, ເຈົ້າສາມາດມີ Weblate instance "
"ສ່ວນຕົວແລ່ນໄດ້ພາຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດວິນາທີ. Dependency ທັງໝົດຂອງ Weblate ຖືກລວມໄວ້ແລ້ວ. PostgreSQL "
"ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ Valkey ເປັນ Caching backend."

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

msgid ""
"The following examples assume you have a working Docker environment, with "
"``docker-compose-plugin`` installed. Please check the Docker documentation "
"for instructions."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າເຈົ້າມີ Docker environment ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້, ພ້ອມກັບ ``docker-compose-"
"plugin`` ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບເອກະສານ Docker ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳ."

msgid ""
"This creates a Weblate deployment server via HTTP, so you should place it "
"behind HTTPS terminating proxy. You can also deploy with a HTTPS proxy, "
"see :ref:`docker-https-portal`. For larger setups, please see :ref:`docker-"
"scaling`."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສ້າງ Weblate deployment server ຜ່ານ HTTP, ສະນັ້ນເຈົ້າຄວນວາງມັນໄວ້ຫຼັງ HTTPS "
"terminating proxy. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດ Deploy ດ້ວຍ HTTPS proxy, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-https-"
"portal`. ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-scaling`."

msgid "Clone the weblate-docker repo:"
msgstr "Clone ເອົາ Weblate-docker repo:"

msgid ""
"The Docker Compose files are example deployment configurations. Operators "
"typically customize them for their own deployment and maintain those local "
"changes. Weblate application updates are delivered through Docker image "
"tags; there is no release-bound update path for customized Compose files."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Docker Compose ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Deployment ຕົວຢ່າງ. "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບຈະປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນສຳລັບການ Deployment ຂອງຕົນເອງ ແລະ "
"ເບິ່ງແຍງການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ການອັບເດດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Weblate ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານ Docker "
"image tags; ບໍ່ມີເສັ້ນທາງການອັບເດດທີ່ຜູກມັດກັບ Release ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Compose ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Create a :file:`docker-compose.override.yml` file with your settings. "
"See :ref:`docker-environment` for full list of environment variables."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ :file:`docker-compose.override.yml` ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-environment` ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ເຕັມຂອງ Environment variables."

msgid ""
"If :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` is not set, the admin user is created "
"with a random password shown on first startup."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, Admin user "
"ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານແບບສຸ່ມທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

msgid ""
"The provided example makes Weblate listen on port 80, edit the port mapping "
"in the :file:`docker-compose.override.yml` file to change it."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ລໍຖ້າຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ Port 80, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ Port mapping "
"ໃນໄຟລ໌ :file:`docker-compose.override.yml` ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງມັນ."

msgid "Start Weblate containers:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Weblate containers:"

msgid ""
"Enjoy your Weblate deployment, it's accessible on port 80 of the ``weblate`` "
"container."
msgstr ""
"ເພີດເພີນກັບການ Deploy Weblate ຂອງທ່ານ, ມັນສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ທາງ Port 80 ຂອງ "
"``weblate`` container."

msgid "Choosing Docker image registry"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ Docker image registry"

msgid "Weblate containers are published to following registries:"
msgstr "Weblate containers ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໄປຍັງ Registry ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Docker Hub, see https://hub.docker.com/r/weblate/weblate"
msgstr "Docker Hub, ເບິ່ງ https://hub.docker.com/r/weblate/weblate"

msgid ""
"GitHub Packages registry, see https://github.com/WeblateOrg/docker/pkgs/"
"container/weblate"
msgstr ""
"GitHub Packages registry, ເບິ່ງ https://github.com/WeblateOrg/docker/pkgs/"
"container/weblate"

msgid ""
"All examples currently fetch images from Docker Hub, please adjust the "
"configuration accordingly to use a different registry."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດໃນປັດຈຸບັນຈະດຶງ Images ຈາກ Docker Hub, ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ "
"Registry ອື່ນ."

msgid "Choosing Docker image tag"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ Docker image tag"

msgid "Please choose a tag that matches your environment and expectations:"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເລືອກ Tag ທີ່ກົງກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ ແລະ ຄວາມຄາດຫວັງຂອງທ່ານ:"

msgid "Tag name"
msgstr "ຊື່ Tag"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

msgid "Use case"
msgstr "ກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານ"

msgid "Weblate stable release, matches latest tagged release"
msgstr "Weblate stable release, ກົງກັບ Release ລ່າສຸດທີ່ຖືກ Tag"

msgid "Rolling updates in a production environment"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແບບ Rolling ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ"

msgid "Weblate stable release"
msgstr "Weblate stable release"

msgid "Rolling updates within a calendar year in a production environment"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແບບ Rolling ພາຍໃນປີປະຕິທິນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ"

msgid "Rolling updates within a monthly release in a production environment"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແບບ Rolling ພາຍໃນ Release ປະຈຳເດືອນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ"

msgid "Well defined deploy in a production environment"
msgstr "ການ Deploy ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈິງ"

msgid ""
"Weblate stable release with development changes in the Docker container (for "
"example updated dependencies)"
msgstr ""
"Weblate stable release ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທາງການພັດທະນາໃນ Docker container (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"Dependency ທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດ)"

msgid "Rolling updates in a staging environment"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແບບ Rolling ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Staging"

msgid "Well defined deploy in a staging environment"
msgstr "ການ Deploy ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ Staging"

msgid "Development version Weblate from Git"
msgstr "Weblate ຮຸ່ນພັດທະນາຈາກ Git"

msgid "Rolling updates to test upcoming Weblate features"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດແບບ Rolling ເພື່ອທົດສອບຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໆຂອງ Weblate"

msgid "Well defined deploy to test upcoming Weblate features"
msgstr "ການ Deploy ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນເພື່ອທົດສອບຟີເຈີໃໝ່ໆຂອງ Weblate"

msgid ""
"Every image is tested by our CI before it gets published, so even the "
"`bleeding` version should be quite safe to use."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກ Image ຈະຖືກທົດສອບໂດຍ CI ຂອງພວກເຮົາກ່ອນເຜີຍແຜ່, ສະນັ້ນຮຸ່ນ `bleeding` "
"ກໍຄວນຈະປອດໄພໃນການໃຊ້ງານໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "Full list of published tags can be found at `GitHub Packages`_"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ເຕັມຂອງ Tags ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ `GitHub Packages`_"

msgid "Docker container with HTTPS support"
msgstr "Docker container ພ້ອມການຮອງຮັບ HTTPS"

msgid ""
"Please see :ref:`docker-deploy` for generic deployment instructions, this "
"section only mentions differences compared to it."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-deploy` ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳໃນການ Deploy ທົ່ວໄປ, "
"ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະກ່າວເຖິງພຽງແຕ່ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກສ່ວນນັ້ນ."

msgid "SSL terminating proxy"
msgstr "SSL terminating proxy"

msgid ""
"SSL can be terminated outside Weblate container. To make this work well "
"together, several headers need to be passed to the container so that it is "
"aware of its actual environment. In more detail, these headers are described "
"in :ref:`reverse-proxy`."
msgstr ""
"SSL ສາມາດຖືກ Terminate ຢູ່ພາຍນອກ Weblate container. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"Headers ຫຼາຍອັນຕ້ອງຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ container ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຮັບຮູ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຈິງຂອງມັນ. "
"ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, Headers ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`reverse-proxy`."

msgid "Example nginx reverse proxy configuration for a Docker container."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ nginx reverse proxy ສຳລັບ Docker container."

msgid "Docker container environment for external SSL termination."
msgstr "Docker container environment ສຳລັບການເຮັດ SSL termination ພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Replace the example trusted proxy address with the address or network of the "
"reverse proxy as seen by the Weblate container. Make sure that untrusted "
"clients cannot reach a published container port by bypassing the reverse "
"proxy."
msgstr ""

msgid "Using own SSL certificates"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງທ່ານເອງ"

msgid ""
"In case you have own SSL certificate you want to use, simply place the files "
"into the Weblate data volume (see :ref:`docker-volume`):"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງຕົນເອງທີ່ຢາກໃຊ້, ພຽງແຕ່ວາງໄຟລ໌ໄວ້ໃນ Weblate data volume "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-volume`):"

msgid ""
":file:`ssl/fullchain.pem` containing the certificate including any needed CA "
"certificates"
msgstr ":file:`ssl/fullchain.pem` ທີ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ລວມເຖິງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ໃດໆທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

msgid ":file:`ssl/privkey.pem` containing the private key"
msgstr ":file:`ssl/privkey.pem` ທີ່ມີ Private key"

msgid ""
"Both of these files must be owned by the same user as the one starting the "
"docker container and have file mask set to ``600`` (readable and writable "
"only by the owning user)."
msgstr ""
"ທັງສອງໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຕ້ອງມີ Owner ເປັນ User ດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Docker container ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີ File "
"mask ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``600`` (ອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄດ້ໂດຍເຈົ້າຂອງໄຟລ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)."

msgid ""
"Additionally, Weblate container will now accept SSL connections on port "
"4443, you will want to include the port forwarding for HTTPS in docker "
"compose override:"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, Weblate container ຈະຍອມຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSL ຢູ່ Port 4443, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງການລວມ "
"Port forwarding ສຳລັບ HTTPS ໃນ Docker compose override:"

msgid ""
"If you already host other sites on the same server, it is likely ports "
"``80`` and ``443`` are used by a reverse proxy, such as NGINX. To pass the "
"HTTPS connection from NGINX to the docker container, you can use the "
"following configuration:"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ໂຮສເວັບໄຊອື່ນຢູ່ໃນເຊີບເວີດຽວກັນ, ເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າ Ports ``80`` ແລະ ``443`` ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ "
"Reverse proxy ເຊັ່ນ NGINX. ເພື່ອສົ່ງ HTTPS connection ຈາກ NGINX ໄປຍັງ Docker "
"container, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Replace ``<SITE_URL>``, ``<SITE>`` and ``<EXPOSED_DOCKER_PORT>`` with actual "
"values from your environment."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນ ``<SITE_URL>``, ``<SITE>`` ແລະ ``<EXPOSED_DOCKER_PORT>`` "
"ດ້ວຍຄ່າຈິງຈາກສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "Automatic SSL certificates using Let’s Encrypt"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ Let’s Encrypt"

msgid ""
"In case you want to use `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`_ "
"automatically generated SSL certificates on public installation, you need to "
"add a reverse HTTPS proxy an additional Docker container, `https-portal "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/steveltn/https-portal/>`_ will be used for that. "
"This is made use of in the :file:`docker-compose-https.yml` file. Then "
"create a :file:`docker-compose-https.override.yml` file with your settings:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າຢາກໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ `Let’s Encrypt <https://"
"letsencrypt.org/>`_ ໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງສາທາລະນະ, ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ Reverse HTTPS proxy "
"ເປັນ Docker container ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ, `https-portal <https://hub.docker.com/r/"
"steveltn/https-portal/>`_ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ :file:`docker-"
"compose-https.yml`. ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງໄຟລ໌ :file:`docker-compose-https.override.yml` "
"ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ:"

msgid ""
"Whenever invoking :program:`docker compose` you need to pass both files to "
"it, and then do:"
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຮຽກໃຊ້ :program:`docker compose` ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສົ່ງທັງສອງໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ມັນ, ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "Upgrading the Docker container"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ Docker container"

msgid ""
"Usually it is good idea to only update the Weblate container and keep the "
"PostgreSQL container at the version you have, as upgrading PostgreSQL is "
"quite painful and in most cases does not bring many benefits."
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວມັນເປັນການດີທີ່ຈະອັບເດດສະເພາະ Weblate container ແລະ ຮັກສາ PostgreSQL "
"container ໄວ້ທີ່ເວີຊັ່ນທີ່ເຈົ້າມີ, ເນື່ອງຈາກການອັບເດດ PostgreSQL ແມ່ນຂ້ອນຂ້າງຫຍຸ້ງຍາກ ແລະ "
"ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳມາເຊິ່ງຜົນປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍປານໃດ."

msgid ""
"You can do this by sticking with the existing docker-compose and just pull "
"the latest images and then restart:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ Docker-compose ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ພຽງແຕ່ Pull images ລ່າສຸດ "
"ຈາກນັ້ນ Restart:"

msgid ""
"The Weblate database should be automatically migrated on first startup, and "
"there should be no need for additional manual actions."
msgstr ""
"ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Weblate ຄວນຈະຖືກ Migrate ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຄວນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກງານດ້ວຍຕົນເອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"Direct upgrades are only supported for releases from the current or previous "
"calendar year. If you need to upgrade from an older release, upgrade first "
"to an intermediate version listed in :ref:`version-specific-instructions`."
msgstr ""
"ການອັບເດດໂດຍກົງຈະຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ Release ຈາກປີປະຕິທິນປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ປີກ່ອນໜ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງອັບເດດຈາກ Release ທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າ, "
"ໃຫ້ອັບເດດເປັນເວີຊັ່ນກາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`version-specific-instructions` ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"If you use the example Compose files without local changes, you can also "
"review updates in the ``docker-compose`` repository, though this is not "
"needed for most Weblate upgrades. Customized Compose files need to be "
"maintained as part of your deployment. See :ref:`docker-postgres-upgrade` "
"for upgrading the PostgreSQL server."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ Compose ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດກວດສອບການອັບເດດໃນ "
"``docker-compose`` repository, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການອັບເດດ Weblate ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. "
"ໄຟລ໌ Compose ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເບິ່ງແຍງໃນສ່ວນຂອງການ Deployment ຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-postgres-upgrade` ສຳລັບການອັບເດດ PostgreSQL server."

msgid "Upgrading PostgreSQL container"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດ PostgreSQL container"

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL 18 changed the default data directory inside the container. A "
"common older setup mounted the database volume at ``/var/lib/postgresql/"
"data``, while PostgreSQL 18 now uses ``/var/lib/postgresql`` by default."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL 18 ປ່ຽນແປງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນພາຍໃນ container. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເກົ່າທົ່ວໄປຈະ Mount "
"database volume ໄວ້ທີ່ ``/var/lib/postgresql/data``, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ PostgreSQL 18 "
"ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ ``/var/lib/postgresql`` ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"If you are upgrading from an older version, either update the mount target "
"in your Docker configuration to the new path, or keep the old mount target "
"and set ``PGDATA`` accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງອັບເດດຈາກເວີຊັ່ນທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່າ, ໃຫ້ອັບເດດ Mount target ໃນ Docker configuration "
"ຂອງທ່ານເປັນເສັ້ນທາງໃໝ່, ຫຼື ຮັກສາ Mount target ອັນເກົ່າໄວ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``PGDATA`` ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"Leaving the old mount target unchanged without setting ``PGDATA`` can cause "
"PostgreSQL to write its data outside the persisted volume."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ອຍໃຫ້ Mount target ເກົ່າໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ``PGDATA`` ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ PostgreSQL "
"ຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນໄວ້ນອກ Persisted volume."

msgid ""
"See `PGDATA documentation <https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres#pgdata>`_ for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ `ເອກະສານ PGDATA <https://hub.docker.com/_/postgres#pgdata>`_ "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"PostgreSQL containers do not support automatic upgrading between version, "
"you need to perform the upgrade manually. Following steps show one of the "
"options of upgrading."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL containers ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດລະຫວ່າງເວີຊັ່ນ, "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດການອັບເດດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໜຶ່ງໃນທາງເລືອກຂອງການອັບເດດ."

msgid "https://github.com/docker-library/postgres/issues/37"
msgstr "https://github.com/docker-library/postgres/issues/37"

msgid "Stop Weblate container:"
msgstr "ຢຸດ Weblate container:"

msgid "Backup the database:"
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

msgid "Stop the database container:"
msgstr "ຢຸດ Database container:"

msgid "Remove the PostgreSQL volume:"
msgstr "ລຶບ PostgreSQL volume:"

msgid ""
"The volume name contains name of the Docker Compose project, which is by "
"default the directory name what is ``weblate-docker`` in this documentation."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ Volume ປະກອບມີຊື່ຂອງ Docker Compose project, ເຊິ່ງໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ "
"ເຊິ່ງໃນເອກະສານນີ້ແມ່ນ ``weblate-docker``."

msgid "Adjust :file:`docker-compose.yml` to use new PostgreSQL version."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງ :file:`docker-compose.yml` ເພື່ອໃຊ້ PostgreSQL ເວີຊັ່ນໃໝ່."

msgid "Start the database container:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Database container:"

msgid "Restore the database from the backup:"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈາກການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ:"

msgid "Please check that the database name matches :envvar:`POSTGRES_DB`."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນກົງກັບ :envvar:`POSTGRES_DB`."

msgid ""
"(Optional) Update password for the Weblate user. This might be needed when "
"migrating to PostgreSQL 14 or 15 as way of storing passwords has been "
"changed:"
msgstr ""
"(ທາງເລືອກ) ອັບເດດລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ Weblate user. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈຳເປັນເມື່ອຍ້າຍໄປຫາ PostgreSQL 14 "
"ຫຼື 15 ເນື່ອງຈາກວິທີການຈັດເກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານໄດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ:"

msgid "Start all remaining containers:"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Containers ທີ່ເຫຼືອທັງໝົດ:"

msgid "Admin sign in"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ Admin"

msgid ""
"After container setup, you can sign in as `admin` user with password "
"provided in :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, or a random password generated "
"on first start if that was not set."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າ Container ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເປັນ `admin` user "
"ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານທີ່ລະບຸໃນ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, ຫຼື "
"ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຸ່ມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

msgid ""
"To reset `admin` password, restart the container "
"with :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` set to new password."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຣີເຊັດລະຫັດຜ່ານ `admin`, ໃຫ້ Restart container "
"ໂດຍຕັ້ງ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` ເປັນລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່."

msgid "Number of processes and memory consumption"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Processes ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ"

msgid ""
"The number of worker processes for both the web application and Celery is "
"determined automatically based on number of CPUs. This works well for most "
"cloud virtual machines as these typically have few CPUs and good amount of "
"memory."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກ (worker processes) ສຳລັບທັງເວັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ ແລະ Celery "
"ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນ CPU. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບ virtual machines "
"ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນຄລາວ ເພາະປົກກະຕິແລ້ວພວກມັນມີ CPU ໜ້ອຍ ແຕ່ມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳໃນປະລິມານທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

msgid ""
"In case you have a lot of CPU cores and hit out of memory issues, try "
"reducing number of workers:"
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີ CPU cores ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ພົບບັນຫາ Memory ບໍ່ພໍ, ໃຫ້ລອງຫຼຸດຈຳນວນ Worker ລົງ:"

msgid "You can also fine-tune individual worker categories:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງປະເພດ Worker ແຕ່ລະອັນໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ:"

msgid ""
"The prefetch multiplier controls how many tasks each worker execution slot "
"can reserve. The default of one avoids reserving additional long-running or "
"payload-heavy tasks. The notification worker uses four in this example "
"because its short tasks can benefit from buffering. Increase the value only "
"after measuring queue latency and worker memory usage."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄູນ prefetch ຄວບຄຸມວ່າແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ worker ສາມາດຈອງວຽກໄດ້ຈັກວຽກ. "
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1 ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຈອງວຽກທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ ຫຼື ວຽກທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນໜັກເພີ່ມເຕີມ. worker ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຊ້ "
"4 ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ເພາະວ່າວຽກໄລຍະສັ້ນຂອງມັນສາມາດໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ "
"(buffering). ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ວັດແທກຄວາມຊັກຊ້າຂອງຄິວ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ worker "
"ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Memory usage can be further reduced by running only a single Celery process:"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳສາມາດຫຼຸດລົງໄດ້ຕື່ມອີກໂດຍການແລ່ນພຽງ Celery process ດຽວ:"

msgid "Scaling horizontally"
msgstr "ການຂະຫຍາຍລະບົບອອກທາງຂ້າງ (Horizontal scaling)"

msgid ""
"You can run multiple Weblate containers to scale the service horizontally. "
"The :file:`/app/data` volume has to be shared by all containers, it is "
"recommended to use cluster filesystem such as GlusterFS for this. "
"The :file:`/app/cache` volume should be separate for each container."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດແລ່ນ Weblate containers ຫຼາຍອັນເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍບໍລິການອອກທາງຂ້າງ. Volume :file:`/"
"app/data` ຕ້ອງຖືກແບ່ງປັນໂດຍທຸກ Container, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Cluster filesystem ເຊັ່ນ "
"GlusterFS ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. Volume :file:`/app/cache` ຄວນຈະແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ "
"Container."

msgid ""
"Each Weblate container has defined role using :envvar:`WEBLATE_SERVICE` "
"environment variable. Please follow carefully the documentation as some of "
"the services should be running just once in the cluster, and the order of "
"the services matters as well."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະ Weblate container ມີບົດບາດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Environment "
"variable :envvar:`WEBLATE_SERVICE`. ກະລຸນາປະຕິບັດຕາມເອກະສານຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກບາງບໍລິການຄວນຈະແລ່ນພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວໃນ Cluster, ແລະ ລຳດັບຂອງບໍລິການກໍມີຄວາມສຳຄັນເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid ""
"You can find example setup in the ``docker-compose`` repo as `docker-compose-"
"split.yml <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/docker-compose/blob/main/docker-"
"compose-split.yml>`__."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຢ່າງໃນ ``docker-compose`` repo ໄດ້ທີ່ `docker-compose-"
"split.yml <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/docker-compose/blob/main/docker-"
"compose-split.yml>`__."

msgid "Docker environment variables"
msgstr "Docker environment variables"

msgid ""
"Many of Weblate's :ref:`config` can be set in the Docker container using the "
"environment variables described below."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`config` ຫຼາຍຢ່າງຂອງ Weblate ສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງໃນ Docker container ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"Environment variables ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້."

msgid ""
"If you need to define a setting not exposed through Docker environment "
"variables, see :ref:`docker-custom-config`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດເຜີຍຜ່ານ Docker environment variables, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-custom-config`."

msgid "Passing secrets"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງ Secret"

msgid ""
"Weblate container supports passing secrets as files. To utilize that, append "
"``_FILE`` suffix to the environment variable and pass secret file via Docker."
msgstr ""
"Weblate container ຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງ Secret ເປັນໄຟລ໌. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມSuffix ``_FILE`` "
"ໃສ່ໃນ Environment variable ແລະ ສົ່ງ Secret file ຜ່ານ Docker."

msgid "Related :file:`docker-compose.yml` might look like:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ :file:`docker-compose.yml` ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງອາດຈະມີລັກສະນະຄື:"

msgid ""
"`How to use secrets in Docker Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/how-"
"tos/use-secrets/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ວິທີການໃຊ້ Secrets ໃນ Docker Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/how-tos/"
"use-secrets/>`_"

msgid "Generic settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ"

msgid "Configures Django debug mode using :setting:`DEBUG`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Django debug mode ໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`DEBUG`."

msgid ""
"Configures the logging verbosity. Set this to ``DEBUG`` to get more detailed "
"logs."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ Logging. ຕັ້ງເປັນ ``DEBUG`` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ Log ທີ່ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Defaults to ``INFO`` when :envvar:`WEBLATE_DEBUG` is turned off, ``DEBUG`` "
"is used when debug mode is turned on."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``INFO`` ເມື່ອ :envvar:`WEBLATE_DEBUG` ຖືກປິດ, ``DEBUG`` ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເມື່ອ "
"Debug mode ຖືກເປີດ."

msgid "For more silent logging use ``ERROR`` or ``WARNING``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Log ທີ່ງຽບກວ່າ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``ERROR`` ຫຼື ``WARNING``."

msgid "Configures the logging of the database queries verbosity."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງ Logging ຂອງ Database queries."

msgid ""
"Configures remote logging using GELF TCP connection. Can be used to "
"integrate with Graylog."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Remote logging ໂດຍໃຊ້ GELF TCP connection. ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Graylog."

msgid "Use custom port for :envvar:`WEBLATE_LOG_GELF_HOST`, defaults to 12201."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Custom port ສຳລັບ :envvar:`WEBLATE_LOG_GELF_HOST`, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 12201."

msgid "Changes the site-title shown in the header of all pages."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ Site-title ທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ Header ຂອງທຸກໜ້າ."

msgid "Configures the site domain. This parameter is required."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Site domain. ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ."

msgid "Include port if using a non-standard one."
msgstr "ລວມ Port ຖ້າໃຊ້ Port ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ."

msgid ""
"Configures the site-admin's name and e-mail. It is used for "
"both :setting:`ADMINS` setting and creating `admin` user "
"(see :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` for more info on that)."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ ແລະ ອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງເວັບໄຊ. ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບທັງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ADMINS` ແລະ "
"ການສ້າງ `admin` user (ເບິ່ງ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ)."

msgid "Sets the password for the `admin` user."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບ `admin` user."

msgid ""
"If not set and `admin` user does not exist, it is created with a random "
"password shown on first container startup."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້ ແລະ `admin` user ບໍ່ມີຢູ່, ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານສຸ່ມທີ່ສະແດງໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"container ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ."

msgid "If not set and `admin` user exists, no action is performed."
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໄວ້ ແລະ `admin` user ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການດຳເນີນການໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"If set the `admin` user is adjusted on every container startup to "
"match :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_NAME` "
"and :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_EMAIL`."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຕັ້ງໄວ້ `admin` user ຈະຖືກປັບປຸງໃນທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ Container "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_NAME` "
"ແລະ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADMIN_EMAIL`."

msgid ""
"It might be a security risk to store password in the configuration file. "
"Consider using this variable only for initial setup (or let Weblate generate "
"random password on initial startup) or for password recovery."
msgstr ""
"ມັນອາດເປັນຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການເກັບລະຫັດຜ່ານໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ Variable "
"ນີ້ສະເພາະການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັ້ງທຳອິດ (ຫຼື ໃຫ້ Weblate ສ້າງລະຫັດຜ່ານສຸ່ມໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ) ຫຼື "
"ສຳລັບການກູ້ຄືນລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

msgid ""
"Whether to send e-mail to admins upon server error. Turned on by default."
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງອີເມວຫາ Admin ເມື່ອເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນເຊີບເວີຫຼືບໍ່. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid ""
"You might want to use other error collection like Sentry or Rollbar and turn "
"this off."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຢາກໃຊ້ການເກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ Sentry ຫຼື Rollbar ແລະ ປິດສິ່ງນີ້."

msgid "The email address that error messages are sent from."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຖືກສົ່ງມາຈາກ."

msgid "Configures the address for outgoing e-mails."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ສຳລັບອີເມວຂາອອກ."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ADMINS_CONTACT`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ADMINS_CONTACT`."

msgid "Configures contact form behavior, see :setting:`CONTACT_FORM`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຟອມຕິດຕໍ່, ເບິ່ງ :setting:`CONTACT_FORM`."

msgid "Configures allowed HTTP hostnames using :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP hostnames ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS`."

msgid "Defaults to ``*`` which allows all hostnames."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``*`` ເຊິ່ງອະນຸຍາດທຸກ Hostnames."

msgid ""
"Configures whether registrations are open by "
"toggling :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າການລົງທະບຽນເປີດຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການສັ່ງເປີດ/ປິດ :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_OPEN`."

msgid ""
"Configures whether captcha is used for registration and other "
"unauthenticated actions, see :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_CAPTCHA`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າວ່າໃຊ້ Captcha ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ການກະທຳອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນຫຼືບໍ່, "
"ເບິ່ງ :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_CAPTCHA`."

msgid ""
"Configure which authentication methods can be used to create new account "
"via :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_BACKENDS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າວິທີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃດທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່ໄດ້ຜ່ານ :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_BACKENDS`."

msgid "Configures :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_REBIND`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :std:setting:`REGISTRATION_REBIND`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_DISPOSABLE_EMAILS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`REGISTRATION_ALLOW_DISPOSABLE_EMAILS`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."

msgid "Defaults to enabled."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເປີດໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "Configures :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`PROJECT_WEB_RESTRICT_ALLOWLIST`."

msgid "Expects a comma-separated list of trusted project slugs."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການລາຍຊື່ Project slugs ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ."

msgid "Configures :setting:`WEBHOOK_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`WEBHOOK_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`WEBHOOK_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."

msgid "Expects a comma-separated list of trusted hostnames or domains."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການລາຍຊື່ Hostnames ຫຼື Domains ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_SIZE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ALLOWED_ASSET_SIZE`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ASSET_RESTRICT_PRIVATE`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ASSET_PRIVATE_ALLOWLIST`."

msgid ""
"Configures the used time zone in Weblate, "
"see :std:setting:`django:TIME_ZONE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Time zone ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ Weblate, ເບິ່ງ :std:setting:`django:TIME_ZONE`."

msgid ""
"To change the time zone of the Docker container itself, use the ``TZ`` "
"environment variable."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ Time zone ຂອງ Docker container ເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Environment variable ``TZ``."

msgid ""
"Makes Weblate assume it is operated behind a reverse HTTPS proxy, it makes "
"Weblate use HTTPS in e-mail and API links or set secure flags on cookies."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ຄິດວ່າຕົນເອງຖືກໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຫຼັງ Reverse HTTPS proxy, ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ໃຊ້ "
"HTTPS ໃນອີເມວ ແລະ API links ຫຼື ຕັ້ງ Secure flags ໃສ່ໃນ Cookies."

msgid "Please see :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` documentation for possible caveats."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານ :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"This does not make the Weblate container accept HTTPS connections, you need "
"to configure that as well, see :ref:`docker-ssl` for examples."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate container ຍອມຮັບ HTTPS connections, "
"ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສິ່ງນັ້ນນຳ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-ssl` ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງ."

msgid "Controls whether the bundled NGINX listens on IPv6 addresses."
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວ່າ Bundled NGINX ຟັງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ທີ່ IPv6 addresses ຫຼືບໍ່."

msgid ""
"``auto`` to enable IPv6 listeners only when IPv6 is available in the "
"container runtime. This is the default."
msgstr ""
"``auto`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ IPv6 listeners ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີ IPv6 ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ Container runtime. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "``on`` to always enable IPv6 listeners."
msgstr "``on`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ IPv6 listeners ສະເໝີ."

msgid "``off`` to disable IPv6 listeners."
msgstr "``off`` ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ IPv6 listeners."

msgid ""
"Lets Weblate fetch the IP address from any given HTTP header. Use this when "
"using a reverse proxy in front of the Weblate container."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate ດຶງ IP address ຈາກ HTTP header ໃດໆທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Reverse "
"proxy ຢູ່ທາງໜ້າ Weblate container."

msgid ""
"Enables :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` and "
"sets :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER`."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`IP_BEHIND_REVERSE_PROXY` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`IP_PROXY_HEADER`."

msgid ""
"When set to ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``, the bundled nginx resolves the client "
"address using :envvar:`WEBLATE_TRUSTED_PROXY_ADDRESSES`, uses that address "
"in its logs, and forwards one normalized address to Weblate."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The bundled nginx no longer trusts ``X-Forwarded-For`` from all network "
"addresses. Trusted proxy addresses have to be configured explicitly."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The format must conform to Django's expectations. Django `transforms "
"<https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/2.2/ref/request-response/"
"#django.http.HttpRequest.META>`_ raw HTTP header names as follows:"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບຕ້ອງສອດຄ່ອງກັບຄວາມຄາດຫວັງຂອງ Django. Django `ແປງ <https://"
"docs.djangoproject.com/en/2.2/ref/request-response/"
"#django.http.HttpRequest.META>`_ ຊື່ Raw HTTP header ດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "converts all characters to uppercase"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດເປັນຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່"

msgid "replaces any hyphens with underscores"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເຄື່ອງໝາຍ Hyphens ເປັນ Underscores"

msgid "prepends ``HTTP_`` prefix"
msgstr "ເຕີມຄຳນຳໜ້າ ``HTTP_``"

msgid "So ``X-Forwarded-For`` would be mapped to ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``."
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ``X-Forwarded-For`` ຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``."

msgid ""
"Configures the IPv4 or IPv6 addresses, networks, or hostnames of reverse "
"proxies trusted by the bundled nginx to supply ``X-Forwarded-For``. Separate "
"multiple values by whitespace."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This setting is used only when :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_HEADER` is "
"``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``. If the list is empty, nginx uses the immediate TCP "
"peer in its logs and forwards that address to Weblate."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only list proxies under your control, and do not expose the Weblate "
"container through a path which bypasses them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Configures :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`IP_PROXY_OFFSET`."

msgid ""
"When :envvar:`WEBLATE_IP_PROXY_HEADER` is ``HTTP_X_FORWARDED_FOR``, the "
"bundled nginx forwards one normalized address and the container uses an "
"effective offset of ``0``."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A boolean that specifies whether to use the :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Port` "
"header in preference to the SERVER_PORT META variable. This should only be "
"enabled if a proxy which sets this header is in use."
msgstr ""
"Boolean ທີ່ລະບຸວ່າຈະໃຊ້ Header :http:header:`X-Forwarded-Port` ແທນຕົວແປ "
"SERVER_PORT META ຫຼືບໍ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີ Proxy ທີ່ຕັ້ງ Header ນີ້ຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "This is a boolean setting (use ``\"true\"`` or ``\"false\"``)."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Boolean (ໃຊ້ ``\"true\"`` ຫຼື ``\"false\"``)."

msgid ""
"A tuple representing an HTTP header/value combination that signifies a "
"request is secure. This is needed when Weblate is running behind a reverse "
"proxy doing SSL termination which does not pass standard HTTPS headers."
msgstr ""
"Tuple ທີ່ເປັນຕົວແທນຂອງການປະສົມ HTTP header/value ທີ່ລະບຸວ່າ Request ມີຄວາມປອດໄພ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເມື່ອ Weblate ແລ່ນຢູ່ຫຼັງ Reverse proxy ທີ່ເຮັດ SSL termination ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ສົ່ງ "
"Standard HTTPS headers."

msgid ""
"Enables :setting:`REQUIRE_LOGIN` to enforce authentication on whole Weblate."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`REQUIRE_LOGIN` ເພື່ອກຳນົດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນທົ່ວ Weblate."

msgid ""
"Enables the :ref:`legal` module in Docker deployments. By default, the "
"integration is disabled; leave this variable unset or empty to disable it."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ :ref:`legal` ໃນ Docker deployments. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Integration "
"ຈະຖືກປິດ; ໃຫ້ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ Variable ນີ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອປິດມັນ."

msgid ""
"``tos-confirm`` to enable the legal module and enforce legal document "
"confirmation during social authentication and for signed-in users."
msgstr ""
"``tos-confirm`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນທາງກົດໝາຍ ແລະ "
"ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍໃນລະຫວ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍ ແລະ "
"ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"``wllegal`` to enable the same integration and additionally load the hosted "
"legal document templates from ``wllegal``. These templates are used by "
"services operated by Weblate s.r.o. and are not intended for general use."
msgstr ""
"``wllegal`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ Integration ດຽວກັນ ແລະ ໂຫຼດ Legal document templates ຈາກ "
"``wllegal``. Templates ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍລິການທີ່ເບິ່ງແຍງໂດຍ Weblate s.r.o. ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ."

msgid ""
"To provide your own legal documents in Docker, override the templates "
"in :file:`/app/data/python/customize/templates/legal/documents`, "
"see :ref:`docker-static-override`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອສະໜອງເອກະສານກົດໝາຍຂອງທ່ານເອງໃນ Docker, ໃຫ້ Override templates ໃນ :file:`/app/"
"data/python/customize/templates/legal/documents`, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`docker-static-"
"override`."

msgid ""
"Recreate the Docker container after changing this environment variable, for "
"example using :program:`docker compose up -d`. Restarting an existing "
"container does not apply changed environment values."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ Docker container ໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນແປງ Environment variable ນີ້, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`docker compose up -d`. ການ Restart container "
"ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າ Environment ທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄປ."

msgid ""
"Configures :setting:`LEGAL_DOCUMENT_CSS_CLASS` in Docker deployments "
"with :envvar:`WEBLATE_LEGAL_INTEGRATION` enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LEGAL_DOCUMENT_CSS_CLASS` ໃນ Docker deployments "
"ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ :envvar:`WEBLATE_LEGAL_INTEGRATION`."

msgid ""
"Set this to the class targeted by your custom legal stylesheet. Set it to an "
"empty string to render legal documents without a wrapper class."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄລາສ (class) ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຮູບແບບ (stylesheet) "
"ທາງກົດໝາຍແບບກຳນົດເອງຂອງທ່ານ. ຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າວ່າງຫາກຕ້ອງການສະແດງເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍໂດຍບໍ່ມີ "
"wrapper class."

msgid ""
"Configures :setting:`LEGAL_HIDDEN_DOCUMENTS` in Docker deployments "
"with :envvar:`WEBLATE_LEGAL_INTEGRATION` enabled."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LEGAL_HIDDEN_DOCUMENTS` ໃນ Docker deployments "
"ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ :envvar:`WEBLATE_LEGAL_INTEGRATION`."

msgid "Provide a comma-separated list of legal document page identifiers."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ລະບຸລາຍຊື່ຂອງ Page identifiers ຂອງເອກະສານກົດໝາຍໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ."

msgid ""
"External legal documents are used as fallbacks for hidden internal pages. "
"The following configuration links both documents externally and requires one "
"agreement covering the terms of service and privacy policy:"
msgstr ""
"ເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍພາຍນອກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວສຳຮອງສຳລັບໜ້າພາຍໃນທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອມໂຍງທັງສອງເອກະສານໄປຫາພາຍນອກ ແລະ ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການຕົກລົງພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ "
"ທີ່ຄວບຄຸມທັງເງື່ອນໄຂການບໍລິການ ແລະ ນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ:"

msgid "Enables :setting:`PUBLIC_ENGAGE`."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ :setting:`PUBLIC_ENGAGE`."

msgid ""
"Configures ID for Google Analytics by "
"changing :setting:`GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ID ສຳລັບ Google Analytics ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ :setting:`GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default title and message for pull requests via API by "
"changing :setting:`DEFAULT_PULL_MESSAGE`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Title ແລະ Message ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Pull requests ຜ່ານ API "
"ໂດຍການປ່ຽນ :setting:`DEFAULT_PULL_MESSAGE`."

msgid ""
"Configures the language simplification policy, "
"see :setting:`SIMPLIFY_LANGUAGES`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Policy ການເຮັດໃຫ້ພາສາງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ເບິ່ງ :setting:`SIMPLIFY_LANGUAGES`."

msgid ""
"Hides glossary components when shared to other projects, "
"see :setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS`."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອນ Glossary components ເມື່ອຖືກແບ່ງປັນໄປຍັງ Project ອື່ນ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :setting:`HIDE_SHARED_GLOSSARY_COMPONENTS`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default :ref:`project-access_control` for new projects, "
"see :setting:`DEFAULT_ACCESS_CONTROL`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`project-access_control` ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ Project ໃໝ່, "
"ເບິ່ງ :setting:`DEFAULT_ACCESS_CONTROL`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default value for :ref:`component-restricted` for new "
"components, see :setting:`DEFAULT_RESTRICTED_COMPONENT`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ :ref:`component-restricted` ສຳລັບ Component ໃໝ່, "
"ເບິ່ງ :setting:`DEFAULT_RESTRICTED_COMPONENT`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default value for :ref:`component-"
"allow_translation_propagation` for new components, "
"see :setting:`DEFAULT_TRANSLATION_PROPAGATION`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ :ref:`component-allow_translation_propagation` ສຳລັບ "
"Component ໃໝ່, ເບິ່ງ :setting:`DEFAULT_TRANSLATION_PROPAGATION`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_EMAIL`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_EMAIL`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_NAME`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_NAME`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`DEFAULT_SHARED_TM`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`DEFAULT_SHARED_TM`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTOCLEAN_TM`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTOCLEAN_TM`."

msgid ""
"Configures the default value for :ref:`component-commit_pending_age` for new "
"components, see :setting:`COMMIT_PENDING_HOURS`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ :ref:`component-commit_pending_age` ສຳລັບ Component ໃໝ່, "
"ເບິ່ງ :setting:`COMMIT_PENDING_HOURS`."

msgid "Configures GPG signing of commits, see :setting:`WEBLATE_GPG_IDENTITY`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPG signing ຂອງ Commits, ເບິ່ງ :setting:`WEBLATE_GPG_IDENTITY`."

msgid ""
"Configures URL prefix where Weblate is running, see :setting:`URL_PREFIX`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL prefix ທີ່ Weblate ແລ່ນຢູ່, ເບິ່ງ :setting:`URL_PREFIX`."

msgid ""
"Configures URL prefix for static files served from :setting:`CACHE_DIR`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL prefix ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Static ທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຈາກ :setting:`CACHE_DIR`."

msgid ""
"Configures checks which you do not want to be displayed, "
"see :setting:`django:SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS`."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າການກວດສອບທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :setting:`django:SILENCED_SYSTEM_CHECKS`."

msgid "Allows to customize :http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` HTTP header."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງ HTTP header :http:header:`Content-Security-Policy`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`LICENSE_FILTER`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LICENSE_FILTER`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`LICENSE_REQUIRED`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LICENSE_REQUIRED`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`WEBSITE_REQUIRED`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`WEBSITE_REQUIRED`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`VERSION_DISPLAY`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`VERSION_DISPLAY`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`HIDE_VERSION`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`HIDE_VERSION`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`BASIC_LANGUAGES`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`BASIC_LANGUAGES`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTO_WATCH`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`DEFAULT_AUTO_WATCH`."

msgid "Configures rate limiter."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Rate limiter."

msgid ""
"You can set configuration for any rate limiter scopes. To do that add "
"``WEBLATE_`` prefix to any of setting described in :ref:`rate-limit`."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ Rate limiter scopes ໃດກໍໄດ້. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຄຳນຳໜ້າ "
"``WEBLATE_`` ໃສ່ໃນ Setting ໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`rate-limit`."

msgid ""
"Configures API rate limiting. Defaults to ``100/day`` for anonymous and "
"``5000/hour`` for authenticated users."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ API rate limiting. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ``100/day`` ສຳລັບ Anonymous ແລະ ``5000/"
"hour`` ສຳລັບ User ທີ່ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ENABLE_HOOKS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ENABLE_HOOKS`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`ENABLE_AVATARS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`ENABLE_AVATARS`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`AVATAR_URL_PREFIX`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`AVATAR_URL_PREFIX`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`LIMIT_TRANSLATION_LENGTH_BY_SOURCE_LENGTH`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`LIMIT_TRANSLATION_LENGTH_BY_SOURCE_LENGTH`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`SSH_EXTRA_ARGS`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`SSH_EXTRA_ARGS`."

msgid ""
"Configures :setting:`BORG_EXTRA_ARGS` as a comma separated list of args."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`BORG_EXTRA_ARGS` ເປັນລາຍຊື່ Args ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດ."

