msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້ໂດຍເວັບເຊີບເວີທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"This variable intentionally lacks ``WEBLATE_`` prefix as it is shared with "
"third-party container used in :ref:`docker-https-portal`."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແປນີ້ບໍ່ມີ ``WEBLATE_`` ນຳໜ້າໂດຍເຈດຕະນາ "
"ເພາະມັນຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຄອນເທນເນີຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ :ref:`docker-https-portal`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`TRANSLATION_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`TRANSLATION_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."

msgid "The value is in bytes."
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນເປັນໄບຕ໌."

msgid "Configures :setting:`COMPONENT_ZIP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`COMPONENT_ZIP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."

msgid "Configures :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE`."

msgid ""
"The value is in bytes. Make sure :envvar:`CLIENT_MAX_BODY_SIZE` is also "
