msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ :setting:`PROJECT_BACKUP_IMPORT_MAX_COMPRESSED_ENTRY_RATIO`."

msgid "Code-hosting sites credentials"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບເວັບໄຊຝາກໂຄ້ດ"

msgid ""
"In the Docker container, the code-hosting credentials can be configured "
"either in separate variables or using a Python dictionary to set them at "
"once. The following examples are for :ref:`code-hosting-github-pull-"
"requests`, but apply to all :ref:`vcs` with appropriately changed variable "
"names."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Docker container, ຂໍ້ມູນຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບການຝາກໂຄ້ດສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ທັງແບບແຍກຕົວປ່ຽນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ "
"Python dictionary ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດໃນເທື່ອດຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບ :ref:`code-hosting-"
"github-pull-requests`, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທຸກໆ :ref:`vcs` ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ."

msgid ""
"All environment variable names must include the ``WEBLATE_`` prefix. For "
"example, to configure GitHub credentials, use ``WEBLATE_GITHUB_USERNAME``, "
"not ``GITHUB_USERNAME``. This applies whether you're configuring for pull "
"requests or any other VCS integration."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຕົວແປສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທັງໝົດຕ້ອງມີ ``WEBLATE_`` ນຳໜ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ GitHub, "
"ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ``WEBLATE_GITHUB_USERNAME`` ບໍ່ແມ່ນ ``GITHUB_USERNAME``. "
"ນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ pull requests ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ VCS ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "An example configuration for GitHub pull requests might look like:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບ GitHub pull requests ອາດຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "Will be used as:"
msgstr "ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ:"

msgid "Alternatively the Python dictionary can be provided as a string:"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ Python dictionary ເປັນສະຕຣິງໄດ້:"

msgid "Or the path to a file containing the Python dictionary:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ Python dictionary:"

