msgid "Weblate 5.14.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.14.1"

msgid "*Released on November 5th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 5 ພະຈິກ 2025.*"

msgid ""
"String context are now tracked in changes history and displayed when "
