msgid "Added HTTP environment overview in :ref:`manage-performance`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພາບລວມສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ HTTP ໃນ :ref:`manage-performance`."

msgid "Docker container is using Python 3.14."
msgstr "Docker container ໃຊ້ Python 3.14."

