msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.consistency.languages` ບໍ່ລວມພາສາ component ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ":ref:`azure-devops-push` API URL parsing."
msgstr "ການແຍກ (parsing) API URL ຂອງ :ref:`azure-devops-push`."

