msgstr ":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` ຕອນນີ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ Docker."

msgid "Removing pending glossary terms."
msgstr "ການລຶບຄຳສັບໃນອຸທານຸກົມທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/142?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/142?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.11"
msgstr "Weblate 5.11"

msgid "*Released on April 15th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 15 ເມສາ 2025.*"

msgid ""
"Added :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/translations/` to retrieve a list of "
"all target translation units for the given source translation unit."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/translations/` "
"ເພື່ອດຶງລາຍການຫົວໜ່ວຍການແປປາຍທາງທັງໝົດສຳລັບຫົວໜ່ວຍການແປຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid ""
"Added :http:delete:`/api/groups/(int:id)/roles/(int:role_id)` to delete a "
"role from a group."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ :http:delete:`/api/groups/(int:id)/roles/(int:role_id)` "
"ເພື່ອລຶບບົດບາດອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ."

msgid ":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` is now available as an add-on."
msgstr ":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນຖານະ add-on."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-automattic-components-format` check to validate placeholders in "
"Automattic components."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-automattic-components-format` ເພື່ອກວດສອບ placeholders "
"ໃນ Automattic components."

msgid "Inherited flags can now be discarded, see :ref:`custom-checks`."
msgstr "ທຸງທີ່ສືບທອດມາຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-checks`."

msgid ""
":ref:`secondary-languages` can now be specified in :ref:`project` "
"and :ref:`component`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`secondary-languages` ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດລະບຸໃນ :ref:`project` "
"ແລະ :ref:`component` ໄດ້."

msgid ":ref:`mt-sources` can now be customized."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-sources` ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Weblate now uses OpenAPI Specification 3.1.1 to generate the schema "
"for :ref:`api`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ OpenAPI Specification 3.1.1 ເພື່ອສ້າງ schema ສຳລັບ :ref:`api`."

msgid ""
":ref:`credits` and :ref:`stats` include translator's join date. "
"Additionally, both reports can be sorted either by the join date or the "
"number of strings translated."
msgstr ""
":ref:`credits` ແລະ :ref:`stats` ລວມວັນທີເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຂອງນັກແປ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, "
"ທັງສອງລາຍງານສາມາດຈັດລຽງຕາມວັນທີເຂົ້າຮ່ວມ ຫຼື ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປໄດ້."

msgid "Widgets show more precise stats."
msgstr "Widgets ສະແດງສະຖິຕິທີ່ຊັດເຈນກວ່າ."

msgid ":ref:`upload` is now tracked in history with details."
msgstr ":ref:`upload` ຕອນນີ້ຖືກຕິດຕາມໃນປະຫວັດພ້ອມລາຍລະອຽດ."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-c-sharp-format` now supports ``csharp-format`` flag for "
"compatibility with GNU gettext."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-c-sharp-format` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບທຸງ ``csharp-format`` ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ "
"GNU gettext."

msgid "Changes in string flags are now tracked in history."
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນທຸງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕອນນີ້ຖືກຕິດຕາມໃນປະຫວັດ."

msgid ":doc:`/admin/machine` documentation extended."
msgstr "ເອກະສານ :doc:`/admin/machine` ຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກ."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` better handles hundreds of matches."
msgstr ":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` ຈັດການຫຼາຍຮ້ອຍລາຍການທີ່ກົງກັນໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Dismissing :ref:`checks` automatically updates propagated strings."
msgstr "ການຍົກເລີກ :ref:`checks` ອັດຕະໂນມັດອັບເດດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແຜ່ກະຈາຍ."

msgid ""
":ref:`project-check_flags` can now also be configured on the project level."
msgstr ":ref:`project-check_flags` ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະດັບໂຄງການໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Improved rendering of :ref:`additional-flags` and :ref:`additional-"
"explanation` changes in history."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງການສະແດງການປ່ຽນແປງ :ref:`additional-flags` ແລະ :ref:`additional-"
"explanation` ໃນປະຫວັດ."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` now automatically transliterates from a matching "
"translation instead of the source strings."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` ຕອນນີ້ປ່ຽນຕົວອັກສອນອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກການແປທີ່ກົງກັນ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"Errors from creating a duplicate glossary and failure to delete a glossary "
"are now handled gracefully."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກການສ້າງອຸທານຸກົມຊ້ຳ ແລະ ການລຶບອຸທານຸກົມລົ້ມເຫຼວ ຕອນນີ້ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"**Security:** Cloning a component could leak component configuration into "
"the URL (:cve:`2025-32021`)."
msgstr ""
"**ຄວາມປອດໄພ:** ການ Cloning component ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ component ຮົ່ວໄຫຼໃນ URL "
"(:cve:`2025-32021`)."

msgid "Fixed captcha verification when some time zone was configured."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການກວດສອບ captcha ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຂດເວລາບາງຢ່າງ."

msgid "Improved translation propagation performance."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບການແຜ່ກະຈາຍການແປ."

msgid ""
"Leading and trailing whitespace are now correctly stripped in glossary "
"strings that also contain a :ref:`check-prohibited-initial-character`."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງທາງໜ້າ ແລະ ທາງຫຼັງຕອນນີ້ຖືກຕັດອອກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມອຸທານຸກົມທີ່ມີ :ref:`check-"
"prohibited-initial-character`."

msgid "Fixed background parsing of newly added translation files."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການແຍກໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ."

msgid "Registration now disallows disposable e-mail domains."
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດເມນອີເມວທີ່ໃຊ້ແລ້ວຖິ້ມ."

msgid ""
"The database migration updates indexes and this might take considerable time."
msgstr "ການຍ້າຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນອັບເດດດັດສະນີ (indexes) ເຊິ່ງອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນພໍສົມຄວນ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/136?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/136?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.10.4"
msgstr "Weblate 5.10.4"

msgid "*Released on March 19th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 19 ມີນາ 2025.*"

msgid "Fixed dismissing of checks."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຍົກເລີກການກວດສອບ."

msgid "Reduced overhead of rendering other strings while translating."
msgstr "ຫຼຸດ overhead ໃນການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມອື່ນໆໃນຂະນະແປ."

msgid "Improved performance of some :ref:`api` endpoints."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງບາງ :ref:`api` endpoints."

msgid "Fixed :ref:`language-parsing-codes` in some corner cases."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ :ref:`language-parsing-codes` ໃນບາງກໍລະນີພິເສດ."

msgid ":ref:`search-strings` now properly finds exact match on the component."
msgstr ":ref:`search-strings` ຕອນນີ້ຊອກຫາຄຳທີ່ກົງກັນແທ້ໃນ component ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/140?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/140?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.10.3"
msgstr "Weblate 5.10.3"

msgid "*Released on March 13th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 13 ມີນາ 2025.*"

msgid "Captcha is not shown for registrations via :ref:`invite-user`."
msgstr "Captcha ບໍ່ສະແດງສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ :ref:`invite-user`."

msgid "Improved performance of API download endpoints."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ API download endpoints."

msgid "Optimized fetching other translations while translating."
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການແປອື່ນໆໃນຂະນະແປ."

msgid "Reduced notifications overhead."
msgstr "ຫຼຸດ overhead ຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

msgid "Improved handling of components using :ref:`internal-urls`."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຈັດການ components ທີ່ໃຊ້ :ref:`internal-urls`."

msgid "Fixed authenticating with some Git servers."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບບາງ Git servers."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/139?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/139?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.10.2"
msgstr "Weblate 5.10.2"

msgid "*Released on February 28th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 28 ກຸມພາ 2025.*"

msgid "Improved :ref:`translation-memory` matching."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຈັບຄູ່ :ref:`translation-memory`."

msgid "Visual diff now better highlights whitespace additions."
msgstr "Visual diff ຕອນນີ້ໄຮໄລ້ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງຫວ່າງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Improved performance on large projects."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບໃນໂຄງການຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

msgid "Consistency of :ref:`search-boolean` in :doc:`/user/search`."
msgstr "ຄວາມສອດຄ່ອງຂອງ :ref:`search-boolean` ໃນ :doc:`/user/search`."

msgid "Fixed some :ref:`addons` trigger upon installation."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂບາງ :ref:`addons` ທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ."

msgid "Fixed restoring of Git repositories from :ref:`projectbackup`."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການກູ້ຄືນ Git repositories ຈາກ :ref:`projectbackup`."

msgid ""
"Weblate has switched to a different library for zxcvbn integration, as the "
"old one is no longer maintained, see :ref:`password-authentication`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໄດ້ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດອື່ນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ zxcvbn, ເນື່ອງຈາກອັນເກົ່າບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດແລ້ວ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`password-authentication`."

msgid ""
"Weblate uses proactive authentication with Git 2.46.0 and newer when HTTP "
"credentials are supplied."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ proactive authentication ກັບ Git 2.46.0 ແລະ ໃໝ່ກວ່າ ເມື່ອມີການລະບຸ HTTP "
"credentials."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"changed settings ``AUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS`` and ``INSTALLED_APPS``; please "
"adjust your settings accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ :file:`settings_example.py`, ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຄືການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"``AUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS`` ແລະ ``INSTALLED_APPS``; "
"ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/138?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/138?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.10.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.10.1"

msgid "*Released on February 21st 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 21 ກຸມພາ 2025.*"

msgid ""
":ref:`check-multiple-failures` better shows failing checks including links "
"to the strings."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-multiple-failures` ສະແດງການກວດສອບທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ລວມທັງລິ້ງໄປຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Detailed overview of locked components on project repository management."
msgstr "ພາບລວມລະອຽດຂອງ components ທີ່ຖືກລັອກໃນການຈັດການ repository ຂອງໂຄງການ."

msgid ":ref:`search-strings` supports searching by source string state."
msgstr ":ref:`search-strings` ຮອງຮັບການຄົ້ນຫາຕາມສະຖານະຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ":ref:`download` performs faster on project and language scopes."
msgstr ":ref:`download` ເຮັດວຽກໄວຂຶ້ນໃນຂອບເຂດໂຄງການ ແລະ ພາສາ."

msgid ""
":ref:`zen-mode` does not display the source string twice when editing it."
msgstr ":ref:`zen-mode` ບໍ່ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບສອງເທື່ອເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂ."

msgid "Fixed :ref:`glossary` terms highlighting."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການໄຮໄລ້ຄຳສັບ :ref:`glossary`."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/137?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/137?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.10"
msgstr "Weblate 5.10"

msgid "*Released on February 14th 2025.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 14 ກຸມພາ 2025.*"

msgid ""
":ref:`check-rst-references` check to validate reStructuredText references."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-rst-references` ເພື່ອກວດສອບການອ້າງອີງ reStructuredText."

msgid ":ref:`check-rst-syntax` check to validate reStructuredText syntax."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-rst-syntax` ເພື່ອກວດສອບໄວຍາກອນ reStructuredText."

msgid "API can now produce CSV output."
msgstr "API ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຜະລິດຜົນຜະລິດ CSV ໄດ້."

msgid ""
"New management command :wladmin:`import_projectbackup` to "
"import :ref:`projectbackup`."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງຈັດການໃໝ່ :wladmin:`import_projectbackup` ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ :ref:`projectbackup`."

msgid "Improved error handling in :ref:`machine-translation-setup`."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຈັດການຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນ :ref:`machine-translation-setup`."

msgid ""
":envvar:`WEBLATE_REGISTRATION_CAPTCHA` is now available in Docker container."
msgstr ":envvar:`WEBLATE_REGISTRATION_CAPTCHA` ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ Docker container."

msgid ""
":guilabel:`Synchronize` on shared repository now operates on all its "
"components."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Synchronize` ໃນ repository ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ ຕອນນີ້ດຳເນີນການກັບທຸກ components "
"ຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-punctuation-spacing` ignores markup such as Markdown or "
"reStructuredText."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-punctuation-spacing` ບໍ່ສົນໃຈ markup ເຊັ່ນ Markdown ຫຼື "
"reStructuredText."

msgid ""
":ref:`autofix-punctuation-spacing` does not alter reStructuredText markup."
msgstr ""
":ref:`autofix-punctuation-spacing` ບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ markup ຂອງ reStructuredText."

msgid "Improved validation errors in :doc:`/api`, see :ref:`api-errors`."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການກວດສອບໃນ :doc:`/api`, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`api-errors`."

msgid ""
"Any language changed into an alias in `Weblate language data <https://"
"github.com/WeblateOrg/language-data/>`__ is now reflected in all existing "
"installations."
msgstr ""
"ພາສາໃດທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ alias ໃນ `Weblate language data <https://github.com/"
"WeblateOrg/language-data/>`__ ຈະຖືກສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"Blank alias languages (not linked to any translation, profile, "
"component, ...) are now automatically removed."
msgstr ""
"ພາສາ alias ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບການແປ, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌, component, ...) "
"ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-duplicate` better works with markup such as Markdown or "
"reStructuredText."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-duplicate` ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນກັບ markup ເຊັ່ນ Markdown ຫຼື reStructuredText."

msgid ""
"Automatically use DeepL API Free endpoint for the DeepL API Free "
"authentication keys in :ref:`mt-deepl`."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ DeepL API Free endpoint ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບລະຫັດການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ DeepL API Free "
"ໃນ :ref:`mt-deepl`."

msgid ""
"Compatibility with third-party static files storage backends for Django."
msgstr "ຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ static files storage backends ຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມສຳລັບ Django."

msgid "Improved language compatibility in :ref:`mt-microsoft-translator`."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຂອງພາສາໃນ :ref:`mt-microsoft-translator`."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-reused` check gracefully handles languages which are not case "
"sensitive."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-reused` ຈັດການພາສາທີ່ບໍ່ແຍກຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
":ref:`component-enforced_checks` are now applied on strings imported from "
"the repository."
msgstr ""
":ref:`component-enforced_checks` ຕອນນີ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກ repository."

msgid ""
"Reduced false positives in :ref:`check-end-colon` and :ref:`check-end-stop` "
"for CJK languages."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼຸດ false positives ໃນ :ref:`check-end-colon` ແລະ :ref:`check-end-stop` "
"ສຳລັບພາສາ CJK."

msgid "OpenAPI schema for API includes more information."
msgstr "OpenAPI schema ສຳລັບ API ລວມມີຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ":ref:`check-regex` supports advanced regular expressions."
msgstr ":ref:`check-regex` ຮອງຮັບ regular expressions ຂັ້ນສູງ."

msgid ":ref:`check-same` gracefully deals with case-insensitive languages."
msgstr ":ref:`check-same` ຈັດການພາສາທີ່ບໍ່ແຍກຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ":ref:`check-reused` wrongly triggered after fixing the error."
msgstr ":ref:`check-reused` ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນຢ່າງຜິດພາດຫຼັງຈາກແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ."

msgid "Dark theme behavior in some situations."
msgstr "ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ Dark theme ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ."

msgid "Translation propagation sometimes did not work as expected."
msgstr "ການແຜ່ກະຈາຍການແປບາງຄັ້ງບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້."

msgid ""
":http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` is now automatically set for AWS."
msgstr ":http:header:`Content-Security-Policy` ຕອນນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ AWS."

msgid ""
":ref:`machine-translation-setup` sometimes cached results too aggressively."
msgstr ":ref:`machine-translation-setup` ບາງຄັ້ງ cache ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຢ່າງຮຸກຮານເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Fixed translations caching in :ref:`machine-translation-setup`."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ cache ການແປໃນ :ref:`machine-translation-setup`."

msgid ""
":ref:`autofix-html` automatic fixups honors the ``ignore-safe-html`` flag."
msgstr ":ref:`autofix-html` ການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດເຄົາລົບທຸງ ``ignore-safe-html``."

msgid ":ref:`check-punctuation-spacing` no longer applies to Breton."
msgstr ":ref:`check-punctuation-spacing` ບໍ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບພາສາ Breton ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "Fixed :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` on linked repositories."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ :ref:`addon-weblate.git.squash` ໃນ repositories ທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-multiple-failures` avoids false positives and better lists "
"related checks."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-multiple-failures` ຫຼີກເວັ້ນ false positives ແລະ "
"ສະແດງລາຍການກວດສອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Running tests using Django test executor is no longer supported, see :doc:`/"
"contributing/tests`."
msgstr ""
"ການຮັນການທົດສອບໂດຍໃຊ້ Django test executor ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ເບິ່ງ :doc:`/"
"contributing/tests`."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-bbcode` check is now disabled by default. The ``bbcode-text`` "
"flag is required to activate this check, see :ref:`custom-checks`."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບ :ref:`check-bbcode` ຕອນນີ້ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຕ້ອງການທຸງ ``bbcode-"
"text`` ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບນີ້, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-checks`."

msgid "API error responses format has changed, see :ref:`api-errors`."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຕອບກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ API ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`api-errors`."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"the new settings for :ref:`api` in ``REST_FRAMEWORK``, "
"``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS``, ``DRF_STANDARDIZED_ERRORS`` and "
"``INSTALLED_APPS``; please adjust your settings accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ :file:`settings_example.py`, "
"ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຄືການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບ :ref:`api` ໃນ ``REST_FRAMEWORK``, "
"``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS``, ``DRF_STANDARDIZED_ERRORS`` ແລະ "
"``INSTALLED_APPS``; ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

msgid "PostgreSQL 12 and MariaDB 10.4 are no longer supported."
msgstr "PostgreSQL 12 ແລະ MariaDB 10.4 ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/133?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/133?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.9.2"
msgstr "Weblate 5.9.2"

msgid "*Released on December 19th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 19 ທັນວາ 2024.*"

msgid ""
"Renamed :ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-data-center-pull-requests` to match new "
"product name."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຊື່ :ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-data-center-pull-requests` "
"ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຊື່ຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່."

msgid ":http:get:`/api/users/` supports searching by user ID."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/users/` ຮອງຮັບການຄົ້ນຫາໂດຍ user ID."

msgid "Avoid query parser crash in multi-threaded environments."
msgstr "ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຄ້າງຂອງ query parser ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ multi-threaded."

msgid "Avoid :ref:`autofix` crash on multi-value strings."
msgstr "ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຄ້າງຂອງ :ref:`autofix` ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຄ່າ."

msgid ""
"Make project tokens work when :ref:`2fa` or :ref:`component-agreement` are "
"enforced."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ project tokens ເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອ :ref:`2fa` ຫຼື :ref:`component-agreement` "
"ຖືກບັງຄັບ."

msgid "Captcha solution were sometimes not accepted."
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ Captcha ບາງຄັ້ງບໍ່ຖືກຍອມຮັບ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/135?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/135?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.9.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.9.1"

msgid "*Released on December 16th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ປ່ອຍອອກເມື່ອວັນທີ 16 ທັນວາ 2024.*"

msgid "Fixed publishing package to PyPI."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການເຜີຍແຜ່ແພັກເກັດໄປຍັງ PyPI."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/134?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/134?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.9"
msgstr "Weblate 5.9"

msgid ""
"Per-project :ref:`machine-translation-setup` can now be configured via the "
"Project :ref:`api`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine-translation-setup` ແບບຕໍ່ໂຄງການ ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ :ref:`api` "
"ຂອງໂຄງການໄດ້."

msgid "Added :http:get:`/api/projects/(string:project)/machinery_settings/`."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/projects/(string:project)/machinery_settings/`."

msgid "Added :http:post:`/api/projects/(string:project)/machinery_settings/`."
msgstr ":http:post:`/api/projects/(string:project)/machinery_settings/`."

msgid ""
"Translation memory import now supports files with XLIFF, PO and CSV formats, "
"see :ref:`memory-user` and :wladmin:`import_memory` command in :ref:`manage`."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳເຂົ້າຄວາມຈຳການແປຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ຮູບແບບ XLIFF, PO ແລະ CSV, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`memory-"
"user` ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງ :wladmin:`import_memory` ໃນ :ref:`manage`."

msgid "The registration CAPTCHA now includes proof-of-work mechanism ALTCHA."
msgstr "CAPTCHA ການລົງທະບຽນຕອນນີ້ລວມມີກົນໄກ proof-of-work ALTCHA."

msgid ""
"Leading problematic characters in CSV are now checks for :ref:`glossary`, "
"see :ref:`check-prohibited-initial-character`."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ມີບັນຫາທາງໜ້າໃນ CSV ຕອນນີ້ຖືກກວດສອບສຳລັບ :ref:`glossary`, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`check-"
"prohibited-initial-character`."

msgid "Logging to :ref:`graylog`."
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກໄປຍັງ :ref:`graylog`."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-google-translate-api-v3` now supports :ref:`glossary-mt` (optional)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mt-google-translate-api-v3` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`glossary-mt` (ທາງເລືອກ)."

msgid ""
"A shortcut to duplicate a component is now available directly in the menu "
"(:guilabel:`Operations` → :guilabel:`Duplicate this component`)."
msgstr ""
"ທາງລັດເພື່ອທຳຊ້ຳ component ຕອນນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍກົງໃນເມນູ (:guilabel:`Operations` "
"→ :guilabel:`Duplicate this component`)."

msgid "Included username when generating :ref:`credits`."
msgstr "ລວມຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງ :ref:`credits`."

msgid ":ref:`bulk-edit` shows a preview of matched strings."
msgstr ":ref:`bulk-edit` ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ""
":http:get:`/api/components/(string:project)/(string:component)/` exposes "
"component lock state."
msgstr ""
":http:get:`/api/components/(string:project)/(string:component)/` "
"ເປີດເຜີຍສະຖານະການລັອກຂອງ component."

msgid "Editor in :ref:`zen-mode` is now stick to bottom of screen."
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂໃນ :ref:`zen-mode` ຕອນນີ້ຕິດຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Added page navigation while :ref:`translating`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການນຳທາງໜ້າໃນຂະນະ :ref:`translating`."

msgid ":ref:`manage-appearance` now has distinct settings for dark mode."
msgstr ":ref:`manage-appearance` ຕອນນີ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບໂໝດມືດ."

msgid "Improved :ref:`translation-propagation` performance."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບ :ref:`translation-propagation`."

msgid ""
"More detailed error messages for :http:post:`/api/translations/"
"(string:project)/(string:component)/(string:language)/file/`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນສຳລັບ :http:post:`/api/translations/(string:project)/"
"(string:component)/(string:language)/file/`."

msgid ""
"Using the ``has:variant`` field now correctly displays strings that have "
"variants in the search language, see :ref:`search-strings`."
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ ``has:variant`` ຕອນນີ້ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຕົວແປໃນພາສາຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`search-strings`."

