"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/128?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.8"
msgstr "Weblate 5.8"

msgid "Added :ref:`component-key_filter` in the component."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ :ref:`component-key_filter` ໃນ component."

msgid ""
":doc:`/user/search` now supports filtering by object path and :ref:`date-"
"search`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/user/search` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບການຕອງຕາມ object path ແລະ :ref:`date-search`."

msgid ""
"Merge requests credentials can now be passed in the repository URL, "
"see :ref:`settings-credentials`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳລັບ Merge requests ໃນຕອນນີ້ສາມາດລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ URL ຂອງຄັງເກັບໄດ້, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`settings-credentials`."

msgid ":ref:`mt-azure-openai` automatic suggestion service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ :ref:`mt-azure-openai`."

msgid ":ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-cloud-pull-requests`."
msgstr ":ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-cloud-pull-requests`."

msgid ":ref:`mt-modernmt` supports :ref:`glossary-mt`."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-modernmt` ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`glossary-mt`."

msgid ":ref:`mt-deepl` now supports specifying translation context."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-deepl` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບການລະບຸບໍລິບົດການແປ."

msgid ":ref:`mt-aws` now supports :ref:`glossary-mt`."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-aws` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ :ref:`glossary-mt`."

msgid ":ref:`autofix` for Devanagari danda now better handles latin script."
msgstr ":ref:`autofix` ສຳລັບ Devanagari danda ຕອນນີ້ຈັດການ latin script ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
":ref:`autofix` for French and Breton now uses a non-breaking space before "
"colons instead of a narrow one."
msgstr ""
":ref:`autofix` ສຳລັບພາສາຝຣັ່ງ ແລະ Breton ຕອນນີ້ໃຊ້ non-breaking space ໜ້າ colon "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ narrow space."

msgid ":ref:`api` now has a preview OpenAPI specification."
msgstr ":ref:`api` ຕອນນີ້ມີ preview OpenAPI specification."

msgid "Stale, empty glossaries are now automatically removed."
msgstr "ອຸທານຸກົມທີ່ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ ແລະ ລ້າສະໄໝຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ":kbd:`?` now displays available :ref:`keyboard`."
msgstr ":kbd:`?` ຕອນນີ້ສະແດງ :ref:`keyboard` ທີ່ມີໃຫ້."

msgid ""
"Translation and language view in the project now include basic information "
"about the language and plurals."
msgstr "ມຸມມອງການແປ ແລະ ພາສາໃນໂຄງການຕອນນີ້ລວມມີຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານກ່ຽວກັບພາສາ ແລະ plurals."

