msgstr ":ref:`search-replace` ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນ."

msgid ":ref:`aresource` now support translatable attribute in its strings."
msgstr ":ref:`aresource` ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ແປໄດ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງມັນ."

msgid ""
"Creating component via file upload (Translate document) now supports "
"bilingual files."
msgstr ""
"ການສ້າງ component ຜ່ານການອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ (Translate document) ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ສອງພາສາ."

msgid "Displaying :ref:`workflow-customization` setting in some cases."
msgstr "ການສະແດງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`workflow-customization` ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ."

msgid "Users can add component in any language already existing in a project."
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ component ໃນພາສາໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໂຄງການແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
":ref:`check-unnamed-format` better handles some strings, such as :ref:`check-"
"python-brace-format`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`check-unnamed-format` ຈັດການຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງຢ່າງໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ, ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`check-python-"
"brace-format`."

msgid "Weblate now requires Python 3.11 or newer."
msgstr "Weblate ຕອນນີ້ຕ້ອງການ Python 3.11 ຫຼືໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid ":ref:`mt-aws` now requires the ``TranslateFullAccess`` permission."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-aws` ຕອນນີ້ຕ້ອງການສິດ ``TranslateFullAccess``."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"the new settings for :ref:`api` in ``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS`` and changes in "
"``REST_FRAMEWORK`` and ``INSTALLED_APPS``; please adjust your settings "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ :file:`settings_example.py`, "
"ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດຄືການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບ :ref:`api` ໃນ ``SPECTACULAR_SETTINGS`` ແລະ "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ ``REST_FRAMEWORK`` ແລະ ``INSTALLED_APPS``; "
"ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/122?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/122?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.7.2"
msgstr "Weblate 5.7.2"

