msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 5 ກັນຍາ 2024.*"

msgid ":ref:`2fa` remembers last method used by user."
msgstr ":ref:`2fa` ຈື່ວິທີການທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid "Instead of redirecting, the sign-out now displays a page."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຈາກການສົ່ງຕໍ່ ມາເປັນການສະແດງໜ້າເວັບຫຼັງຈາກອອກຈາກລະບົບ."

msgid "Improved readability of exception logs."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການອ່ານບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Updating of translations from the repository in linked components."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຄຳແປຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນອົງປະກອບທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງ."

msgid "Improved rendering of digest notification e-mails."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການສະແດງຜົນອີເມວແຈ້ງເຕືອນແບບລວມຍອດ."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/126?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/126?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.7.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.7.1"

msgid "*Released on August 30th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 30 ສິງຫາ 2024.*"

msgid ""
"Updated language names to better describe different scripts and Sinitic "
"languages."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຊື່ພາສາເພື່ອອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ພາສາໃນກຸ່ມຊິນິຕິກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.cleanup.generic` is now automatically installed for "
"formats which need it to update non-translation content in the translated "
"files."
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.cleanup.generic` "
"ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຮູບແບບຟາຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໃນການອັບເດດເນື້ອຫາທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳແປໃນຟາຍທີ່ແປແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"Support for using Docker network names in automatic suggestion settings."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຊື່ເຄືອຂ່າຍ Docker ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຳແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Fixed authentication using some third-party providers such as Azure."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການພິສູດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກບາງແຫ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ Azure."

msgid "Support for formal and informal Portuguese in :ref:`mt-deepl`."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບພາສາປອກຕຸຍການແບບທາງການ ແລະ ບໍ່ເປັນທາງການໃນ :ref:`mt-deepl`."

msgid "QR code for TOTP is now black/white even in dark mode."
msgstr "ລະຫັດ QR ສຳລັບ TOTP ຈະເປັນສີດຳ/ຂາວ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນໂໝດມືດ."

msgid ""
"Fixed TOTP authentication when WebAuthn is also configured for the user."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການພິສູດຢືນຢັນ TOTP ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ WebAuthn ໄວ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/125?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/125?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.7"
msgstr "Weblate 5.7"

msgid "*Released on August 15th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 15 ສິງຫາ 2024.*"

msgid ""
":ref:`2fa` is now supported using Passkeys, WebAuthn, authentication apps "
"(TOTP), and recovery codes."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ :ref:`2fa` ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ Passkeys, WebAuthn, ແອັບພິສູດຢືນຢັນ (TOTP) ແລະ "
"ລະຫັດກູ້ຄືນ."

msgid ":ref:`2fa` can be enforced at the team or project level."
msgstr ":ref:`2fa` ສາມາດບັງຄັບໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນລະດັບທີມ ຫຼື ລະດັບໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
":ref:`adding-new-strings` can now create plural strings in the user "
"interface."
msgstr ":ref:`adding-new-strings` ສາມາດສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້."

msgid ":ref:`labels` now include description to explain them."
msgstr ":ref:`labels` ຕອນນີ້ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍເພື່ອອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບປ້າຍກຳກັບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "New :ref:`notifications` for completed translation and component."
msgstr "ມີ :ref:`notifications` ໃໝ່ສຳລັບການແປ ແລະ ອົງປະກອບທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-openai` now supports custom models and URLs and offers rephrasing "
"of existing strings."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mt-openai` ຮອງຮັບໂມເດວ ແລະ URL ແບບກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ "
"ສະເໜີໃຫ້ມີການປັບປ່ຽນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` automatic suggestion service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ :ref:`mt-cyrtranslit`."

msgid ":ref:`addon-weblate.properties.sort` can now do case-sensitive sorting."
msgstr ":ref:`addon-weblate.properties.sort` ສາມາດຈັດລຽງແບບແຍກຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The status widgets are now supported site-wide and language-wide, "
"see :ref:`promotion`."
msgstr ""
"ວິດເຈັດສະຖານະຮອງຮັບທັງລະດັບເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ລະດັບພາສາແລ້ວ, ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ :ref:`promotion`."

msgid ":ref:`reports` are now available for categories."
msgstr ":ref:`reports` ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບໝວດໝູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Highlight newlines in the editor."
msgstr "ເນັ້ນການຂຶ້ນບັນທັດໃໝ່ໃນບັນນາທິການ."

msgid ":doc:`/formats/csv` better handle files with two fields only."
msgstr ":doc:`/formats/csv` ຈັດການຟາຍທີ່ມີພຽງສອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Browse mode can now be navigated using keyboard, see :ref:`keyboard`."
msgstr "ໂໝດຊອກຫາສາມາດນຳທາງດ້ວຍແປ້ນພິມໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ :ref:`keyboard`."

msgid ""
"``GET /api/components/(string:project)/(string:component)/credits/`` and "
"``GET /api/projects/(string:project)/credits/`` API endpoints for components "
"and projects."
msgstr ""
"endpoint ຂອງ API ``GET /api/components/(string:project)/(string:component)/"
"credits/`` ແລະ ``GET /api/projects/(string:project)/credits/`` ສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບ "
"ແລະ ໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
":ref:`glossary-terminology` entries in Glossary can now only be created by "
"users with :guilabel:`Add glossary terminology` permission."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການ :ref:`glossary-terminology` ໃນອະພິທານສັບ "
"ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ທີ່ມີສິດ :guilabel:`Add glossary terminology` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ":ref:`check-python-brace-format` detects extra curly braces."
msgstr ":ref:`check-python-brace-format` ກວດພົບວົງເລັບປີກກາທີ່ເກີນມາ."

msgid "Screenshots now can be pasted from the clipboard in :ref:`screenshots`."
msgstr "ພາບໜ້າຈໍສາມາດວາງຈາກຄລິບບອດໃນ :ref:`screenshots` ໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Accessibility of keyboard navigation."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງການນຳທາງດ້ວຍແປ້ນພິມ."

msgid ":ref:`git-exporter` now works with all Git based :ref:`vcs`."
msgstr ":ref:`git-exporter` ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບ :ref:`vcs` ທີ່ໃຊ້ Git ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ":ref:`check-max-size` sometimes failed to render screenshot."
msgstr ":ref:`check-max-size` ບາງຄັ້ງລົ້ມເຫລວໃນການສະແດງພາບໜ້າຈໍ."

msgid "Weblate now uses mistletoe instead of misaka as a Markdown renderer."
msgstr "Weblate ໃຊ້ mistletoe ແທນ misaka ເປັນຕົວແປງ Markdown."

msgid ":ref:`csp` is now stricter what might block third-party customizations."
msgstr ":ref:`csp` ເຂັ້ມງວດຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະຂັດຂວາງການປັບແຕ່ງຈາກພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Monolingual formats no longer copy comments from :ref:`component-template` "
"when adding strings to translation."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບພາສາໜຶ່ງດຽວຈະບໍ່ຄັດລອກຄຳເຫັນຈາກ :ref:`component-template` ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ "
"ເມື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມເຂົ້າໃນການແປ."

msgid ""
"Dropped support for Amagama in :ref:`machine-translation-setup` as the "
"service is no longer maintained."
msgstr ""
"ຢຸດຮອງຮັບ Amagama ໃນ :ref:`machine-translation-setup` "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍລິການດັ່ງກ່າວບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການດູແລແລ້ວ."

msgid "Default value for :setting:`SENTRY_SEND_PII` was changed."
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ :setting:`SENTRY_SEND_PII` ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid ""
"Translation credit reports in the JSON format now follows a different format "
"for entries."
msgstr "ລາຍງານສິນເຊື່ອການແປໃນຮູບແບບ JSON ປະຈຸບັນໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການບັນທຶກລາຍການແບບໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"the new settings for :ref:`2fa` and changes in ``INSTALLED_APPS``, "
"``SOCIAL_AUTH_PIPELINE`` and ``MIDDLEWARE``; please adjust your settings "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ :file:`settings_example.py` "
"ທີ່ສຳຄັນແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບ :ref:`2fa` ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ ``INSTALLED_APPS``, "
"``SOCIAL_AUTH_PIPELINE`` ແລະ ``MIDDLEWARE``; ກະລຸນາປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງ."

msgid ""
":setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` is now required for WebAuthn support. If you cannot "
"use HTTPS, please silence related check as described "
"in :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` documentation."
msgstr ""
":setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS` ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບ WebAuthn. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ HTTPS ໄດ້, "
"ກະລຸນາປິດການກວດສອບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ :setting:`ENABLE_HTTPS`."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/116?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/116?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.6.2"
msgstr "Weblate 5.6.2"

msgid "*Released on July 1st 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 1 ກໍລະກົດ 2024.*"

msgid "Rendering of :ref:`labels` color selection widget."
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນວິດເຈັດເລືອກສີ :ref:`labels`."

msgid "Detection of pending outgoing commits."
msgstr "ການກວດຫາຄອມມິດທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid ":ref:`addons` button layout."
msgstr "ໂຄງຮ່າງປຸ່ມ :ref:`addons`."

msgid "Crash when installing :ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` add-on."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດການປິດໂຕເອງຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງອັດອອນ :ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery`."

msgid "Removal of source strings in :ref:`glossary`."
msgstr "ການລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນ :ref:`glossary`."

msgid ""
"Validation of :ref:`projectbackup` ZIP file upon restoring "
"(:cve:`2024-39303` / :ghsa:`jfgp-674x-6q4p`)."
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບຟາຍ ZIP ຂອງ :ref:`projectbackup` ໃນລະຫວ່າງການກູ້ຄືນ "
"(:cve:`2024-39303` / :ghsa:`jfgp-674x-6q4p`)."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/124?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/124?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.6.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.6.1"

msgid "*Released on June 24th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 24 ມິຖຸນາ 2024.*"

msgid ""
"Docker container accepts :envvar:`WEBLATE_REMOVE_ADDONS` "
"and :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADD_MACHINERY` to customize automatic suggestion "
"services and :envvar:`WEBLATE_CORS_ALLOW_ALL_ORIGINS` for CORS handling in "
"API."
msgstr ""
"ຄອນເທນເນີ Docker ຮອງຮັບ :envvar:`WEBLATE_REMOVE_ADDONS` "
"ແລະ :envvar:`WEBLATE_ADD_MACHINERY` ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງບໍລິການແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ແລະ :envvar:`WEBLATE_CORS_ALLOW_ALL_ORIGINS` ສຳລັບການຈັດການ CORS ໃນ API."

msgid "Added OpenMetrics compatibility for :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບ OpenMetrics ສຳລັບ :http:get:`/api/metrics/`."

msgid "Language aliases in :doc:`/admin/machine`."
msgstr "ນາມແຝງພາສາໃນ :doc:`/admin/machine`."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/123?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/123?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.6"
msgstr "Weblate 5.6"

msgid "*Released on June 19th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 19 ມິຖຸນາ 2024.*"

msgid ":ref:`addons` activity log for tracking add-on activity."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກກິດຈະກຳ :ref:`addons` ສຳລັບຕິດຕາມການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງອັດອອນ."

msgid "Improved date range selection in :ref:`reports`."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການເລືອກຊ່ວງວັນທີໃນ :ref:`reports`."

msgid ":ref:`notifications` now include strings which need updating."
msgstr ":ref:`notifications` ຕອນນີ້ລວມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ອັບເດດ."

msgid "Improved compatibility with password managers."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບກັບແອັບຈັດການລະຫັດຜ່ານ."

msgid "Improved tracking of uploaded changes."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດ."

msgid ""
"Gracefully handle temporary machine translation errors in automatic "
"suggestions."
msgstr "ຈັດການຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຊົ່ວຄາວຈາກການແປດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຈັກໃນຄຳແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

msgid ""
":http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/` now includes ``last_updated`` timestamp."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/` ຕອນນີ້ລວມເວລາ ``last_updated``."

msgid ""
":http:get:`/api/changes/(int:id)/` now includes ``old`` and ``details``."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/changes/(int:id)/` ຕອນນີ້ລວມ ``old`` ແລະ ``details``."

msgid "Reduced memory usage and increased performance of some views."
msgstr "ຫຼຸດການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງບາງມຸມມອງ."

msgid "Loading of strings with many glossary matches."
msgstr "ການໂຫຼດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີລາຍການກົງກັບອະພິທານສັບຫຼາຍ."

msgid "Fixed behavior of some site-wide :ref:`addons`."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂພຶດຕິກຳຂອງບາງ :ref:`addons` ໃນລະດັບເວັບໄຊ."

msgid "Saving strings needing editing to :doc:`/formats/winrc`."
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການການແກ້ໄຂໃນ :doc:`/formats/winrc`."

msgid ":ref:`check-xml-tags` better handle XML entities."
msgstr ":ref:`check-xml-tags` ຈັດການ XML entities ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Automatic suggestions could mix up replacements between translated strings."
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳອັດຕະໂນມັດອາດຈະສະຫຼັບການແທນທີ່ລະຫວ່າງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວ."

msgid "Compatibility with Django 5.1."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກກັບ Django 5.1."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/114?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໂດຍລະອຽດ <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/114?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.5.5"
msgstr "Weblate 5.5.5"

msgid "*Released on May 13th 2024.*"
msgstr "*ອອກວັນທີ 13 ພຶດສະພາ 2024.*"

msgid "False-positive merge failure alert when using push branch."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄວາມຜິດພາດການລວມຟາຍທີ່ຜິດພາດເມື່ອໃຊ້ push branch."

