msgid ""
"The native Gettext support in PHP is buggy and often missing on Windows "
"builds, it is recommended to use third party library `motranslator <https://"
"github.com/phpmyadmin/motranslator>`_ instead."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບ Gettext ແບບ native ໃນ PHP ມີບັນຫາ (buggy) ແລະມັກຈະບໍ່ມີໃນ Windows builds, "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ `motranslator <https://github.com/phpmyadmin/"
"motranslator>`_ ແທນ."

msgid "You can also use :ref:`javaprop` if plurals are not needed."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`javaprop` ຖ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພະຫຸພົດ."

msgid "You can also use plain :ref:`json` if plurals are not needed."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`json` ທຳມະດາ ຖ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພະຫຸພົດ."

msgid ""
"The more detailed workflow for some formats is described in following "
"chapters:"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າສຳລັບບາງຮູບແບບ ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນບົດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Educating developers for proper internationalization"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ແກ່ນັກພັດທະນາເພື່ອການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນສາກົນຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ"

msgid ""
"Software internationalization is not just about being able to translate "
"strings but about making the whole software look native to a user from "
"another country. This also includes things like date or number formatting, "
"currency display, or inputting text in the right direction. Most software "
"frameworks have good support for this, so please follow their instructions "
"for all these areas."
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດຊອບແວໃຫ້ເປັນສາກົນບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ແຕ່ແມ່ນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຊອບແວທັງໝົດເບິ່ງຄືກັບເປັນຂອງທ້ອງຖິ່ນສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈາກປະເທດອື່ນ. ນີ້ລວມເຖິງສິ່ງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການຈັດຮູບແບບວັນທີ ຫຼື ຕົວເລກ, ການສະແດງສະກຸນເງິນ, ຫຼື ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. "
"ເຟຣມເວີກຊອບແວສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຮອງຮັບສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ດີ, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນກະລຸນາປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂອງພວກເຂົາສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດ."

msgid ""
"The string translation might not be a straightforward task as well. This is "
"especially true for short strings like captions or button labels. Different "
"languages have different rules, and it is not reasonable to expect that the "
"same string will always be translated the same. In many situations it also "
"might not be clear how to translate, and it is even challenging to "
"distinguish whether the word is a verb or a noun."
msgstr ""
"ການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມອາດບໍ່ແມ່ນວຽກທີ່ກົງໄປກົງມາ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມຈິງໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄຳບັນຍາຍ "
"ຫຼື ຊື່ປຸ່ມ. ພາສາຕ່າງກັນມີກົດລະບຽບຕ່າງກັນ, "
"ແລະມັນບໍ່ສົມເຫດສົມຜົນທີ່ຈະຄາດຫວັງວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນຈະຖືກແປຄືກັນສະເໝີ. ໃນຫຼາຍສະຖານະການ "
"ມັນອາດບໍ່ຊັດເຈນວ່າຈະແປແນວໃດ, ແລະມັນຍັງຍາກທີ່ຈະແຍກອອກວ່າຄຳນັ້ນເປັນຄຳກິລິຍາ ຫຼື ຄຳນາມ."

msgid ""
"All developers should understand this and uniquely identify strings used in "
"different scopes. For example, ``None`` meaning \"no users\" might be "
"translated differently from ``None`` meaning \"no items\". Use different "
"keys or contexts to distinguish these terms for translators. You can provide "
"additional context in Weblate, such as :ref:`screenshots` "
"or :ref:`additional-explanation`."
msgstr ""
"ນັກພັດທະນາທຸກຄົນຄວນເຂົ້າໃຈສິ່ງນີ້ ແລະລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂອບເຂດຕ່າງໆຢ່າງເປັນເອກະລັກ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: "
"``None`` ທີ່ໝາຍເຖິງ \"ບໍ່ມີຜູ້ໃຊ້\" ອາດຖືກແປຕ່າງຈາກ ``None`` ທີ່ໝາຍເຖິງ \"ບໍ່ມີລາຍການ\". ໃຊ້ຄີ "
"(keys) ຫຼື ບໍລິບົດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນເພື່ອຈຳແນກຄຳສັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ຜູ້ແປ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຫ້ບໍລິບົດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ Weblate, "
"ເຊັ່ນ: :ref:`screenshots` ຫຼື :ref:`additional-explanation`."

msgid ""
"The technical side is only part of the work. Translators also notice the "
"project workflow around strings, releases, and communication. A few "
"practices make collaboration much easier:"
msgstr ""
"ດ້ານເຕັກນິກເປັນພຽງສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງວຽກ. ຜູ້ແປຍັງສັງເກດເຫັນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂຄງການກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, "
"ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ, ແລະການສື່ສານ. ບາງວິທີປະຕິບັດຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຮ່ວມມືງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ:"

msgid ""
"Respond to translator questions and comments, and make sure the advertised "
"contact channel is actually monitored."
msgstr ""
"ຕອບຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ຄວາມຄິດເຫັນຂອງຜູ້ແປ, "
"ແລະຮັບປະກັນວ່າຊ່ອງທາງການຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ປະກາດໄວ້ນັ້ນມີການຕິດຕາມກວດກາຕົວຈິງ."

msgid ""
"Avoid unnecessary churn in source strings. Rewording or replacing existing "
"strings without a user-visible reason creates avoidable translation work."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ. ການປັບຄຳ ຫຼື "
"ການແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ ຈະສ້າງວຽກແປທີ່ຫຼີກລ່ຽງໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Add enough context for translators to understand short or ambiguous strings. "
"Avoid concatenating sentences from fragments, use placeholders that can be "
"reordered, and rely on built-in plural handling."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມບໍລິບົດໃຫ້ພຽງພໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ແປເຂົ້າໃຈຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍກຳກວມ. "
"ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການນຳປະໂຫຍກມາຕໍ່ກັນຈາກຊິ້ນສ່ວນ, ໃຊ້ placeholder ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດລຽງໃໝ່ໄດ້, ແລະ "
"ອາໄສການຈັດການພະຫຸພົດທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນລະບົບ."

msgid ""
"Ship translations regularly so completed work does not stay unused in "
"Weblate for long periods."
msgstr "ສົ່ງງານແປເປັນປະຈຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ວຽກທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວບໍ່ຖືກປະໄວ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ໃນ Weblate ເປັນເວລາດົນ."

msgid ""
"Communicate workflow or policy changes, and keep contribution requirements "
"realistic for smaller language teams."
msgstr ""
"ສື່ສານການປ່ຽນແປງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼື ນະໂຍບາຍ, ແລະ "
"ຮັກສາຂໍ້ກຳນົດໃນການປະກອບສ່ວນໃຫ້ເປັນຈິງສຳລັບທີມພາສາຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ."

msgid ""
"If a project is no longer maintained, reflect that in the translation "
"workflow instead of leaving components open indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າໂຄງການບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການດູແລແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ສະທ້ອນສິ່ງນັ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການແປ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ອົງປະກອບເປີດໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດໄປ."

msgid ""
"Weblate can help with some of these issues. In particular, regular automatic "
"commits from Weblate make translation progress visible in the source code "
"history and reduce the risk that finished work is forgotten before a "
"release. See :ref:`continuous-translation` for automation options."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂບາງບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍສະເພາະ, ການ commit ອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກ Weblate "
"ເປັນປະຈຳເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການແປເຫັນໄດ້ໃນປະຫວັດຂອງ source code ແລະ "
"ຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ວຽກທີ່ແປສຳເລັດແລ້ວຈະຖືກລືມກ່ອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`continuous-"
"translation` ສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "Success stories"
msgstr "ເລື່ອງລາວຄວາມສຳເລັດ"

msgid ""
"Have you written about your experience with Weblate — a blog post, case "
"study, or article about your translation journey? We’d love to feature it "
"here! Add a link to your story and help others discover how Weblate is used "
"in real projects around the world."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າໄດ້ຂຽນກ່ຽວກັບປະສົບການຂອງເຈົ້າກັບ Weblate ບໍ — ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ blog post, ກໍລະນີສຶກສາ (case "
"study), ຫຼື ບົດຄວາມກ່ຽວກັບການເດີນທາງໃນການແປຂອງເຈົ້າ? ພວກເຮົາຢາກຈະນຳສະເໜີມັນທີ່ນີ້! "
"ເພີ່ມລິ້ງຫາເລື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄົນອື່ນຄົ້ນພົບວິທີທີ່ Weblate ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການຈິງທົ່ວໂລກ."

msgid ""
"`Global Grist: How ANCT and the open-source community helped translate Grist "
"into 20+ languages`_"
msgstr ""
"`Global Grist: ວິທີທີ່ ANCT ແລະ ຊຸມຊົນ open-source ຊ່ວຍແປ Grist ເປັນ 20+ ພາສາ`_"

msgid ""
"`Translating Open Source Software with Weblate: A GRASS GIS Case Study`_"
msgstr "`ການແປຊອບແວ Open Source ດ້ວຍ Weblate: ກໍລະນີສຶກສາ GRASS GIS`_"

msgid "Localization libraries and packages"
msgstr "ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດ ແລະ ແພັກເກັດການແປພາສາ"

msgid ""
"Weblate can be integrated into your framework using :doc:`/api`. This page "
"lists third-party libraries which integrate Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າໃນເຟຣມເວີກຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ :doc:`/api`. "
"ໜ້ານີ້ລາຍຊື່ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດຂອງພາກສ່ວນທີສາມທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Weblate."

msgid ""
"`Weblate Translation Provider for Symfony Translation <https://github.com/"
"m2mtech/weblate-translation-provider/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Weblate Translation Provider ສຳລັບ Symfony Translation <https://github.com/"
"m2mtech/weblate-translation-provider/>`_"

msgid ""
"`Weblate plugin for Figma <https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/"
"1053050985172660071/weblate-integration>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Weblate plugin ສຳລັບ Figma <https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/"
"1053050985172660071/weblate-integration>`_"

msgid ""
"`WeblateFX, a JavaFX-based Weblate desktop client <https://github.com/"
"javierllorente/weblatefx>`_"
msgstr ""
"`WeblateFX, Weblate desktop client ທີ່ໃຊ້ JavaFX <https://github.com/"
"javierllorente/weblatefx>`_"

msgid ""
"`JWeblate, a Java-based Weblate library <https://github.com/javierllorente/"
"jweblate>`_"
msgstr ""
"`JWeblate, ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດ Weblate ທີ່ໃຊ້ Java <https://github.com/javierllorente/"
"jweblate>`_"

msgid ""
"`Spring MessageSource backed by a Weblate server <https://github.com/"
"porscheinformatik/weblate-spring>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Spring MessageSource ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍເຊີບເວີ Weblate <https://github.com/"
"porscheinformatik/weblate-spring>`_"

msgid ""
"`GoLang API library for weblate <https://gitlab.com/gajdusek/goweblate>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດ GoLang API ສຳລັບ weblate <https://gitlab.com/gajdusek/goweblate>`_"

msgid ""
"`Perceval backends for Weblate <https://github.com/chaoss/grimoirelab-"
"perceval-weblate>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Perceval backends ສຳລັບ Weblate <https://github.com/chaoss/grimoirelab-"
"perceval-weblate>`_"

msgid ""
"`Visual Studio Code Extension for Weblate <https://github.com/ianFar96/"
"vscode-weblate-extension>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Visual Studio Code Extension ສຳລັບ Weblate <https://github.com/ianFar96/"
"vscode-weblate-extension>`_"

msgid ""
"`Unofficial Weblate SDK for Flutter <https://pub.dev/packages/weblate_sdk>`_"
msgstr ""
"`SDK ຢ່າງບໍ່ເປັນທາງການຂອງ Weblate ສຳລັບ Flutter <https://pub.dev/packages/"
"weblate_sdk>`_"

msgid ""
"Are you building a Weblate integration for your framework? Get listed here! "
"Either submit a pull request with the changes directly or write us at "
"care@weblate.org to get listed."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າກຳລັງສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Weblate ສຳລັບເຟຣມເວີກຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ບໍ? ໃຫ້ມີຊື່ຢູ່ໃນນີ້ເລີຍ! ສົ່ງ pull request "
"ທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຂຽນຫາພວກເຮົາທີ່ care@weblate.org ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີລາຍຊື່."

msgid "Managing translations"
msgstr "ການຈັດການການແປພາສາ"

msgid ""
"New strings can be made available for translation when they appear in the "
"base file, called :ref:`component-new_base` (see :ref:`component`). If your "
"file format doesn't require such a file, as is the case with most "
"monolingual translation flows, you can start with empty files."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຫ້ແປໄດ້ເມື່ອມັນປາກົດຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານ, ເອີ້ນວ່າ :ref:`component-new_base` "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`component`). ຖ້າຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ, "
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບການແປພາສາແບບ monolingual ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ເປົ່າໄດ້."

msgid ""
"Weblate can add new strings to existing files for most of the file formats. "
"You can also specify :guilabel:`Context` for bilingual formats to "
"distinguish same strings used in different context. :guilabel:`Auto-adjust "
"context when an identical string already exists.` can be used to "
"automatically adjust :guilabel:`Context` by adding a numeric suffix in case "
"such a string already exist in the translation."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໃສ່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວສຳລັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. "
"ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດລະບຸ :guilabel:`Context` ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ bilingual "
"ເພື່ອແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວກັນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນບໍລິບົດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. :guilabel:`Auto-adjust context when an "
"identical string already exists.` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບ :guilabel:`Context` "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຕົວເລກຕໍ່ທ້າຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນການແປ."

msgid "Adding new translations"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມການແປພາສາໃໝ່"

msgid ""
"New languages can be added right away when requested by a user in Weblate, "
"or a notification will be sent to project admins for approval and manual "
"addition. This can be done using :ref:`component-new_lang` "
"in :ref:`component`."
msgstr ""
"ພາສາໃໝ່ສາມາດຖືກເພີ່ມໄດ້ທັນທີເມື່ອມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຮ້ອງຂໍໃນ Weblate, ຫຼື "
"ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້ຜູ້ດູແລໂຄງການເພື່ອອະນຸມັດ ແລະ ເພີ່ມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`component-new_lang` ໃນ :ref:`component`."

msgid ""
"Some formats expect to start with an empty file and only translated strings "
"to be included (for example :ref:`aresource`), while others expect to have "
"all keys present (for example :ref:`gettext`). The document-based formats "
"(for example :ref:`odf`) start with a copy of the source document and all "
"strings marked as needing editing. In some situations this really doesn't "
"depend on the format, but rather on the framework you use to handle the "
"translation (for example with :ref:`json`)."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຮູບແບບຄາດວ່າຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ເປົ່າ ແລະ ໃຫ້ລວມເອົາສະເພາະຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: :ref:`aresource`), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮູບແບບອື່ນໆຄາດວ່າຈະມີຄີ (keys) ທັງໝົດຢູ່ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ: :ref:`gettext`). ຮູບແບບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ເອກະສານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: :ref:`odf`) "
"ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍສຳເນົາຂອງເອກະສານຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າຕ້ອງການການແກ້ໄຂ. "
"ໃນບາງສະຖານະການ ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບແບບ, ແຕ່ຂຶ້ນກັບເຟຣມເວີກທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການການແປ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງກັບ :ref:`json`)."

msgid ""
"When you specify :ref:`component-new_base` in :ref:`component`, Weblate uses "
"this file to start new translations. Any existing translations is removed "
"from the file when doing so."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລະບຸ :ref:`component-new_base` ໃນ :ref:`component`, Weblate "
"ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການແປໃໝ່. ການແປໃດໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ເມື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້."

msgid ""
"When :ref:`component-new_base` is empty and the file format supports it, an "
"empty file is created where new strings are added once they are translated."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ :ref:`component-new_base` ເປົ່າ ແລະ ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮອງຮັບ, ໄຟລ໌ເປົ່າຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ "
"ເຊິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປເມື່ອມັນຖືກແປ."

msgid ""
"The :ref:`component-language_code_style` allows you to customize language "
"code used in generated filenames. Additionally, any mappings defined "
"in :ref:`project-language_aliases` are applied in reverse."
msgstr ""
":ref:`component-language_code_style` "
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປັບແຕ່ງລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການ mapping "
"ໃດໆທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`project-language_aliases` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ."

msgid ""
"If you add a language file in connected remote repository, respective "
"translation is added to the component when Weblate updates local repository."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ພາສາໃນ remote repository ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້, "
"ການແປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນອົງປະກອບເມື່ອ Weblate ອັບເດດ local repository."

msgid ""
"More info on the repository update settings can be found on the :ref:`update-"
"vcs`."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການອັບເດດ repository ສາມາດພົບໄດ້ທີ່ :ref:`update-vcs`."

msgid "Removing existing translations"
msgstr "ການລຶບການແປທີ່ມີຢູ່"

msgid ""
"Languages, components, or the projects they are in, can be removed (deleted "
"from Weblate and remote repository if used) from the "
"menu :guilabel:`Operations` ↓ :guilabel:`Removal` of each project, "
"component, or language."
msgstr ""
"ພາສາ, ອົງປະກອບ, ຫຼື ໂຄງການທີ່ພວກມັນຢູ່ ສາມາດຖືກລຶບອອກ (ລຶບອອກຈາກ Weblate ແລະ remote "
"repository ຖ້າມີການນຳໃຊ້) ຈາກເມນູ :guilabel:`Operations` ↓ :guilabel:`Removal` "
"ຂອງແຕ່ລະໂຄງການ, ອົງປະກອບ, ຫຼື ພາສາ."

msgid ""
"Initiating the :guilabel:`Removal` action shows the list of components to be "
"removed. You have to enter the object's `slug` to confirm the removal. The "
"`slug` is the project's, language's, or component's pathname as it can be "
"seen in the URL."
msgstr ""
"ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການດຳເນີນການ :guilabel:`Removal` ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ອົງປະກອບທີ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ. "
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງໃສ່ `slug` ຂອງວັດຖຸເພື່ອຢືນຢັນການລຶບ. `slug` ຄື path ຊື່ຂອງໂຄງການ, ພາສາ, ຫຼື "
"ອົງປະກອບ ດັ່ງທີ່ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນ URL."

msgid ""
"If you want to remove just some specific strings, there are following ways:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລຶບພຽງບາງຂໍ້ຄວາມສະເພາະ, ມີວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Manually in the source file. They will be removed from the translation "
"project as well upon Weblate's repository update."
msgstr ""
"ລຶບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໂຄງການແປດ້ວຍເຊັ່ນກັນເມື່ອ Weblate ອັບເດດ "
"repository."

msgid ""
"In Weblate’s UI via button :guilabel:`Operations` ↓ :guilabel:`Remove` while "
"editing the string. This has differences between file formats, "
"see: :ref:`component-manage_units`"
msgstr ""
"ໃນ UI ຂອງ Weblate ຜ່ານປຸ່ມ :guilabel:`Operations` ↓ :guilabel:`Remove` "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ນີ້ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງ: :ref:`component-"
"manage_units`"

msgid ""
"If you delete a language file in connected remote repository, respective "
"translation will be removed from the component when Weblate updates local "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າລຶບໄຟລ໌ພາສາໃນ remote repository ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້, "
"ການແປທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກອົງປະກອບເມື່ອ Weblate ອັບເດດ local repository."

msgid "String variants"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມ (String variants)"

msgid ""
"Variants are useful to group several strings together so that translators "
"can see all variants of the string at one place."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ (Variants) ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍໆອັນເຂົ້າກັນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ແປສາມາດເຫັນຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນບ່ອນດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Abbreviations (shortened forms, contractions) are a good example of variants."
msgstr "ຕົວຫຍໍ້ (ຮູບແບບສັ້ນ, ຄຳຫຍໍ້) ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ດີຂອງຕົວເລືອກ."

msgid "Automated key based variants"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄີ (Key)"

msgid ""
"You can define regular expression to group the strings based on the key of "
"monolingual translations in the :ref:`component`:"
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດນິພົດປົກກະຕິ (regular expression) ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄີຂອງການແປແບບ "
"monolingual ໃນ :ref:`component`:"

msgid ""
"In case the :guilabel:`Key` matches the expression, the matching part is "
"removed to generate root key of the variant. Then all the strings with the "
"same root key become part of a single variant group, also including the "
"string with the key exactly matching the root key."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ :guilabel:`Key` ກົງກັບນິພົດ, ສ່ວນທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເພື່ອສ້າງຄີຮາກ (root key) "
"ຂອງຕົວເລືອກ. ຈາກນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຄີຮາກດຽວກັນຈະກາຍເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມຕົວເລືອກດຽວ, "
"ລວມເຖິງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄີທີ່ກົງກັບຄີຮາກຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ."

msgid "The following table lists some usage examples:"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລາຍຊື່ບາງຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້:"

msgid "Regular expression variant"
msgstr "ນິພົດປົກກະຕິຂອງຕົວເລືອກ"

msgid "Matched translation keys"
msgstr "ຄີຂອງການແປທີ່ກົງກັນ"

msgid "Suffix identification"
msgstr "ການລະບຸຕົວຕໍ່ທ້າຍ"

msgid "``monthShort``, ``monthMin``, ``month``"
msgstr "``monthShort``, ``monthMin``, ``month``"

msgid "Inline identification"
msgstr "ການລະບຸໃນແຖວ"

msgid "``dial#S.key``, ``dial#M.key``, ``dial.key``"
msgstr "``dial#S.key``, ``dial#M.key``, ``dial.key``"

msgid "Manual variants"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

msgid ""
"You can manually link specific strings using ``variant:SOURCE`` flag. This "
"can be useful for bilingual translations which do not have keys to group "
"strings automatically, or to group strings which keys are not matching, but "
"should be considered together when translating."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສະເພາະດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ flag ``variant:SOURCE``. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການແປແບບ bilingual ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີຄີເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຫຼື "
"ເພື່ອຈັດກຸ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄີບໍ່ກົງກັນ, ແຕ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາຮ່ວມກັນໃນເວລາແປ."

msgid ""
"The additional variant for a string can also be added using "
"the :guilabel:`Tools` while translating (when :ref:`component-manage_units` "
"is turned on):"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Tools` ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແປ "
"(ເມື່ອ :ref:`component-manage_units` ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ):"

msgid "The variant source string has to be at most 768 characters long."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຕົວເລືອກຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວບໍ່ເກີນ 768 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "Variants while translating"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ແປ"

msgid "The variant is later grouped when translating:"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມໃນພາຍຫຼັງເມື່ອແປ:"

msgid "String labels"
msgstr "ປ້າຍກຳກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ (String labels)"

msgid ""
"Split component translation strings into categories by text and colour in "
"the project configuration."
msgstr "ແບ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມການແປຂອງອົງປະກອບອອກເປັນໝວດໝູ່ຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ສີ ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
"Labels can be assigned to units in :ref:`additional` by bulk editing, or "
"using the :ref:`addon-weblate.flags.bulk` add-on."
msgstr ""
"ປ້າຍກຳກັບສາມາດຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ກັບໜ່ວຍງານ (units) ໃນ :ref:`additional` ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂແບບ "
"bulk, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ add-on :ref:`addon-weblate.flags.bulk`."

msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "ຄຳຖາມທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ (FAQ)"

msgid "How to create an automated workflow?"
msgstr "ຈະສ້າງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate can handle all the translation things semi-automatically for you. If "
"you give it push access to your repository, the translations can happen "
"without interaction, unless some merge conflict occurs."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດຈັດການທຸກຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບການແປໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແບບກິ່ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຫ້ສິດການ push ໃຫ້ກັບ "
"repository ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ການແປສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການໂຕ້ຕອບ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຈະມີບັນຫາ "
"merge conflict."

msgid ""
"Set up your Git repository to tell Weblate when there is any change, "
"see :ref:`hooks` for info on how to do it."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Git repository ຂອງເຈົ້າເພື່ອບອກ Weblate ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`hooks` "
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດ."

msgid ""
"Set a push URL at your :ref:`component` in Weblate, this allows Weblate to "
"push changes to your repository."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າ push URL ທີ່ :ref:`component` ຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ Weblate, ສິ່ງນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ Weblate push "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງ repository ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Turn on :ref:`component-push_on_commit` on your :ref:`component` in Weblate, "
"this will make Weblate push changes to your repository whenever they happen "
"at Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ :ref:`component-push_on_commit` ທີ່ :ref:`component` ຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ Weblate, "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate push ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງ repository ຂອງເຈົ້າທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມັນເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ "
"Weblate."

msgid "How to access repositories over SSH?"
msgstr "ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງ repository ຜ່ານ SSH ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid "Please see :ref:`vcs-repos` for info on setting up SSH keys."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ :ref:`vcs-repos` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SSH keys."

msgid "How to fix merge conflicts in translations?"
msgstr "ຈະແກ້ໄຂ merge conflict ໃນການແປໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"Merge conflicts happen from time to time when the translation file is "
"changed in both Weblate and the upstream repository concurrently. You can "
"usually avoid this by merging Weblate translations prior to making changes "
"in the translation files (e.g. before running msgmerge). Just tell Weblate "
"to commit all pending translations (you can do it in :guilabel:`Repository "
"maintenance` in the :guilabel:`Operations` menu) and merge the repository "
"(if automatic push is not on)."
msgstr ""
"Merge conflicts ເກີດຂຶ້ນເປັນບາງຄັ້ງຄາວເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ການແປຖືກປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນ Weblate ແລະ upstream "
"repository ພ້ອມກັນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປເຈົ້າສາມາດຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການ merge ການແປຂອງ Weblate "
"ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ການແປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ກ່ອນ run msgmerge). ພຽງແຕ່ບອກ Weblate ໃຫ້ "
"commit ການແປທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງທັງໝົດ (ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ :guilabel:`Repository maintenance` "
"ໃນເມນູ :guilabel:`Operations`) ແລະ merge repository (ຖ້າ automatic push "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດ)."

msgid ""
"If you've already encountered a merge conflict, the easiest way to solve all "
"conflicts locally on your machine, is to add Weblate as a remote repository, "
"merge it into upstream and fix any conflicts. Once you push changes back, "
"Weblate will be able to use the merged version without any other special "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບ merge conflict ແລ້ວ, ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການແກ້ໄຂ conflicts ທັງໝົດໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ "
"ແມ່ນການເພີ່ມ Weblate ເປັນ remote repository, merge ມັນເຂົ້າໃນ upstream ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂ "
"conflicts. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າ push ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບຄືນ, Weblate ຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ເວີຊັນທີ່ merge "
"ແລ້ວໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີການດຳເນີນການພິເສດໃດໆ."

msgid ""
"If you resolve the conflict in a pull request, merge it with a regular merge "
"commit. Do not squash merge it. Squash merging creates a new commit instead "
"of preserving the Weblate commits, so Weblate might not recognize that its "
"local commits are already included upstream and might need a repository "
"reset to recover."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າເຈົ້າແກ້ໄຂ conflict ໃນ pull request, ໃຫ້ merge ມັນດ້ວຍ regular merge commit. "
"ຢ່າໃຊ້ squash merge. Squash merge ຈະສ້າງ commit ໃໝ່ ແທນທີ່ຈະຮັກສາ Weblate commits "
"ໄວ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ Weblate ອາດຈະບໍ່ຮັບຮູ້ວ່າ local commits ຂອງມັນໄດ້ຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ upstream ແລ້ວ ແລະ "
"ອາດຕ້ອງໄດ້ reset repository ເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນ."

msgid ""
"Weblate uses shallow clones by default to reduce cloning time and disk "
"usage. Because of this, the workflow below works best when you start from an "
"up-to-date checkout of the upstream repository. If you clone directly from "
"the exported Weblate repository, or if your upstream checkout is missing "
"recent commits, ``git remote update weblate`` can fail with errors such as "
"``warning: no common commits``, ``bad revision``, or missing objects. This "
"does not necessarily mean that Weblate and the upstream repository have "
"conflicting changes. Administrators who want to make this workflow more "
"reliable can adjust :setting:`VCS_CLONE_DEPTH`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ shallow clones ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອຫຼຸດເວລາ cloning ແລະ ການໃຊ້ງານດິດ. "
"ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້, ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ checkout "
"ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝຂອງ upstream repository. ຖ້າເຈົ້າ clone ໂດຍກົງຈາກ exported Weblate "
"repository, ຫຼື ຖ້າ upstream checkout ຂອງເຈົ້າຂາດ commits ລ່າສຸດ, ``git remote "
"update weblate`` ອາດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍ error ເຊັ່ນ ``warning: no common commits``, "
"``bad revision``, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Weblate ແລະ upstream "
"repository ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຂັດກັນສະເໝີໄປ. "
"ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ "
"ສາມາດປັບ :setting:`VCS_CLONE_DEPTH`."

msgid ""
"Depending on your setup, access to the Weblate repository might require "
"authentication. When using the built-in :ref:`git-exporter` in Weblate, you "
"authenticate with your username and the API key."
msgstr ""
"ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ, ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Weblate repository ອາດຕ້ອງມີການພິສູດຕົວຕົນ "
"(authentication). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ built-in :ref:`git-exporter` ໃນ Weblate, "
"ເຈົ້າຈະພິສູດຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ API key ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"The workflow usually looks like this when you start from an up-to-date "
"checkout of the upstream repository:"
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກມັກຈະເປັນແບບນີ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ checkout ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝຂອງ upstream "
"repository:"

msgid ""
"If you're using multiple branches in Weblate, you can do the same to all of "
"them:"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ຫຼາຍ branches ໃນ Weblate, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນກັບພວກມັນທັງໝົດ:"

msgid ""
"In case of gettext PO files, there is a way to merge conflicts in a semi-"
"automatic way:"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງໄຟລ໌ gettext PO, ມີວິທີການ merge conflicts ແບບກິ່ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

msgid ""
"Fetch and keep a local clone of the Weblate Git repository. Also get a "
"second fresh local clone of the upstream Git repository (i. e. you need two "
"copies of the upstream Git repository: An intact and a working copy):"
msgstr ""
"Fetch ແລະ ຮັກສາ local clone ຂອງ Weblate Git repository ໄວ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ເອົາ "
"local clone ທີສອງທີ່ສົດໃໝ່ຂອງ upstream Git repository (ເຊັ່ນ: ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ 2 ສຳເນົາຂອງ "
"upstream Git repository: ສຳເນົາທີ່ສົມບູນ ແລະ ສຳເນົາທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ):"

msgid "How do I translate several branches at once?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະແປຫຼາຍ branches ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate supports pushing translation changes within one :ref:`project`. For "
"every :ref:`component` which has it turned on (the default behavior), the "
"change made is automatically propagated to others. This way translations are "
"kept synchronized even if the branches themselves have already diverged "
"quite a lot, and it is not possible to simply merge translation changes "
"between them."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບການ push ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປພາຍໃນ :ref:`project` ດຽວ. "
"ສຳລັບທຸກໆ :ref:`component` ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ (ພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດຈະຖືກກະຈາຍໄປສູ່ອົງປະກອບອື່ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ວິທີນີ້ການແປຈະຖືກຮັກສາໃຫ້ຊິ້ງກັນ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ branches ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍແລ້ວ ແລະ ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດ merge "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ."

msgid ""
"Once you merge changes from Weblate, you might have to merge these branches "
"(depending on your development workflow) discarding differences:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າ merge ການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກ Weblate, ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງ merge branches ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ "
"(ຂຶ້ນກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການພັດທະນາຂອງເຈົ້າ) ໂດຍຍົກເລີກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ:"

msgid "How to translate multi-platform projects?"
msgstr "ຈະແປໂຄງການ multi-platform ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate supports a wide range of file formats (see :doc:`formats`) and the "
"easiest approach is to use the native format for each platform."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ (ເບິ່ງ :doc:`formats`) ແລະ ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດຄືການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ "
"native ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມ."

msgid ""
"Once you have added all platform translation files as components in one "
"project (see :ref:`adding-projects`), you can utilize the translation "
"propagation feature (turned on by default, and can be turned off in "
"the :ref:`component`) to translate strings for all platforms at once."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ການແປທຸກແພລັດຟອມເປັນ components ໃນໂຄງການດຽວແລ້ວ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`adding-"
"projects`), ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການກະຈາຍການແປ (translation propagation) "
"(ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລະ ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໃນ :ref:`component`) "
"ເພື່ອແປຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບທຸກແພລັດຟອມພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid "How to export the Git repository that Weblate uses?"
msgstr "ຈະສົ່ງອອກ Git repository ທີ່ Weblate ໃຊ້ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"There is nothing special about the repository, it lives under "
"the :setting:`DATA_DIR` directory and is named :file:`vcs/<project>/"
"<component>/`. If you have SSH access to this machine, you can use the "
"repository directly."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງພິເສດກ່ຽວກັບ repository ນັ້ນ, ມັນຢູ່ໃນໄດເລກະທໍລີ :setting:`DATA_DIR` ແລະ "
"ມີຊື່ວ່າ :file:`vcs/<project>/<component>/`. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີການເຂົ້າເຖິງ SSH ໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງນີ້, "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ repository ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"For anonymous access, you might want to run a Git server and let it serve "
"the repository to the outside world."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ run Git server ແລະ ໃຫ້ມັນໃຫ້ບໍລິການ "
"repository ແກ່ໂລກພາຍນອກ."

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use :ref:`git-exporter` inside Weblate to automate "
"this."
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`git-exporter` ພາຍໃນ Weblate "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid "What are the options for pushing changes back upstream?"
msgstr "ມີຕົວເລືອກໃດແດ່ສຳລັບການ push ການປ່ຽນແປງກັບຄືນ upstream?"

msgid ""
"This heavily depends on your setup, Weblate is quite flexible in this area. "
"Here are examples of some workflows used with Weblate:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼາຍ, Weblate ມີຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນຫຼາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ນີ້. "
"ນີ້ຄືຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບ Weblate:"

msgid ""
"Weblate automatically pushes and merges changes (see :ref:`auto-workflow`)."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ເຮັດການ push ແລະ merge ການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`auto-"
"workflow`)."

msgid ""
"You manually tell Weblate to push (it needs push access to the upstream "
"repository)."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າບອກ Weblate ໃຫ້ push ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ມັນຕ້ອງການສິດ push ໄປຍັງ upstream repository)."

msgid ""
"Somebody manually merges changes from the Weblate git repository into the "
"upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄົນ merge ການປ່ຽນແປງຈາກ Weblate git repository ເຂົ້າໃນ upstream repository "
"ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

msgid ""
"Somebody rewrites history produced by Weblate (e.g. by eliminating merge "
"commits), merges changes, and tells Weblate to reset the content in the "
"upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"ບາງຄົນຂຽນປະຫວັດທີ່ Weblate ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ (ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍການກຳຈັດ merge commits), merge "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງ, ແລະ ບອກ Weblate ໃຫ້ reset ເນື້ອຫາໃນ upstream repository."

msgid "Of course you are free to mix all of these as you wish."
msgstr "ແນ່ນອນ ເຈົ້າມີອິດສະຫຼະໃນການປະສົມປະສານສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດຕາມທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ."

msgid ""
"How can I limit Weblate access to only translations, without exposing source "
"code to it?"
msgstr ""
"ຂ້ອຍຈະຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ Weblate ໃຫ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ການແປ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດເຜີຍ source code "
"ໃຫ້ກັບມັນໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"You can use `git submodule`_ for separating translations from source code "
"while still having them under version control."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ `git submodule`_ ເພື່ອແຍກການແປອອກຈາກ source code "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາພວກມັນໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ການຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ (version control)."

msgid "Create a repository with your translation files."
msgstr "ສ້າງ repository ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ການແປຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "Add this as a submodule to your code:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນ submodule ເຂົ້າໃນ code ຂອງເຈົ້າ:"

msgid ""
"Link Weblate to this repository, it no longer needs access to the repository "
"containing your source code."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ Weblate ກັບ repository ນີ້, ມັນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຂົ້າເຖິງ repository ທີ່ມີ source code "
"ຂອງເຈົ້າອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "You can update the main repository with translations from Weblate by:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດອັບເດດ main repository ດ້ວຍການແປຈາກ Weblate ໂດຍ:"

msgid ""
"Weblate should be linked to the translation repository directly. It does not "
"populate submodules when cloning a parent repository, so translation files "
"inside a submodule are not available through the parent repository. "
"See :ref:`git-submodules`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Please consult the `git submodule`_ documentation for more details."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາປຶກສາຫາລືເອກະສານ `git submodule`_ ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "How can I check whether my Weblate is set up properly?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະກວດສອບໄດ້ແນວໃດວ່າ Weblate ຂອງຂ້ອຍຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate includes a set of configuration checks which you can see in the "
"admin interface, just follow the :guilabel:`Performance report` link in the "
"admin interface, or open the ``/manage/performance/`` URL directly."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ລວມມີຊຸດການກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນ admin interface, "
"ພຽງແຕ່ຕິດຕາມລິ້ງ :guilabel:`Performance report` ໃນ admin interface, ຫຼື ເປີດ URL ``/"
"manage/performance/`` ໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Why are all commits committed by Weblate <noreply@weblate.org>?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງ commits ທັງໝົດຈຶ່ງຖືກ commit ໂດຍ Weblate <noreply@weblate.org>?"

msgid ""
"Weblate uses ``Weblate <noreply@weblate.org>`` as the default **committer** "
"for all commits, which is configured by :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_EMAIL` "
"and :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_NAME`. This is a technical identifier showing "
"that the commit was processed through Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ ``Weblate <noreply@weblate.org>`` ເປັນ **committer** ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ "
"commits ທັງໝົດ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_EMAIL` "
"ແລະ :setting:`DEFAULT_COMMITER_NAME`. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວລະບຸທາງເຕັກນິກທີ່ສະແດງວ່າ commit "
"ນັ້ນຖືກປະມວນຜົນຜ່ານ Weblate."

msgid ""
"However, the **author** of each commit is correctly recorded as the "
"individual user who made the translation (when using Git). This means you "
"can see who actually translated each string by examining the commit author "
"field. The same applies to Mercurial; only Subversion does not have this "
"capability."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, **author** ຂອງແຕ່ລະ commit ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງວ່າເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນທີ່ເຮັດການແປ "
"(ເມື່ອໃຊ້ Git). ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ວ່າໃຜແປຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດແທ້ໆໂດຍການກວດສອບຟີລ໌ commit "
"author. ສິ່ງດຽວກັນນີ້ໃຊ້ກັບ Mercurial; ມີພຽງແຕ່ Subversion ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄວາມສາມາດນີ້."

msgid ""
"In Git, there is a distinction between the committer (who created the commit "
"object) and the author (who made the changes). Weblate acts as the committer "
"while preserving individual translator attribution as authors."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ Git, ມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ committer (ຜູ້ທີ່ສ້າງ commit object) ແລະ author "
"(ຜູ້ທີ່ເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງ). Weblate ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເປັນ committer ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາການໃຫ້ກຽດ "
"(attribution) ຜູ້ແປແຕ່ລະຄົນໃນຖານະ author."

msgid ""
"For commits where authorship cannot be determined (such as automated changes "
"from anonymous suggestions or machine translation results), the author is "
"set to the anonymous user. You can configure the anonymous user's name and e-"
"mail in :setting:`ANONYMOUS_USER_NAME`."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບ commits ທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດ authorship ໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກຄຳແນະນຳທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ ຫຼື ຜົນການແປດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຈັກ), author "
"ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ ແລະ "
"ອີເມວຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນໃນ :setting:`ANONYMOUS_USER_NAME`."

msgid "How to move files in the repository without losing history in Weblate?"
msgstr "ຈະຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໃນ repository ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ປະຫວັດໃນ Weblate ຫາຍໄປໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"To keep the history, comments, or screenshots linked to strings after "
"changing the files location you need to ensure that these strings are never "
"deleted in Weblate. These removals can happen in case the Weblate repository "
"is updated, but the component configuration still points to the old files. "
"This makes Weblate assume that it should delete all the translations."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮັກສາປະຫວັດ, ຄວາມຄິດເຫັນ, ຫຼື screenshots ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼັງຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງສະຖານທີ່ໄຟລ໌, "
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບໃນ Weblate. ການລຶບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ "
"Weblate repository ຖືກອັບເດດ, ແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງປະກອບຍັງຊີ້ໄປທີ່ໄຟລ໌ເກົ່າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ Weblate "
"ຄິດວ່າມັນຄວນລຶບການແປທັງໝົດ."

msgid "The solution to this is to perform the operation in sync with Weblate:"
msgstr "ວິທີແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້ຄືການປະຕິບັດການດຳເນີນການໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບ Weblate:"

msgid "Lock the affected component in Weblate."
msgstr "ລັອກອົງປະກອບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບໃນ Weblate."

msgid "Commit any pending changes and merge them into the upstream repository."
msgstr "Commit ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງທັງໝົດ ແລະ merge ພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ upstream repository."

msgid ""
"Disable receiving webhooks the :ref:`project`; this prevents Weblate from "
"immediately seeing changes in the repository."
msgstr ""
"ປິດການຮັບ webhooks ຂອງ :ref:`project`; ສິ່ງນີ້ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ Weblate ເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ "
"repository ທັນທີ."

msgid ""
"Do any needed changes in the repo (for example using :command:`git mv`), "
"push them to the upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນ repo (ຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ :command:`git mv`), push ພວກມັນໄປຍັງ "
"upstream repository."

msgid ""
"Change the :ref:`component` to match the new setup; upon changing "
"configuration, Weblate will fetch the updated repository and notice the "
"changed locations while keeping existing strings."
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນ :ref:`component` ໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່; ເມື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, Weblate ຈະ fetch "
"repository ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ ແລະ ສັງເກດເຫັນສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ປ່ຽນໄປໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Unlock the component and re-enable hooks in the project configuration."
msgstr "ປົດລັອກອົງປະກອບ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ hooks ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງການ."

msgid ""
":ref:`projectbackup` might be useful to perform prior to such disrupting "
"changes."
msgstr ""
":ref:`projectbackup` ອາດເປັນປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດກ່ອນການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບດັ່ງກ່າວ."

msgid "How do I review the translations of others?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະກວດສອບການແປຂອງຄົນອື່ນໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"There are several review based workflows available in Weblate, "
"see :ref:`workflows`."
msgstr ""
"ມີຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ອີງໃສ່ການກວດສອບຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນ Weblate, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`workflows`."

msgid ""
"You can subscribe to any changes made in :ref:`notifications` and then check "
"others contributions as they come in by e-mail."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດສະໝັກຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ເຮັດໃນ :ref:`notifications` ແລະ "
"ຈາກນັ້ນກວດສອບການປະກອບສ່ວນຂອງຄົນອື່ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ພວກມັນເຂົ້າມາທາງອີເມວ."

msgid ""
"There is a review tool available at the bottom of the translation view, "
"where you can choose to browse translations made by others since a given "
"date."
msgstr ""
"ມີເຄື່ອງມືກວດສອບຢູ່ທີ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງມຸມມອງການແປ, ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ browse "
"ການແປທີ່ເຮັດໂດຍຄົນອື່ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ວັນທີທີ່ກຳນົດ."

msgid "How do I provide feedback on a source string?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະໃຫ້ຄຳຕິຊົມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"On context tabs below translation, you can use the :guilabel:`Comments` tab "
"to provide feedback on a source string, or discuss it with other translators."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖບ context ດ້ານລຸ່ມການແປ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ແຖບ :guilabel:`Comments` "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄຳຕິຊົມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ຫຼື ປຶກສາຫາລືກັບຜູ້ແປອື່ນໆ."

msgid "How can I use existing translations while translating?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະໃຊ້ການແປທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຂະນະທີ່ແປໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"All translations within Weblate can be used thanks to shared translation "
"memory."
msgstr ""
"ການແປທັງໝົດພາຍໃນ Weblate ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຂໍຂອບໃຈກັບ translation memory ທີ່ແບ່ງປັນກັນ."

msgid "You can import existing translation memory files into Weblate."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ translation memory ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເຂົ້າໃນ Weblate."

msgid ""
"Use the import functionality to load compendium as translations, suggestions "
"or translations needing review. This is the best approach for a one-time "
"translation using a compendium or a similar translation database."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການນຳເຂົ້າເພື່ອໂຫຼດ compendium ເປັນການແປ, ຄຳແນະນຳ, ຫຼື ການແປທີ່ຕ້ອງການການກວດສອບ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການແປແບບຄັ້ງດຽວໂດຍໃຊ້ compendium ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນການແປທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ."

msgid ""
"You can set up :ref:`mt-tmserver` with all databases you have and let "
"Weblate use it. This is good when you want to use it several times during "
"translation."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ :ref:`mt-tmserver` ດ້ວຍຖານຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຈົ້າມີ ແລະ ໃຫ້ Weblate ໃຊ້ງານມັນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນດີເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ງານມັນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນລະຫວ່າງການແປ."

msgid ""
"Another option is to translate all related projects in a single Weblate "
"instance, which will make it automatically pick up translations from other "
"projects as well."
msgstr ""
"ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງຄືການແປໂຄງການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດໃນ Weblate instance ດຽວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນດຶງການແປຈາກໂຄງການອື່ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid "Does Weblate update translation files besides translations?"
msgstr "Weblate ອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ການແປນອກເໜືອຈາກການແປບໍ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate tries to limit changes in translation files to a minimum. For some "
"file formats it might unfortunately lead to reformatting the file. If you "
"want to keep the file formatted your way, please use a pre-commit hook for "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ພະຍາຍາມຈຳກັດການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ການແປໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ. ສຳລັບບາງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ "
"ມັນອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການຈັດຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຢ່າງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຮັກສາຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຕາມວິທີຂອງເຈົ້າ, "
"ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ pre-commit hook ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນ."

msgid "How do I merge updated POT file with PO translations?"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຈະ merge ໄຟລ໌ POT ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວກັບການແປ PO ໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`updating-target-files` for information on updating PO files when "
"the POT template changes."
msgstr ""
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`updating-target-files` ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ເມື່ອ template POT "
"ປ່ຽນແປງ."

msgid "Where do language definitions come from and how can I add my own?"
msgstr "ນິຍາມພາສາມາຈາກໃສ ແລະ ຂ້ອຍຈະເພີ່ມຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້ແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"The basic set of language definitions is included within Weblate and "
"Translate-toolkit. This covers more than 150 languages and includes info "
"about plural forms or text direction."
msgstr ""
"ຊຸດນິຍາມພາສາພື້ນຖານຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນ Weblate ແລະ Translate-toolkit. ນີ້ກວມເອົາຫຼາຍກວ່າ 150 "
"ພາສາ ແລະ ລວມເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບພະຫຸພົດ ຫຼື ທິດທາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"You are free to define your own languages in the administrative interface, "
"you just need to provide info about it."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າມີອິດສະຫຼະໃນການກຳນົດພາສາຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໃນ administrative interface, "
"ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບມັນ."

msgid "Can Weblate highlight changes in a fuzzy string?"
msgstr "Weblate ສາມາດເນັ້ນການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມ fuzzy ໄດ້ບໍ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate supports this, however it needs the data to show the difference."
msgstr "Weblate ຮອງຮັບສິ່ງນີ້, ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ ມັນຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອສະແດງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ."

msgid ""
"For Gettext PO files, you have to pass the parameter ``--previous`` "
"to :command:`msgmerge` when updating PO files, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Gettext PO, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສົ່ງ parameter ``--previous`` "
"ໄປຍັງ :command:`msgmerge` ເມື່ອອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO, ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid ""
"For monolingual translations, Weblate can find the previous string by ID, so "
"it shows the differences automatically."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການແປແບບ monolingual, Weblate ສາມາດຊອກຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມກ່ອນໜ້າໂດຍ ID, "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງສະແດງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"Why does Weblate still show old translation strings when I've updated the "
"template?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງ Weblate ຈຶ່ງຍັງສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມການແປເກົ່າທັງທີ່ຂ້ອຍອັບເດດ template ແລ້ວ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate does not try to manipulate the translation files in any way other "
"than allowing translators to translate. So it also does not update the "
"translatable files when the template or source code have been changed. You "
"simply have to do this manually and push changes to the repository, Weblate "
"will then pick up the changes automatically."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ບໍ່ພະຍາຍາມປັບປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ການແປໃນທາງໃດທາງໜຶ່ງນອກເໜືອຈາກການອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ແປເຮັດວຽກ. "
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແປໄດ້ເມື່ອ template ຫຼື source code ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ push ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປຍັງ repository, ຈາກນັ້ນ Weblate "
"ຈະຮັບເອົາການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

msgid ""
"It is usually a good idea to merge changes done in Weblate before updating "
"translation files, as otherwise you will usually end up with some conflicts "
"to merge."
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະ merge ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດໃນ Weblate ກ່ອນອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ການແປ, "
"ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າມັກຈະຈົບລົງດ້ວຍ conflict ບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງ merge."

msgid "How to handle renaming translation files?"
msgstr "ຈະຈັດການກັບການປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ການແປແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"When renaming files in the repository, it can happen that Weblate sees this "
"as removal and adding of the files. This can lead to losing strings history, "
"comments and suggestions."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນ repository, ມັນອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ວ່າ Weblate ເຫັນສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນການລຶບ ແລະ ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍປະຫວັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ຄວາມຄິດເຫັນ ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳ."

msgid "To avoid that, perform renaming in following steps:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດການປ່ຽນຊື່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid "Lock the translation component in :ref:`manage-vcs`."
msgstr "ລັອກອົງປະກອບການແປໃນ :ref:`manage-vcs`."

msgid "Commit pending changes in :ref:`manage-vcs`."
msgstr "Commit ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງໃນ :ref:`manage-vcs`."

msgid "Merge Weblate changes to the upstream repository."
msgstr "Merge ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງ Weblate ເຂົ້າໃນ upstream repository."

msgid "Disable receiving updates via hooks using :ref:`project-enable_hooks`."
msgstr "ປິດການຮັບການອັບເດດຜ່ານ hooks ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`project-enable_hooks`."

msgid "Perform the renaming of the files in the repository."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນ repository."

msgid "Update the component configuration to match new file names."
msgstr "ອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງປະກອບໃຫ້ກົງກັບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່."

msgid "Enable update hooks and unlock the component."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ update hooks ແລະ ປົດລັອກອົງປະກອບ."

msgid "Requests sometimes fail with \"too many open files\" error"
msgstr "Requests ບາງຄັ້ງລົ້ມເຫຼວດ້ວຍ error \"too many open files\""

msgid ""
"This happens sometimes when your Git repository grows too much and you have "
"many of them. Compressing the Git repositories will improve this situation."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນບາງຄັ້ງເມື່ອ Git repository ຂອງເຈົ້າໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ ແລະ ເຈົ້າມີພວກມັນຫຼາຍ. ການບີບອັດ Git "
"repositories ຈະປັບປຸງສະຖານະການນີ້ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The easiest way to do this is to run:"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ຄື run:"

msgid "When accessing the site I get a \"Bad Request (400)\" error"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງເວັບໄຊ, ຂ້ອຍໄດ້ຮັບ error \"Bad Request (400)\""

msgid ""
"This is most likely caused by an improperly "
"configured :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS`. It needs to contain all hostnames you "
"want to access on your Weblate. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຈາກ :setting:`ALLOWED_HOSTS` ທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ມັນຕ້ອງມີ hostname "
"ທັງໝົດທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນ Weblate ຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

msgid "What does mean \"There are more files for the single language (en)\"?"
msgstr "\"There are more files for the single language (en)\" ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"This typically happens when you have translation file for source language. "
"Weblate keeps track of source strings and reserves source language for this. "
"The additional file for same language is not processed."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເຈົ້າມີໄຟລ໌ການແປສຳລັບພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບ. Weblate ຕິດຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ "
"ຈອງພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບໄວ້ສຳລັບສິ່ງນີ້. ໄຟລ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບພາສາດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid ""
"In case the translation to the source language is desired, please change "
"the :ref:`component-source_language` in the component settings. You might "
"want to use `English (Developer)` as a source language, or "
"utilize :ref:`source-quality-gateway`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການການແປເປັນພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ກະລຸນາປ່ຽນ :ref:`component-source_language` "
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອົງປະກອບ. ເຈົ້າອາດຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ `English (Developer)` ເປັນພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ຫຼື "
"ນຳໃຊ້ :ref:`source-quality-gateway`."

msgid ""
"In case the translation file for the source language is not needed, please "
"remove it from the repository."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ການແປສຳລັບພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ, ກະລຸນາລຶບມັນອອກຈາກ repository."

msgid ""
"In case the translation file for the source language is needed, but should "
"be ignored by Weblate, please adjust the :ref:`component-language_regex` to "
"exclude it."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ການແປສຳລັບພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບຈຳເປັນ, ແຕ່ຄວນຖືກລະເລີຍໂດຍ Weblate, "
"ກະລຸນາປັບ :ref:`component-language_regex` ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນມັນ."

msgid ""
"You might get similar error message for other languages as well. In that "
"case the most likely reason is that several files map to single language in "
"Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ເຈົ້າອາດໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ error ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນສຳລັບພາສາອື່ນເຊັ່ນກັນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ "
"ເຫດຜົນທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ map ໄປຍັງພາສາດຽວໃນ Weblate."

msgid ""
"This can be caused by using obsolete language codes together with new one "
"(``ja`` and ``jp`` for Japanese) or including both country specific and "
"generic codes (``fr`` and ``fr_FR``). See :ref:`language-parsing-codes` for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ຫຼ້າສະໄໝຮ່ວມກັບອັນໃໝ່ (``ja`` ແລະ ``jp`` "
"ສຳລັບພາສາຍີ່ປຸ່ນ) ຫຼື ການລວມເອົາລະຫັດສະເພາະປະເທດ ແລະ ລະຫັດທົ່ວໄປ (``fr`` ແລະ ``fr_FR``). "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`language-parsing-codes` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ"

msgid "Does Weblate support other VCSes than Git and Mercurial?"
msgstr "Weblate ຮອງຮັບ VCS ອື່ນນອກຈາກ Git ແລະ Mercurial ບໍ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate currently does not have native support for anything other "
"than :ref:`vcs-git` (with extended support for :ref:`code-hosting-github-"
"pull-requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gerrit`, and :ref:`vcs-git-svn`) "
"and :ref:`vcs-mercurial`, but it is possible to write backends for other "
"VCSes."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ Weblate ບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບແບບ native ສຳລັບສິ່ງໃດນອກເໜືອຈາກ :ref:`vcs-git` "
"(ພ້ອມການຮອງຮັບແບບຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບ :ref:`code-hosting-github-pull-"
"requests`, :ref:`code-hosting-gerrit`, ແລະ :ref:`vcs-git-svn`) ແລະ :ref:`vcs-"
"mercurial`, ແຕ່ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຂຽນ backends ສຳລັບ VCS ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "Weblate also supports VCS-less operation, see :ref:`vcs-local`."
msgstr "Weblate ຍັງຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບ VCS-less, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`vcs-local`."

msgid ""
"For native support of other VCSes, Weblate requires using distributed VCS, "
"and could probably be adjusted to work with anything other than Git and "
"Mercurial, but somebody has to implement this support."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຮອງຮັບ native ຂອງ VCS ອື່ນໆ, Weblate ຕ້ອງການການໃຊ້ distributed VCS, ແລະ "
"ອາດຈະສາມາດປັບໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກກັບສິ່ງໃດກໍໄດ້ນອກເໜືອຈາກ Git ແລະ Mercurial, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງມີຄົນມາຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດການຮອງຮັບນີ້."

msgid "How does Weblate credit translators?"
msgstr "Weblate ໃຫ້ກຽດ (credit) ຜູ້ແປແນວໃດ?"

msgid ""
"Every change made in Weblate is committed into VCS under the translators "
"name. This way every single change has proper authorship, and you can track "
"it down using the standard VCS tools you use for code."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດໃນ Weblate ຈະຖືກ committed ເຂົ້າໃນ VCS ພາຍໃຕ້ຊື່ຜູ້ແປ. "
"ວິທີນີ້ທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງມີ authorship ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕິດຕາມມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື VCS "
"ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ສຳລັບ code."

msgid ""
"Additionally, when the translation file format supports it, the file headers "
"are updated to include the translator's name."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ການແປຮອງຮັບ, file headers ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເພື່ອລວມເອົາຊື່ຂອງຜູ້ແປ."

msgid "Why does Weblate force showing all PO files in a single tree?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງ Weblate ຈຶ່ງບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສະແດງໄຟລ໌ PO ທັງໝົດໃນ tree ດຽວ?"

msgid ""
"Weblate was designed in a way that every PO file is represented as a single "
"component. This is beneficial for translators, so they know what they are "
"actually translating."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃນທາງທີ່ໄຟລ໌ PO ທຸກໄຟລ໌ຖືກສະແດງເປັນອົງປະກອບດຽວ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຜູ້ແປ, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຂົາກຳລັງແປຫຍັງແທ້ໆ."

msgid ""
"Translators can translate all the components of a project into a specific "
"language as a whole."
msgstr "ຜູ້ແປສາມາດແປອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດຂອງໂຄງການເປັນພາສາສະເພາະໂດຍລວມໄດ້."

msgid "Why does Weblate use language codes such sr_Latn or zh_Hant?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງ Weblate ຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາເຊັ່ນ sr_Latn ຫຼື zh_Hant?"

msgid ""
"These are language codes defined by :rfc:`5646` to better indicate that they "
"are really different languages instead previously wrongly used modifiers "
"(for ``@latin`` variants) or country codes (for Chinese)."
msgstr ""
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ :rfc:`5646` ເພື່ອລະບຸໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນວ່າພວກມັນເປັນພາສາທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນແທ້ໆ "
"ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ modifiers ທີ່ໃຊ້ຜິດໆໃນເມື່ອກ່ອນ (ສຳລັບຕົວແປ ``@latin``) ຫຼື ລະຫັດປະເທດ "
"(ສຳລັບພາສາຈີນ)."

msgid ""
"Weblate still understands legacy language codes and will map them to current "
"one - for example ``sr@latin`` will be handled as ``sr_Latn`` or ``zh@CN`` "
"as ``zh_Hans``."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຍັງເຂົ້າໃຈລະຫັດພາສາແບບເກົ່າ (legacy) ແລະ ຈະ map ພວກມັນໄປຍັງອັນປັດຈຸບັນ - ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"``sr@latin`` ຈະຖືກຈັດການເປັນ ``sr_Latn`` ຫຼື ``zh@CN`` ເປັນ ``zh_Hans``."

msgid ""
"Weblate defaults to POSIX style language codes with underscore, "
"see :ref:`languages` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາແບບ POSIX ທີ່ມີ underscore ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`languages` "
"ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Localization file formats"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ການແປພາສາ"

msgid ""
"Weblate supports a wide range of translation formats. Each format is "
"slightly different and provides a different set of capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບການແປທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບແບບມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ "
"ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

msgid ""
"When choosing a file format for your application, it's better to stick to "
"some well-established format in the toolkit/platform you use. This way your "
"translators can additionally use whatever tools they are used to, and will "
"more likely contribute to your project."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເລືອກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງເຈົ້າ, ມັນດີກວ່າທີ່ຈະຍຶດຕິດກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຍອມຮັບໃນ "
"toolkit/platform ທີ່ເຈົ້າໃຊ້. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ຜູ້ແປຂອງເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ພວກເຂົາເຄີຍໃຊ້, ແລະ "
"ມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະປະກອບສ່ວນເຂົ້າໃນໂຄງການຂອງເຈົ້າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "Automatic detection"
msgstr "ການກວດຫາອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid ""
"Weblate tries to detect file format during :ref:`adding-projects`. The "
"detection might be wrong for different variants of the same serialization "
"format (JSON, YAML, properties) or file encoding, so please verify "
"that :ref:`component-file_format` is correct before creating the component."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ພະຍາຍາມກວດສອບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ໃນລະຫວ່າງ :ref:`adding-projects`. "
"ການກວດສອບອາດຜິດພາດສຳລັບຕົວແປຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບແບບ serialization ດຽວກັນ (JSON, YAML, "
"properties) ຫຼື file encoding, ດັ່ງນັ້ນກະລຸນາຢືນຢັນວ່າ :ref:`component-file_format` "
"ຖືກຕ້ອງກ່ອນສ້າງອົງປະກອບ."

msgid "Translation types capabilities"
msgstr "ຄວາມສາມາດຂອງປະເພດການແປ"

msgid ""
"Please refer to the documentation page of each individual file format for "
"information about which features are supported in that format."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາອ້າງອີງເຖິງໜ້າເອກະສານຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດໃດຖືກຮອງຮັບໃນຮູບແບບນັ້ນ."

msgid "Bilingual and monolingual formats"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ bilingual ແລະ monolingual"

msgid ""
"Both :index:`monolingual <pair: translation; monolingual>` "
"and :index:`bilingual <pair: translation; bilingual>` formats are supported. "
"Bilingual formats store two languages in single file—source and translation "
"(typical examples are :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`xliff` or :ref:`apple`). On the "
"other side, monolingual formats identify the string by ID, and each language "
"file contains only the mapping of those to any given language "
"(typically :ref:`aresource`). Some file formats are used in both variants, "
"see the detailed description below."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບທັງຮູບແບບ :index:`monolingual <pair: translation; monolingual>` "
"ແລະ :index:`bilingual <pair: translation; bilingual>`. ຮູບແບບ Bilingual "
"ເກັບສອງພາສາໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ດຽວ—ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ການແປ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`xliff` ຫຼື :ref:`apple`). ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, "
"ຮູບແບບ monolingual ລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ວຍ ID, ແລະ ແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ພາສາບັນຈຸພຽງແຕ່ການ mapping "
"ຂອງສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນກັບພາສາໃດໜຶ່ງ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ :ref:`aresource`). "
"ບາງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນທັງສອງຕົວແປ, ເບິ່ງຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້."

msgid ""
"For correct use of monolingual files, Weblate requires access to a file "
"containing complete list of strings to translate with their source—this file "
"is called :ref:`component-template` within Weblate, though the naming might "
"vary in your paradigm."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ monolingual ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, Weblate "
"ຕ້ອງການການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີລາຍຊື່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຄົບຖ້ວນເພື່ອແປພ້ອມກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ—ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ :ref:`component-"
"template` ພາຍໃນ Weblate, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການຕັ້ງຊື່ອາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນ paradigm ຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid ""
"Additionally this workflow can be extended by utilizing :ref:`component-"
"intermediate` to include strings provided by developers, but not to be used "
"as is in the final strings."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ :ref:`component-"
"intermediate` ເພື່ອລວມເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ນັກພັດທະນາໃຫ້ມາ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕາມສະພາບໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມສຸດທ້າຍ."

msgid "String states"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

msgid ""
"Many file formats only differentiate \"Untranslated\" and \"Translated\" "
"strings. With some formats it is possible to store more fine-grained state "
"information, such as \"Needs editing\" or \"Approved\"."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ແຍກແຍະພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"Untranslated\" ແລະ \"Translated\". ກັບບາງຮູບແບບ "
"ມັນສາມາດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານະທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າໄດ້, ເຊັ່ນ \"Needs editing\" ຫຼື \"Approved\"."

msgid "Source string description"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

msgid ""
"Source string descriptions can be used to pass additional info about the "
"string to translate."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະແປ."

msgid ""
"Several formats have native support for providing additional info to "
"translators (for "
"example :ref:`xliff`, :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`webex`, :ref:`csv`, :ref:`xlsx`, :ref:`qtling`, :ref:`go-"
"i18n-json`, :ref:`gotext-json`, :ref:`arb`, :ref:`dotnet`). Many other "
"formats extract closest comment as source string description."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບມີການຮອງຮັບ native ສຳລັບການໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມແກ່ຜູ້ແປ "
"(ຕົວຢ່າງ :ref:`xliff`, :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`webex`, :ref:`csv`, :ref:`xlsx`, :ref:`qtling`, :ref:`go-"
"i18n-json`, :ref:`gotext-json`, :ref:`arb`, :ref:`dotnet`). "
"ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບອື່ນໆຈະສະກັດຄຳເຫັນທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດເປັນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ."

msgid ""
"The :ref:`additional-explanation` on strings can be stored and parsed from a "
"few file formats."
msgstr ""
":ref:`additional-explanation` ກ່ຽວກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດຖືກເກັບ ແລະ parsed ຈາກບາງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "Currently supported only in :ref:`tbx`."
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໃນ :ref:`tbx`."

msgid "Source string location"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

msgid ""
"Location of a string in source code might help proficient translators figure "
"out how the string is used."
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານທີ່ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນ source code ອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ແປທີ່ມີຄວາມຊຳນານເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ແນວໃດ."

msgid ""
"This information is typically available in bilingual formats where strings "
"are extracted from the source code using tools. For example :ref:`gettext` "
"and :ref:`qtling`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ມັກຈະມີຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ bilingual ເຊິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກສະກັດຈາກ source code ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງ :ref:`gettext` ແລະ :ref:`qtling`."

msgid ""
"Translation flags allow customizing Weblate behavior. Some formats support "
"defining those in the translation file (you can always define them in the "
"Weblate interface, see :ref:`custom-checks`)."
msgstr ""
"Flags ການແປອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ Weblate. "
"ບາງຮູບແບບຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນໄຟລ໌ການແປ (ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດພວກມັນໃນ Weblate interface "
"ໄດ້ສະເໝີ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-checks`)."

msgid "This feature is modelled on flags in :ref:`gettext`."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕາມ flags ໃນ :ref:`gettext`."

msgid ""
"Additionally, XML-based formats that support flags extract them from the non-"
"standard attribute ``weblate-flags``. The ``max-length:N`` flag is also "
"supported through the ``maxwidth`` `attribute <https://docs.oasis-open.org/"
"xliff/v1.2/os/xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_ as defined in the XLIFF standard, "
"see :ref:`xliff-flags`."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ແບບ XML ທີ່ສະໜັບສະໜູນ flags ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນພວກມັນມາຈາກ attribute "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ ``weblate-flags``. flag ``max-length:N`` ກໍໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຜ່ານ "
"attribute ``maxwidth`` `attribute <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_ ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນມາດຕະຖານ XLIFF, ເບິ່ງທີ່ :ref:`xliff-"
"flags`."

msgid "`PO files documentation`_"
msgstr "`ເອກະສານໄຟລ໌ PO`_"

msgid "Context"
msgstr "ບໍລິບົດ"

msgid ""
"Context is used to differentiate identical strings in a bilingual format "
"used in different scopes (for example `Sun` can be used as an abbreviated "
"name of the day \"Sunday\" or as the name of our closest star)."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິບົດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເໝືອນກັນໃນຮູບແບບ bilingual ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ `Sun` "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນຊື່ຫຍໍ້ຂອງວັນ \"Sunday\" ຫຼື ເປັນຊື່ຂອງດາວທີ່ໃກ້ພວກເຮົາທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"For monolingual formats the string identifier (often called key) can serve "
"the same purpose and additional context is not necessary."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ monolingual, ຕົວລະບຸຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ມັກເອີ້ນວ່າຄີ) ສາມາດຮັບໃຊ້ຈຸດປະສົງດຽວກັນ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີບໍລິບົດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "Pluralized strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມພະຫຸພົດ"

msgid ""
"Plurals are necessary to properly localize strings with variable count. The "
"rules depend on a target language and many formats follow CLDR specification "
"for that."
msgstr ""
"ພະຫຸພົດມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຜັນແປໄດ້ຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ. ກົດລະບຽບຂຶ້ນກັບພາສາເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ "
"ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບປະຕິບັດຕາມມາດຕະຖານ CLDR ສຳລັບສິ່ງນັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"Plural support in the supported features table means Weblate can represent "
"plural strings for the format. Some formats need existing plural metadata or "
"a specific variant, and cannot create new plural strings unless that is "
"natively supported by the format."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບພະຫຸພົດໃນຕາຕະລາງຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ Weblate "
"ສາມາດສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມພະຫຸພົດສຳລັບຮູບແບບນັ້ນໄດ້. ບາງຮູບແບບຕ້ອງການ metadata ພະຫຸພົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຫຼື "
"ຮຸ່ນສະເພາະ, ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມພະຫຸພົດໃໝ່ໄດ້ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຮູບແບບນັ້ນຈະຮອງຮັບໂດຍກົງ."

msgid ""
"Pluralizing strings need proper support from the application framework as "
"well. Choose native format of your platform such "
"as :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`aresource` or :ref:`stringsdict`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມພະຫຸພົດຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບທີ່ເໝາະສົມຈາກແຟຣມເວີກຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຊັ່ນກັນ. ເລືອກຮູບແບບ native "
"ຂອງແພລັດຟອມຂອງເຈົ້າ ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`gettext`, :ref:`aresource` ຫຼື :ref:`stringsdict`."

msgid "Read-only strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ"

msgid ""
"Read-only strings from translation files will be included, but can not be "
"edited in Weblate. This feature is natively supported by few formats "
"(:ref:`xliff` and :ref:`aresource`), but can be emulated in others by adding "
"a ``read-only`` flag, see :ref:`custom-checks`."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມ read-only ຈາກໄຟລ໌ການແປຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໃນ Weblate ໄດ້. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຖືກຮອງຮັບແບບ native ໂດຍບາງຮູບແບບ (:ref:`xliff` ແລະ :ref:`aresource`), "
"ແຕ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄືກັນໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບອື່ນໂດຍການເພີ່ມ flag ``read-only``, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-"
"checks`."

msgid "Removing obsolete strings"
msgstr "ການລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ"

msgid ""
"Some file formats can store obsolete strings. Weblate can remove these "
"obsolete strings from formats that support this operation."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບາງປະເພດສາມາດເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ (obsolete strings) ໄດ້. Weblate "
"ສາມາດລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກຈາກຮູບແບບທີ່ຮອງຮັບການດຳເນີນການນີ້."

msgid "Supporting other formats"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບອື່ນໆ"

msgid ""
"Most formats supported by `translate-toolkit`_ which support serializing can "
"be easily supported, but they did not (yet) receive any testing. In most "
"cases, an additional thin layer is needed in Weblate to hide differences in "
"behavior of different storages."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ `translate-toolkit`_ ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບການ serializing "
"ສາມາດຖືກຮອງຮັບໄດ້ງ່າຍ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບໃດໆ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຕ້ອງການ layer "
"ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ Weblate ເພື່ອປິດບັງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໃນພຶດຕິກຳຂອງການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ."

msgid ""
"To add support for a new format, the preferred approach is to first "
"implement support for it in the `translate-toolkit`_."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບໃໝ່, ວິທີການທີ່ມັກໃຊ້ແມ່ນການຈັດຕັ້ງປະຕິບັດການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບມັນໃນ `translate-"
"toolkit`_ ກ່ອນ."

msgid ""
"File format parameters provide a way to configure settings related to the "
"file format. They are configured at component level and allow you to "
"customize how file parsing and serialization are handled."
msgstr ""
"Parameters ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌. ພວກມັນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະດັບອົງປະກອບ "
"ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປັບແຕ່ງວິທີການ parse ແລະ serialization ຂອງໄຟລ໌."

msgid "List of file format parameters"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ parameter ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌"

msgid "Android string resources"
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ Android"

msgid "Android specific file format for translating applications."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສະເພາະຂອງ Android ສຳລັບການແປແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ."

msgid ""
"A very similar formats are :doc:`/formats/compose-multiplatform-resources` "
"and :doc:`/formats/moko-resources`."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຫຼາຍຄື :doc:`/formats/compose-multiplatform-resources` ແລະ :doc:`/"
"formats/moko-resources`."

msgid ""
"Android string resources are monolingual, the :ref:`component-template` is "
"stored in a different location from the other files -- :file:`res/values/"
"strings.xml`."
msgstr ""
"Android string resources ເປັນ monolingual, :ref:`component-template` "
"ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຕ່າງຈາກໄຟລ໌ອື່ນ -- :file:`res/values/strings.xml`."

msgid "Weblate does following escaping of strings:"
msgstr "Weblate ເຮັດການ escape ຂໍ້ຄວາມດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "If a strings is valid XML, it is inserted as XML to translation."
msgstr "ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນ XML ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃສ່ເປັນ XML ໃນການແປ."

msgid ""
"``?`` and ``@`` are escaped with a ``\\\\`` at the beginning of the string "
"to avoid interpreting them as style or resource references."
msgstr ""
"``?`` ແລະ ``@`` ຖືກ escape ດ້ວຍ ``\\\\`` ທີ່ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແປຄວາມໝາຍພວກມັນເປັນ style ຫຼື resource references."

msgid ""
"In case string contains multiple spaces, it is quoted with double quotes "
"(``\"``)."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມມີຊ່ອງຫວ່າງຫຼາຍອັນ, ມັນຈະຖືກໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງຢືມ (``\"``)."

msgid ""
"Newlines are escaped as ``\\\\n``, but the actual newline is kept for "
"readability as well."
msgstr ""
"Newlines ຖືກ escape ເປັນ ``\\\\n``, ແຕ່ newline "
"ຕົວຈິງກໍຍັງຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມສາມາດໃນການອ່ານເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid ""
"Android `string-array` structures are not currently supported. To work "
"around this, you can break your string arrays apart:"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງສ້າງ Android `string-array` ປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ. ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແຍກ "
"string arrays ຂອງເຈົ້າອອກຈາກກັນ:"

msgid "become:"
msgstr "ກາຍເປັນ:"

msgid ""
"The `string-array` that points to the `string` elements should be stored in "
"a different file, and not be made available for translation."
msgstr ""
"`string-array` ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຍັງອົງປະກອບ `string` ຄວນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ອື່ນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນນຳມາໃຫ້ແປ."

msgid ""
"This script may help pre-process your existing strings.xml files and "
"translations: https://gist.github.com/paour/11291062"
msgstr ""
"Script ນີ້ອາດຊ່ວຍໃນການ pre-process ໄຟລ໌ strings.xml ແລະ ການແປທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງເຈົ້າ: https://"
"gist.github.com/paour/11291062"

msgid ""
"To avoid translating some strings, these can be marked as non-translatable. "
"This can be especially useful for string references:"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແປບາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດຖືກໝາຍວ່າບໍ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້. "
"ນີ້ສາມາດເປັນປະໂຫຍດໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງຂໍ້ຄວາມ (string references):"

msgid ""
"`Android string resources documentation <https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"topics/resources/string-resource>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ເອກະສານ Android string resources <https://developer.android.com/guide/"
"topics/resources/string-resource>`_"

msgid "Weblate configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Weblate"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component`"
msgstr "Typical Weblate :ref:`component`"

msgid "`Empty`"
msgstr "`Empty`"

msgid "`Android String Resource`"
msgstr "`Android String Resource`"

msgid "Apple iOS strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມ Apple iOS"

msgid ""
"File format typically used for translating Apple :index:`iOS <pair: iOS; "
"translation>` applications, but also standardized by PWG 5100.13 and used on "
"NeXTSTEP/OpenSTEP."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບການແປແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Apple :index:`iOS <pair: iOS; "
"translation>`, ແຕ່ຍັງຖືກມາດຕະຖານໂດຍ PWG 5100.13 ແລະ ໃຊ້ໃນ NeXTSTEP/OpenSTEP."

msgid "Apple iOS strings are usually used as monolingual."
msgstr "Apple iOS strings ມັກຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ monolingual."

msgid ""
"`Apple \"strings files\" documentation <https://developer.apple.com/library/"
"archive/documentation/MacOSX/Conceptual/BPInternational/"
"MaintaingYourOwnStringsFiles/MaintaingYourOwnStringsFiles.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ເອກະສານ Apple \"strings files\" <https://developer.apple.com/library/"
"archive/documentation/MacOSX/Conceptual/BPInternational/"
"MaintaingYourOwnStringsFiles/MaintaingYourOwnStringsFiles.html>`_"

msgid ""
"`Message Catalog File Format in PWG 5100.13 <https://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/"
"candidates/cs-ippjobprinterext3v10-20120727-5100.13.pdf#page=66>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Message Catalog File Format ໃນ PWG 5100.13 <https://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/"
"candidates/cs-ippjobprinterext3v10-20120727-5100.13.pdf#page=66>`_"

msgid ""
"``Resources/en.lproj/Localizable.strings`` or ``Resources/Base.lproj/"
"Localizable.strings``"
msgstr ""
"``Resources/en.lproj/Localizable.strings`` ຫຼື ``Resources/Base.lproj/"
"Localizable.strings``"

msgid "`iOS Strings`"
msgstr "`iOS Strings`"

msgid "File encoding"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນຂອງໄຟລ໌ (Encoding)"

msgid "`UTF-8`"
msgstr "`UTF-8`"

msgid "App store metadata files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງ App store"

msgid ""
"Metadata used for publishing apps in various app stores can be translated. "
"Currently the following tools are compatible:"
msgstr ""
"Metadata ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຜີຍແຜ່ແອັບໃນ app stores ຕ່າງໆສາມາດຖືກແປໄດ້. "
"ປະຈຸບັນເຄື່ອງມືຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດຮອງຮັບໄດ້:"

msgid ""
"`Triple-T gradle-play-publisher <https://github.com/Triple-T/gradle-play-"
"publisher>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Triple-T gradle-play-publisher <https://github.com/Triple-T/gradle-play-"
"publisher>`_"

msgid ""
"`Fastlane <https://docs.fastlane.tools/getting-started/android/setup/#fetch-"
"your-app-metadata>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Fastlane <https://docs.fastlane.tools/getting-started/android/setup/#fetch-"
"your-app-metadata>`_"

msgid ""
"`F-Droid <https://f-droid.org/docs/"
"All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`F-Droid <https://f-droid.org/docs/"
"All_About_Descriptions_Graphics_and_Screenshots/>`_"

msgid ""
"The metadata consists of several textfiles, which Weblate will present as "
"separate strings to translate."
msgstr ""
"Metadata ປະກອບດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼາຍອັນ, ເຊິ່ງ Weblate ຈະສະແດງເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໃຫ້ແປ."

msgid ""
"In case you don't want to translate certain strings (for example "
"changelogs), you can hide them using :ref:`component-key_filter` or mark "
"them read-only (see :ref:`custom-checks`). This can be automated by "
"the :ref:`addon-weblate.flags.bulk`."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງຢ່າງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ changelogs), "
"ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊ່ອນພວກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`component-key_filter` ຫຼື ໝາຍພວກມັນເປັນ read-only "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-checks`). ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.flags.bulk`."

msgid "`App store metadata files`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ metadata ຂອງ App store`"

msgid "ARB File"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ ARB"

msgid ""
"ARB translations are monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a base "
"file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປ ARB ເປັນ monolingual, ດັ່ງນັ້ນແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນ)."

msgid "`Application Resource Bundle Specification`_"
