msgid "Handling duplicate strings"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ"

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate treats each occurrence of a string as a separate "
"translation unit to provide line-based context. This can be problematic in "
"AsciiDoc tables, where reordering rows changes the context and can lead to "
"translation loss."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Weblate ປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະການປະກົດຕົວຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນໜ່ວຍການແປແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເປັນບັນຫາໃນຕາຕະລາງ AsciiDoc, "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ການຈັດລຽງແຖວໃໝ່ຈະປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ ແລະ ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍການແປ."

msgid ""
"To consolidate identical strings into a single translation unit, "
"enable :guilabel:`Deduplicate identical strings` in the :ref:`component-"
"file_format_params`."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອລວມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເໝືອນກັນເຂົ້າໃນໜ່ວຍການແປດຽວ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Deduplicate identical "
"strings` ໃນ :ref:`component-file_format_params`."

msgid ""
"Enabling this option disables line-based context for the merged units, "
"ensuring that translations remain stable even if rows or sections are moved "
"within the document."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວສຳລັບໜ່ວຍງານທີ່ລວມເຂົ້າກັນ, "
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າການແປຍັງຄົງສະຖຽນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າແຖວ ຫຼື ພາກສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຍ້າຍພາຍໃນເອກະສານ."

msgid "Catkeys file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Catkeys"

msgid "File format used for Haiku operating system translations."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແປລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ Haiku."

msgid "`Catkeys file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Catkeys`"

msgid "Compose Multiplatform resources"
msgstr "Compose Multiplatform resources"

msgid "A variant of :doc:`/formats/android`. It differs in escaping."
msgstr "ຕົວແປຂອງ :doc:`/formats/android`. ມັນແຕກຕ່າງໃນການ escape."

msgid ""
"`Kotlin Compose Multiplatform Resources <https://kotlinlang.org/docs/"
"multiplatform/compose-multiplatform-resources.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Kotlin Compose Multiplatform Resources <https://kotlinlang.org/docs/"
"multiplatform/compose-multiplatform-resources.html>`_"

msgid "`Compose Multiplatform Resource`"
msgstr "`Compose Multiplatform Resource`"

msgid "CSV files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ CSV"

msgid ""
"CSV files can contain a simple list of source and translation. Weblate "
"supports the following files:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ CSV ສາມາດບັນຈຸລາຍຊື່ທຳມະດາຂອງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ການແປ. Weblate ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

msgid ""
"Files with header defining fields (``location``, ``source``, ``target``, "
"``ID``, ``fuzzy``, ``context``, ``translator_comments``, "
"``developer_comments``). This is the recommended approach, as it is the "
"least error prone. Choose :guilabel:`CSV file` as a file format."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ header ກຳນົດ fields (``location``, ``source``, ``target``, ``ID``, "
"``fuzzy``, ``context``, ``translator_comments``, ``developer_comments``). "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳ, ເພາະມັນມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ. ເລືອກ :guilabel:`CSV file` ເປັນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Files with two fields—source and translation (in this order). "
"Choose :guilabel:`Simple CSV file` as a file format."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີສອງ fields—ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ການແປ (ຕາມລຳດັບນີ້). ເລືອກ :guilabel:`Simple CSV "
"file` ເປັນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Headerless files with fields in order defined by the `translate-toolkit`_: "
"``location``, ``source``, ``target``, ``ID``, ``fuzzy``, ``context``, "
"``translator_comments``, ``developer_comments``. Choose :guilabel:`CSV file` "
"as a file format."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີ header ທີ່ມີ fields ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ `translate-toolkit`_: ``location``, "
"``source``, ``target``, ``ID``, ``fuzzy``, ``context``, "
"``translator_comments``, ``developer_comments``. ເລືອກ :guilabel:`CSV file` "
"ເປັນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

msgid ""
"Remember to define :ref:`component-template` when your files are monolingual "
"(see :ref:`bimono`)."
msgstr ""
"ຢ່າລືມກຳນົດ :ref:`component-template` ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າເປັນ monolingual "
"(ເບິ່ງ :ref:`bimono`)."

msgid ""
"By default, the CSV format does autodetection of file encoding. This can be "
"unreliable in some corner cases and causes performance penalty. Please "
"choose a file format encoding to avoid this (for example :guilabel:`UTF-8`)."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຮູບແບບ CSV ຈະກວດສອບ file encoding ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດບໍ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. ກະລຸນາເລືອກ file format encoding "
"ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງນີ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ :guilabel:`UTF-8`)."

msgid ""
"The CSV format currently automatically detects the dialect of the CSV file. "
"In some cases the automatic detection might fail and you will get mixed "
"results. This is especially true for CSV files with newlines in the values. "
"As a workaround it is recommended to omit quoting characters."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ CSV ປະຈຸບັນກວດສອບ dialect ຂອງໄຟລ໌ CSV ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ໃນບາງກໍລະນີການກວດສອບອັດຕະໂນມັດອາດລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ເຈົ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນທີ່ປະສົມກັນ. "
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຄວາມຈິງໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ມີ newlines ໃນ values. ເພື່ອເປັນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ quoting characters."

msgid "Multivalue CSV file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Multivalue CSV"

msgid ""
