msgid "Fluent format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Fluent"

msgid ""
"Fluent is a monolingual text format that focuses on asymmetric localization: "
"a simple string in one language can map to a complex multi-variant "
"translation in another language."
msgstr ""
"Fluent ເປັນຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມ monolingual ທີ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ການແປພາສາແບບບໍ່ສົມມາຕຣິກ (asymmetric "
"localization): ຂໍ້ຄວາມງ່າຍໆໃນພາສາໜຶ່ງສາມາດ map "
"ໄປຍັງການແປທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໃນອີກພາສາໜຶ່ງ."

msgid "`Project Fluent website <https://projectfluent.org/>`_"
msgstr "`ເວັບໄຊ Project Fluent <https://projectfluent.org/>`_"

msgid "`Fluent file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Fluent`"

msgid "Format.JS JSON file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Format.JS JSON"

msgid ""
"File format used when translating Format.JS and React-Intl applications."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອແປແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Format.JS ແລະ React-Intl."

msgid ""
"`Format.JS Message Extraction <https://formatjs.github.io/docs/getting-"
"started/message-extraction>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ການສະກັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ Format.JS <https://formatjs.github.io/docs/getting-started/"
"message-extraction>`_"

msgid "`Format.JS JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ JSON ຂອງ Format.JS`"

msgid "GNU gettext PO (Portable Object)"
msgstr "GNU gettext PO (Portable Object)"

msgid "Most widely used format for translating libre software."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການແປຊອບແວເສລີ."

msgid ""
"Contextual info stored in the file is supported by adjusting its headers or "
"linking to corresponding source files."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນບໍລິບົດທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ ແມ່ນຮອງຮັບໂດຍການປັບແຕ່ງສ່ວນຫົວ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

msgid "`Gettext on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gettext>`_"
msgstr "`Gettext ໃນ Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gettext>`_"

msgid "Showing source string change"
msgstr "ການສະແດງການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

msgid ""
"Weblate can extract previous source strings from the PO files if present and "
"show the string difference for strings needing editing based on that. To "
"include these, :program:`msgmerge` has to be executed with ``--previous`` "
"and the resulting PO file then contains lines such as:"
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສາມາດສະກັດຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ PO ໄດ້ ຖ້າມີ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍອີງໃສ່ສິ່ງນັ້ນ. ເພື່ອລວມສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້, "
"ຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດ :program:`msgmerge` ດ້ວຍ ``--previous`` ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ PO "
"ທີ່ໄດ້ຜົນລັດຈະບັນຈຸແຖວຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ:"

msgid ""
"This is controlled by the ``po_keep_previous`` :ref:`file_format_params` "
"parameter. It does not affect obsolete entries marked with ``#~``."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍພາຣາມິເຕີ ``po_keep_previous`` :ref:`file_format_params`. "
"ມັນບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ກັບລາຍການທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ (obsolete) ເຊິ່ງໝາຍດ້ວຍ ``#~``."

msgid "Obsolete strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝ"

msgid ""
":program:`msgmerge` keeps strings removed from the POT file as obsolete "
"``#~`` entries by default. Enable the "
"``po_remove_obsolete`` :ref:`file_format_params` parameter to remove "
"obsolete entries when Weblate saves PO files."
msgstr ""
":program:`msgmerge` ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ POT ໄວ້ເປັນລາຍການ ``#~`` "
"ທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ "
"``po_remove_obsolete`` :ref:`file_format_params` ເພື່ອລຶບລາຍການທີ່ລ້າສະໄໝອອກເມື່ອ "
"Weblate ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ PO."

msgid "PO file header"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຫົວໄຟລ໌ PO"

msgid ""
"The header of the PO file is automatically maintained by Weblate. It can be "
"configured to include the ``Language-Team``, ``Last-Translator``, ``X-"
"Generator`` and ``Report-Msgid-Bugs-To`` headers using "
"the :ref:`file_format_params`."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໄຟລ໌ PO ຈະຖືກເບິ່ງແຍງໂດຍ Weblate ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ມັນສາມາດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອລວມເອົາສ່ວນຫົວ ``Language-Team``, ``Last-Translator``, ``X-"
"Generator`` ແລະ ``Report-Msgid-Bugs-To`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`file_format_params`."

msgid ""
"The header comments also can be updated to contain author names "
"using :ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.authors`."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍໃນສ່ວນຫົວຍັງສາມາດຖືກອັບເດດໃຫ້ບັນຈຸຊື່ຜູ້ຂຽນໂດຍໃຊ້ :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.gettext.authors`."

msgid "Line wrapping"
msgstr "ການຕັດແຖວ"

msgid ""
"The line wrapping mostly matches GNU gettext behavior. Both the wrapping "
"algorithm in the GNU gettext and the Unicode data the wrapping is based on "
"evolve which might cause differences in some corner cases."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັດແຖວສ່ວນຫຼາຍຈະກົງກັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງ GNU gettext. ທັງສູດການຕັດແຖວໃນ GNU gettext ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ "
"Unicode ທີ່ການຕັດແຖວອີງໃສ່ ມີການພັດທະນາ ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໃນບາງກໍລະນີພິເສດ."

msgid ""
"The wrapping width can be configured using the ``po_line_wrap`` parameter, "
"see :ref:`file_format_params`."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງໃນການຕັດແຖວສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ ``po_line_wrap``, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`file_format_params`."

msgid "Generating matching MO files"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ MO ທີ່ກົງກັນ"

msgid ""
"In case MO files are kept in the repository together with PO "
"files, :ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.mo` can be used to keep them up-to-date "
"with PO files."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ MO ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ Repository ຮ່ວມກັບໄຟລ໌ PO, ສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.gettext.mo` ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນປັດຈຸບັນກັບໄຟລ໌ PO."

msgid "Updating PO files from the POT file"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ຈາກໄຟລ໌ POT"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.msgmerge` can be used to update PO files from "
"the POT file, see :ref:`updating-target-files`."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ :ref:`addon-weblate.gettext.msgmerge` ເພື່ອອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ຈາກໄຟລ໌ POT, "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`updating-target-files`."

msgid "Monolingual gettext"
msgstr "gettext ແບບພາສາດຽວ"

msgid ""
"Some projects decide to use gettext as monolingual formats—they code just "
"the IDs in their source code and the string then needs to be translated to "
"all languages, including English. This is supported, though you have to "
"choose this file format explicitly when importing components into Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ບາງໂຄງການຕັດສິນໃຈໃຊ້ gettext ເປັນຮູບແບບພາສາດຽວ—ພວກເຂົາຂຽນໂຄດພຽງແຕ່ ID ໄວ້ໃນ Source "
"Code ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງຖືກແປເປັນທຸກພາສາ, ລວມທັງພາສາອັງກິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ, "
"ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນເວລາທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ (import) Component ເຂົ້າສູ່ "
"Weblate."

msgid "The bilingual gettext PO file typically looks like this:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ PO ຂອງ gettext ແບບສອງພາສາ (bilingual) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "The monolingual gettext PO file typically looks like this:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ PO ຂອງ gettext ແບບພາສາດຽວ (monolingual) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:"

msgid "While the base language file will be:"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໄຟລ໌ພາສາພື້ນຖານຈະເປັນ:"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` for bilingual gettext"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ gettext ແບບສອງພາສາ"

msgid "`Gettext PO file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Gettext PO`"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` for monolingual gettext"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ gettext ແບບພາສາດຽວ"

msgid "`Gettext PO file (monolingual)`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Gettext PO (ແບບພາສາດຽວ)`"

msgid ""
":ref:`file_format_params` with the pattern `po_*` can be used to configure "
"the behavior of the gettext format."
msgstr ""
":ref:`file_format_params` ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບ `po_*` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຮູບແບບ gettext."

msgid "go-i18n JSON files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ go-i18n JSON"

msgid "Support for v2 variant of this format was added."
msgstr "ໄດ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບແບບ v2 ຂອງຮູບແບບນີ້."

msgid ""
"go-i18n translations are monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a base "
"file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປແບບ go-i18n ເປັນແບບພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"Weblate supports the go-i18n JSON v1 and v2 variants. Please choose correct "
"file format matching your environment."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບ go-i18n JSON v1 ແລະ v2. "
"ກະລຸນາເລືອກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "Example file v1:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ v1:"

msgid "Example file v2:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ v2:"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` for v1"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ v1"

msgid "`go-i18n v1 JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ JSON go-i18n v1`"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` for v2"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິສຳລັບ v2"

msgid "`go-i18n v2 JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ JSON go-i18n v2`"

msgid "gotext JSON files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ gotext JSON"

msgid ""
"gotext translations are monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a base "
"file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປແບບ gotext ເປັນແບບພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"`I18n in Go: Managing Translations <https://www.alexedwards.net/blog/i18n-"
"managing-translations>`_"
msgstr ""
"`I18n in Go: ການຈັດການການແປ <https://www.alexedwards.net/blog/i18n-managing-"
"translations>`_"

msgid "`gotext JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ gotext JSON`"

msgid "GWT properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ GWT"

msgid "Native GWT format for translations."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ GWT ຕົ້ນສະບັບສຳລັບການແປ."

msgid "GWT properties are usually used as monolingual translations."
msgstr "GWT properties ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນການແປແບບພາສາດຽວ."

msgid ""
"`GWT localization guide <https://www.gwtproject.org/doc/latest/"
"DevGuideI18n.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ຄູ່ມືການເຮັດ localization ຂອງ GWT <https://www.gwtproject.org/doc/latest/"
"DevGuideI18n.html>`_"

msgid ""
"`GWT Internationalization Tutorial <https://www.gwtproject.org/doc/latest/"
"tutorial/i18n.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ບົດຮຽນການເຮັດ Internationalization ຂອງ GWT <https://www.gwtproject.org/doc/"
"latest/tutorial/i18n.html>`_"

msgid "`GWT Properties`"
msgstr "`GWT Properties`"

msgid "HTML files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ HTML"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the HTML files and offered for "
"the translation."
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ HTML ແລະ ສະເໜີເພື່ອການແປ."

msgid "`HTML file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ HTML`"

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate treats each occurrence of a string as a separate "
"translation unit to provide line-based context. This can be problematic in "
"HTML files, where moving elements changes the context and can lead to "
"translation loss."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Weblate "
"ຈະປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ທຸກໆການພົບເຫັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນໜ່ວຍການແປແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເປັນບັນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ HTML, ເຊິ່ງການຍ້າຍອົງປະກອບຈະປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ ແລະ ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍການແປ."

msgid ""
"Enabling this option disables line-based context for the merged units, "
"ensuring that translations remain stable even if elements are moved within "
"the document."
msgstr ""
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວສຳລັບໜ່ວຍທີ່ລວມເຂົ້າກັນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້ວ່າການແປຍັງຄົງສະຖຽນເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກຍ້າຍພາຍໃນເອກະສານກໍຕາມ."

msgid "i18next JSON files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ i18next JSON"

msgid "Support for v4 variant of this format was added."
msgstr "ໄດ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບສຳລັບຮູບແບບ v4 ຂອງຮູບແບບນີ້."

msgid ""
"In case you use plurals, it is recommended to use v4 as that aligned plural "
"handling with CLDR. Older versions have different plural rules for some "
"languages which are not correct."
msgstr ""
"ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ພົດພົດ (plurals), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ v4 ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນປັບການຈັດການພົດພົດໃຫ້ກົງກັບ CLDR. "
"ເວີຊັນທີ່ເກົ່າກວ່ານັ້ນມີກົດການໃຊ້ພົດພົດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບບາງພາສາ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid ""
"i18next is an internationalization framework written in and for JavaScript. "
"Weblate supports its localization files with features such as plurals."
msgstr ""
"i18next ເປັນເຟຣມເວີກການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນສາກົນ (internationalization) ທີ່ຂຽນໃນ ແລະ ສຳລັບ "
"JavaScript. Weblate ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (localization) "
"ຂອງມັນດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ພົດພົດ."

msgid ""
"i18next translations are monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a base "
"file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປແບບ i18next ເປັນແບບພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "i18next JSON file v4"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ i18next JSON v4"

msgid ""
"Choose this format if unsure. It stores plurals using standard CLDR suffixes."
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບແບບນີ້ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ. ມັນເກັບພົດພົດໂດຍໃຊ້ປັດໄຈຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (suffixes) ມາດຕະຖານ CLDR."

msgid "i18next JSON file v3"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ i18next JSON v3"

msgid "Use for legacy projects which are using numeric suffixes for plurals."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂຄງການເກົ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ປັດໄຈຕໍ່ທ້າຍເປັນຕົວເລກສຳລັບພົດພົດ."

msgid ""
"The v2 and v1 variants are mostly compatible with v3, with exception of how "
"plurals are handled."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ v2 ແລະ v1 ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ v3, ຍົກເວັ້ນວິທີການຈັດການພົດພົດ."

msgid "https://www.i18next.com/"
msgstr "https://www.i18next.com/"

msgid "`i18next JSON Format <https://www.i18next.com/misc/json-format>`_"
msgstr "`ຮູບແບບ i18next JSON <https://www.i18next.com/misc/json-format>`_"

msgid "`i18next JSON file v3`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ i18next JSON v3`"

msgid "IDML Format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ IDML"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the Adobe InDesign Markup "
"Language files and offered for the translation."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ Adobe InDesign Markup Language ແລະ "
"ສະເໜີເພື່ອການແປ."

msgid "`IDML file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ IDML`"

msgid "INI translations"
msgstr "ການແປ INI"

msgid ""
"INI file format for translations. Weblate currently supports several "
"variants of JSON translations:"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ INI ສຳລັບການແປ. ປັດຈຸບັນ Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆຂອງການແປແບບ JSON:"

msgid "Monolingual INI files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ INI ແບບພາສາດຽວ"

msgid "INI translations are usually used as monolingual translations."
msgstr "ການແປແບບ INI ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນການແປແບບພາສາດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Weblate only extracts keys from sections within an INI file. In case your "
"INI file lacks sections, you might want to use :ref:`joomla` "
"or :ref:`javaprop` instead."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສະກັດພຽງແຕ່ Keys ຈາກ Section ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ INI ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ INI "
"ຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ມີ Section, ທ່ານອາດຈະຢາກໃຊ້ :ref:`joomla` ຫຼື :ref:`javaprop` ແທນ."

msgid "`INI File`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ INI`"

msgid "Inno Setup INI translations"
msgstr "ການແປ Inno Setup INI"

msgid "Inno Setup INI file format for translations."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ Inno Setup INI ສຳລັບການແປ."

msgid ""
"Inno Setup INI translations are usually used as monolingual translations."
msgstr "ການແປແບບ Inno Setup INI ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນການແປແບບພາສາດຽວ."

msgid ""
"The only notable difference to :ref:`ini` is in supporting ``%n`` and ``%t`` "
"placeholders for line break and tab."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງດຽວທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຈາກ :ref:`ini` ແມ່ນການຮອງຮັບ Placeholder ``%n`` ແລະ "
"``%t`` ສຳລັບການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ ແລະ ແຖບ (tab)."

msgid ""
"Only Unicode files (``.islu``) are currently supported, ANSI variant "
"(``.isl``) is currently not supported."
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ Unicode (``.islu``) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຮູບແບບ ANSI (``.isl``) "
"ປັດຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "`Inno Setup INI File`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Inno Setup INI`"

msgid "Java properties"
msgstr "Java properties"

msgid "Native Java format for translations."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Java ຕົ້ນສະບັບສຳລັບການແປ."

msgid "Java properties are usually used as monolingual translations."
msgstr "Java properties ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນການແປແບບພາສາດຽວ."

msgid ""
"Weblate supports ISO-8859-1, UTF-8 and UTF-16 variants of this format. All "
"of them support storing all Unicode characters, it is just differently "
"encoded. In the ISO-8859-1, the Unicode escape sequences are used (for "
"example ``zkou\\u0161ka``), all others encode characters directly either in "
"UTF-8 or UTF-16."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບ ISO-8859-1, UTF-8 ແລະ UTF-16 ຂອງຮູບແບບນີ້. "
"ທັງໝົດນີ້ຮອງຮັບການເກັບຕົວອັກສອນ Unicode ທັງໝົດ, ພຽງແຕ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕ່າງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໃນ ISO-8859-1, "
"ຈະໃຊ້ Unicode escape sequences (ຕົວຢ່າງ ``zkou\\u0161ka``), "
"ສ່ວນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕົວອັກສອນໂດຍກົງບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນ UTF-8 ຫຼື UTF-16."

msgid ""
"Loading escape sequences works in UTF-8 mode as well, so please be careful "
"choosing the correct encoding set to match your application needs."
msgstr ""
"ການໂຫຼດ escape sequences ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ UTF-8 ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ສະນັ້ນ "
"ກະລຸນາລະມັດລະວັງໃນການເລືອກຊຸດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid ""
"`Java properties on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.properties>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Java properties ໃນ Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.properties>`_"

msgid "`Java Properties`"
msgstr "`Java Properties`"

msgid "`ISO-8859-1`"
msgstr "`ISO-8859-1`"

msgid "Joomla translations"
msgstr "ການແປ Joomla"

msgid "Native Joomla format for translations."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Joomla ຕົ້ນສະບັບສຳລັບການແປ."

msgid "Joomla translations are usually used as monolingual translations."
msgstr "ການແປແບບ Joomla ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນການແປແບບພາສາດຽວ."

msgid "`Joomla Language File`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ພາສາ Joomla`"

msgid "JSON files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ JSON"

msgid ""
"The structure of JSON file is properly preserved even for complex situations "
"which were broken in prior releases."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງໄຟລ໌ JSON ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນສະຖານະການທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນທີ່ເຄີຍມີບັນຫາໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ກໍຕາມ."

msgid ""
"JSON format is used mostly for translating applications implemented in "
"JavaScript."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ JSON ຖືກໃຊ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການແປແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ JavaScript."

msgid "Weblate currently supports several variants of JSON translations:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນ Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆຂອງການແປແບບ JSON:"

msgid ""
"Simple key / value files, used for example by `vue-i18n` or `react-intl`."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Key / Value ງ່າຍໆ, ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ `vue-i18n` ຫຼື `react-intl`."

msgid "Files with nested keys."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ Nested Keys (Key ຊ້ອນກັນ)."

msgid ""
"JSON translations are usually monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a "
"base file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປແບບ JSON ມັກຈະເປັນແບບພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`JSON file` and :guilabel:`JSON nested structure file` can "
"both handle same type of files. Both preserve existing JSON structure when "
"translating."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`JSON file` ແລະ :guilabel:`JSON nested structure file` "
"ສາມາດຈັດການໄຟລ໌ປະເພດດຽວກັນໄດ້. ທັງສອງຮັກສາໂຄງສ້າງ JSON ທີ່ມີຢູ່ເດີມໃນເວລາແປ."

msgid ""
"The only difference between them is when adding new strings using Weblate. "
"The nested structure format parses the newly added key and inserts the new "
"string into the matching structure. For example ``app.name`` key is inserted "
"as:"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງດຽວລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນແມ່ນເມື່ອເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ Weblate. ຮູບແບບโครงสร้าง Nested "
"ຈະແຍກວິເຄາະ Key ທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ ແລະ ແຊກຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປໃນໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ກົງກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ Key "
"``app.name`` ຈະຖືກແຊກເປັນ:"

msgid ""
"Nested files are supported as well (see above for requirements), such a file "
"can look like:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງ Nested ກໍຮອງຮັບເຊັ່ນກັນ (ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂ້າງເທິງ), ໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວອາດມີລັກສະນະຄື:"

msgid "`JSON nested structure file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ JSON nested structure`"

msgid ""
":ref:`file_format_params` with the pattern `json_*` can be used to configure "
"the behavior of the JSON format."
msgstr ""
":ref:`file_format_params` ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບ `json_*` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຮູບແບບ JSON."

msgid "Laravel PHP strings"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມ Laravel PHP"

msgid "The Laravel PHP localization files are supported as well with plurals:"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ Laravel PHP ກໍຮອງຮັບເຊັ່ນກັນ ພ້ອມດ້ວຍພົດພົດ:"

msgid ""
"The translation keys no longer include PHP structure and only contain the "
"actual key."
msgstr "Key ການແປບໍ່ລວມເອົາໂຄງສ້າງ PHP ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ມີພຽງແຕ່ Key ຕົວຈິງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "`Localization in Laravel`_"
msgstr "`ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນໃນ Laravel`_"

msgid "`Laravel PHP strings`"
msgstr "`ຂໍ້ຄວາມ Laravel PHP`"

msgid "Markdown files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Markdown"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the Markdown files and offered "
"for the translation. For Markdown files with JSX syntax, use :ref:`mdx`."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ Markdown ແລະ ສະເໜີເພື່ອການແປ. ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Markdown "
"ທີ່ມີໄວຍາກອນ JSX, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`mdx`."

msgid ""
"Markdown units automatically get the ``md-text``, ``auto-safe-html`` and "
"``strict-same`` flags. This keeps the unsafe HTML check active for plain "
"text, standard HTML, and custom elements while avoiding HTML cleanup on non-"
"HTML angle-bracket syntax such as MDX or JSX-like components. Use the "
"explicit ``safe-html`` flag for strings that are known to contain HTML and "
"should always be sanitized, including SVG or MathML snippets."
msgstr ""
"ໜ່ວຍ Markdown ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ Flag ``md-text``, ``auto-safe-html`` ແລະ ``strict-same`` "
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການກວດສອບ HTML ທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ສະເໝີສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ, HTML "
"ມາດຕະຖານ, ແລະອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການທຳຄວາມສະອາດ HTML ໃນໄວຍາກອນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ "
"HTML ເຊັ່ນ MDX ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບແບບ JSX. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Flag ``safe-html`` "
"ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າບັນຈຸ HTML ແລະ ຄວນຖືກອະນາໄມ (sanitized) ສະເໝີ, ລວມທັງ SVG ຫຼື "
"ຊິ້ນສ່ວນ MathML."

msgid "`Markdown file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Markdown`"

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate treats each occurrence of a string as a separate "
"translation unit to provide line-based context. This can be problematic in "
"Markdown tables, where reordering rows changes the context and can lead to "
"translation loss."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Weblate "
"ຈະປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ທຸກໆການພົບເຫັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນໜ່ວຍການແປແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເປັນບັນຫາໃນຕາຕະລາງ Markdown, ເຊິ່ງການຈັດລຳດັບແຖວໃໝ່ຈະປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍການແປ."

msgid "Translating front matter values"
msgstr "ການແປຄ່າ Front matter"

msgid ""
"By default, YAML front matter is extracted as a single translatable block. "
"Enable :guilabel:`Translate front matter values` in :ref:`component-"
"file_format_params` to parse YAML front matter and translate only scalar "
"string values while preserving keys, structure, comments, and formatting "
"when possible. The same setting is available for :ref:`mdx` files."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, YAML front matter ຈະຖືກສະກັດເປັນບລັອກດຽວທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້. "
"ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Translate front matter values` ໃນ :ref:`component-"
"file_format_params` ເພື່ອແຍກວິເຄາະ YAML front matter ແລະ ແປສະເພາະຄ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມ Scalar "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາ Key, ໂຄງສ້າງ, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ, ແລະຮູບແບບເມື່ອເປັນໄປໄດ້. "
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນນີ້ຍັງມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ :ref:`mdx`."

msgid "MDX files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ MDX"

msgid ""
"MDX files are Markdown files with JSX syntax. Weblate extracts translatable "
"Markdown text and preserves imports, exports, JSX components, and "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ MDX ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ Markdown ທີ່ມີໄວຍາກອນ JSX. Weblate ສະກັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ Markdown ທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ "
"ແລະ ຮັກສາ Imports, Exports, ອົງປະກອບ JSX, ແລະ Expression."

msgid ""
"MDX units automatically get the ``md-text``, ``auto-safe-html``, ``strict-"
"same`` and ``safe-mdx`` flags. This keeps the unsafe HTML check active for "
"plain text, standard HTML, and custom elements while avoiding HTML cleanup "
"on MDX and JSX-like syntax. Use the explicit ``safe-html`` flag for strings "
"that are known to contain HTML and should always be sanitized, including SVG "
"or MathML snippets."
msgstr ""
"ໜ່ວຍ MDX ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ Flag ``md-text``, ``auto-safe-html``, ``strict-same`` ແລະ "
"``safe-mdx`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ການກວດສອບ HTML "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ສະເໝີສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ, HTML ມາດຕະຖານ, ແລະອົງປະກອບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການທຳຄວາມສະອາດ HTML ໃນໄວຍາກອນ MDX ແລະ JSX. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Flag ``safe-"
"html`` ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າບັນຈຸ HTML ແລະ ຄວນຖືກອະນາໄມສະເໝີ, ລວມທັງ SVG ຫຼື ຊິ້ນສ່ວນ "
"MathML."

msgid "`MDX file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ MDX`"

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate treats each occurrence of a string as a separate "
"translation unit to provide line-based context. This can be problematic in "
"MDX tables or repeated component content, where reordering changes the "
"context and can lead to translation loss."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Weblate "
"ຈະປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ທຸກໆການພົບເຫັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເປັນໜ່ວຍການແປແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເປັນບັນຫາໃນຕາຕະລາງ MDX ຫຼື ເນື້ອຫາອົງປະກອບທີ່ມີການຊ້ຳກັນ, ເຊິ່ງການຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່ຈະປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ "
"ແລະ ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍການແປ."

msgid "draggable/i18n lang files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ພາສາ draggable/i18n"

msgid "The library was former published as mi18n."
msgstr "ໄລບຣາຣີນີ້ເຄີຍຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນຊື່ mi18n."

msgid ""
"File format used for JavaScript localization by `draggable/i18n`_. "
"Syntactically it matches :ref:`javaprop`."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງ JavaScript ໂດຍ `draggable/i18n`_. "
"ທາງໄວຍາກອນມັນກົງກັບ :ref:`javaprop`."

msgid "`draggable/i18n`_"
msgstr "`draggable/i18n`_"

msgid "`draggabble/i18n lang file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ພາສາ draggabble/i18n`"

msgid "Mobile Kotlin resources"
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນ Kotlin ສຳລັບມືຖື"

msgid ""
"A variant of :doc:`/formats/android`. It differs in plural tag (``plural`` "
"is used instead of ``plurals``) and escaping."
msgstr ""
"ຮຸ່ນແຕກແຍກຂອງ :doc:`/formats/android`. ມັນແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແທັກພະຫຸພົດ (ໃຊ້ ``plural`` ແທນ "
"``plurals``) ແລະ ການເຮັດ escaping."

msgid ""
"`Mobile Kotlin resources <https://github.com/icerockdev/moko-resources>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mobile Kotlin resources <https://github.com/icerockdev/moko-resources>`_"

msgid "`Mobile Kotlin Resource`"
msgstr "`Mobile Kotlin Resource`"

msgid "Nextcloud Apps JSON files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ JSON ຂອງ Nextcloud Apps"

msgid "JSON-based format used in Nextcloud Apps that use JavaScript and HTML."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ JSON ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນ Nextcloud Apps ທີ່ໃຊ້ JavaScript ແລະ HTML."

msgid "`Nextcloud JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Nextcloud JSON`"

msgid "OpenDocument Format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ OpenDocument"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the OpenDocument files and "
"offered for the translation."
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ OpenDocument ແລະ ສະເໜີເພື່ອການແປ."

msgid "`OpenDocument file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ OpenDocument`"

msgid "PHP strings"
msgstr "PHP strings"

msgid ""
"PHP translations are usually monolingual, so it is recommended to specify a "
"base file with (what is most often the) English strings."
msgstr ""
"ການແປແບບ PHP ມັກຈະເປັນແບບພາສາດຽວ, ສະນັ້ນ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາອັງກິດ "
"(ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເປັນແບບນັ້ນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ)."

msgid "Weblate currently supports several variants of PHP translations:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນ Weblate ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆຂອງການແປແບບ PHP:"

msgid "Monolingual PHP strings in various syntax"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມ PHP ແບບພາສາດຽວໃນໄວຍາກອນທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ"

msgid "`PHP strings`"
msgstr "`ຂໍ້ຄວາມ PHP`"

msgid "Qt Linguist .ts"
msgstr "Qt Linguist .ts"

msgid "Translation format used in Qt based applications."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການແປທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ອີງໃສ່ Qt."

msgid ""
"Qt Linguist files are used as both bilingual and monolingual translations. "
"Weblate supports both the current version 2 format and the legacy version 1 "
"format. Select the file format matching the version produced by your "
"application."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Qt Linguist ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນທັງການແປແບບສອງພາສາ (bilingual) ແລະ ພາສາດຽວ "
"(monolingual). Weblate ຮອງຮັບທັງຮູບແບບເວີຊັນ 2 ໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ເວີຊັນ 1 ແບບເກົ່າ. "
"ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນທີ່ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຂອງທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "`Qt Linguist manual <https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtlinguist-index.html>`_"
msgstr "`ຄູ່ມື Qt Linguist <https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtlinguist-index.html>`_"

msgid "Version 2"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ 2"

msgid ""
"This is the default format for ``.ts`` files and supports the full set of Qt "
"Linguist features available in Weblate."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ ``.ts`` ແລະ ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດທັງໝົດຂອງ Qt Linguist ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ "
"Weblate."

msgid "Version 1"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນ 1"

msgid ""
"The legacy format supports messages, contexts and the unfinished state. It "
"does not support plurals, locations, descriptions or Weblate flags."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບເກົ່າຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ບໍລິບົດ (contexts) ແລະ ສະຖານະທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບພະຫຸພົດ "
"(plurals), ຕຳແໜ່ງ (locations), ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ຫຼື ແຟລັກຂອງ Weblate."

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` when using as bilingual"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິເມື່ອໃຊ້ແບບສອງພາສາ"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Qt Linguist translation file (version 2)`"
msgid "`Qt Linguist translation file (version 2)`"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ການແປ Qt Linguist (ເວີຊັນ 2)`"

msgid "Typical Weblate :ref:`component` when using as monolingual"
msgstr ":ref:`component` ຂອງ Weblate ໂດຍປົກກະຕິເມື່ອໃຊ້ແບບພາສາດຽວ"

msgid ""
"For version 1 files, use the same configuration and select :guilabel:`Qt "
"Linguist translation file (version 1)` as the file format."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ເວີຊັນ 1, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນ ແລະ ເລືອກ :guilabel:`ໄຟລ໌ການແປ Qt Linguist "
"(ເວີຊັນ 1)` ເປັນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌."

msgid "JavaScript Resource Files (RESJSON)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ JavaScript (RESJSON)"

msgid ""
"JSON-based format used in Windows Store apps that use JavaScript and HTML. "
"Sometimes it is also referred as Windows JSON."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ JSON ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໃນແອັບ Windows Store ທີ່ໃຊ້ JavaScript ແລະ HTML. "
"ບາງຄັ້ງມັນກໍຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ Windows JSON."

msgid "`RESJSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ RESJSON`"

msgid "ResourceDictionary files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ ResourceDictionary"

msgid ""
"ResourceDictionary is a monolingual XML file format used to package "
"localizable string resources for Windows Presentation Foundation (WPF) "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"ResourceDictionary ແມ່ນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ XML "
"ແບບພາສາດຽວທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລວມຊັບພະຍາກອນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ Windows "
"Presentation Foundation (WPF)."

msgid "`ResourceDictionary file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ ResourceDictionary`"

msgid ".NET resource files (RESX, RESW)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ .NET (RESX, RESW)"

msgid ""
"A .NET XML resource file employs a monolingual XML file format used in "
"Microsoft .NET applications."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ຊັບພະຍາກອນ XML ຂອງ .NET ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ XML ແບບພາສາດຽວທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ "
"Microsoft .NET."

msgid ""
"It can use ``.resx`` or ``.resw`` extension. Despite the difference of file "
"extension, the ``.resw`` file format is identical to the ``.resx`` file "
"format, except that ``.resw`` files may contain only strings and file paths."
msgstr ""
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ ``.resx`` ຫຼື ``.resw`` ໄດ້. "
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໄຟລ໌, ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ ``.resw`` ກໍຄືກັນກັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ "
"``.resx``, ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ ``.resw`` ອາດບັນຈຸພຽງແຕ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ (file paths) "
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "`.NET resource file`"
msgstr "`.NET resource file`"

msgid "Ruby YAML files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Ruby YAML"

msgid "Ruby i18n YAML files with language as root node."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Ruby i18n YAML ທີ່ມີພາສາເປັນ Root Node."

msgid "Example Ruby i18n YAML file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ Ruby i18n YAML:"

msgid "`Ruby YAML file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Ruby YAML`"

msgid "Stringsdict format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ Stringsdict"

msgid ""
"XML based format used by Apple which is able to store plural forms of a "
"string."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໂດຍ Apple ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເກັບຮູບແບບພົດພົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້."

msgid ""
"`Stringsdict File Format <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/"
"localizing-strings-that-contain-plurals>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ Stringsdict <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode/"
"localizing-strings-that-contain-plurals>`_"

msgid ""
"``Resources/en.lproj/Localizable.stringsdict`` or ``Resources/Base.lproj/"
"Localizable.stringsdict``"
msgstr ""
"``Resources/en.lproj/Localizable.stringsdict`` ຫຼື ``Resources/Base.lproj/"
"Localizable.stringsdict``"

msgid "`Stringsdict file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ Stringsdict`"

msgid "Subtitle files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ"

msgid "Weblate can translate various subtitle files:"
msgstr "Weblate ສາມາດແປໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ:"

msgid "SubRip subtitle file (``*.srt``)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ SubRip (``*.srt``)"

msgid "MicroDVD subtitle file (``*.sub``)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ MicroDVD (``*.sub``)"

msgid "Advanced Substation Alpha subtitles file (``*.ass``)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ Advanced Substation Alpha (``*.ass``)"

msgid "Substation Alpha subtitle file (``*.ssa``)"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ Substation Alpha (``*.ssa``)"

msgid "`SubRip subtitle file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ຄຳບັນຍາຍ SubRip`"

msgid "TermBase eXchange format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ TermBase eXchange"

msgid "TBX is an XML format for the exchange of terminology data."
msgstr "TBX ແມ່ນຮູບແບບ XML ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນຄຳສັບ."

msgid "`TBX on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TermBase_eXchange>`_"
msgstr "`TBX ໃນ Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TermBase_eXchange>`_"

msgid "Explanations"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍ"

msgid ""
"Weblate loads and saves explanation from TBX files to be displayed "
"in :ref:`glossary`."
msgstr "Weblate ໂຫຼດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກຄຳອະທິບາຍຈາກໄຟລ໌ TBX ເພື່ອສະແດງໃນ :ref:`glossary`."

msgid ""
"Translation explanation is stored as ``<note from=\"translator\"></note>`` "
"tag."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍການແປຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ Tag ``<note from=\"translator\"></note>``."

msgid "Source string explanation is stored as ``<descrip></descrip>`` tag."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ Tag ``<descrip></descrip>``."

msgid ""
"Source string description is stored as ``<descrip type=\"Usage note\"></"
"descrip>`` tag."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳບັນຍາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນ Tag ``<descrip type=\"Usage note\"></descrip>``."

msgid "Glossary flags and read-only metadata"
msgstr "Flag ຂອງ Glossary ແລະ Metadata ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ"

msgid ""
"Weblate imports terms with ``forbidden`` or ``obsolete`` administrative "
"status in ``<termNote type=\"administrativeStatus\">`` as :ref:`glossary-"
"forbidden`."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັບທີ່ມີສະຖານະການບໍລິຫານເປັນ ``forbidden`` ຫຼື ``obsolete`` ໃນ "
"``<termNote type=\"administrativeStatus\">`` ເປັນ :ref:`glossary-forbidden`."

msgid ""
"Terms with ``<descrip type=\"Translation needed\">No</descrip>`` are "
"imported as read-only strings, see :ref:`glossary-untranslatable`."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັບທີ່ມີ ``<descrip type=\"Translation needed\">No</descrip>`` "
"ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`glossary-untranslatable`."

msgid "Importing glossary files"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ Glossary"

msgid ""
"TBX can store multiple languages in one XML file, but Weblate still maps "
"each component file to a translation language using the component file mask. "
"For a TBX glossary component, the component source language is used for "
"source terms and the language parsed from the file name is used as the "
"target glossary language."
msgstr ""
"TBX ສາມາດເກັບຫຼາຍພາສາໃນໄຟລ໌ XML ດຽວ, ແຕ່ Weblate ຍັງຄົງ Map ແຕ່ລະໄຟລ໌ Component "
"ໄປຍັງພາສາການແປໂດຍໃຊ້ Component File Mask. ສຳລັບ Component Glossary ຂອງ TBX, "
"ພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງ Component ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຄຳສັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ "
"ພາສາທີ່ແຍກວິເຄາະມາຈາກຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນພາສາ Glossary ປາຍທາງ."

msgid ""
"Avoid naming a TBX translation file with the same language code as the "
"component source language, because the source language already exists in "
"Weblate and the file can be detected as a duplicate language."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ການແປ TBX ດ້ວຍລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ຄືກັນກັບພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງ Component, "
"ເພາະວ່າພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບມີຢູ່ໃນ Weblate ແລ້ວ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ອາດຖືກກວດພົບວ່າເປັນພາສາຊ້ຳກັນ."

msgid "`TermBase eXchange file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ TermBase eXchange`"

msgid "TOML"
msgstr "TOML"

msgid ""
"TOML is a generic format like :doc:`/formats/yaml` or :doc:`/formats/json` "
"and can be used to localize applications."
msgstr ""
"TOML ແມ່ນຮູບແບບທົ່ວໄປຄືກັນກັບ :doc:`/formats/yaml` ຫຼື :doc:`/formats/json` ແລະ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນໄດ້."

msgid "Weblate supports TOML in several variants:"
msgstr "Weblate ຮອງຮັບ TOML ໃນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ:"

msgid "`TOML file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ TOML`"

msgid "Plain TOML file without support for plurals."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ TOML ທຳມະດາທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບພົດພົດ."

msgid "`go-i18n TOML file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ TOML go-i18n`"

msgid "go-i18n variant with plurals support."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ go-i18n ພ້ອມການຮອງຮັບພົດພົດ."

msgid "Text files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the plain text files and offered "
"for the translation. Each paragraph is translated as a separate string."
msgstr ""
"ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້ຈະຖືກສະກັດອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ ແລະ ສະເໜີເພື່ອການແປ. "
"ແຕ່ລະວັກຈະຖືກແປເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

msgid "There are several flavors of this format:"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບຂອງຮູບແບບນີ້:"

msgid "Plain text file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ (Plain text)"

msgid "DokuWiki text file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ DokuWiki"

msgid "MediaWiki text file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ MediaWiki"

msgid "`Plain text file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ`"

msgid ""
"By default, Weblate treats each paragraph as a separate translation unit to "
"provide line-based context. This can be problematic in text files where "
"paragraphs are frequently reordered, as it changes the context and can lead "
"to translation loss."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Weblate ຈະປະຕິບັດຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະວັກເປັນໜ່ວຍການແປແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເປັນບັນຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ວັກຕ່າງໆຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່ເລື້ອຍໆ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນປ່ຽນບໍລິບົດ ແລະ "
"ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ການສູນເສຍການແປ."

msgid ""
"This parameter is shared with **DokuWiki** and **MediaWiki** formats. "
"Enabling this option disables line-based context for the merged units."
msgstr ""
"ພາຣາມິເຕີນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກັບຮູບແບບ **DokuWiki** ແລະ **MediaWiki**. "
"ການເປີດໃຊ້ທາງເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດໃຊ້ງານບໍລິບົດແບບອີງຕາມແຖວສຳລັບໜ່ວຍທີ່ລວມເຂົ້າກັນ."

msgid "WebExtension JSON"
msgstr "WebExtension JSON"

msgid ""
"File format used when translating extensions for Mozilla Firefox or Google "
"Chromium."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອແປ Extensions ສຳລັບ Mozilla Firefox ຫຼື Google Chromium."

msgid ""
"While this format is called JSON, its specification allows including \"//\"-"
"style comments. Weblate does strip these comments while parsing the files "
"and discards them when saving."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮູບແບບນີ້ຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ JSON, ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງມັນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລວມເອົາຄຳອະທິບາຍແບບ \"//\". "
"Weblate ຈະລຶບຄຳອະທິບາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ແຍກວິເຄາະໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຈະປະຖິ້ມມັນເມື່ອບັນທຶກ."

msgid ""
"`Google chrome.i18n <https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/"
"api/i18n>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google chrome.i18n <https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/reference/"
"api/i18n>`_"

msgid ""
"`Mozilla Extensions Internationalization <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/Internationalization>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Mozilla Extensions Internationalization <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/Internationalization>`_"

msgid "`WebExtension JSON file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ WebExtension JSON`"

msgid "Windows RC files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Windows RC"

msgid "Support for Windows RC files has been rewritten."
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ Windows RC ໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່."

msgid ""
"RC files are language files used to localize translatable text, dialogs, "
"menus, for Windows applications."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ RC ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້, Dialog, Menu, ສຳລັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ "
"Windows ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid "Example Windows RC file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ Windows RC:"

msgid "`RC file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ RC`"

msgid "WixLocalization file"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ WixLocalization"

msgid ""
"WixLocalization (WXL) files are language files used to localize translatable "
"text, dialogs, menus, for WiX Toolset."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ WixLocalization (WXL) ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້, Dialog, "
"Menu, ສຳລັບ WiX Toolset ເປັນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

msgid "Example WXL file:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ WXL:"

msgid "`WixLocalization file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ WixLocalization`"

msgid "XLIFF 1.1 and 1.2"
msgstr "XLIFF 1.1 ແລະ 1.2"

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2` is a different format and is not backwards compatible "
"with XLIFF 1.2."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2` ເປັນຮູບແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານກັບ XLIFF 1.2 ໄດ້ "
"(ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນທາງກັບກັນ)."

msgid ""
"XML-based format created to standardize translation files, but in the end it "
"is one of `many standards <https://xkcd.com/927/>`_, in this area."
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ XML ເຊິ່ງສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ການແປມີມາດຕະຖານ, ແຕ່ສຸດທ້າຍມັນກໍເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນ "
"`ຫຼາຍມາດຕະຖານ <https://xkcd.com/927/>`_ ໃນດ້ານນີ້."

msgid ""
"`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)` is usually used as "
"bilingual, but Weblate supports it as monolingual as well."
msgstr ""
"`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)` "
"ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນແບບສອງພາສາ, ແຕ່ Weblate ກໍຮອງຮັບມັນໃນແບບພາສາດຽວເຊັ່ນກັນ."

msgid "Weblate supports XLIFF in several variants:"
msgstr "Weblate ຮອງຮັບ XLIFF ໃນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ:"

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 translation file`"
msgstr "`ໄຟລ໌ການແປ XLIFF 1.2`"

msgid ""
"Simple XLIFF file where content of the elements is stored as plain text (all "
"XML elements being escaped)."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ XLIFF ງ່າຍໆທີ່ເນື້ອຫາຂອງອົງປະກອບຖືກເກັບເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ (ອົງປະກອບ XML ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກ "
"Escape)."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with placeables support`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 ພ້ອມການຮອງຮັບ Placeables`"

msgid "Standard XLIFF supporting placeables and other XML elements."
msgstr "XLIFF ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Placeables ແລະ ອົງປະກອບ XML ອື່ນໆ."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with gettext extensions`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 ພ້ອມ Gettext Extensions`"

msgid ""
"XLIFF enriched by `XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_ to "
"support plurals."
msgstr ""
"XLIFF ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຕີມດ້ວຍ `XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_ "
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບພົດພົດ."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with Apple extensions`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 ພ້ອມ Apple Extensions`"

msgid "XLIFF enriched by Apple to support plurals."
msgstr "XLIFF ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຕີມໂດຍ Apple ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບພົດພົດ."

msgid "`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)`_ specification"
msgstr ""
"`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)`_ ສະເປັກ (Specification)"

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_"

msgid "`XLIFF on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XLIFF>`_"
msgstr "`XLIFF ໃນ Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XLIFF>`_"

msgid "Translation states"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການແປ"

msgid ""
"The ``state`` attribute in the file is partially processed and mapped to the "
"\"Needs edit\" state in Weblate (the following states are used to flag the "
"string as needing edit if there is a target present: ``new``, ``needs-"
"translation``, ``needs-adaptation``, ``needs-l10n``). Should the ``state`` "
"attribute be missing, a string is considered translated as soon as a "
"``<target>`` element exists."
msgstr ""
"Attribute ``state`` ໃນໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນບາງສ່ວນ ແລະ Map ໄປຍັງສະຖານະ \"Needs edit\" "
"ໃນ Weblate (ສະຖານະຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ ຖ້າມີເປົ້າໝາຍ: ``new``, "
"``needs-translation``, ``needs-adaptation``, ``needs-l10n``). ຖ້າ Attribute "
"``state`` ຂາດໄປ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາວ່າຖືກແປແລ້ວທັນທີທີ່ມີອົງປະກອບ ``<target>``."

msgid ""
"If the translation string has ``approved=\"yes\"``, it will also be imported "
"into Weblate as \"Approved\", anything else will be imported as \"Waiting "
"for review\" (which matches the XLIFF specification)."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມການແປມີ ``approved=\"yes\"``, ມັນກໍຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າສູ່ Weblate ເປັນ \"Approved\", "
"ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າເປັນ \"Waiting for review\" (ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບສະເປັກ XLIFF)."

msgid "While saving, Weblate doesn't add those attributes unless necessary:"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ບັນທຶກ, Weblate ຈະບໍ່ເພີ່ມ Attribute ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນນອກຈາກຈະຈຳເປັນ:"

msgid ""
"The ``state`` attribute is only added in case string is marked as needing "
"edit."
msgstr "Attribute ``state`` ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກໝາຍວ່າຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"The ``approved`` attribute is only added in case string has been reviewed."
msgstr "Attribute ``approved`` ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມໄດ້ຜ່ານການກວດສອບແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid ""
"In other cases the attributes are not added, but they are updated in case "
"they are present."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີອື່ນ Attribute ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເພີ່ມ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"That means that when using the XLIFF format, it is strongly recommended to "
"turn on the Weblate review process, in order to see and change the approved "
"state of strings."
msgstr ""
"ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ XLIFF, ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ຂະບວນການກວດສອບຂອງ Weblate "
"ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນສະຖານະ Approved ຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid ""
"Similarly upon importing such files (in the upload form), you should "
"choose :guilabel:`Import as translated` under :guilabel:`Processing of "
"strings needing edit`."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວ (ໃນຟອມອັບໂຫຼດ), ທ່ານຄວນເລືອກ :guilabel:`Import as "
"translated` ພາຍໃຕ້ :guilabel:`Processing of strings needing edit`."

msgid "Whitespace and newlines in XLIFF"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງ ແລະ ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໃນ XLIFF"

msgid ""
"Generally types or amounts of whitespace is not differentiated between in "
"XML formats. If you want to keep it, you have to add the "
"``xml:space=\"preserve\"`` flag to the string."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ປະເພດ ຫຼື ຈຳນວນຂອງຊ່ອງຫວ່າງຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈຳແນກໃນຮູບແບບ XML. "
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮັກສາມັນໄວ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ Flag ``xml:space=\"preserve\"`` ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ."

msgid "Specifying translation flags"
msgstr "ການລະບຸ Flag ການແປ"

msgid ""
"You can specify additional translation flags (see :ref:`custom-checks`) by "
"using the ``weblate-flags`` attribute. Weblate also understands ``maxwidth`` "
"and ``font`` attributes from the XLIFF specification:"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸ Flag ການແປເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`custom-checks`) ໂດຍໃຊ້ Attribute "
"``weblate-flags``. Weblate ຍັງເຂົ້າໃຈ Attribute ``maxwidth`` ແລະ ``font`` "
"ຈາກສະເປັກ XLIFF:"

msgid ""
"The ``font`` attribute is parsed for font family, size and weight, the above "
"example shows all of that, though only font family is required. Any "
"whitespace in the font family is converted to underscore, so ``Source Sans "
"Pro`` becomes ``Source_Sans_Pro``, please keep that in mind when naming the "
"font group (see :ref:`fonts`)."
msgstr ""
"Attribute ``font`` ຈະຖືກແຍກວິເຄາະຫາ Font Family, ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ນ້ຳໜັກ, "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນທັງໝົດນັ້ນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ Font Family ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "
"ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງໃດໆໃນ Font Family ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນ Underscore, ສະນັ້ນ ``Source Sans Pro`` "
"ຈະກາຍເປັນ ``Source_Sans_Pro``, ກະລຸນາຈື່ສິ່ງນີ້ໄວ້ໃນເວລາຕັ້ງຊື່ກຸ່ມ Font (ເບິ່ງ :ref:`fonts`)."

msgid ""
"`font attribute in XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#font>`_"
msgstr ""
"`font attribute ໃນ XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#font>`_"

msgid ""
"`maxwidth attribute in XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_"
msgstr ""
"`maxwidth attribute ໃນ XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_"

msgid "String keys"
msgstr "Key ຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

msgid ""
"Weblate identifies the units in the XLIFF file by ``resname`` attribute in "
"case it is present and falls back to ``id`` (together with ``file`` tag if "
"present)."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ລະບຸໜ່ວຍຕ່າງໆໃນໄຟລ໌ XLIFF ໂດຍ Attribute ``resname`` ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ "
"ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ ``id`` (ພ້ອມກັບ Tag ``file`` ຖ້າມີ) ແທນ."

msgid ""
"The ``resname`` attribute is supposed to be human friendly identifier of the "
"unit making it more suitable for Weblate to display instead of ``id``. The "
"``resname`` has to be unique in the whole XLIFF file. This is required by "
"Weblate and is not covered by the XLIFF standard - it does not put any "
"uniqueness restrictions on this attribute."
msgstr ""
"Attribute ``resname`` ຄວນເປັນຕົວລະບຸທີ່ມະນຸດອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍຂອງໜ່ວຍນັ້ນ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບ Weblate ໃນການສະແດງແທນ ``id``. ``resname`` "
"ຕ້ອງເປັນເອກະລັກ (unique) ໃນໄຟລ໌ XLIFF ທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍ Weblate ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກວມເອົາໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ XLIFF - ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ວາງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຄວາມເປັນເອກະລັກໃດໆໄວ້ເທິງ Attribute "
"ນີ້."

