"The workflow builds and validates source and wheel artifacts, publishes to "
"PyPI using trusted publishing, creates GitHub releases for tags, attaches "
"package SBOM files to GitHub releases, and creates package provenance and "
"SBOM attestations."
msgstr ""
"Workflow ຈະ Build ແລະ ກວດສອບສິ່ງປະດິດແບບ source ແລະ wheel, ເຜີຍແຜ່ໄປຍັງ PyPI ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"trusted publishing, ສ້າງ GitHub releases ສຳລັບແທັກຕ່າງໆ, ແນບໄຟລ໌ SBOM ຂອງ package "
"ໃສ່ GitHub releases, ແລະ ສ້າງ package provenance ແລະ SBOM attestations."

msgid "Weblate Client Docker image"
msgstr "Weblate Client Docker image"

msgid "`Weblate Client Docker image`_ and `Weblate Client GHCR registry`_"
msgstr "`Weblate Client Docker image`_ ແລະ `Weblate Client GHCR registry`_"

msgid ""
"`Weblate Client Dockerfile`_, `Weblate Client Docker workflow`_, and :doc:`/"
"wlc`"
msgstr ""
"`Weblate Client Dockerfile`_, `Weblate Client Docker workflow`_, ແລະ :doc:`/"
"wlc`"

msgid ""
"The workflow builds multi-architecture images, tests the command-line client "
"image, scans with Anchore and Trivy, and publishes to Docker Hub and GitHub "
"Packages. Published image digests are signed with Cosign, CycloneDX image "
"SBOMs are generated with Syft, and image provenance and SBOM attestations "
"are pushed to the registries."
msgstr ""
"Workflow ຈະ Build images ແບບ multi-architecture, ທົດສອບ image ຂອງ command-"
"line client, ສະແກນດ້ວຍ Anchore ແລະ Trivy, ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ໄປຍັງ Docker Hub ແລະ GitHub "
"Packages. Image digests ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ຈະຖືກເຊັນດ້ວຍ Cosign, CycloneDX image SBOMs "
"ຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍ Syft, ແລະ image provenance ແລະ SBOM attestations ຈະຖືກ Push ໄປຍັງ "
"Registries."

msgid ""
"The development Docker files in :file:`dev-docker/` and the fuzzing "
"container definitions in :file:`.clusterfuzzlite/` are development and "
"testing infrastructure, not production release artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Docker ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາໃນ :file:`dev-docker/` ແລະ ຄຳນິຍາມ Fuzzing container "
"ໃນ :file:`.clusterfuzzlite/` ເປັນພຽງໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ ແລະ ທົດສອບ, "
"ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງປະດິດທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ຈິງ (production)."

msgid ""
"Docker Compose files, including the `Weblate Docker Compose repository`_ and "
"local override examples, are example deployment configurations rather than "
"release artifacts. Operators typically adapt them for their own deployments "
"and update Weblate primarily by selecting or pulling Docker image tags. They "
"are not covered by the release signatures, SBOMs, or provenance statements "
"on this page."
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ Docker Compose, ລວມທັງ `Weblate Docker Compose repository`_ ແລະ "
"ຕົວຢ່າງການປັບແຕ່ງໃນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ເປັນພຽງຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງ ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງປະດິດທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ. "
"ຜູ້ປະຕິບັດງານມັກຈະປັບປ່ຽນພວກມັນສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງຕົນເອງ ແລະ ອັບເດດ Weblate "
"ໂດຍຕົ້ນຕໍຜ່ານການເລືອກ ຫຼື ດຶງ Docker image tags. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກວມເອົາໂດຍລາຍເຊັນຂອງເວີຊັນ, "
"SBOMs, ຫຼື ຄຳຖະແຫຼງການຢັ້ງຢືນໃນໜ້ານີ້."

msgid "Software Bill of Material"
msgstr "Software Bill of Material"

msgid ""
"Weblate publishes a Software Bill of Material (SBOM) using the CycloneDX "
"format for released versions. The SBOM is available as a versioned ``weblate-"
"<version>-sbom.cdx.json`` file in the `GitHub release assets`_ and is also "
"attached to the release provenance using GitHub artifact attestations. This "
"can be used to review the dependencies for security issues or license "
"compliance."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ເຜີຍແຜ່ Software Bill of Material (SBOM) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ CycloneDX "
"ສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ. SBOM ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ ``weblate-<version>-sbom.cdx.json`` "
"ທີ່ມີເວີຊັນໃນ `GitHub release assets`_ ແລະ ຍັງຖືກແນບໃສ່ release provenance ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"GitHub artifact attestations. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົບທວນ Dependencies "
"ສຳລັບບັນຫາຄວາມປອດໄພ ຫຼື ການປະຕິບັດຕາມໃບອະນຸຍາດ."

msgid ""
"The release SBOM records document-level metadata for the CISA 2025 minimum "
"elements, including the SBOM author, software producer, generation tools, "
"timestamp, generation context, and Weblate release component identity. "
"Dependency component details are emitted by the ecosystem SBOM generators "
"used during the release. Python component license and hash completeness "
"therefore depends on CycloneDX export support in :program:`uv`."
msgstr ""
"Release SBOM ບັນທຶກເມຕາດາຕ້າລະດັບເອກະສານສຳລັບອົງປະກອບຂັ້ນຕໍ່າຂອງ CISA 2025, ລວມທັງຜູ້ຂຽນ "
"SBOM, ຜູ້ຜະລິດຊອບແວ, ເຄື່ອງມືການສ້າງ, ວັນທີເວລາ, ບໍລິບົດການສ້າງ, ແລະ ຕົວຕົນຂອງສ່ວນປະກອບ "
"Weblate ທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ. ລາຍລະອຽດສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Dependency ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍຜູ້ສ້າງ SBOM ຂອງ "
"Ecosystem ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຄວາມຄົບຖ້ວນຂອງໃບອະນຸຍາດ ແລະ Hash "
"ຂອງສ່ວນປະກອບ Python ຈຶ່ງຂຶ້ນກັບການຮອງຮັບການສົ່ງອອກ CycloneDX ໃນ :program:`uv`."

msgid ""
"The Weblate release workflow publishes verification material for the Weblate "
"Python source distribution and wheel in `GitHub release assets`_. Release "
"assets include the package archives, Sigstore signature bundles, release "
"notes, and the release SBOM. The same package archives are uploaded to PyPI "
"using trusted publishing, but the Sigstore bundle files are not uploaded to "
"PyPI because the release workflow removes files not accepted by PyPI before "
"publishing."
msgstr ""
"Workflow ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ Weblate ເຜີຍແຜ່ວັດສະດຸການກວດສອບສຳລັບ Weblate Python source "
"distribution ແລະ wheel ໃນ `GitHub release assets`_. Release assets ລວມເຖິງ "
"Package archives, Sigstore signature bundles, ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ, ແລະ Release "
"SBOM. Package archives ດຽວກັນຖືກອັບໂຫຼດໄປຍັງ PyPI ໂດຍໃຊ້ trusted publishing, ແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ "
"Sigstore bundle ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອັບໂຫຼດໄປຍັງ PyPI ເພາະ Workflow ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ PyPI "
"ບໍ່ຍອມຮັບອອກກ່ອນການເຜີຍແຜ່."

msgid ""
"Verify the files downloaded from GitHub release assets when you need the "
"published signatures, attestations, and SBOM. PyPI package files can be "
"compared to the matching GitHub release assets by filename and digest."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາຈາກ GitHub release assets ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການລາຍເຊັນ, ການຢັ້ງຢືນ, ແລະ "
"SBOM ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ໄວ້. ໄຟລ໌ PyPI package ສາມາດປຽບທຽບກັບ GitHub release assets "
"ທີ່ກົງກັນໄດ້ໂດຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ Digest."

msgid "Release signatures"
msgstr "ລາຍເຊັນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ"

msgid ""
"Weblate package archives are cryptographically signed using Sigstore "
"signatures. The signature bundles are attached to the GitHub release next to "
"the signed :file:`.tar.gz` and :file:`.whl` files."
msgstr ""
"Package archives ຂອງ Weblate ຖືກເຊັນລາຍເຊັນທາງ cryptography ໂດຍໃຊ້ Sigstore "
"signatures. Signature bundles ຖືກແນບໃສ່ກັບ GitHub release "
"ຖັດຈາກໄຟລ໌ :file:`.tar.gz` ແລະ :file:`.whl` ທີ່ຖືກເຊັນແລ້ວ."

msgid ""
"The verification can be performed using the :pypi:`sigstore package "
"<sigstore>`. The following example verifies the wheel from the 5.4 release; "
"adjust the version and filenames for the release you are checking:"
msgstr ""
"ການກວດສອບສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :pypi:`sigstore package <sigstore>`. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກວດສອບ wheel ຈາກເວີຊັນ 5.4; ປັບເວີຊັນ ແລະ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບເວີຊັນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງກວດສອບ:"

msgid "Release attestations"
msgstr "ການຢັ້ງຢືນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນ (Release attestations)"

msgid ""
"The release workflow creates two kinds of `GitHub artifact attestations`_ "
"for the package archives:"
msgstr ""
"Workflow ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຈະສ້າງ `GitHub artifact attestations`_ ສອງປະເພດສຳລັບ "
"Package archives:"

msgid ""
"Build provenance attestations generated by :file:`.github/workflows/"
"setup.yml` using :program:`actions/attest-build-provenance`."
msgstr ""
"Build provenance attestations ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ :file:`.github/workflows/setup.yml` "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`actions/attest-build-provenance`."

msgid ""
"SBOM attestations generated by :file:`.github/workflows/setup.yml` "
"using :program:`actions/attest` with the CycloneDX release SBOM."
msgstr ""
"SBOM attestations ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ :file:`.github/workflows/setup.yml` "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`actions/attest` ພ້ອມກັບ CycloneDX release SBOM."

msgid ""
"The attestations can be verified using :program:`gh`. The following example "
"checks the build provenance attestation for the 5.4 wheel:"
msgstr ""
"ການຢັ້ງຢືນສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ :program:`gh`. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການກວດສອບການຢັ້ງຢືນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດການສ້າງ (build provenance) ສຳລັບ wheel 5.4:"

msgid ""
"Use the CycloneDX predicate type to verify the SBOM attestation attached to "
"the same package artifact:"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ປະເພດ CycloneDX predicate ເພື່ອກວດສອບການຢັ້ງຢືນ SBOM ທີ່ຄັດຕິດມາກັບໄຟລ໌ຊອບແວ (package "
"artifact) ດຽວກັນ:"

msgid "SBOM and checksums"
msgstr "SBOM ແລະ ຄ່າກວດສອບ (checksums)"

msgid ""
"The release SBOM is a CycloneDX JSON file named ``weblate-<version>-"
"sbom.cdx.json`` and is attached to GitHub release assets. The SBOM "
"attestation is attached to the package archives, not to the SBOM file as a "
"separate release artifact."
msgstr ""
"SBOM ຂອງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ CycloneDX JSON ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ ``weblate-<version>-"
"sbom.cdx.json`` ແລະ ຖືກຄັດຕິດໄວ້ໃນ GitHub release assets. ການຢັ້ງຢືນ SBOM "
"ຈະຖືກຄັດຕິດໄວ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດ (archives), ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄັດຕິດໄວ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ SBOM ໃນຖານະໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

msgid ""
"Weblate does not currently publish a separate checksum manifest such "
"as :file:`SHA256SUMS` for release artifacts."
msgstr ""
"ປະຈຸບັນ Weblate ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ລາຍການຄ່າກວດສອບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊັ່ນ :file:`SHA256SUMS` "
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ."

msgid "Other release channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງທາງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນອື່ນໆ"

msgid ""
"The release artifact inventory does not currently identify signatures, "
"SBOMs, or provenance attestations for Helm charts. The verification "
"instructions in this section apply to the Weblate Python release artifacts "
"published by this repository. Docker image and Weblate Client supply-chain "
"metadata is published by their owning repositories."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາໃນປະຈຸບັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີລາຍເຊັນ, SBOM, ຫຼື ການຢັ້ງຢືນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດສຳລັບ Helm "
"charts. ຄຳແນະນຳການກວດສອບໃນສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ Weblate Python ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ໂດຍຄັງເກັບນີ້ "
"(repository). ສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) ຂອງ Docker image ແລະ Weblate Client "
"ແມ່ນຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ໂດຍຄັງເກັບທີ່ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Releases and supported versions"
msgstr "ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນ ແລະ ເວີຊັ່ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

msgid ""
"This page summarizes the public release, security-update, and upgrade "
"support policies for Weblate. For maintainer release steps, see :doc:`/"
"contributing/release`. For upgrade commands, see :doc:`/admin/upgrade`. For "
"published release artifacts, SBOMs, signatures, and provenance attestations, "
"see :doc:`release-artifacts`."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້ານີ້ສະຫຼຸບນະໂຍບາຍການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນສາທາລະນະ, ການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ, ແລະ "
"ການຮອງຮັບການອັບເກຣດສຳລັບ Weblate. ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ :doc:`/"
"contributing/release`. ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງອັບເກຣດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ :doc:`/admin/upgrade`. "
"ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່, SBOM, ລາຍເຊັນ, ແລະ ການຢັ້ງຢືນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ :doc:`release-"
"artifacts`."

msgid ""
"Weblate uses calendar versioning with monthly releases. The version format "
"is ``<YEAR>.<MONTH>.<PATCH>`` with a numeric, non-zero-padded month. The "
"``<PATCH>`` part is omitted for the first release in a month when it would "
"be ``0``, for example ``2026.5``. Patch releases use the full version "
"number, for example ``2026.5.1``."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ໃຊ້ລະບົບເວີຊັ່ນຕາມປະຕິທິນ ໂດຍມີການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນທຸກໆເດືອນ. ຮູບແບບເວີຊັ່ນແມ່ນ ``<ປີ>.<ເດືອນ>."
"<ແພັດສ໌>`` ໂດຍເດືອນຈະເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ມີເລກສູນນຳໜ້າ. ສ່ວນ ``<ແພັດສ໌>`` "
"ຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນໄວ້ສຳລັບການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນທຳອິດຂອງເດືອນ ເມື່ອມັນເປັນເລກ ``0``, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``2026.5``. "
"ສ່ວນການປ່ອຍແພັດສ໌ (Patch releases) ຈະໃຊ້ເລກເວີຊັ່ນເຕັມ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``2026.5.1``."

msgid ""
"Monthly releases are usually published at the beginning of the month. Patch "
"releases include bug fixes, security fixes, and dependency updates which "
"should not wait for the next monthly release."
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນປະຈຳເດືອນປົກກະຕິຈະເຜີຍແຜ່ໃນຕົ້ນເດືອນ. ການປ່ອຍແພັດສ໌ (Patch releases) "
"ຈະລວມເອົາການແກ້ໄຂບັກ, ການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມປອດໄພ, ແລະ ການອັບເດດສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນ (dependencies) "
"ທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນລໍຖ້າຈົນເຖິງການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນປະຈຳເດືອນຖັດໄປ."

msgid ""
"The Docker container includes an additional version component to track "
"changes in the container itself, such as dependencies. Fixed Docker image "
"tags include the patch component together with this build component, even "
"when the Weblate version omits a ``0`` patch component. These updates may "
"include security updates."
msgstr ""
"Docker container ຈະມີສ່ວນປະກອບເວີຊັ່ນເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຕົວ container ເອງ, "
"ເຊັ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ່າງໆ. ແທັກ (Tags) ຂອງ Docker image "
"ທີ່ຄົງທີ່ຈະລວມເອົາສ່ວນແພັດສ໌ພ້ອມກັບສ່ວນປະກອບການສ້າງ (build component) ນີ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເວີຊັ່ນຂອງ "
"Weblate ຈະລະເວັ້ນແພັດສ໌ເລກ ``0`` ກໍຕາມ. ການອັບເດດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດລວມເຖິງການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ."

msgid "Security updates"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ"

msgid ""
"Weblate provides security updates to address vulnerabilities and enhance the "
"application's security posture. Only the latest release is guaranteed to "
"receive security updates. Users are encouraged to keep Weblate up to date to "
"benefit from the latest security improvements."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ສະໜອງການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊ່ອງໂຫວ່ ແລະ ເສີມສ້າງຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ. "
"ສະເພາະເວີຊັ່ນຫຼ້າສຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວນອັບເດດ "
"Weblate ໃຫ້ເປັນເວີຊັ່ນໃໝ່ສະເໝີ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນປະໂຫຍດຈາກການປັບປຸງຄວາມປອດໄພຫຼ້າສຸດ."

msgid ""
"Security update coverage and direct upgrade support are separate policies."
msgstr "ການຄຸ້ມຄອງການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ ແລະ ການຮອງຮັບການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງແມ່ນຄົນລະນະໂຍບາຍກັນ."

msgid "Version"
msgstr "ເວີຊັ່ນ"

msgid "Security update coverage"
msgstr "ການຄຸ້ມຄອງການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ"

msgid "End of guaranteed security updates"
msgstr "ສິ້ນສຸດການຮັບປະກັນການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພ"

msgid "Direct upgrade support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງ"

msgid "Latest Weblate release"
msgstr "Weblate ເວີຊັ່ນຫຼ້າສຸດ"

msgid "Guaranteed."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນ."

msgid ""
"When the next Weblate release is published, normally the following month."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ Weblate ເວີຊັ່ນຖັດໄປຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນໃນເດືອນຕໍ່ມາ."

msgid "Supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "Older releases from the current or previous calendar year"
msgstr "ເວີຊັ່ນເກົ່າຈາກປີປະຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ປີກ່ອນໜ້າ"

msgid ""
"Not guaranteed. Upgrade to the latest release to receive guaranteed security "
"updates."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນ. ກະລຸນາອັບເກຣດເປັນເວີຊັ່ນຫຼ້າສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຮັບປະກັນ."

msgid "Ended when a newer Weblate release was published."
msgstr "ສິ້ນສຸດລົງເມື່ອມີການເຜີຍແຜ່ Weblate ເວີຊັ່ນໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid "Direct upgrades are supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງ."

msgid "Older releases"
msgstr "ເວີຊັ່ນເກົ່າກວ່າ"

msgid "Not guaranteed."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮັບປະກັນ."

msgid ""
"Upgrade through the intermediate versions listed in :ref:`version-specific-"
"instructions`."
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດຜ່ານເວີຊັ່ນລະຫວ່າງກາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ :ref:`version-specific-instructions`."

msgid ""
"Direct upgrades are supported from releases in the current or previous "
"calendar year. The first release in a new year drops direct upgrade support "
"for releases from the year before the previous year."
msgstr ""
"ການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງແມ່ນຮອງຮັບຈາກເວີຊັ່ນໃນປີປະຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ປີກ່ອນໜ້າ. "
"ການປ່ອຍເວີຊັ່ນທຳອິດໃນປີໃໝ່ຈະຍົກເລີກການຮອງຮັບການອັບເກຣດໂດຍກົງສຳລັບເວີຊັ່ນຈາກປີກ່ອນຂອງປີກ່ອນໜ້າ."

