msgid ""
"The following change actions can appear in notification payloads. Fedora "
"Messaging uses the identifier column in message topics, while webhook "
"payloads use the name column in the ``action`` field."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນແປງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນຂໍ້ມູນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ (notification payloads). "
"Fedora Messaging ຈະໃຊ້ຄໍລຳຕົວລະບຸ (identifier) ໃນຫົວຂໍ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ webhook "
"payloads ຈະໃຊ້ຄໍລຳຊື່ໃນຟິລ ``action``."

msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

msgid "Identifier"
