msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-component-"
"update`, :ref:`addon-event-daily`, :ref:`addon-event-event-change`"

msgid ""
"Automatically translates strings using machine translation or other "
"components."
msgstr "ແປຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ການແປດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຈັກ ຫຼື ສ່ວນປະກອບອື່ນໆ."

msgid "JavaScript localization CDN"
msgstr "CDN ສຳລັບການແປພາສາ JavaScript"

msgid ""
"The percentage of translated strings that must be present for translation to "
"be included."
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປແລ້ວເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອໃຫ້ການແປນັ້ນຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ."

msgid "CSS selector to detect localizable elements."
msgstr "CSS selector ສຳລັບກວດຫາອົງປະກອບທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້."

msgid "Name of cookie which stores language preference."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງຄຸກກີ້ທີ່ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາສາທີ່ມັກ."

msgid ""
"List of filenames in current repository or remote URLs to parse for "
"translatable strings."
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນຄັງປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື URL ທາງໄກ ເພື່ອນຳມາສະກັດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປໄດ້."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"daily`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-commit`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"repository-post-remove`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"daily`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-commit`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"repository-post-remove`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"

msgid ""
"Publishes translations into content delivery network for use in JavaScript "
"or HTML localization."
msgstr ""
"ເຜີຍແຜ່ການແປເຂົ້າໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍການຈັດສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ (CDN) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການແປພາສາ JavaScript ຫຼື HTML."

msgid ""
"Can be used to localize static HTML pages, or to load localization in the "
"JavaScript code."
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປພາສາໜ້າ HTML ຄົງທີ່, ຫຼື ເພື່ອໂຫຼດການແປພາສາໃນຊຸດຄຳສັ່ງ JavaScript."

msgid ""
"Generates a unique URL for your component you can include in HTML pages to "
"localize them. See :ref:`weblate-cdn` for more details."
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ URL ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນສຳລັບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງທ່ານ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດນຳໄປໃສ່ໃນໜ້າ HTML ເພື່ອແປພາສາພວກມັນ. "
"ເບິ່ງ :ref:`weblate-cdn` ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid ""
"This add-on requires additional configuration on the Weblate "
"server. :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH` configures where generated files will "
"be written (on a filesystem), and :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL` defines where "
"they will be served (URL). Serving of the files is not done by Weblate and "
"has to be set up externally (typically using a CDN service)."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນເສີມນີ້ຕ້ອງການການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນເຊີເວີ Weblate. :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_PATH` "
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນທີ່ຈະຂຽນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌), ແລະ :setting:`LOCALIZE_CDN_URL` "
"ກຳນົດບ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (URL). ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໂດຍ Weblate ແລະ "
"ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກພາຍນອກ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນໃຊ້ບໍລິການ CDN)."

msgid ""
"This add-on is configured on :guilabel:`Hosted Weblate` and serves the files "
"via ``https://weblate-cdn.com/``."
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນເສີມນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃນ :guilabel:`Hosted Weblate` ແລະ ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄຟລ໌ຜ່ານ ``https://"
"weblate-cdn.com/``."

msgid "Translation files CDN"
msgstr "CDN ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ການແປ"

msgid "`This add-on has no configuration.`"
msgstr "`ສ່ວນເສີມນີ້ບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.`"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-component-"
"update`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-commit`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"repository-post-remove`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-component-"
"update`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-commit`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"repository-post-remove`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"

msgid "Publishes translation files into a content delivery network."
msgstr "ເຜີຍແຜ່ໄຟລ໌ການແປລົງໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍການສົ່ງເນື້ອຫາ."

msgid ""
"Publishes translation files without converting them to another format. Files "
"are written below the add-on specific CDN directory and served from "
"``LOCALIZE_CDN_URL/<add-on UUID>/``. Single-file translations use the "
"language code and original file extension, for example ``cs.json`` or "
"``de.po``. Multi-file translations are served below the language code using "
"paths relative to the translation directory. Monolingual components include "
"the source language file, while bilingual components publish only target-"
"language files. See :ref:`cdn-server-security` for secure serving guidance."
msgstr ""
"ເຜີຍແຜ່ໄຟລ໌ການແປໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແປງເປັນຮູບແບບອື່ນ. ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຂຽນໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ CDN "
"ສະເພາະຂອງສ່ວນເສີມ ແລະ ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຈາກ ``LOCALIZE_CDN_URL/<add-on UUID>/``. "
"ການແປແບບໄຟລ໌ດ່ຽວຈະໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາ ແລະ ນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ເດີມ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``cs.json`` ຫຼື ``de.po``. "
"ການແປແບບຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍໃຕ້ລະຫັດພາສາໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ທີ່ທຽບກັບໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການແປ. "
"ສ່ວນປະກອບແບບພາສາດ່ຽວຈະລວມເອົາໄຟລ໌ພາສາຕົ້ນສະບັບ, "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ່ວນປະກອບແບບສອງພາສາຈະເຜີຍແຜ່ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ພາສາເປົ້າໝາຍ. ເບິ່ງ :ref:`cdn-server-"
"security` ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳການໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ປອດໄພ."

msgid "Remove blank strings"
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງ"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"commit`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"commit`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-update`"

msgid "Removes strings without a translation from translation files."
msgstr "ລຶບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ມີການແປອອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ການແປ."

msgid ""
"Use this to not have any empty strings in translation files (for example if "
"your localization library displays them as missing instead of falling back "
"to the source string)."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມວ່າງໃນໄຟລ໌ການແປ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: "
"ຖ້າໄລບຣາຣີການແປພາສາຂອງທ່ານສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເປັນ \"ຫາຍໄປ\" ແທນທີ່ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ)."

msgid "Cleanup translation files"
msgstr "ລຶບລ້າງໄຟລ໌ການແປ"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"update`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-pre-commit`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"update`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-pre-commit`"

msgid ""
"Update all translation files to match the monolingual base file. For most "
"file formats, this means removing stale translation keys no longer present "
"in the base file."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງໄຟລ໌ການແປທັງໝົດໃຫ້ກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບພາສາດຽວ. ສຳລັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, "
"ນີ້ໝາຍເຖິງການລຶບຄີການແປທີ່ເກົ່າ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid ""
"For formats containing additional content besides translation strings (such "
"as :ref:`html`, :ref:`winrc`, or :ref:`odf`) this also brings the "
"translation file in sync with the base file."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຮູບແບບທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາເພີ່ມເຕີມນອກເໜືອຈາກຂໍ້ຄວາມການແປ (ເຊັ່ນ :ref:`html`, :ref:`winrc`, "
"ຫຼື :ref:`odf`) ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ການແປຊິງຄ໌ກັບໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານນຳອີກ."

msgid ""
"For a one-time cleanup of a single translation file, use :guilabel:`Cleanup "
"unused` in :ref:`repository-maintenance` on that translation instead of "
"installing the add-on."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການທຳຄວາມສະອາດໄຟລ໌ການແປດ່ຽວພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ :guilabel:`Cleanup unused` "
"ໃນ :ref:`repository-maintenance` ຂອງການແປນັ້ນ ແທນທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນເສີມ."

msgid "Add missing languages"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພາສາທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປ"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"daily`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-add`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-"
"daily`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-add`"

msgid ""
"Ensures a consistent set of languages is used for all components within a "
"project."
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຊຸດພາສາທີ່ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນສຳລັບທຸກສ່ວນປະກອບພາຍໃນໂຄງການ."

msgid "The components shared from other projects are not considered in this."
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຖືກແບ່ງປັນມາຈາກໂຄງການອື່ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳມາພິຈາລະນາໃນສ່ວນນີ້."

msgid ""
"Missing languages are checked once every 24 hours, and when new languages "
"are added in Weblate."
msgstr "ພາສາທີ່ຫາຍໄປຈະຖືກກວດສອບທຸກໆ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ, ແລະ ເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມພາສາໃໝ່ໃນ Weblate."

msgid "Unlike most others, this add-on affects the whole project."
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ທັງໝົດໂຄງການ ເຊິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກສ່ວນເສີມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່."

msgid ""
"Auto-translate the newly added strings with :ref:`addon-"
"weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate`."
msgstr ""
"ແປຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ເພີ່ມໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດດ້ວຍ :ref:`addon-weblate.autotranslate.autotranslate`."

msgid "Component discovery"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາສ່ວນປະກອບ"

msgid ""
"The regular expression must define a named group for component. Also define "
"a named group for language when matching translation files. When the file "
"mask is set, omit language and match the monolingual base or new base file "
"instead."
msgstr ""

msgid "Use Django template syntax. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໄວຍາກອນແມ່ແບບ Django. ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຕ້ອງມີ {{ component }}."

msgid "Define the monolingual base filename"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຊື່ໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານແບບພາສາເວີຊັນດຽວ"

msgid ""
"Leave empty for bilingual translation files. When set, this template must "
"include {{ component }}."
msgstr "ປະວ່າງໄວ້ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ການແປສອງພາສາ. ຫາກກຳນົດ, ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຕ້ອງມີ {{ component }}."

msgid ""
"Filename of file used for creating new translations. For gettext choose .pot "
"file. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ້າງການແປໃໝ່. ສຳລັບ gettext ໃຫ້ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ .pot. ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຕ້ອງມີ "
"{{ component }}."

msgid ""
"Filename of intermediate translation file. In most cases this is a "
"translation file provided by developers and is used when creating actual "
"source strings. This template must include {{ component }}."
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງໄຟລ໌ການແປລະດັບກາງ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ການແປທີ່ນັກພັດທະນາສະໜອງໃຫ້ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບຕົວຈິງ. ແມ່ແບບນີ້ຕ້ອງມີ {{ component }}."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Discovered file masks:"
msgid "Define the file mask"
msgstr "File masks ທີ່ຄົ້ນພົບ:"

msgid ""
"Leave empty to match translation files directly. When set, discovery matches "
"the monolingual base or new base file and uses this template as the file "
"mask. Include a language wildcard and {{ component }}, for example locale/*/"
"{{ component }}.po or docs/{{ component }}_*.md."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Regular expression to filter translation files against when scanning for "
"file mask."
msgstr "Regular expression ສຳລັບກັ່ນຕອງໄຟລ໌ການແປເມື່ອສະແກນຫາ file mask."

msgid "Clone add-ons from the main component to the newly created ones"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກສ່ວນເສີມຈາກສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼັກໄປຫາສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່"

msgid "Remove components for inexistent files"
msgstr "ລຶບສ່ວນປະກອບສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"update`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-event-add-on-installation`, :ref:`addon-event-repository-post-"
"update`"

msgid ""
"Automatically adds or removes project components based on file changes in "
"the version control system."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງໂຄງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງໄຟລ໌ໃນລະບົບຄວບຄຸມເວີຊັນ."

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The matching is done using regular expressions enabling complex "
#| "configuration, but some knowledge is required to do so. The regular "
#| "expression to match translation files has to contain two named groups to "
#| "match component and language. All named groups in the regular expression "
#| "can be used as variables in the template fields."
msgid ""
"The matching is done using regular expressions enabling complex "
"configuration, but some knowledge is required to do so. Usually the regular "
"expression to match translation files has to contain two named groups to "
"match component and language. When creating components from a monolingual "
"base or new base file, omit the language group and match that source file "
"instead. All named groups in the regular expression can be used as variables "
"in the template fields."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັບຄູ່ແມ່ນເຮັດໂດຍໃຊ້ນິພົດເຣກກູລ່າ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຮູ້ພື້ນຖານໃນການໃຊ້ງານ. ນິພົດເຣກກູລ່າເພື່ອຈັບຄູ່ໄຟລ໌ການແປ ຈະຕ້ອງມີກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຊື່ (named "
"groups) ສອງກຸ່ມ ເພື່ອຈັບຄູ່ສ່ວນປະກອບ ແລະ ພາສາ. ທຸກກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຊື່ໃນນິພົດເຣກກູລ່າສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ເປັນຕົວປ່ຽນ "
"ໃນຟິລຂອງແມ່ແບບໄດ້."

msgid "Discovery requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຄົ້ນຫາ"

msgid ""
"To discover a component successfully, the configuration has to do all of the "
"following:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຄົ້ນຫາສ່ວນປະກອບປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດທັງໝົດດັ່ງນີ້:"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The regular expression must define ``component`` and ``language`` named "
#| "groups."
msgid ""
"The regular expression must define a ``component`` named group. Matching "
"translation files also requires a ``language`` named group."
msgstr "ນິພົດເຣກກູລ່າຕ້ອງກຳນົດກຸ່ມທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ ``component`` ແລະ ``language``."

msgid ""
"Template fields used to name or locate per-component files must include "
"``{{ component }}``, so the rendered value actually changes for each "
"discovered component."
msgstr ""
"ຟິລແມ່ແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ ຫຼື ລະບຸຕຳແໜ່ງໄຟລ໌ຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບ ຕ້ອງລວມເອົາ ``{{ component }}``, "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ສະແດງຜົນມີການປ່ຽນແປງ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບທີ່ຄົ້ນພົບ."

