msgstr "ຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງການພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

msgid "CA certificate bundle (PEM)"
msgstr "ຊຸດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste only PEM certificate blocks, each starting with \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\" and ending with \"-----END CERTIFICATE-----\"."
msgstr ""
"ວາງສະເພາະບລັອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ PEM, ແຕ່ລະບລັອກຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\" "
"ແລະ ລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍ \"-----END CERTIFICATE-----\"."

msgid "Client private key (PEM)"
msgstr "ຄີສ່ວນຕົວຂອງໄຄເອັນ (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste a single unencrypted PEM private key block. Encrypted private keys are "
"not supported."
msgstr ""
"ວາງບລັອກ PEM private key ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດພຽງອັນດຽວ. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ private key ທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

msgid "Client certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງໄຄເອັນ (PEM)"

msgid ""
"Paste only the PEM certificate block starting with \"-----BEGIN "
"CERTIFICATE-----\"; do not paste the output from \"openssl x509 -text\"."
msgstr ""
"ວາງສະເພາະບລັອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ PEM ທີ່ຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\"; "
"ຫ້າມວາງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ \"openssl x509 -text\"."

msgid ""
"Choose which change events should trigger this add-on. :ref:`addon-choice-"
"event_filter`"
msgstr "ເລືອກເຫດການການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈະກະຕຸ້ນສ່ວນເສີມນີ້. :ref:`addon-choice-event_filter`"

msgid "Sends notifications to a Fedora Messaging compatible AMQP exchange."
msgstr "ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ AMQP exchange ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Fedora Messaging."

msgid ""
"Fedora Messaging is AMQP-based publisher for all changes happening in "
"Weblate. You can hook additional services on changes happening in Weblate "
"using this."
msgstr ""
"Fedora Messaging ແມ່ນຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່ (publisher) ຕາມພື້ນຖານ AMQP ສຳລັບທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນ "
"Weblate. ທ່ານສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍລິການເພີ່ມເຕີມເຂົ້າກັບການປ່ຽນແປງໃນ Weblate ໂດຍໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້."

msgid "Message topic"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

msgid ""
"All messages have topic ``weblate.<action>.<project>.<category...>."
"<component>.<translation>``. When configured, ``topic_prefix`` is prepended "
"to this topic using a single dot separator, for example "
"``org.fedoraproject.weblate.project_backed_up.website``. The action is "
"lowercase textual representation of action with underscores instead of "
"space, for example ``resource_updated``; see :ref:`change-actions` for all "
"action identifiers. The remaining parts match Weblate object path segments."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດຈະມີຫົວຂໍ້ໃນຮູບແບບ ``weblate.<action>.<project>.<category...>."
"<component>.<translation>``. ເມື່ອມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ``topic_prefix`` "
"ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ທາງໜ້າຫົວຂໍ້ນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຈຸດເປັນຕົວແຍກ, ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"``org.fedoraproject.weblate.project_backed_up.website``. ການດຳເນີນການ "
"(action) ຈະເປັນຕົວອັກສອນພິມນ້ອຍທີ່ແທນການດຳເນີນການ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກາງລຸ່ມ (underscore) "
"ແທນຍະຫວ່າງ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ``resource_updated``; ເບິ່ງ :ref:`change-actions` "
"ສຳລັບຕົວລະບຸການດຳເນີນການທັງໝົດ. ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະກົງກັບສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ຂອງອັອບເຈັກໃນ "
"Weblate."

msgid ""
"For example, a project backup event for the ``website`` project uses "
"``weblate.project_backed_up.website``. A translation change in the "
"``website`` project, ``frontend`` component, and Czech translation uses "
"``weblate.translation_changed.website.frontend.cs``. The same change in the "
"``frontend`` component inside the ``parent`` and ``child`` categories uses "
"``weblate.translation_changed.website.parent.child.frontend.cs``."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເຫດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໂຄງການສຳລັບໂຄງການ ``website`` ຈະໃຊ້ "
"``weblate.project_backed_up.website``. ການປ່ຽນແປງການແປໃນໂຄງການ ``website``, "
"ສ່ວນປະກອບ ``frontend``, ແລະ ການແປພາສາເຊັກ ຈະໃຊ້ "
"``weblate.translation_changed.website.frontend.cs``. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງດຽວກັນໃນສ່ວນປະກອບ ``frontend`` ພາຍໃຕ້ໝວດໝູ່ ``parent`` ແລະ ``child`` "
"ຈະໃຊ້ ``weblate.translation_changed.website.parent.child.frontend.cs``."

