"`Alibaba Translate Documentation <https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/"
"machine-translation>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ເອກະສານ Alibaba Translate <https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/machine-"
"translation>`_"

msgid "Advanced features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຂັ້ນສູງ"

msgid "Anthropic API URL"
msgstr "Anthropic API URL"

msgid "Base URL of the Anthropic API. Leave empty to use the default URL."
msgstr "URL ພື້ນຖານຂອງ Anthropic API. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ URL ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "Anthropic model"
msgstr "ໂມເດວ Anthropic"

msgid "``claude-haiku-4-5`` -- Claude Haiku 4.5"
msgstr "``claude-haiku-4-5`` -- Claude Haiku 4.5"

msgid "``claude-sonnet-5`` -- Claude Sonnet 5"
msgstr "``claude-sonnet-5`` -- Claude Sonnet 5"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "``claude-opus-4-8`` -- Claude Opus 4.8"
msgid "``claude-opus-5`` -- Claude Opus 5"
msgstr "``claude-opus-4-8`` -- Claude Opus 4.8"

#, fuzzy
#| msgid "``claude-fable-5`` -- Claude Fable 5"
msgid "``claude-fable-5-1`` -- Claude Fable 5.1"
msgstr "``claude-fable-5`` -- Claude Fable 5"

msgid "``claude-opus-4-8`` -- Claude Opus 4.8"
msgstr "``claude-opus-4-8`` -- Claude Opus 4.8"

msgid "``claude-fable-5`` -- Claude Fable 5"
msgstr "``claude-fable-5`` -- Claude Fable 5"

msgid "``custom`` -- Custom model"
msgstr "``custom`` -- ໂມເດວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

msgid "Translator persona"
msgstr "ບຸກຄະລິກຂອງຜູ້ແປ (Persona)"

msgid ""
"Describe the persona of translator to improve the accuracy of the "
"translation. For example: “You are a squirrel breeder.”"
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍບຸກຄະລິກຂອງຜູ້ແປເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການແປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: “ເຈົ້າເປັນຜູ້ລ້ຽງກະຮອກ.”"

msgid "Translator style"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຜູ້ແປ"

msgid ""
"Describe the style of translation. For example: “Use informal language.”"
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍຮູບແບບຂອງການແປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: “ໃຊ້ພາສາທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນທາງການ.”"

msgid "Language-specific instructions"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳສະເພາະພາສາ"

msgid ""
"JSON object mapping existing target language codes to extra instructions, up "
"to 1000 characters each."
msgstr ""
"JSON object ທີ່ຈັບຄູ່ລະຫັດພາສາປາຍທາງທີ່ມີຢູ່ກັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ບໍ່ເກີນ 1000 ຕົວອັກສອນຕໍ່ອັນ."

msgid "Custom model name"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂມເດວທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

msgid "Only needed when model is set to 'Custom model'"
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມເດນເປັນ 'ໂມເດນກຳນົດເອງ' ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

msgid "Max tokens"
msgstr "Max tokens"

msgid "Maximum number of tokens to generate in the response."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Token ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສ້າງໃນການຕອບກັບ."

msgid "Performs translation using `Anthropic's Claude`_ models."
msgstr "ແປພາສາໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມເດວ `Claude ຂອງ Anthropic`_."

msgid ""
"The Anthropic API provides access to the Claude family of models, which are "
"known for their strong reasoning and language capabilities. You need an API "
"key from Anthropic to use this service."
msgstr ""
"Anthropic API ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຕະກູນໂມເດວ Claude, ເຊິ່ງເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນດີ "
"ໃນດ້ານຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ເຫດຜົນ ແລະ ພາສາທີ່ເຂັ້ມແຂງ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄີ API ຈາກ Anthropic "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ບໍລິການນີ້."

msgid ""
"The model choices favor current generally available Claude models. "
"Previously offered models remain selectable while Anthropic continues to "
"support them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Use persona and style fields to further fine-tune translations. These will "
"be used in a prompt for Claude and allow you to change the style of the "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຊ່ອງບຸກຄະລິກ (persona) ແລະ ຮູບແບບ (style) ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງການແປໃຫ້ລະອຽດຕື່ມ. "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຄຳສັ່ງ (prompt) ສຳລັບ Claude ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຮູບແບບການແປໄດ້."

msgid "The service automatically uses :ref:`glossary`, see :ref:`glossary-mt`."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໃຊ້ :ref:`glossary` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເບິ່ງ :ref:`glossary-mt`."

msgid ""
"`Anthropic API documentation <https://docs.anthropic.com/en/api/getting-"
"started>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ເອກະສານ Anthropic API <https://docs.anthropic.com/en/api/getting-started>`_"

msgid "`Anthropic Console <https://platform.claude.com/>`_"
msgstr "`Anthropic Console <https://platform.claude.com/>`_"

msgid ""
"A libre software machine translation platform providing translations to a "
"limited set of languages."
msgstr "ແພລດຟອມການແປພາສາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງແບບຊອບແວເສລີ ທີ່ໃຫ້ການແປສຳລັບຊຸດພາສາທີ່ຈຳກັດ."

msgid ""
"The recommended way to use Apertium is to run your own Apertium-APy server."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການໃຊ້ Apertium ແມ່ນການເປີດເຊີບເວີ Apertium-APy ຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ."

msgid "`Apertium website <https://www.apertium.org/>`_"
msgstr "`ເວັບໄຊ Apertium <https://www.apertium.org/>`_"

msgid ""
"`Apertium APy documentation <https://wiki.apertium.org/wiki/Apertium-apy>`_"
msgstr "`ເອກະສານ Apertium APy <https://wiki.apertium.org/wiki/Apertium-apy>`_"

msgid "API secret key"
msgstr "API secret key"

msgid "Region name"
msgstr "ຊື່ພາກພື້ນ (Region name)"

msgid "Formality"
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມເປັນທາງການ"

msgid "*empty value* -- Default"
msgstr "*ຄ່າຫວ່າງ* -- ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

msgid "``FORMAL`` -- Formal"
msgstr "``FORMAL`` -- ເປັນທາງການ"

msgid "``INFORMAL`` -- Informal"
msgstr "``INFORMAL`` -- ບໍ່ເປັນທາງການ"

msgid "Brevity"
msgstr "ຄວາມກະທັດຮັດ"

msgid "Prefer shorter translations when supported."
msgstr "ບຸລິມະສິດການແປທີ່ສັ້ນກວ່າເມື່ອຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "``ON`` -- Enabled"
msgstr "``ON`` -- ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

msgid "Profanity"
msgstr "ຄຳຫຍາບຄາຍ"

msgid "Mask profane words in translated text."
msgstr "ປິດບັງຄຳຫຍາບຄາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປ."

msgid "``MASK`` -- Mask profanity"
msgstr "``MASK`` -- ປິດບັງຄຳຫຍາບຄາຍ"

msgid ""
"Amazon Translate is a neural machine translation service for translating "
"text to and from English across a breadth of supported languages. The "
"service requires the `TranslateFullAccess` Managed Policy."
msgstr ""
"Amazon Translate ແມ່ນບໍລິການການແປພາສາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງແບບນິວຣອນ ສຳລັບການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມ ໄປ ແລະ ມາ "
"ຈາກພາສາອັງກິດ ໃນທຸກພາສາທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ບໍລິການນີ້ຕ້ອງການນະໂຍບາຍການຈັດການ "
"`TranslateFullAccess`."

msgid ""
"`Amazon Translate Documentation <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/translate/>`_"
msgstr "`ເອກະສານ Amazon Translate <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/translate/>`_"

msgid ""
"`AWS TranslateFullAccess Policy <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-managed-"
"policy/latest/reference/TranslateFullAccess.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`AWS TranslateFullAccess Policy <https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-managed-"
"policy/latest/reference/TranslateFullAccess.html>`_"

msgid "LLM model"
msgstr "ໂມເດວ LLM"

msgid "Azure OpenAI endpoint URL"
msgstr "Azure OpenAI endpoint URL"

msgid ""
"Endpoint URL of the instance, e.g: https://my-instance.openai.azure.com."
msgstr "URL Endpoint ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ຕົວຢ່າງ: https://my-instance.openai.azure.com."

msgid "Azure OpenAI deployment"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Azure OpenAI"

msgid "The model's unique deployment name."
msgstr "ຊື່ການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກຂອງໂມເດນ."

msgid "Performs translation using `OpenAI`_ hosted on Azure."
msgstr "ແປພາສາໂດຍໃຊ້ `OpenAI`_ ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ Azure."

msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "Client ID"

msgid "Client secret"
msgstr "Client secret"

msgid "Machine translation service provided by Baidu."
msgstr "ບໍລິການແປພາສາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໂດຍ Baidu."

msgid ""
"This service uses an API and you need to obtain an ID and API key from Baidu "
"to use it."
msgstr "ບໍລິການນີ້ໃຊ້ API ແລະ ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຂໍເອົາ ID ແລະ ຄີ API ຈາກ Baidu ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "`Baidu Translate API <https://fanyi-api.baidu.com/product/11>`_"
msgstr "`Baidu Translate API <https://fanyi-api.baidu.com/product/11>`_"

msgid "Machine translation service using the Cyrtranslit library."
msgstr "ບໍລິການແປພາສາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີ Cyrtranslit."

msgid ""
"This service converts text between Cyrillic and Latin scripts for languages "
"that have both scripts."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການນີ້ປ່ຽນຂໍ້ຄວາມລະຫວ່າງຕົວອັກສອນຊີຣີລິກ (Cyrillic) ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນລາຕິນ "
"ສຳລັບພາສາທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ທັງສອງແບບ."

msgid ""
"`Cyrtranslit repository <https://github.com/opendatakosovo/cyrillic-"
"transliteration>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ຄັງເກັບ Cyrtranslit <https://github.com/opendatakosovo/cyrillic-"
"transliteration>`_"

msgid "Uses the specified formality if language is not specified as (in)formal"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ລະດັບຄວາມເປັນທາງການທີ່ລະບຸ ຖ້າພາສານັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດວ່າເປັນແບບທາງການ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເປັນທາງການ"

msgid "Translation context"
msgstr "ບໍລິບົດຂອງການແປ"

msgid ""
"Describe the context of the translation to improve the accuracy of the "
"translation."
msgstr "ອະທິບາຍບໍລິບົດຂອງການແປເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການແປ."

msgid "Use next-gen model"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂມເດວລຸ້ນໃໝ່ (next-gen)"

msgid "Prefer next-gen LLM over classic machine translation model."
msgstr "ເລືອກໃຊ້ LLM ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ແທນໂມເດນການແປດ້ວຍຈັກແບບດັ້ງເດີມ."

msgid ""
"DeepL is a paid service providing good machine translation for a few "
"languages. You need to purchase :guilabel:`DeepL API` subscription."
msgstr ""
"DeepL ແມ່ນບໍລິການແບບເສຍເງິນທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແປພາສາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບດີສຳລັບບາງພາສາ. "
"ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຊື້ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ :guilabel:`DeepL API`."

msgid ""
"API URL to use with the DeepL service. Configure the base endpoint without "
"an API version; Weblate selects the appropriate DeepL API version for each "
"request."
msgstr ""
"API URL ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບບໍລິການ DeepL. ກຳນົດ endpoint ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃສ່ເວີຊັນຂອງ API; Weblate "
"ຈະເລືອກເວີຊັນ DeepL API ທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄຳຮ້ອງ."

msgid "DeepL API v1 is no longer supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ DeepL API v1 ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

msgid "``https://api.deepl.com/`` (default in Weblate)"
msgstr "``https://api.deepl.com/`` (ມາດຕະຖານໃນ Weblate)"

msgid ""
"Is meant for API usage on the paid plan, and the subscription is usage-based."
msgstr "ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ API ໃນແພັກເກດເສຍເງິນ, ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ແມ່ນຄິດຕາມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

msgid ""
"Is meant for API usage on the free plan, and the subscription is usage-based."
msgstr "ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ API ໃນແພັກເກດຟຣີ, ແລະ ການສະໝັກໃຊ້ແມ່ນຄິດຕາມການໃຊ້ງານຈິງ."

msgid ""
"Weblate supports DeepL formality, it will choose matching one based on the "
"language (for example, there is ``de@formal`` and ``de@informal``)."
msgstr ""
"Weblate ຮອງຮັບລະດັບຄວາມເປັນທາງການຂອງ DeepL, ມັນຈະເລືອກອັນທີ່ກົງກັນ ຕາມພາສາ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ມີ "
"``de@formal`` ແລະ ``de@informal``)."

msgid ""
"The translation context can optionally be specified to improve translations "
"quality. Read more on that in `DeepL translation context documentation "
"<https://developers.deepl.com/docs/learning-how-tos/examples-and-guides/how-"
"to-use-context-parameter>`_."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດກຳນົດບໍລິບົດຂອງການແປໄດ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄຸນນະພາບຂອງການແປ. ອ່ານເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນ "
"`ເອກະສານບໍລິບົດການແປຂອງ DeepL <https://developers.deepl.com/docs/learning-how-"
"tos/examples-and-guides/how-to-use-context-parameter>`_."

msgid "`DeepL translator <https://www.deepl.com/translator>`_"
msgstr "`DeepL translator <https://www.deepl.com/translator>`_"

msgid "`DeepL pricing <https://www.deepl.com/pro>`_"
msgstr "`ລາຄາ DeepL <https://www.deepl.com/pro>`_"

msgid ""
"`DeepL API documentation <https://developers.deepl.com/docs/getting-started/"
"quickstart>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ເອກະສານ DeepL API <https://developers.deepl.com/docs/getting-started/"
"quickstart>`_"

msgid ""
"Free dictionary and translation memory for almost every living language."
msgstr "ວັດຈະນານຸກົມ ແລະ ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳການແປຟຣີ ສຳລັບເກືອບທຸກພາສາທີ່ຍັງໃຊ້ຢູ່."

msgid ""
"The API is gratis to use, but usage of the translations is subject to the "
"license of the used data source. There is a limit of calls that may be done "
